window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1401,"title":"Chapter 1401 They Wanted To Kill Her?","paragraphs":["1401 They Wanted To Kill Her?","“I’m not an expert. I’m just a fan,” He Wenxian said humbly.","He Weinian smiled and said, “Wenxian has liked to repair ancient books since she was young, so she studied the craft for a period of time. If you like, you can have a chat with Wenxian about it.”","Qiao Xi straightened her back, and the corners of her mouth curled up slightly. “I happen to have a damaged ancient painting in my hand. It was left to me by my grandfather. Because this ancient painting is too precious, I don’t dare to casually find someone to repair it. Miss He, why don’t you help me?”","He Wenxian’s heart trembled, but her expression did not change at all. “Of course.”","!!","“It’s getting late, Ah Zheng. We’ll take our leave first. See you in a few days.” He Weinian stood up and prepared to leave.","He Wenxian could not help but glance at Gu Zheng, her eyes filled with unwillingness. She forcefully suppressed her emotions and smiled as she looked at Qiao Xi. “Xi Xi, on the day of the cultural relics event, you can bring the ancient painting over. Even if I’m not confident in repairing it, there’ll be so many seniors present there. I believe they’ll definitely be able to help you.”","“Thank you in advance, Miss He,” Qiao Xi said casually.","He Weinian and He Wenxian stood up and left. After the two of them got into the car, He Weinian smiled in satisfaction. “Wenxian, you performed well today. If you’re really able to help Qiao Xi repair that ancient painting, it can be considered as you’ve done her a great favor. She won’t be able to hold anything against you anymore.","“Try your best to be friends with Qiao Xi, but don’t be too intimate with her. You have to be distant and aware of the limits. That way, when something happens to Qiao Xi, no one will suspect you.”","He Wenxian replied.","He Weinian’s eyes were filled with schemes. “Wenxian, you have to know that there’s no flawless plan. What you have to do is to play with people’s hearts. As long as you shed a few tears when something happens to Qiao Xi, no one will suspect you. After all, how could anyone suspect you of doing something to Qiao Xi when you look so sad?”","Back then, he had also gotten rid of those obstacles and become the greatest beneficiary. It was inevitable that he would be suspected. However, even if he would kill his in-laws and wife, how could he kill his child?","In the end, those doubts gradually dissipated over time. No one remembered what had happened back then.","He Weinian looked at He Wenxian. “I originally planned to let Tingchen marry Qiao Xi, but I didn’t expect Qiao Xi to actually marry Gu Zheng. However, it’s not too late.","“We’ve already obtained the address of the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. We’ll send someone to kill her now. As long as she dies, you’ll be the legitimate Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor.”","He Wenxian also smiled proudly. She knew that her father had bribed some ancient painting masters. As long as the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor died, those people would appear to confirm her identity.","Qiao Xi, who was in the living room, looked at He Weinian’s and Wen Xian’s backs. She raised her eyes and asked Gu Zheng, “You keep saying that He Weinian isn’t a good person. Actually, I think he’s not bad!”","“What do you mean?” Gu Zheng smirked.","Qiao Xi said, “I was just about to find out which wicked person intercepted my invitation when Chairman He came to tell me that it was him. It saved me a lot of trouble. He’s too considerate!”","Gu Zheng chuckled with a trace of coldness.","The next second, Qiao Xi gnashed her teeth and said, “They actually dare to intercept my invitation! They even asked for my address! They want to silence me!”","Originally, Qiao Xi wanted to take revenge on Kang Jichuan first. Unexpectedly, Kang Jichuan did not follow Kang Ru to Li City. Instead, it was He Weinian who came over. Since that was the case, she would deal with the He family first!","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with icy coldness. “Originally, I was only interested in The Forgotten River, but I have to go to this event now!”","At this moment, the cultural relic restoration experts had already arrived in Li City and were holding a meeting. They had even invited a team of reporters to record the scene.","The meeting lasted for a total of three days. The content was different every day, but they all revolved around one thing—how to repair that ancient book.","Those who received the invitations all came to Li City in advance, afraid that they would not be able to make it in time for this event. This was because everyone had heard that there were two famous figures attending this event. One was the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor who shocked the entire cultural relics world back then, while the other was the even more mysterious Twilight.","It was said that Twilight had a noble status and had learned ancient calligraphy and painting restoration since he was young. Hence, he could complete restoration works alone since he was very young. Many people only learned this after they became adults, but Twilight was already proficient in it when he was young. Moreover, this man won the most prestigious award in the ancient calligraphy and painting restoration competition ten years ago. He even won the championship for three consecutive years."]},{"number":1402,"title":"Chapter 1402 The Mysterious Big Boss Appeared","paragraphs":["1402 The Mysterious Big Boss Appeared","Twilight’s honor in the cultural relics world could be said to be unprecedented. Unfortunately, three years later, he withdrew from the cultural relics world. Immediately after, a new star appeared in the perfume industry with Twilight’s name.","After this mysterious man left the cultural relics world, he turned to the perfume industry and became the focus of everyone’s attention again. Hence, everyone wanted to see what this mysterious big shot looked like.","Twilight and the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor were invited to this event. When the two mysterious figures appeared together, everyone present would definitely not have made this trip in vain.","Regardless of whether Twilight would come or not, the cultural relics restoration department had already released the news that the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor had agreed and would definitely come.","!!","When Qiao Xi arrived, the venue was extremely lively. The camera team had already set up their equipment. The entire event needed to be recorded. When the time came, it would be made into a documentary to promote the restoration of cultural relics.","However, there were not many people who were interested in the restoration of cultural relics, after all. They did not attract much attention in Li City. When Qiao Xi arrived, she was really shocked by the scene in front of her.","It was really a sea of people!","She thought that this was just an event and that there were not many people who were interested in the restoration of cultural relics, so only dozens of people would be in attendance. However, she realized that there were tons of people queuing at the door.","Qiao Xi thought carefully and understood the organizers’ intentions. Cultural relic restoration was really too unpopular, but the country needed a large number of relevant talents. They could only take this opportunity to publicize the restoration of culture and make everyone think that this industry had prospects.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes slightly and looked at He Wenxian, who was not far away. She was holding a red and gold invitation in her hand. Her invitation had been intercepted, so if she and Gu Zheng wanted to enter, they could only use He Weinian’s business card. However, this was too degrading!","Just as Qiao Xi was feeling depressed, a young man in a suit suddenly walked over and said respectfully, “Mr. Gu, Mrs. Gu, please come in.”","Qiao Xi was stunned.","What was going on? Gu Zheng had not even given them his business card, so how did the staff know to come over and invite them in? That person seemed to have known that they would come, so he specially came out to welcome them.","Qiao Xi was just thinking about it when Gu Zheng had already held her hand and entered. The two of them had just entered when they heard a commotion not far away.","Seeing their confusion, the staff explained respectfully, “Mr. and Mrs. Gu, because the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor is here, many fans are gathered here. I heard that many seniors in the cultural relics world like that lady very much!”","When Qiao Xi heard the name ‘Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor’, she felt a wave of disgust in her heart. Why did she randomly come up with such a name back then?","The real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor was here, while the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor over there was He Wenxian, that fake.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up, and her eyes were filled with ridicule.","The staff member was just a university student who came out to work part-time in his spare time. When he saw Qiao Xi staring in that direction, he probed, “Mrs. Gu, do you know the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor? Do you want to go over and take a look?”","Gu Zheng’s gaze was slightly cold, scaring the staff member so much that his heart stopped. In front of such a big shot, he had to be careful at all times, lest he said the wrong thing.","The next second, Mrs. Gu smiled at him. “Alright, let’s go take a look.”","She wanted to see how shameless He Wenxian was. Not only did she want to occupy her identity as the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, but she also wanted to silence her.","Gu Zheng’s cold gaze instantly became gentle as he said softly, “I’ll go with you.”","The staff member heaved a sigh of relief, but he did not expect the cold man just now to instantly become gentle when facing Mrs. Gu.","Qiao Xi pulled Gu Zheng and walked straight over. There were four people standing in the middle of the crowd.","Oh! The family of four was here!","He Wenxian was the center of attention and answered the reporters’ questions generously. Suddenly, He Tingchen swept his gaze over and widened his eyes in surprise. He waved enthusiastically. “Ah Zheng! You’re here!”","He Tingchen was an innocent person, similar to Kang Ru. He was clearly in his 20s, but he was still as naive as a child. He actually thought that Gu Zheng would treat him as a friend. After all, Gu Zheng had not had any close friends all these years. He felt that he was a special existence in Gu Zheng’s heart.","Now that Gu Zheng was powerful, how could he forget his friend who helped him in times of crisis?","He Tingchen had never thought that it was a big deal for the He family to betray Gu Zheng. That was a few years ago. He thought that Gu Zheng would have let it go by now, so he greeted him without hesitation."]},{"number":1403,"title":"Chapter 1403 The Higher You Climb, The Worse You Fall","paragraphs":["1403 The Higher You Climb, The Worse You Fall","He Tingchen said excitedly, “Ah Zheng, you’re here too! I’m really happy to see you! Did you specially come here because you heard that Wenxian is the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor?”","The surrounding people consciously made way. Even if everyone present did not know who ‘Ah Zheng’ was, they could tell from He Tingchen’s reaction that he was a big shot.","However, wasn’t it said that Gu Zheng had already cut off all contact with the He family? It seemed that rumors were really untrustworthy.","He Weinian laughed heartily. “Ah Zheng, Xi Xi, it’s really good that you’re here. Xi Xi, did you bring that painting?”","!!","Qiao Xi also smiled hypocritically. “Of course. After all, Miss He is so formidable, so she’ll naturally be able to help me restore this painting.”","“Yes, yes.” He Weinian nodded, but a trace of coldness flashed past his eyes.","Qiao Xi looked at He Wenxian and smiled meaningfully. “Miss He, you’re actually the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor? I heard that the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor repaired an incomplete scroll back then, and it caused a sensation!”","Ever since Gu Zheng appeared, He Wenxian’s gaze had been on him. Greed and unwillingness were mixed together. She could only forcefully suppress the surging emotions in her heart.","Her eyes were filled with Gu Zheng, so He Wenxian did not hear Qiao Xi’s words clearly for a moment. She hurriedly came back to her senses. “What did you say?”","“I’m just curious about how you suddenly became the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. It’s really surprising!”","Everyone looked at each other. Why did they feel that Mrs. Gu’s words were strange?","He Wenxian’s heart was filled with Gu Zheng, so she did not think too much about Qiao Xi’s words. She only thought that Qiao Xi was jealous of her, so she smiled calmly. “Xi Xi, I’ve been in contact with cultural relics since I was young and have always been the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor! It’s just that I’ve been busy with the company’s matters all these years and can’t care about anything else. But this event is especially important. Coincidentally, I’m also in Li City, so I came to participate.”","He Wenxian took out the red and gold invitation letter in public. The name written on it was Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. Her name was not written on it, but everyone knew that the invitations were personally sent by the staff of the cultural relic restoration department. They would’ve carefully checked her identity. Since Miss He could take out the invitation letter, it meant that she was Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor.","Mrs. Gu should have nothing to say now!","He Wenxian’s gaze landed on Qiao Xi. If Qiao Xi raised her doubts in front of everyone, the others would stop her even without He Wenxian saying anything.","After a few seconds of silence, Qiao Xi only replied casually, “Oh, I see.”","For some reason, a trace of panic suddenly surged in He Wenxian’s heart. Afraid that others would notice something wrong, she could only squeeze out a smile. “Ah Zheng, I didn’t tell you in advance because I thought you wouldn’t come. I didn’t expect you to come and support me.”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent. He did not say anything and did not even bother to look at her.","The atmosphere instantly became awkward, and it was Qiao Xi who broke the silence. “Miss He, I heard that many master-level figures were unable to complete the scroll that the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor repaired. There are still many unrestored cultural relics in this event. I hope you can display your skills and enlighten us.”","He Wenxian’s heart trembled, but she still smiled gently. “Of course.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with ridicule. With He Wenxian’s ostentatious character, she would definitely publicize her identity as the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor and get the reporters to report this matter, hoping to become famous in a day.","However... the higher one climbed, the worse one would fall. Qiao Xi really wanted to see He Wenxian’s expression after she was exposed.","Today was the first day of the event. The atmosphere was relaxed and pleasant, and the scene was a little noisy. Qiao Xi found a quiet seat and sat down.","There was a group of people arguing at the side. “I didn’t expect the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor to really come! She’s really a young lady in her 20s!”","“She’s the eldest daughter of the He family! Not only is she capable, but she’s also beautiful. I heard that she might become the heir of the He family in the future!”","“Sigh! Why is the difference between people so big? She has a noble status. Plus, she’s rich, beautiful, and so outstanding. She’s too perfect. What about us?!”","“She’s truly a competent, rich, and beautiful woman!”","“By the way, didn’t they say that the mysterious big shot, Twilight, would be coming too? I heard that he’s also very noble. If he’s handsome, he’ll be a match made in heaven with Miss He!”","He Wenxian heard everyone’s discussion and smiled proudly. She could not help but look at Qiao Xi, who was in the corner.","Qiao Xi was just a canary raised by Gu Zheng. She was able to enter the event venue today because of the He family. So what if she married Gu Zheng? She would never be as respected as her!"]},{"number":1404,"title":"Chapter 1404 How Dirty!","paragraphs":["1404 How Dirty!","He Wenxian’s expression became even prouder. She was now a genius in the cultural relics world, but what did Qiao Xi know? She was just a jewelry designer!","Being a cultural relic restorer was something to be proud of. She could restore the calligraphy and paintings left behind by many ancient people. Everything she did was for the sake of promoting the country’s culture. Not only would she be respected by everyone, but the country would also be proud of her. Such honor was something Qiao Xi could never hope to achieve in her life.","He Wenxian straightened her back arrogantly and smiled confidently.","She had long hired a professional cultural relic restorer. If she was asked to complete the restoration on the spot, she could say that she did not like cameras and crowds and that she needed to work alone. Then, her father would arrange for a cultural relic restorer to help her complete her work. At that time, she could just appear in front of everyone with the work.","She wanted Qiao Xi to see who was qualified to stand by Gu Zheng’s side!","Yes, this honor was stolen, but stealing it without being discovered was also an ability. Who asked the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor to be unlucky enough to bump into her?","Qiao Xi supported her chin and sized up He Wenxian, who was not far away. She saw pride, greed, and killing intent in her eyes.","Even though Qiao Xi had a cold character, she could not help but feel angry at this moment.","What if she was just a powerless young woman? She would be killed just because she was outstanding. The He family had nurtured professional assassins who would not fail at all. Before she could even ask for help, she would be beheaded.","Just like that, a genius girl would disappear from this world before she could even stand out. No one would even know her name.","He Wenxian occupied her identity and stole the glory that should belong to her. She even wanted to step on her corpse to climb up the social ladder. What a dirty act!","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes and curled her lips into a gloomy smile.","At this moment, He Wenxian was like a sparkling star. She was welcomed and respected no matter where she went. She was busy talking to her seniors and naturally did not have the time to observe Qiao Xi. At this moment, He Wenyin took the opportunity to slip over.","Qiao Xi sat there quietly and gently swirled the contents of her wine glass. She was stunningly beautiful, but she gave off a distant feeling.","When He Wenyin saw this beautiful scene, she could not help but sigh in her heart. No wonder a cold man like Gu Zheng would get married in a flash. After meeting such a beautiful woman, he would definitely get married as soon as possible to avoid her being snatched away.","She looked around and quietly leaned over. “Qiao Xi.”","Qiao Xi had long noticed the gaze behind her and elegantly turned around. “Second Miss He! Why are you here with me? Shouldn’t you be giving interviews like He Tingchen?”","He Wenyin smiled meaningfully. “Didn’t you see how many people from the He family were there just now?”","Qiao Xi thought for a moment. There were four people in the He family except for He Wenyin.","He Wenyin sneered. “They wouldn’t have brought me here to be interviewed. I sneaked in.”","“But...” He Wenyin thought about how Qiao Xi already knew that she had a grudge against the He family. Moreover, she had even reminded Qiao Xi to be careful of the He family, so He Wenyin did not have to hide anything in front of Qiao Xi.","“Qiao Xi, do you really believe that my sister is the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor?”","“Even if I don’t believe it, so what?” Qiao Xi took a bite of the chocolate cake. The rich taste bloomed on the tip of her tongue, and her eyes lit up.","He Wenyin stared at her for a while. “So you know?”","Actually, when Qiao Xi spoke just now, everyone had a tacit understanding. However, He Wenyin was an uncontrollable factor. Qiao Xi did not want to expose too much in front of her.","“You’re the second daughter of the He family. You should know better than me whether she’s the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor or not.”","He Wenyin snorted. “I absolutely don’t believe that she’s the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, but the servants of the He family will definitely believe her.”","“Oh?” Qiao Xi looked at her with interest.","He Wenyin said with a mocking expression, “My sister has been learning the four arts since she was young. Although she might not be proficient, her skills are acknowledged on the surface. As for the restoration of cultural relics, it started five years ago. She bought many related books and often pretends to repair ancient books at home. If I were a servant at home and saw Eldest Miss buying these books and repairing ancient books in the study from time to time, I would naturally think that she’s an expert in this area.","“Now that she’s attending the event as the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, the servants of the He family will naturally recall her restoring ancient books at home. Of course, they’ll believe her without a doubt.”"]},{"number":1405,"title":"Chapter 1405 Targeted By A Pack Of Hungry Wolves","paragraphs":["1405 Targeted By A Pack Of Hungry Wolves","“Miss He came prepared!” A cold light flashed through Qiao Xi’s eyes. She really did not expect He Wenxian to start preparing to occupy someone else’s identity so early.","“That’s right! So no one will suspect her.” He Wenyin snorted.","“The He family has been scheming against the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor for many years. That young lady seems to know that she’s being schemed against. She’s quite unlucky to be targeted by the He family. Sigh...”","He Wenyin sighed helplessly, and her probing gaze landed on Qiao Xi. She asked with a smile, “Mrs. Gu, do you think the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor will personally come to the scene to expose her if he finds out?”","!!","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. Everything was obvious.","He Wenyin also smiled. She knew that her guess was right. “I think the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor will definitely fight back and make He Wenxian fall from her pedestal.”","Qiao Xi could not help but nod.","That was right, that was what she wanted to do.","Not only did she have to expose He Wenxian in public, but she also had to let everyone know that He Wenxian had been scheming against the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor since a few years ago. She did not even hesitate to silence her. How was He Wenxian going to clear her name after that?","Now, He Wenxian was a high and mighty cultural relic restorer, but she would soon become an impostor despised by everyone.","He Wenyin suddenly leaned closer and asked in a low voice, “Qiao Xi, do you hate He Wenxian so much because she has taken a liking to Gu Zheng?”","Qiao Xi chuckled. “That’s not true. It’s her freedom to like whoever she wants, but it’s her fault for insisting on provoking me.”","Moreover, so what if she liked Gu Zheng? Gu Zheng would never like her.","He Wenyin looked enlightened. After a few seconds of silence, she suddenly changed the topic. “Qiao Xi, I heard that an earl from Y Nation came to Li City to look for you?”","“Yes,” Qiao Xi said frankly. “Second Miss He, what do you think?”","Seeing that she was open to discussing it, He Wenyin went straight to the point. “I reminded you last time that He Weinian’s goal in coming back this time was you. Now, that earl, Kang Ru, has also come to Li City from overseas to look for you. Recently, many people have been eyeing you!","“Let’s stop here. I can’t be discovered by the He family, so I’ll leave first.”","As soon as He Wenyin finished speaking, she left in a hurry. When she reached the door, she suddenly stopped in her tracks and turned to look back at Qiao Xi.","Actually, when she first saw Qiao Xi, she thought that Gu Zheng had married a beautiful wife. She was even hesitant about working with Gu Zheng as she was afraid that Mrs. Gu would expose her plan. Now, it seemed that Mrs. Gu’s strategy was not inferior to Gu Zheng’s. They were really a match made in heaven.","She had guessed a long time ago that Qiao Xi was the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. After all, she would secretly investigate the He family and all things related to them.","However, after investigating for a long time, there were only a few words of news about the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. She was a young girl from an ordinary family who lived in a remote rented house.","Originally, He Wenyin would absolutely not have thought that the rented house was related to Qiao Xi. It was just that when she sent someone to wait near the rented house, they accidentally spotted Qiao Xi, so she thought of the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. Coupled with her conversation with Qiao Xi today, she was already able to confirm Qiao Xi’s identity.","Since their enemy was He Wenxian, she would also help Qiao Xi. She wanted to see He Wenxian fall from grace with her own eyes.","Due to the fact that some students and scholars from related majors could not attend, the event was held live. There were only a few thousand people in the live-stream. Compared to other live-streams, the contrast was high. However, He Wenxian was already very satisfied.","She did not need many people in the live-stream. In any case, they were all ordinary netizens. It was enough as long as some scholars and experts knew about it. After this event ended successfully, she would use her identity as the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor to become an expert in the restoration of ancient books. She would be known as good-looking, rich, and talented. She would also be valued by the seniors in the cultural relics world. Her future would definitely be bright.","Faced with the cameras around her, He Wenxian was full of smiles.","A reporter asked, “Miss He, you’re already an expert in ancient book restoration at such a young age. When did you start learning this?”","When He Tingchen heard this question, he was instantly excited. His words were filled with bragging. “Wenxian has liked to repair ancient books since she was young. At first, we thought that this was just a hobby and didn’t care about it. However, since five years ago, Wenxian has been spending a lot of time studying. She often restores ancient books at home. Our parents thought that Wenxian wanted to pursue her studies in this and were very supportive of her. Unexpectedly, Wenxian had already made a name for herself in the cultural relics world a few years ago!”"]},{"number":1406,"title":"Chapter 1406 Her Things Are Missing","paragraphs":["1406 Her Things Are Missing","He Tingchen’s eyes were filled with sincerity. He was so happy that he could not close his mouth.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up. He Tingchen had a simple character and was not good at pretending. At this moment, he really believed that He Wenxian was the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. He even thought that his father and sister were true philanthropists.","Such a naive person was actually from the He family. They grew up under the same roof, yet He Weinian could actually nurture He Tingchen and He Wenxian to have completely different personalities. It was really too magical.","He Tingchen became more and more agitated as he spoke. “Wenxian is outstandingly capable. Our parents planned to let her manage the company, so Wenxian never told us that she’s the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. Actually, my parents are very open-minded. If Wenxian likes something, we’ll support her. I didn’t expect this girl to hide it from us for so many years.”","He Wenxian smiled humbly. “I just loved it back then. I didn’t expect to have my current achievements. After that, I was too busy with work and didn’t have time to practice it, so I didn’t tell my family.”","Everyone could not help but sigh. Miss He was really too humble and low-profile. If they were the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, they would definitely want the entire world to know. However, Miss He had actually hidden it for so many years without even telling her family.","It was fine that she had such ability, but it was really rare for her to not be arrogant or rash.","Everyone in the cultural relics world had more or less heard of the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. She was a genius who repaired the damaged scroll a few years ago. They thought that she was a senior in her 40s or 50s, but they did not expect her to be just a young woman in her 20s.","The reason why geniuses were called geniuses was that they could stand out from their peers. Hence, as soon as the live broadcast started, the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor gained a large number of fans. Most of them were university students who treated her as a role model. The live broadcast gradually became lively.","He Wenxian did not care how many viewers there were in the live-stream. It was enough as long as she could stand out in the cultural relics world.","At this moment, Qiao Xi’s phone rang. After she picked it up, the other party said respectfully, “Eldest Miss, Young Master said that your things are missing.”","Qiao Xi was stunned for a moment. “Get Second Brother to answer the phone.”","After a while, Luo Qing’s cold and low voice was heard. “Xi Xi.”","At this moment, Qin An, who was beside him, had already begun complaining. “No way! I still remember putting it in the safe when I came previously! Although this painting isn’t very valuable, it’s still an ancient painting. Little Six definitely wouldn’t have casually thrown it away. Why is it gone?”","With that said, Qin An snatched the phone away and said in an anxious tone, “Little Six, where did you put the painting? Teacher asked us to bring the painting back for him. He wants to try repairing it, but we can’t find it!”","Liang Pingchuan liked to collect ancient calligraphy and paintings. He knew that Qiao Xi had an ancient painting that was seriously damaged, so he sent Qin An to get it. Unexpectedly, the painting was missing.","Qiao Xi pondered for a few seconds before understanding the situation. She said helplessly, “You’re late. The painting was taken away.”","“Who took it?” Qin An stomped his feet in anger. He had come all the way here to get the painting for his teacher, but he had made a wasted trip.","Before Qiao Xi could speak, a surprised voice suddenly came from the other end of the phone. “Miss He, I heard that this ancient painting is at least a hundred years old. Although it’s not a famous work, it’s a huge challenge for cultural relic restorers. I saw this painting once two years ago. It’s very damaged. I didn’t expect you to be almost done repairing it. You’re really too awesome!”","Qiao Xi looked in the direction of the voice, and Qin An, who was on the other end of the phone, also caught the main point. The ancient painting from a hundred years ago was very damaged but was almost repaired. Wasn’t this the painting Little Six lost?","Qin An’s eyes were filled with anger. He could not help but clench his fists. Although he was a doctor who saved people and he did not like fighting and killing, he really wanted to rush over and beat He Wenxian up.","“He Wen! Xian!”","“Third Brother, you’re quite smart! You guessed it just like that. I won’t talk to you anymore.” Qiao Xi smiled slyly.","“What are you gonna do?” Qin An hurriedly asked.","Qiao Xi said casually, “What else can I do? Of course, I’ll expose her!”","At this moment, everyone surrounded He Wenxian. Everyone was very curious about what this ancient painting looked like in the past. After all, the clarity of this painting was already perfect, but this was not the final product. It could not help but attract everyone’s attention."]},{"number":1407,"title":"Chapter 1407 Watching The Clown Act","paragraphs":["1407 Watching The Clown Act","Everyone present was an expert in cultural relic restoration. They also wanted to see the original appearance of this painting. After a while, a group of people gathered around He Wenxian.","He Wenxian smiled like a flower and stood gracefully in the middle of the crowd.","The person who spoke just now hurriedly took out his phone and clicked on a photo. “This is the original appearance of the ancient painting. I saw it two years ago when I went to an exhibition. I heard that after the exhibition ended, that painting was bought by a young woman.","“This ancient painting is rich in content and has complicated colors. I wasn’t confident in repairing it, so I took a photo. I was originally wondering how a young lady could repair such a severely damaged ancient painting. I didn’t expect that the person who bought this painting back then was Miss He!”","The person who spoke was handsome. He was in his 40s and was quite famous in the cultural relics world.","Everyone leaned forward to look at the photo on his phone. They could vaguely recognize that it was the same painting. They did not expect He Wenxian to restore it so perfectly. No wonder everyone said that the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor was a genius in the cultural relics world. Her restoration skills had already reached the top in the country. And she was still so young.","Qiao Xi sat in a corner and watched the commotion with interest.","Unknowingly, Gu Zheng was sitting beside her with a trace of coldness on his body. He asked gently, “Xi Xi, what are you looking at?”","“I’m just watching a clown put on an act!” Qiao Xi’s tone was filled with disdain.","The man next to her was tall, handsome, and well-defined. His sharp eyebrows were raised, and his thin lips were pursed tightly. He looked straight at her with a pair of charming eyes, making her subconsciously indulge in him.","He moved closer and naturally pulled Qiao Xi into his embrace. His low and hoarse voice sounded in her ears. “Xi Xi, how much longer are you going to look at her? Isn’t this the best time to expose her?”","Qiao Xi’s surroundings were filled with Gu Zheng’s scorching aura. Her cheeks were slightly red as she lowered her head in response. “Let’s wait a little longer.”","With He Wenxian’s character, she would definitely try her best to let everyone see this painting. When all the seniors and experts arrived and saw this painting, they would definitely praise He Wenxian.","Qiao Xi really wanted to hear how those seniors evaluated the restoration work of this painting. If she exposed He Wenxian now, she would be shy when she heard all their praises afterward.","Gu Zheng seemed to understand her thoughts and smiled gently at her. “I’ll listen to you, Xi Xi.”","On the other hand, someone asked, “Miss He, the cultural relic appraisal expert, Old Master Li, is also present. Do you want to show this painting to Old Master Li?”","He Wenxian was delighted.","Old Master Li was the previous head of the Li family in Li City. He had a noble status and was a famous cultural relic appraisal expert in the country. He had studied cultural relic restoration for decades and was extremely famous in the cultural relic world.","When He Wenxian heard that Old Master Li’s granddaughter had a good relationship with Qiao Xi, she was instantly interested.","Her father said that he would not allow her to offend Qiao Xi, but he did not restrict her from interacting with the Li family. If Old Master Li was also very satisfied with her restoration skills, how would Qiao Xi feel?","At the thought of this, He Wenxian was very proud of herself. She pretended to be surprised and smiled. “Old Master Li is here too? Then let’s have him take a look at this painting!”","As Old Master Li’s status in the cultural relics world was respected, the organizers had given him a total of five invitations. Those who had invitations could even bring companions in, so Li Xing’er’s family was present. Not only that, but Li Xing’er also called Gu Yao over to join in the fun. As soon as the two of them entered, they heard that the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor was here.","Li Xing’er was extremely excited. “Ah! She’s really here! Gu Yao, you’ve heard of this genius girl, right?! My parents like her very much. Let’s go see what she looks like later!”","Gu Yao nodded without interest.","Li Xing’er asked the staff at the side, “What’s her real name?”","“The eldest daughter of the He family, He Wenxian.”","Li Xing’er was stunned for a moment. She was about to turn around and talk to Gu Yao when she saw his subtle expression. “Her? She’s the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor?”","Seeing Gu Yao’s disdainful face, Li Xing’er asked curiously. Gu Yao talked angrily the entire way. By the time the two of them found the Li family, Li Xing’er already knew about the grudge between the He family, Gu Zheng, and Qiao Xi.","Li Xing’er’s expression suddenly darkened. “He Wenxian clearly knows that Xi Xi is Gu Shan, yet she still accused her in public of not being qualified to work in Gu Corporation’s design department. Where did she get her guts from?!”"]},{"number":1408,"title":"Chapter 1408 Rumors Stop With Wise People","paragraphs":["1408 Rumors Stop With Wise People","“Gu Corporation is Gu Zheng’s business. If he’s willing to let Xi Xi take over, what can an outsider like He Wenxian do? She even said that she’s Gu Zheng’s childhood sweetheart. Isn’t she just rushing to be a mistress?! Such a disgusting person can’t be the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor!”","Hearing Li Xing’er’s indignant words, Old Madam Li and Old Master Li could not help but frown.","Old Master Li said meaningfully, “I know some news about the He family. All these years, the He family has been holding charity banquets and making donations. They’re famous philanthropists. He Weinian and He Wenxian have done a perfect job. It makes people think...”","He could not find any words to describe the He family.","!!","Gu Yao blurted out, “It’s like an act! It’s as if it was done according to a script!”","Old Master Li was enlightened. “Ah Yao has a point. No one can find anything wrong with He Weinian’s and He Wenxian’s words and actions. Perhaps there are really such perfect people in the world, but this family always gives me the feeling that they’re fake. It’s as if they’re acting according to a script.”","Gu Yao hurriedly nodded. “Qiao Xi said the same thing!”","Old Master Li said indifferently, “Ever since the He family returned to the country, many people have been rushing to curry favor with them, but we don’t have much contact with the He family. I’ve lived for so long and have seen many things. He Weinian looks like a kind person on the surface, but in reality... he’s unfathomable.”","When Gu Yao heard Old Master Li’s evaluation, he was even more excited. There was actually someone who had the same thoughts as Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi. They were finally not fighting alone anymore. At least someone else could see through He Weinian’s hypocritical mask.","Back then, when Gu Zheng cut off all ties with He Weinian, those people said that Gu Zheng was ungrateful because the He family’s reputation was too perfect. Now, it seemed that rumors stopped at wise people. Only a smart person like Old Master Li could understand.","“Ah Yao, you just said that He Wenxian clearly knows that Xi Xi is Gu Shan, yet she still wanted to chase her out of the company?” Old Master Li asked casually.","“Yes, Qiao Xi was working in the design department at that time. He Wenxian went to Gu Corporation to bid and mocked Qiao Xi in front of everyone. After that, He Weinian personally brought He Wenxian to apologize. His attitude was very sincere, but I kept having the feeling that...”","Old Master Li smiled heartily. “Do you think that He Wenxian has always been so perfect since she was young and has never had any negative news? Why would she be so rash to target Xi Xi?”","Old Master Li’s words hit the nail on the head. This was also something that Gu Yao could not figure out. Even if He Wenxian was jealous of Qiao Xi, she should not have criticized her in front of everyone!","“Some people are good at pretending, but there are always times when they slip up. After all, that’s her nature. No matter how much she hides, she’ll expose herself,” Old Madam Li said with a cold smile.","The two elders of the Li family were both smart people and naturally understood the logic behind this. Old Madam Li frowned. “But is she really the famous Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor?”","Li Xing’er’s face was filled with disdain. How could a genius like the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor be a hypocrite like He Wenxian?","Just as Li Xing’er was feeling indignant, she heard a group of people walking over. “Old Master Li!”","Many experts greeted Old Master Li respectfully when they saw him. When He Wenxian saw this scene, her eyes were filled with greed. If she could obtain Old Master Li’s recognition, then...","“Old Master Li, Miss He is the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. I remember you saying that you admire the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor very much. Today, she brought a hundred-year-old ancient painting that has been restored. Please take a look.”","Old Master Li’s gaze landed on He Wenxian. He did suspect He Wenxian’s identity, but the invitations for this event had to be delivered to the guests personally. Moreover, her identity had to be repeatedly verified. In that case, how was He Wenxian pretending to be the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor without being discovered?","Everyone came to the middle of the hall. The ancient painting was slowly unfolded and placed on the table for everyone to admire.","Li Xing’er had learned some things about cultural relic restoration from her grandfather since she was young. She also felt that this painting was restored perfectly. It was almost impossible to tell that it was a painting from a hundred years ago. However, she quickly frowned.","No! He Wenxian had bullied Xi Xi. She would never admit that He Wenxian was capable!","“I heard that you’re Xi Xi’s friend.” Li Xing’er did not want to pay attention to her, but He Wenxian took the initiative to lean forward and greet her warmly.","“Miss Li, you also know how to restore cultural relics. What do you think of this painting?”","As soon as He Wenxian spoke, everyone’s eyes landed on Li Xing’er."]},{"number":1409,"title":"Chapter 1409 Not Only Do We Know Each Other, But We’re Also Married","paragraphs":["1409 Not Only Do We Know Each Other, But We’re Also Married","Suddenly, someone said in confusion, “I heard that the Li family obtained a total of five invitations! In that case, does Li Xing’er also know how to restore cultural relics?”","“There are indeed five invitations, but none of them are for Li Xing’er. Her invitation was meant for her brother. Speaking of which, only Li Xing’er didn’t receive an invitation out of everyone else in the Li family. The Li family is a scholarly family. They’ve been studying cultural relics since their ancestors. They’re proficient in the four arts. But only Li Xing’er... Tsk tsk.”","“Miss He is the real daughter of a scholarly family. She has such achievements at such a young age. She relied on her identity to bring her family to attend the event, but Li Xing’er still has to rely on her parents to enter the event venue. This is the difference!”","He Wenxian heard everyone’s discussion and smiled in embarrassment, but a trace of pride flashed past her eyes.","!!","Li Xing’er was so angry that her face turned red. She suppressed the anger in her heart. After all, this was the venue of the cultural relic restoration event, and He Wenxian was the respected Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. If she lost her temper in public, wouldn’t it be embarrassing for the Li family?","If it were not for her family’s image, she would have rushed over and beaten He Wenxian up!","Gu Yao was right. He Wenxian was a scheming b*tch. She pretended to be the perfect socialite but deliberately talked to her to let everyone laugh at her. Stepping on others to praise oneself was not something that the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor would do!","Seeing Li Xing’er glaring at her angrily, He Wenxian did not continue chatting. Instead, she said respectfully, “Old Master Li, may I ask you to evaluate this painting?”","Old Master Li glanced at his angry granddaughter and glanced at He Wenxian sharply.","However, He Wenxian was someone He Weinian had personally trained. Even when she met Old Master Li’s sharp gaze, she was not afraid at all.","After a moment of silence, Old Master Li slowly said, “The most important thing is to restore it. The requirement for the paint and strokes is very strict. The restoration method of this painting is different from ordinary people, but it’s perfectly done. It’s enough to show that the restoration method is very brilliant.”","The steps to restore ancient paintings were very complicated, so sometimes, restorers needed to spend a year or longer to restore a painting. This kind of work was boring and tested one’s patience.","In Old Master Li’s opinion, although this ancient painting had not been completely restored, it was already top-notch. It was indeed worthy of the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor’s reputation.","It was true that he did not like He Wenxian, but he had to be objective when evaluating ancient paintings. Hence, he spoke truthfully.","“It must have taken a lot of effort to restore this painting. Try your best to restore every inch of the painting. It’s really rare for one to have such patience and skills at such a young age.”","He Wenxian instantly beamed.","Qiao Xi, who was at the side, was very happy when she heard Old Master Li’s evaluation. Old Master Li did not know that she was the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, so the evaluation he gave was objective. It meant that her restoration skills were indeed very superb.","Since she had already heard the praises, it was time for her to go on stage.","Qiao Xi stood up and walked toward the crowd. Song Shiyu leaned over to Gu Zheng’s ear and said softly, “President, it’s time for you to perform. Aren’t you going to take a look?”","Gu Zheng looked up at him and smiled meaningfully. Then, he stood up and walked to the other side.","Song Shiyu was stunned.","Had the president come to the wrong place?","Gu Zheng went straight to the person in charge’s office and spoke to the person inside. The other party looked surprised. “Mr. Gu, you... You want to organize a competition at the last minute?","“This...” The person in charge was in a dilemma.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were calm as he said casually, “I heard that the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor only used a month to restore that incomplete copy of Autumn Leaves. With such superb skills, it’s time for everyone to broaden their horizons. It should also be filmed for the documentary.”","When the other party heard Gu Zheng’s words, his eyes instantly widened. He asked excitedly, “Mr. Gu, do you know the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor?”","“Of course.” Gu Zheng smiled meaningfully.","Not only did he know her, but he was also married to her.","At Gu Zheng’s request, the organizers agreed to organize the competition. Gu Zheng immediately made a call. The other party was a little slow to pick up, but Gu Zheng was not impatient at all. His tone was gentle. “Mr. Wu, I want to ask you for a favor.”","Mr. Wu was stunned for a moment before realizing who was on the other end of the phone. He shouted excitedly, “Twilight! You actually called me! I thought you had forgotten about me a long time ago! If you have anything to say, just say it. I’ll definitely help if I can!”"]},{"number":1410,"title":"Chapter 1410 Prepared For This Moment For Five Years","paragraphs":["1410 Prepared For This Moment For Five Years","“I hope you can come to Li City and identify someone in public.” Gu Zheng curled his lips and said, “I remember that you were in charge of restoring that incomplete copy of Autumn Leaves back then.”","Mr. Wu recalled the past, and his voice was a little melodious. “I was in charge, but for some reason, no one knows that I was in charge of the restoration of Autumn Leaves. There were some parts that I really didn’t have the confidence to restore. After all, it’s an extremely precious incomplete scroll. I didn’t dare to rashly do anything. In the end, it was restored by a 15-year-old girl. That young lady was beautiful and even gave herself a name. What’s her name... Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor?”","Gu Zheng could not help but laugh.","“By the way, where’s that child recently? Why haven’t we heard from her?” Mr. Wu asked.","!!","When Gu Zheng thought of Qiao Xi’s shy and embarrassed expression, his heart was filled with joy. He smiled and replied, “Perhaps she’s embarrassed.”","It seemed that the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor wouldn’t be able to hide anymore!","On the other hand, when Qiao Xi walked into the crowd, she heard everyone discussing.","“I heard that a few years ago, Miss He bought an ancient book that was seriously damaged at an exhibition. After it was repaired, it was placed in Chairman He’s study. I saw it the last time I visited. At that time, I should have guessed that Miss He was the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor!”","“I heard that Miss He even published a paper on cultural relic restoration when she was overseas. At that time, it was widely praised. I didn’t expect such a young woman to like cultural relic restoration and be quite knowledgeable about it. Who else could the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor be if not her?”","“My servant is a relative of a servant from the Ling family. I heard that Miss He likes to repair those paintings and calligraphy works in the study when she has time. As servants, they didn’t know what restoration was. Only now do they know that Miss He has been studying those things since she was in her teens.”","“Sigh! Why didn’t I realize it earlier?! Miss He is actually the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor!”","Everyone said regretfully. The Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor they had been looking for all these years had been by their side.","At this moment, a large number of people on the internet had also started to help He Wenxian prove her identity. Many details could prove that He Wenxian was the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. However, the more anxious one was to prove something, the more guilty one looked.","Qiao Xi grunted coldly. From the moment the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor’s name appeared, He Wenxian had started planning to make everyone believe that she was the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. Her perseverance was really praiseworthy.","He Wenxian’s plan seemed flawless, and even Qiao Xi could not find any fault with it. It seemed that it would not be easy to prove her identity!","Now that He Wenxian had already done her best to win people’s hearts, she had gained a good first impression. However, since she was a cultural relic restorer, she had to have skills. He Wenxian stole the restored ancient painting to prove her ability to everyone, but this alone was not enough.","At this moment, the documentary’s camera team looked for He Wenxian. They hoped that she could explain the restoration process in front of the camera.","He Wenxian had already thought of this process. She had long memorized the restoration steps and explained them generously in front of the camera.","At this moment, everyone’s eyes were on her as if she was a dazzling star.","He Wenxian raised her head arrogantly and scanned everyone’s expressions. They were filled with admiration and envy. It turned out that the feeling of being respected was so wonderful.","She had been preparing for five years for this moment. She kept perfecting every detail and thought of all the possible situations in advance. Thus, she could calmly deal with whatever happened at the event venue today.","However...","Qiao Xi quietly listened to her story and sneered.","Just now, Old Master Li also said that her restoration method was different from others, while what He Wenxian said was a normal restoration method. Her words could indeed deceive some people, but not Twilight and Old Master Li.","Speaking of which, Twilight was also coming to this event. Would he expose He Wenxian?","After He Wenxian finished speaking, she smiled gently at the camera. “That’s my restoration method. If I did something wrong, I ask for your guidance.”","As soon as she finished speaking, the entire hall erupted in deafening applause.","At this moment, He Wenxian was extremely proud. Her gaze swept through the crowd before finally landing on Qiao Xi.","Right, she had almost forgotten about Qiao Xi!"]},{"number":1411,"title":"Chapter 1411 I’m Not Doubting, I’m Confirming","paragraphs":["1411 I’m Not Doubting, I’m Confirming","He Wenxian suddenly recalled that Qiao Xi had said that she was interested in the restoration of cultural relics too, but that was just her hobby. She was not a professional at all.","During this period of time, He Wenxian always remembered He Weinian’s instructions. She had to be a generous, tolerant, and magnanimous lady. Most importantly, she could not offend Qiao Xi.","However, everyone’s adoring gazes and praises made her gradually lose her mind. She forgot about He Weinian’s reminder.","She stared at Qiao Xi with a burning gaze and said uncontrollably, “Xi Xi.”","!!","Everyone followed her gaze and looked over. Qiao Xi stood at the back and slowly raised her eyes to meet He Wenxian’s eyes.","He Wenxian smiled gently. “Xi Xi, I remember you saying that you’re very interested in the restoration of cultural relics. Many experts are here today. You can look for me or your seniors to ask for guidance.”","Qiao Xi quietly looked at her and suddenly sneered. “I do have something to ask you, Miss He.”","The camera was pointed at He Wenxian and Qiao Xi. He Wenxian’s gaze was gentle, and her voice carried a trace of affection. “Ask away, Xi Xi.”","The next second, everyone heard Qiao Xi ask word by word, “Miss He, are you sure you restored this painting?”","Boom!!!","As soon as these words were spoken, the surroundings were in an uproar.","Why would this lady ask such a question? This painting was brought by Miss He, so she was naturally the one who restored it. Moreover, how many other people in the world could have such superb restoration skills?","He Wenxian’s heart trembled, but her expression did not change. She pretended to be puzzled and said aggrievedly, “Xi Xi, you... Why did you say that? Of course, I’m the one who restored this painting!”","The angry gazes of everyone descended on Qiao Xi.","Before Qiao Xi could speak, He Wenxian frowned. Her voice was gentle but carried a trace of hurt. “Xi Xi, you said that you’re interested in the restoration of cultural relics, so I brought you in. Why did you say that in front of everyone?”","Only then did everyone understand that this lady did not even have an invitation. It was Miss He who invited her in. Not only did she not appreciate it, but she even questioned Miss He in public.","He Wenxian lowered her eyes sadly and smiled bitterly. “Xi Xi, they can all suspect me, but why are you doing this to me? I originally wanted to bring you to meet the other experts as soon as the event ended. If you’re really interested in this field, I could recommend you to learn from them, but you...”","“This woman is really heartless!” Someone had already opened their mouth to criticize.","Qiao Xi looked at the aggrieved and hurt He Wenxian with a disdainful expression.","He Weinian had spent a lot of effort to help He Wenxian create the image of the elegant and gentle eldest daughter of the He family. Little did he know that He Wenxian was not such a person. She was clearly a little b*tch who liked to pretend to be pitiful. It would be more appropriate if he had asked her to play the role of Guan Hui. If he insisted on her playing the role of an extraordinary eldest daughter, she would be exposed sooner or later.","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent as she raised her eyebrows. “Miss He, it’s not that I suspect you, but I’m sure that you didn’t restore this painting because...”","She paused for a moment, then said with a smile, “Because the person who bought this painting at the exhibition two years ago was me!”","He Wenxian’s face instantly turned pale. Her ears buzzed as she widened her eyes in shock.","What? Qiao Xi bought this painting?","Everyone heard Qiao Xi’s words clearly, and the hall instantly exploded.","“How is that possible? If she was the one who bought this painting, why is this painting in Miss He’s hands now?”","“Could it be that Miss He lied to us?”","Everyone knew that a seriously damaged painting was worthless, so the person who bought this painting definitely wanted to repair it. As for who to look for to repair it, that was up to Qiao Xi to decide. However, since the owner of this painting had come forward to question He Wenxian, then...","Qiao Xi watched helplessly as He Wenxian’s gentle face gradually became ferocious. “Miss He, you can investigate the sales records of the exhibition and see who the buyer of this painting was. I also hope you can give me a reasonable explanation as to why this painting ended up in your hands. When did you obtain this painting and restore it?”","The moment that was said, everyone’s eyes were filled with doubt. The passionate gazes of admiration just now suddenly changed, making He Wenxian panic.","Miss Qiao had said that she could investigate the sales records of the exhibition, which meant that she was confident enough to prove this matter. On the other hand, Miss He did not respond for a long time, making her look a little guilty."]},{"number":1412,"title":"Chapter 1412 Aren’t You Guilty?","paragraphs":["1412 Aren’t You Guilty?","He Wenxian’s head was heavy, and the voices around her became muffled.","How could Qiao Xi be the buyer of this painting? Wasn’t this painting repaired by the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor? Could it be that Qiao Xi knew the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor?","Moreover, why did Qiao Xi buy an ancient painting that was so badly damaged? This was not a famous painting to begin with. It was utterly worthless. If one wanted to buy it, it was most likely to have it restored...","Wait! A realization suddenly surged into He Wenxian’s heart. She widened her eyes, which were filled with disbelief. Gradually, a layer of panic appeared on her face.","Could it be that... Qiao Xi was the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor?","After they obtained the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor’s address, they originally wanted to kill that woman to avoid future trouble. However, after waiting for a few days, the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor never appeared.","He Wenxian was enlightened. Her body trembled violently. Panic, unwillingness, and fear were almost corroding her.","Qiao Xi was actually the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor!","No, no!","No one could prove it yet. Who would believe Qiao Xi’s words? She had to calm down now and not let others notice anything amiss. As long as she refused to admit it, Qiao Xi would be helpless.","He Wenxian calmed down for a while and bit her lip. She looked at Qiao Xi with sorrow in her eyes as if she had suffered a great grievance. “Xi Xi, I’ve always treated you as a friend. Why are you doing this to me...”","“Miss He, even if we’re friends, we have to tell the truth!” Qiao Xi looked at her with a smile and said casually, “I bought this painting from the exhibition. Now that it’s in your hands, I just want to ask why you became the person who restored the painting. Is there anything wrong with that? I haven’t even questioned you about stealing my painting, yet you’re already feeling aggrieved. Can’t I ask why I lost my belongings?”","He Wenxian’s expression froze as everyone looked at her.","Miss Qiao was right! She just wanted to ask why her painting was in He Wenxian’s hands. Whether He Wenxian was the real restorer or not, Miss Qiao was the real owner of this painting!","Miss Qiao had yet to question her for being a thief, but He Wenxian looked aggrieved. If she had any difficulties, she could just voice them. Wouldn’t avoiding the main point make her guilty?","He Wenxian pursed her lips tightly and cursed Qiao Xi in her heart. She had underestimated Qiao Xi. She did not expect that Qiao Xi could actually turn the situation around with just a few words.","She was stunned on the spot, her mind blank. For a moment, she did not know how to explain herself.","The way everyone looked at her became more and more subtle. They were all filled with doubts.","“Let me explain it for Wenxian.” A gentle voice suddenly sounded from not far away. He Weinian walked over from the crowd with a gentle expression, but his gaze swept toward Qiao Xi with dense killing intent.","He walked to He Wenxian’s side and stood still as he looked at Qiao Xi in confusion. “Miss Qiao, Wenxian really didn’t know who the owner of this painting was. She didn’t consider it carefully. I’ll apologize on Wenxian’s behalf, but...”","Qiao Xi’s gaze turned gloomy. She was very clearly aware that He Weinian was not easy to deal with.","The next second, a trace of mockery flashed past He Weinian’s eyes. “But someone asked Wenxian to help restore this painting. As a professional cultural relic restorer, she’s only in charge of restoring this painting and not investigating who the owner of this painting is. However, you questioned her in public and embarrassed her. Isn’t this a little too much?”","He Weinian’s tone was gentle, and there was a loving smile on his face, but the words he said were cold.","When everyone heard this, their attitudes changed. Someone immediately stood on He Weinian’s side. “Chairman He is right! Miss Qiao lost the painting in a moment of carelessness. How can she blame Miss He?”","“Miss He is a cultural relic restorer. She’s only in charge of restoring cultural relics. She doesn’t have time to care so much! Miss He, you’re innocent!”","He Weinian’s expression softened a little. “Someone looked for Wenxian and asked her to restore this painting last year. The other party is very mysterious and has never appeared. They’ve been in contact with Wenxian online. Moreover, because it’s been too long, those chat records no longer exist. If we had known earlier, Wenxian would have kept the evidence. That way, she wouldn’t be suspected.”","Most people believed He Weinian’s explanation. After all, he was a famous philanthropist. How could he lie?","“Could it be that Miss Qiao deliberately got Miss He to restore it and pretended not to know? She wants to frame Miss He for stealing the painting and pretending to be the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor!”","He Weinian’s eyes narrowed slightly. At this moment, he was already sure that Qiao Xi was the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. However, Wenxian could not be exposed no matter what, so he could only offend Qiao Xi."]},{"number":1413,"title":"Chapter 1413 Elegant And Noble Man","paragraphs":["1413 Elegant And Noble Man","He Weinian was silent for a moment. There was a trace of coldness in the corners of his eyes, but he said gently, “Miss Qiao, someone else asked Wenxian to restore this painting. Everyone in our He family can prove it. I wonder... how did Wenxian offend you? Why are you targeting her? Could it be because of... Gu Zheng?”","He Weinian’s laughter carried a trace of mockery. “Miss Qiao, don’t worry. Wenxian and Ah Zheng are just friends.”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. He Weinian was indeed an old fox. With just a few words, he made her look like a jealous woman. Everyone thought that she was jealous that He Wenxian and Gu Zheng were childhood sweethearts, so she targeted He Wenxian.","She did not care about everyone’s gazes and just smiled indifferently. “Miss He, are you unwilling to admit it?”","He Wenxian’s eyes were filled with sorrow as she bit her lip. “Xi Xi...”","“Chairman He.” Qiao Xi’s sharp gaze landed on He Weinian. “Since I was able to say this in public, it means that I’m sure that Miss He isn’t the one who restored this painting.”","He Weinian said unhurriedly, “Then who do you think restored this painting, Miss Qiao?”","“Me.” Qiao Xi’s voice was cold. As soon as this answer was uttered, the entire venue instantly fell silent.","He Wenxian’s expression stiffened, and her face gradually turned pale. She had indeed guessed Qiao Xi’s identity, but when Qiao Xi said it in public, she was still unable to accept it.","A trace of panic flashed through He Weinian’s eyes. He originally did not want to fall out with Qiao Xi, but now that Qiao Xi had said it in public, he could only offend her.","The Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor... had to be Wenxian!","He Wenxian stood on the spot, her mind in a mess. Actually, this was not the first time she had snatched someone else’s identity. However, those people were either already dead or did not dare to retort because of the He family’s power. However, Qiao Xi had Gu Zheng’s back, so she naturally had the guts to stand up and resist.","He Wenxian lowered her eyes and pondered for a moment. She smiled helplessly. “Xi Xi, stop fooling around. Everyone knows that I’m the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. Even if you don’t like me, you can’t spout nonsense!”","Qiao Xi looked at her coldly. “Since you said that you’re the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, then show me the evidence.”","He Wenxian was flustered. She knew that Qiao Xi had a record of the exhibition, so she was confident in questioning her in public. However, as for the evidence in her hands...","She hesitated for a few seconds before saying, “The official invitation letter is evidence. Xi Xi, you said that you’re the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, so why is the invitation in my hands?”","Qiao Xi retorted without the slightest hesitation, “With the He family’s current power, isn’t it very easy to intercept an invitation? Miss He, you said that you’re the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor and that I’m deliberately slandering you, but you can’t produce any evidence. Since we’re both saying conflicting things, why don’t we compete?”","He Wenxian’s face was pale, and she gradually lost control of her expression. Her tone also became irritable. “Why should I compete with you? I know you don’t like me just because Ah Zheng and I are childhood sweethearts, but we’re just friends. If you say that I’m not the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, then show me the evidence! You’re slandering me with empty words. Miss Qiao, aren’t you bullying me right now?”","He Weinian’s expression was also a little gloomy. “Miss Qiao, even if you’re Ah Zheng’s wife, you can’t bully Wenxian like this. No matter how bad our He family is, we’re still a rich family. How can I allow you to slander my daughter like this?”","The surrounding crowd echoed, “That’s right! Miss Qiao, you’re deliberately targeting Miss He. It’s about time. Don’t affect the progress of the event.”","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression. He Wenxian was quite good at winning over people’s hearts. It had only been a short while, yet she had already obtained a large number of fans. There was no need for He Wenxian to speak up for her.","Just as Qiao Xi was about to counterattack, the surroundings suddenly fell silent. The dense crowd suddenly made way. They saw a tall figure who was standing at the door with the light against him.","The man was wearing a black windbreaker. He was tall and well-proportioned. He wore a black mask, revealing only his long eyes and thin lips. He exuded an elegant and noble aura.","Everyone looked at each other. They had a feeling that this person’s identity was not ordinary, but they had never seen him before. What was even more shocking was that the few veteran cultural relic experts present all went forward to greet him warmly.","When one of the reporters saw who it was, his eyes instantly lit up as he exclaimed, “Mr. Twilight is here!”","Boom!!!","These words were like a huge rock that smashed into everyone’s hearts. They all looked at the man.","His long and sharp eyes swept across the crowd. His eyes were calm, but they were hidden with stars, making one inadvertently indulge in them."]},{"number":1414,"title":"Chapter 1414 Miss He, Your Brain Works In Strange Ways","paragraphs":["1414 Miss He, Your Brain Works In Strange Ways","The hall was very quiet, and everyone’s eyes were filled with amazement.","It turned out that he was Twilight, a genius who occupied the top positions in the cultural relics and perfume industry! He was the mysterious idol in everyone’s hearts!","Before this, most people had never seen Twilight. This gentleman had always been very mysterious and rarely participated in these events. Unexpectedly, he came this time. At this moment, everyone was attracted by his appearance and did not pay attention to what had just happened.","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly as she stared at the man in front of her. His appearance just happened to interrupt her confrontation with He Wenxian. It was too much of a coincidence.","She looked at the man in a daze, finding him inexplicably familiar. Her gaze gradually became wanton.","The man seemed to have noticed something and raised his eyes slightly to meet her gaze. His deep eyes were like a bottomless pool. Because he was a little far away, Qiao Xi was unable to see his expression, but Gu Zheng’s appearance appeared in her mind.","This man was similar to Gu Zheng!","Before Qiao Xi could think it through, the person at the side began to introduce, “Mr. Twilight, the person in front of you is the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor you praised previously, Miss He Wenxian.”","Twilight looked at He Wenxian. Her light brown eyes looked very mysterious. He Wenxian’s heart thumped as the corners of her mouth curled up proudly. The moment Twilight appeared, she suddenly felt confident. The seniors in the cultural relic restoration world would not allow an outsider to slander the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor.","He Wenxian smiled and walked forward, extending her hand warmly. “Mr. Twilight, it’s a pleasure to meet you.”","The man stood where he was with an indifferent expression. He did not reach out. Time gradually passed, and the surroundings fell silent.","He Wenxian’s hand froze in midair, and the smile on her face gradually stiffened. After maintaining this posture for more than ten seconds, the senior beside her hurriedly reminded, “Mr. Twilight.”","They remembered that Mr. Twilight had said that he liked the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor’s restoration methods very much. Moreover, she was a girl, so he had to show her some respect. How could Mr. Twilight ignore Miss He’s offer to shake his hand?","Hearing that senior’s voice, Twilight gradually looked up and said, “Miss He.”","Twilight’s voice was not like Gu Zheng’s. His voice was cold as he asked word by word, “Didn’t someone already question your identity?”","He Wenxian’s face was pale. She gritted her teeth and retracted her stiff hand.","An expert beside her immediately stood up. “Mr. Twilight, Miss He is the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. Miss Qiao slandered Miss He in public because of a personal grudge.”","“Miss He has been involved in various cultural relic restoration activities since five years ago and even published relevant papers. Many people can confirm that Miss He is very hardworking in cultural relic restoration. On the other hand, Miss Qiao is unknown, but she claims to be the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. How laughable!”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. In order to consolidate her identity, He Wenxian must have spent a lot of money to win people’s hearts. However, this was not strange. The He family had plundered a lot of donations behind the scenes, so it was easy to bribe a few greedy ‘scholars.’","He Wenxian squeezed out a smile and said aggrievedly, “Mr. Twilight, I really didn’t buy this painting. Someone asked me to help restore it, but Xi Xi said that she never found anyone to restore it. She accused me of pretending to be the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor and even asked me to produce evidence.”","Twilight nodded, indicating that he heard her.","He Wenxian’s eyes were filled with pride. She thought that Twilight would speak up for her, but the next second, Twilight said casually, “Miss He, are you saying that in order to scheme against you, Miss Qiao bought that painting at the exhibition two years ago and deliberately sent it to you to have it restored? Miss He, your brain works in strange ways!”","The blood drained from He Wenxian’s face.","Everyone widened their eyes. They could all hear the mockery in Mr. Twilight’s words. In that case, did he also suspect He Wenxian?","Logically speaking, Miss Qiao had not married Gu Zheng two years ago and did not know He Wenxian. How could she have set up a trap for Miss He?","Qiao Xi looked at this man in a daze, and the familiar feeling grew stronger and stronger.","He Wenxian’s voice was difficult. “Mr. Twilight, that’s not what I meant. This matter is indeed a little coincidental, but I don’t admit Xi Xi’s accusations. I...”","“Since you and Miss Qiao can’t produce any evidence, why don’t you two compete?” Twilight’s thin lips curled up. “If Miss He is really the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, you naturally won’t refuse. I also want to see if the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor’s restoration technique is as outstanding as the rumors say.”"]},{"number":1415,"title":"Chapter 1415 These Eyes Are Too Like His","paragraphs":["1415 These Eyes Are Too Like His","He Wenxian’s blood froze.","Did Twilight know Qiao Xi? Why was he helping Qiao Xi as soon as he appeared?","Expert Yu was also here with Twilight, and he was the organizer of this meeting. When he heard that the two of them were going to compete, he looked excited.","Both women said that they were the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, so one of them must be telling the truth. Since they were going to compete, they could see the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor’s restoration technique with their own eyes. This trip was not in vain.","Expert Yu immediately echoed, “Alright! Mr. Twilight is right. It’s settled, then. I don’t think Miss He will object!”","Everyone present also wanted to see the Thousand FacesImmortal Doctor’s restoration technique. Seeing that the expert had spoken, everyone joined in.","He Wenxian’s body stiffened as sweat trickled down her forehead. At this moment, she felt as if she was standing on the edge of a cliff with a group of pursuers behind her. She was in a dilemma.","Expert Yu and Twilight both said that this competition had to be held, but fortunately, the competition was set for tomorrow. He Wenxian still had some time to prepare. If she rejected the competition now, she would definitely be suspected by everyone.","After a moment of silence, He Wenxian calmed down and said with a bitter smile, “Xi Xi, I don’t understand why you’re doing this. Since you insist on competing, then let’s rely on our own abilities. The truth will be revealed tomorrow.”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up as her beautiful eyes glistened. “Alright! I hope you won’t play tricks behind my back, Miss He. If others find out, the image that you’ve painstakingly maintained for so many years will be ruined!”","“Xi Xi, I’ve always treated you with sincerity. I was the one who invited you to enter the venue, but you...” He Wenxian lowered her head. “Now that things have come to this, I don’t want to argue with you anymore. Just pretend that I was wrong and made the wrong friend.”","Qiao Xi had a disdainful expression as she turned around and left coldly.","When she turned around, He Wenxian’s expression instantly turned vicious. He Weinian walked to her side and patted her shoulder. He lowered his voice and said, “Don’t worry, she won’t participate in the competition tomorrow.”","He Wenxian said in exasperation, “Who exactly is Twilight? He’s actually speaking up for Qiao Xi! She’s already so arrogant, so how could she not participate in the competition?”","“There are many reasons why she can’t participate in the competition. For example...” He Weinian sneered. “For example, her hand is crippled.”","He Wenxian gasped.","He Weinian chuckled. “Interesting! I didn’t expect her to be the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. She hid it well. No wonder we didn’t see her when we went to the rented house.”","Qiao Xi was very useful to the He family, so they could not kill her for the time being. However, they could cripple one of her hands.","This time, he wanted to teach Qiao Xi a painful lesson and let her know what the consequences of becoming enemies with the He family were!","At this moment, Qiao Xi had already left the hall. She had just walked to the corridor of the lounge when she bumped into someone. A tall man was standing in the long and narrow corridor. When he heard footsteps behind him, he slowly turned around.","He was wearing a black mask, and his eyes were long and cold. His voice was a little unfamiliar. “Miss Qiao.”","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled as she looked straight into his eyes. His light brown eyes were suffused with a trace of light under the illumination of the lights. These eyes were really too similar, but this person’s aura was different from Gu Zheng’s.","She smiled at him and took a few steps forward to maintain a normal social distance. “Mr. Twilight, thank you so much for just now.”","“Mhm.” The man lowered his eyes, his long eyelashes casting a shadow on his eyelids. He took a few steps forward without a trace, and his voice was as elegant as a low cello. “I know you’re the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes in surprise.","The man looked away and said calmly, “I participated in the restoration of Autumn Leaves.”","Qiao Xi instantly reacted. Back then, she relied on that incomplete scroll to become famous in the cultural relic restoration world. At that time, she was not even 15 years old. After she got to know Kang Jichuan, she had long forgotten about the restoration of cultural relics. As for who restored that incomplete scroll with her back then, she did not remember at all.","Qiao Xi looked at the man in front of her without hiding anything and chuckled. “I’m very curious why you’re wearing a mask. Are you ashamed of something?”","“Yes, I don’t look good,” Twilight replied indifferently.","Qiao Xi found it funny, and her tone carried a trace of ridicule. “Why do I feel that you’re very good-looking?”"]},{"number":1416,"title":"Chapter 1416 Sharing The President’s Concern","paragraphs":["1416 Sharing The President’s Concern","“I was injured and disfigured a few years ago. I wear a mask because I’m afraid of scaring others,” the man explained as he looked at Qiao Xi with curved eyes.","Injured and disfigured?","Qiao Xi kept having the feeling that something was wrong. This person was too similar to Gu Zheng. Could it be that Gu Zheng was Twilight?","Qiao Xi stared at him with a burning gaze for a while, then looked away and said indifferently, “I’m sorry for being presumptuous. Mr. Twilight, I’ll get going first.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi entered the lounge without waiting for Twilight’s response.","After entering, Qiao Xi was still filled with doubt. Was he really not Gu Zheng? However, this person’s figure and eyes were very similar to Gu Zheng’s. She had been married to Gu Zheng for so long, so how could she not even recognize her husband?","However...","What Qiao Xi did not know was that after she entered the lounge, Twilight took off his mask, and the corners of his mouth curled into a meaningful smile.","A moment later, Gu Zheng pushed the door open and entered. He was still wearing the navy blue suit, and his eyes were gentle with a trace of affection. “Xi Xi, I heard that you’re competing with He Wenxian tomorrow?”","Qiao Xi nestled on the sofa and sized up Gu Zheng with a wanton gaze. She casually pouted aggrievedly. “Ah Zheng, you weren’t by my side just now. The He family joined forces to bully me. Where did you go?”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and replied indifferently, “I happened to meet an acquaintance, so we chatted for a while.”","Acquaintance? Did Gu Zheng know anyone here? Why did she feel that Gu Zheng was lying to her?","She raised an eyebrow. “Oh? Which acquaintance? Have I seen them before?”","“Song Zhen, Song Shiyu and Song Shijing’s uncle,” Gu Zheng replied frankly.","Qiao Xi immediately thought for a moment. It seemed that there really was such a person. Moreover, he was a professional in the cultural relics restoration department, so his position was quite high.","However, if Gu Zheng wanted to hide it from her, she would not be able to get anything out of him even if she asked Song Zhen. After all, he was Song Shiyu’s uncle!","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to glance at him and went straight to the point. “Have you heard of Twilight? I think he’s very similar to you, especially his eyes. You both have light brown eyes.”","Gu Zheng quietly took a sip of tea, then looked at her with a smile. “So, Xi Xi, you think I’m Twilight?”","Qiao Xi neither agreed nor disagreed.","“I’m not that powerful.” His voice was gentle, and his laughter was pleasant. “If you don’t believe me, you can check the surveillance cameras. Just now, Song Zhen and I went to his office to chat for 20 minutes. Moreover, there are surveillance cameras in his office. With your methods, it shouldn’t be difficult to check the surveillance cameras.","“It’s easy for you to investigate me. Why would I dare to lie to you?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","She actually had nothing to say. Seeing how confident Gu Zheng was, even if she investigated, she would not be able to find anything. Hence, there was no need.","However, Twilight...","He was wearing a black windbreaker. His figure and eyes were so similar to Gu Zheng’s. Even the expression on his face was exactly the same. Could it be that she had really made a mistake?","Qiao Xi thought for a moment before getting up to go to the surveillance room.","“Young Madam, the president was really with my uncle just now. They just chatted for a while. His feelings for you can be seen by the sun and moon. He definitely won’t do anything to let you down!” Song Shiyu explained in a panic.","Qiao Xi pulled up the surveillance footage from earlier. Gu Zheng had indeed entered the lounge with Song Zhen. If Gu Zheng really wanted to pretend to be Twilight, he had to quickly change his clothes and rush to the scene. Moreover, he needed Song Zhen to cover for him. Time seemed to be a little short.","However, Qiao Xi did not understand why Gu Zheng was hiding the fact that he was Twilight. In any case, she was already starting to suspect something. Why not just tell her? Why was he hiding it?","Qiao Xi looked at Song Shiyu seriously. “Have you seen Twilight?”","Song Shijing was about to answer when he was interrupted by Qiao Xi. “I’m not asking you. I want Song Shiyu to answer.”","Song Shijing was calm and meticulous. There was no point in asking him, so Qiao Xi started with Song Shiyu.","Seeing that Qiao Xi was so serious, Song Shijing did not dare to say anything. He could only blink at Song Shiyu, signaling him not to spout nonsense.","Song Shiyu immediately understood, but he felt inexplicably flustered. Of course, he knew the president’s identity and knew that the president wanted to hide it from Young Madam. As the president’s personal assistant, he had to share the president’s worries and let the president know his loyalty. Perhaps the president would even give him a raise!","In order not to arouse suspicion and take this opportunity to vent his dissatisfaction, Song Shiyu immediately understood and complained loudly, “Of course, I’ve seen him before. Twilight is a petty person. He’s ugly and has a bad character. He even looks down on others and is as proud as a peacock!”"]},{"number":1417,"title":"Chapter 1417 He’s Imitating Gu Zheng","paragraphs":["1417 He’s Imitating Gu Zheng","Hearing Song Shiyu’s words, Song Shijing was speechless.","Qiao Xi was stunned for a few seconds before asking again, “Huh? I think Twilight is alright. He’s not really like what you said, right?”","Afraid that Qiao Xi would suspect something, Song Shiyu continued to attack. “Young Madam, that’s because you didn’t see his true colors for yourself. People like him are the best at pretending. Don’t interact with him at all costs. He’s not a good person! He’s even disfigured. He wears a mask all day and imitates our president to attract attention.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly as she asked in surprise, “Imitate Gu Zheng?”","!!","Song Shiyu said without hesitation, “Yes! He likes to imitate the president and make others think that he’s as handsome as the president. How shameless!”","Qiao Xi seemed to not believe him: “...”","If Gu Zheng was really Twilight, Song Shiyu would probably die after this!","Song Shiyu was as timid as a mouse. How dare he scold Gu Zheng like this?","Perhaps she was thinking too much.","At this moment, Gu Zheng was standing outside the surveillance room. Hearing Song Shiyu’s complaints, the corners of his mouth twitched.","Song Shiyu had to admit that he had learned his lesson. He found a good opportunity to scold the president behind his back without being punished.","Song Shiyu glanced at the president outside the door from the corner of his eye. Seeing that he was calm, he was relieved and said more naturally, “Young Madam, do you know who Twilight is now? You have to stay away from him in the future to avoid being schemed against by him.”","In that case, Young Madam would not suspect the president’s identity anymore!","Song Shiyu smiled in satisfaction. He could finally scold the president without worrying about the consequences.","Qiao Xi looked up into Song Shiyu’s eyes and realized that he was not guilty or nervous at all. He did not look like he was lying!","She pondered for a moment and shook her head. She was not in the mood to think about such things. It did not matter who Twilight was now.","At this moment, Gu Zheng walked in. Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at him and smiled lightly. “Ah Zheng, don’t you think the name Twilight is quite strange? A young man with such a name is inferior to the name I came up with—Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor!”","“Yes, of course. He’s inferior to Xi Xi.” Gu Zheng smiled dotingly, his eyes unchanged.","At this moment, in the hall outside, everyone was discussing the real and fake Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. The circle for the restoration of cultural relics was too small, and small matters could instantly spread, but this matter had not spread to the outside world.","At this moment, the forum for the restoration of cultural relics had also exploded. More people supported He Wenxian, but there were also people who knew that Qiao Xi was Gu Shan. Thus, they said that it was unnecessary for Qiao Xi to lie. They maintained their rationality and waited for the final outcome.","[Qiao Xi knows how to design clothes and jewelry, and she also knows how to compose. She’s indeed very talented, but does this definitely mean that she’s the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor? Cultural relic restoration can’t be confused with other industries!]","[To be honest, I admire Qiao Xi very much, but restoring cultural relics requires a lot of patience. She usually spends so much time on fashion design, so how could she have time to study other things?]","[We’ll see who’s real and who’s fake tomorrow. With God Twilight around, there definitely won’t be any shady dealings!]","[I heard that the cultural relic restoration expert, Mr. Wu, will be at the scene tomorrow. With Mr. Wu and Twilight around, we’ll definitely be able to confirm who the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor is!]","[I keep having the feeling that He Wenxian is more like someone who has the patience to repair cultural relics. Qiao Xi’s face is more like a movie star’s, not a person who focuses on research.]","[I think so too! Why do you think Qiao Xi dares to challenge He Wenxian in public? She doesn’t even have an invitation. She only managed to enter because of He Wenxian’s reputation. How could she be the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor? Won’t she be exposed after the competition tomorrow? She’ll lose all her dignity!]","[Could it be that she was just being rash today and won’t participate in the competition tomorrow? Some people just like to cause trouble. They think it’s fine as long as they’re famous, regardless of whether their reputation is good or bad.]","Just as everyone was discussing fervently online, a thread appeared in everyone’s vision.","[There are a hundred ways for Miss Qiao to refuse to attend the competition.]","Those who paid attention to this matter were all university students or hobbyists who majored in cultural relic restoration. When everyone saw this title, they clicked on it.","The original poster said that they were a university student who hated Qiao Xi’s actions. Qiao Xi clearly used He Wenxian’s name to enter, but she bit back and questioned He Wenxian’s identity.","The university student first expressed their opinion, then began to mock Qiao Xi’s behavior."]},{"number":1418,"title":"Chapter 1418 She’s Lying Again","paragraphs":["1418 She’s Lying Again","[What excuse do you think Miss Qiao will use to refuse to attend the competition?] The poster first raised a question, then began to express their opinion.","[Miss Qiao might say that she was injured. For example, she accidentally cut her hand while cooking or got into a car accident. The most important thing about restoring cultural relics is the details. If her hand is injured, she naturally won’t be able to participate in the competition. This way, the competition tomorrow can only be canceled. That way, we still can’t be sure who the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor is. Stalling for time is the best way.]","When this person posted that, everyone instantly understood.","[OP is right! There are many ways to refuse to attend the competition. As long as her hand is injured, she’ll have an excuse not to participate in the competition. She can also continue to say that she’s the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor.]","!!","[Oh my God! Qiao Xi is too shameless!]","[OP has long guessed Qiao Xi’s methods and reminded us first. I want to see what excuse she’ll use tomorrow. If she really gets into a car accident, that’ll be too funny!]","[He Wenxian is so innocent! How can she be blamed by such a person?!]","The discussion online was extremely lively. Everyone wanted to see if Qiao Xi would participate in this competition.","...","In Y Nation.","Kang Jichuan’s expression changed when he saw the news online.","He did not know He Wenxian well, but he knew very well that Qiao Xi was the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor.","Why were these people scolding Qiao Xi? If she wasn’t confident, why would she question He Wenxian in public in the first place?","Kang Jichuan’s expression was gloomy. No matter what, Qiao Xi was his younger sister. He naturally could not stand others bullying his younger sister.","At this moment, the doctor knocked on the door and walked in. “Mr. Kang, Miss Kang’s condition has stabilized. She’ll be fine for the time being.”","Kang Jichuan nodded. “If I leave Y Nation for the time being, will it affect her?”","“It’s best if Miss Kang has her family by her side. If you need to go out, you can bring Miss Kang along and let her go out for a walk. It’ll be better for your body to recover.”","When Kang Jichuan heard this, his brows instantly relaxed.","The sound of gentle footsteps came from the door. Kang Qingzhi appeared at the door. “Brother, where are you going?”","Kang Jichuan’s gaze instantly softened a little. When he saw Kang Qingzhi, he could not help but think of Qiao Xi.","He paused for a moment and replied, “Qingzhi, my father’s biological daughter is in Li City. We...”","Kang Qingzhi smiled sweetly at him, but there was a trace of sorrow in her eyes. Her voice was a little choked, but she still smiled and said, “Go ahead. I’m fine, Brother.”","Kang Jichuan looked at her pale face and stroked her hair. He said softly, “Qingzhi, she’s in trouble in Li City. I have to go over and help her. The doctor said that your condition has stabilized. Do you want to come with me?”","“Trouble?” Kang Qingzhi looked at her curiously, then at the lit computer screen. She said casually, “He Wenxian?”","“Qingzhi, you know her?” Kang Jichuan was a little surprised.","Kang Qingzhi nodded. Her voice was sweet and carried a trace of innocence. “I’ve long heard of He Wenxian. She’s very famous overseas. I heard that she’s very capable and likes to do some research.”","A trace of doubt arose in Kang Jichuan’s heart. Could it be that Xi Xi had lied to him?","After he reunited with Xi Xi, he realized that she had a bad habit of lying. She always bullied Qingzhi but refused to admit it. She stole Qingzhi’s things and said that they were hers.","Did she lie again because she wanted to bully Miss He?","After his father went to Li City, he had yet to bring Xi Xi back. Kang Jichuan felt a little uneasy. “I have to go to Li City.”","“Brother, bring me along.” Kang Qingzhi looked at him with anticipation. Her round eyes were covered in a layer of mist, and her small nose was red. “I’ve occupied her identity for so many years. I have to apologize in person.”","“Qingzhi, how can we blame you? We’ve always treated you as family. Even if Xi Xi comes back, you’re still the eldest daughter of the Kang family. It’s just that I’ve been thinking about my wandering sister and am worried. Her return won’t affect you in any way,” Kang Jichuan said.","Kang Qingzhi nodded slightly lonely, then squeezed out a sweet smile. “Brother, don’t worry about me. I’ll get along well with Xi Xi. I’m already very satisfied that I’ve been able to live until now. If I’m not around one day, there should be someone to accompany you and Dad. That way, you won’t be lonely!”","Kang Jichuan’s heart felt as if it had been struck by a heavy object, and he was on the brink of tears."]},{"number":1419,"title":"Chapter 1419 Accident Or Man-Made","paragraphs":["1419 Accident Or Man-Made","When the doctor at the side saw this scene, he had a strange feeling. All these years, he had been in charge of treating Miss Kang. Although Miss Kang’s condition was indeed not too optimistic, she did not have to keep saying such things.","Miss Kang was constantly reminding others that she was a patient and would not live long. Thus, everyone should treat her well. As for the real Miss Kang, she was still very healthy, so she could spend a lot of time with the Kang family in the future. On the other hand, she only had a few years left to live.","All these years, everyone in the Kang family had seen it clearly. Although Miss Kang and the Kang father and son were not related by blood, the Kang father and son doted on her very much, especially Young Master Kang. He wished he could pluck the stars in the sky for her.","The family doctor withdrew his gaze and suddenly felt that the name Qiao Xi was a little familiar as if he had heard it somewhere before.","That day, Kang Qingzhi and Kang Jichuan got on a plane to Li City.","...","The next day.","At 9:40 a.m., reporters, cultural relic restoration experts, and other invited audience members were all present. At this moment, the He family had also arrived, but Qiao Xi was nowhere to be seen.","“The competition is about to start. Why isn’t she here yet?”","“Could it be that she’s afraid?!”","“It’s not time yet, so she’s not late. She might come in a while.”","He Wenxian listened to the discussion, her eyes filled with pride.","They would not let Qiao Xi die. After all, Qiao Xi was still useful, but it was still possible to cripple one of her hands and make her unable to participate in the competition.","Time passed minute by minute. The number of people present seemed to have almost doubled compared to yesterday, and the discussion online became more and more heated.","He Wenxian lowered her voice and asked, “Have you arranged it?”","The assistant behind her replied respectfully, “Don’t worry, Eldest Miss. Everything is ready.”","He Wenxian smiled in satisfaction. She took out her phone to look at the news online and smiled wantonly.","[Qiao Xi is too much! She was the one who said she wanted to compete yesterday, but she hasn’t appeared even after a long time. Everyone is very busy and doesn’t have time to play with her! She’s clearly not the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, yet she insists on occupying someone else’s identity. Why is she so shameless?!]","[She’s just a fashion designer. She really thinks highly of herself! The people who support her are all brainless. They were deceived by her face!]","[He Wenxian is obviously a scholarly person. People who like to do research should be as gentle and generous as He Wenxian.]","[Yesterday, this woman swore to issue a challenge, but she doesn’t dare to appear today. I’m dying of laughter. Yesterday, someone on the internet predicted that Qiao Xi would find an excuse to refuse to attend the competition, such as getting injured in a car accident.]","More and more people were paying attention to this matter. Many people who did not usually pay attention to the restoration of cultural relics also noticed the popularity of this topic online.","He Wenxian glanced around. Qiao Xi was indeed not here yet, but... why was Mr. Twilight not here either?","At Longwan Residential.","Qiao Xi had just walked out of the door when she saw Song Shijing waiting at the door. Seeing her come out, he said hurriedly, “Young Madam, the president has an urgent meeting and has gone out a long time ago. He asked me to send you to the scene.”","“If he’s holding an emergency meeting, why aren’t you with him?” Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows.","“Song Shiyu is attending that meeting, so I can stay and protect you in case the He family has ulterior motives.”","Qiao Xi got into the car, and she was driven all the way to the underground parking lot. Song Shijing got out of the car as well. “Young Madam, I’ll send you up.”","“There’s no need. Go back first and don’t let the He family see you,” Qiao Xi instructed.","Song Shijing was Gu Zheng’s personal assistant and had always been by his side. Now that Song Shijing was here, He Weinian might change his plan at the last minute.","Qiao Xi got out of the car and walked toward the elevator in the parking lot. She had just reached an intersection when she heard the sound of a car speeding over.","The cars that entered the parking lot were all very slow, but this car was extremely fast. Before Qiao Xi could react, the car had already arrived in front of her. Qiao Xi instinctively took a step back.","“Young Madam!” Song Shijing’s voice sounded behind her, but Qiao Xi had already lost the ability to think. No matter how powerful she was, she could not be faster than the car that was speeding over.","Suddenly, a strong arm appeared around her waist and pulled her back. Her body instantly fell into a scorching embrace, and she successfully dodged the approaching car. However, the two of them also fell heavily to the floor due to the strong inertia."]},{"number":1420,"title":"Chapter 1420 Save Her Life","paragraphs":["1420 Save Her Life","Song Shijing immediately called the bodyguards outside to stop the car and ran toward Qiao Xi.","As people would subconsciously support themselves with their hands when they fell, Qiao Xi’s palm was grazed by the ground, and her arm was slightly dislocated. She gritted her teeth in pain and pressed the joint of her arm with her other hand, instantly fixing her dislocated arm.","She groaned. It was so painful that sweat broke out on her forehead. Fortunately, the pain was only momentary and she soon could not feel it anymore.","At this moment, a low and hoarse voice suddenly came from above. “You can fix your arm yourself. Miss Qiao, you’re really different.”","!!","Qiao Xi only cared about the injury on her arm and did not have the time to see who saved her until now. She suddenly raised her eyes and was instantly stunned.","Black mask, long and narrow light brown eyes, and pursed thin lips...","“Twilight?” A trace of doubt flashed past her eyes.","The man’s expensive suit was stained with dust. His wrist was cut, and blood was dripping down. However, he did not care about it as if his hand was not injured. He asked casually, “Who did you offend, Miss Qiao? They actually hired an assassin to kill you.”","Qiao Xi looked at the traces left behind by the tires with a gloomy gaze. “Heh, I really want to know too!”","Song Shijing’s heart jumped. He almost suffocated when he saw what had just happened. Fortunately, the president appeared in time to protect Young Madam. Otherwise, the consequences would have been unimaginable.","“Song Shijing,” Qiao Xi called out his name. “Catch that driver and call the police in half an hour.”","“Yes, Young Madam,” Song Shijing replied respectfully.","Qiao Xi turned to look at the masked man and said softly, “Mr. Twilight, you got injured because you saved me. I’ll be responsible for the medical fees.”","“Alright.” Twilight did not refuse and smiled at her.","Song Shijing brought the first aid kit over immediately and glanced at Twilight subconsciously. Then, he said distantly, “Sir, your wound is bleeding. Do you need to get it bandaged?”","Twilight ignored him and smiled as he looked at Qiao Xi. “Since I was injured because of you, why don’t you help me bandage it?”","Song Shijing understood instantly. He put down the first aid kit and found an excuse to leave.","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes and thought for a moment. After all, Twilight got injured in order to save her. It was reasonable for her to help bandage his wound. Moreover, she had learned medicine from her grandfather for so many years and could be considered half a doctor. She nodded and said, “The ground is too dirty, and there are many germs. I need to help you clean your wound first. It might hurt a little.”","Ten minutes later, Qiao Xi helped him treat his wound, then pulled out a bandage and wrapped it up.","Twilight had protected her in her arms the moment she landed, so her wound was not serious. It was just a light graze, but she specially wrapped it in bandages a few more times. She looked like she was seriously injured.","Twilight looked at her with interest. “Miss Qiao, you don’t have to bandage your wound to this extent.”","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. “Since someone wants me to be injured, I can’t disappoint them!”","Twilight looked at the time. “You’re late.”","“With you around, I believe you can explain it to me. After all, I’m late because I was bandaging your wound. It’s reasonable. Moreover, you have such a high status in the cultural relic restoration world. No one will suspect anything you say.”","Twilight’s long eyes were filled with amusement. “Miss Qiao, you’re so smart. You came up with an excuse so quickly. I like dealing with smart people like you.”","“Someone wants to harm me and doesn’t want me to appear at the competition venue. I can’t just do nothing! Although I look weak, I’m not a pushover.”","Twilight stared at her with a burning gaze and smiled. “I’m looking forward to your next performance, Miss Qiao.”","“Then I’ll have to trouble you to help me, Mr. Twilight,” Qiao Xi replied with a smile.","She had said so much to Twilight because she wanted to take the opportunity to test if Twilight was Gu Zheng. However, time was tight, so she had to make He Wenxian pay the price!","At this moment, it was already half past ten. The venue was slightly noisy. After all, half an hour had passed since the competition, yet Qiao Xi had yet to appear.","The well-educated scholars and experts were already impatient, but the reporters were extremely excited. They hurriedly raised their microphones in front of He Wenxian.","“Miss He, do you think Miss Qiao will appear?”","He Wenxian shook her head. “I don’t know either, but since Xi Xi has agreed, I believe she’ll come.”"]},{"number":1421,"title":"Chapter 1421 The Reason For Being Late","paragraphs":["1421 The Reason For Being Late","Madam He looked gentle on the surface, but her heart was filled with a trace of anger. All these years, everyone in the He family had maintained a gentle and kind image. As the mistress of the He family, she was naturally no exception. However, when she found out that Qiao Xi was questioning her daughter in public, she could not help but be furious.","“Miss Qiao must be afraid, so she doesn’t dare to come.” Madam He sneered, the disdain in her eyes about to overflow. Then, she said fiercely, “She’s clearly jealous of our Wenxian, so—”","When the reporters heard this, they hurriedly asked, “Madam He, quickly tell us what’s going on.”","He Weinian narrowed his eyes. He Wenxian immediately pulled Madam He back and smiled at the reporters in embarrassment. “I’m sorry, my mother is just a little angry. Please don’t mind her.”","He Wenxian’s eyes were filled with disappointment. “I thought that this event would go very smoothly, but I didn’t expect Xi Xi to appear and ruin things. Although I don’t understand why she did this, my mother loves me very much and can’t bear to see me suffer, so she said those words. She didn’t mean anything else.”","Everyone could understand Madam He very well. Seeing her daughter being bullied and accused of ‘stealing someone else’s identity’, Madam He stood up for her daughter. Although she was behaving a little differently from her gentle and kind appearance in the past, it was reasonable.","Seeing that everyone’s expressions were normal, He Weinian’s expression softened a little.","“Qiao Xi was so arrogant yesterday, so why doesn’t she dare to show her face today?”","“It’s because she’s afraid. In front of the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, her restoration technique is just a small trick. She probably doesn’t want to lose her reputation in public, so after thinking about it carefully, she decided not to come.”","Hearing everyone’s discussion, He Wenxian could not help but smile.","After the commotion Qiao Xi caused, everyone’s hearts ached for her even more. Moreover, she could use this opportunity to obtain the attention of everyone in the cultural relic restoration world, including the mysterious Mr. Twilight. This was a good thing for her.","Qiao Xi was probably injured now and would probably not come.","He Wenxian’s eyes flashed with resentment. She did not know how serious Qiao Xi’s injuries were, but it did not matter even if she lost an arm or a leg. As long as she was still breathing, she would still be useful.","Not long after, He Wenxian’s friend, Xu Yuxin, also rushed over. When she heard that Qiao Xi did not dare to appear for a long time, she could not help but laugh loudly.","Xu Yuxin had never seen Qiao Xi before, but she knew that Qiao Xi had snatched away the position of Mrs. Gu. That position originally belonged to He Wenxian, so she hated Qiao Xi from the bottom of her heart. She felt that Qiao Xi was a mistress who interfered in someone else’s relationship.","The reason why He Wenxian wanted to be friends with Xu Yuxin was that this woman was simple-minded and rude. She wanted to use Xu Yuxin’s stupidity to make herself seem kind and gentle.","Xu Yuxin laughed without caring about her image. “Haha! Who does she think she is? How dare she compare herself to you? She must know that you’re the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, so she doesn’t dare to come! I’m dying of laughter!”","He Wenxian frowned slightly and was a little helpless. “It doesn’t matter what she does to me, but everyone came to the event to promote the culture of cultural relic restoration. Because she’s late, everyone has been delayed for so long. I really don’t know what to do.”","The moment that was said, the suppressed anger in everyone’s hearts surged.","Expert Yu, who had a higher status at the scene, stood up and said loudly, “Old Master Wu will be here later. We can’t let him wait with us. I’ll call Miss Qiao first and ask if she’s coming.”","Just as Expert Yu picked up the phone and was about to dial the number, his phone rang first. When the call connected, a cold voice came from the other end. “I’m sorry, Expert Yu. I got into a car accident, so I’m late.”","Expert Yu was stunned at first. He suddenly recalled that someone on the internet had guessed yesterday that Qiao Xi would use the excuse of getting into a car accident to refuse to attend the competition.","Unexpectedly, she...","“Expert Yu, please tell everyone that I was in a car accident.”","“Um... I don’t think anyone will believe me.” Expert Yu sounded very troubled.","Actually, Expert Yu also had some doubts in his heart. How could it be such a coincidence? That was until he heard a low and domineering male voice on the other end of the phone. “Miss Qiao and I got into a car accident together.”","Expert Yu’s eyes widened instantly, and his body suddenly tensed up. He asked anxiously, “Mr. Twilight, how are you doing?”","The man’s voice was still low and cold. “Not too good.”"]},{"number":1422,"title":"Chapter 1422 This Competition Is Meaningless","paragraphs":["1422 This Competition Is Meaningless","Expert Yu’s heart skipped a beat. The next second, he heard the man’s cold voice. “I’m indeed in a bad mood, so those who hurt her are in trouble.”","Hearing the voice on the phone, Expert Yu was a little puzzled. When did they meet? From what Mr. Twilight said, he seemed to care a lot about Miss Qiao?","However, he had long heard that Miss Qiao was married and her husband was the famous president of Gu Corporation. He doted on her very much, and it was impossible for her to get a divorce. Mr. Twilight was crazily testing the waters!","Expert Yu asked softly, “Mr. Twilight, what should I do?”","!!","Twilight narrowed her eyes. Xi Xi was taking the risk to expose the He family’s true colors. Of course, it was also for him.","His voice suddenly became gentler. “I’ll listen to you, Miss Qiao.”","At this moment, Xu Yuxin looked at the time and complained impatiently, “Why isn’t Qiao Xi here yet?! Everyone’s time is very precious. Who has the time to wait for her here?!","“If she’s not coming, she should just say so. How annoying!”","He Wenxian said gently, “Expert Yu has already called to ask. If it’s confirmed that she’s not coming, she won’t waste everyone’s time. If she really likes the identity of the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, I’m willing to give it to her. I...”","“Wenxian! Why should you give it to her? You’re too kind. Others are already bullying you, yet you’re still backing down!” Xu Yuxin interrupted her, then looked at Expert Yu. “How is it? Did Qiao Xi answer the phone? What’s going on with her?”","Expert Yu looked at the commotion and could not help but sigh.","No matter if He Wenxian was the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor or not, he did not like her very much. She clearly knew that Qiao Xi was late, yet she still added fuel to the fire and deliberately said those words to incite public anger.","Previously, Expert Yu had some doubts about Qiao Xi’s identity, but now that he had received a call from Mr. Twilight and knew that he was on Miss Qiao’s side, he was sure that Miss Qiao was the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor.","He looked up at He Wenxian with disdain. Miss Qiao would be able to make a comeback soon.","“Miss Qiao got into a car accident. She’ll...”","Before he could finish, there was a commotion at the venue that interrupted Expert Yu’s words. The people He Wenxian had bribed all stood up and complained, “Are you trying to fool a fool?! Yesterday, someone on the internet predicted the excuses she might use to avoid the competition, but she still dares to say that she got into a car accident!”","A trace of pride flashed past He Wenxian’s eyes.","The person at the side continued to mock, “She made so many scholars and experts wait for her for more than half an hour, but she said on the phone that she was in a car accident and isn’t going to show up. Isn’t this too much?! Wasn’t she very arrogant yesterday? She said that she was the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. Now, she’s afraid. I’ve really never seen such a shameless person!”","“Ugh! I really want to vomit! Yesterday, I thought that she might be the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. I really regret it now! Why was I deceived by her face?!”","“Miss He, please forgive us. We were bewitched by her beauty, so we believed her. I’m really sorry!”","“Actually, there’s no need for this competition to be held. Miss He came to the venue a long time ago, while Qiao Xi didn’t dare to appear at all. This proves everything. Miss He is undoubtedly a genius!”","He Wenxian smiled gently at everyone. She was generous, elegant, and calm.","Most of the people present were cursing Qiao Xi for not keeping her word and maligning a good person. However, there were also some people who still felt that Qiao Xi might have really gotten into a car accident. Even so, under the excited and angry atmosphere, they did not dare to say anything to defend Qiao Xi and could only quietly watch this scene.","He Wenxian stood up and took a few steps forward. She asked softly, “Expert Yu, if Xi Xi doesn’t come, then this competition should be canceled, right?”","Expert Yu glanced at her and gritted his teeth. “She’ll appear.”","He Wenxian’s gaze changed. Before she could speak, Xu Yuxin, who was at the side, could not help but say, “Expert Yu, you’re an expert in cultural relic restoration, so you’re willing to believe Qiao Xi. You hope that she’ll respect the restoration of cultural relics, but the truth is that Qiao Xi isn’t coming. She’s afraid of losing her reputation in public, so she made up the excuse of getting into a car accident to avoid this competition. How could it be such a coincidence that she got into a car accident on the way here?","“She’s clearly doing this on purpose! She just wants to ride on Wenxian’s coattails and become famous in this way. Wenxian is the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. This competition is meaningless!”"]},{"number":1423,"title":"Chapter 1423 No One Likes Lying Women","paragraphs":["1423 No One Likes Lying Women","He Wenxian reached out to stop Xu Yuxin, but she ended up just standing at the side and sighing as if she could not do anything.","It was probably because the people He Wenxian bribed had played a role, but Qiao Xi’s actions had really angered everyone.","“If she’s pretending to be in a car accident, I hope it’s true. It’s best if she dies. That way, everyone will still feel sorry for her. She’s just relying on her vixen face to gain sympathy. Such a person shouldn’t have appeared at the cultural relic restoration event in the first place.”","He Wenxian was extremely happy when she heard the increasingly intense curses of everyone. It was even to the extent that she wanted to curse Qiao Xi to vent her anger. Now, she was finally able to trample on Qiao Xi.","!!","So what if Qiao Xi was the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor? Who would believe her? Now that her reputation was ruined, she was utterly not worthy of Gu Zheng!","Under such public opinion, no matter how much Gu Zheng liked her, he would probably waver. After all, no one would like a woman who liked to lie.","He Wenxian tried her best to control the joy in her heart and maintained a worried expression, afraid that she would laugh out loud. Just as she was secretly delighted, she suddenly saw a figure at the door.","“Aren’t I here now?” A cold female voice passed through the crowd and entered He Wenxian’s ears. Her expression instantly stiffened.","Qiao Xi? She... Why was she here? Didn’t she get into a car accident? Logically speaking, those people had already succeeded. At this moment, Qiao Xi should be in the hospital for emergency treatment!","The noisy hall instantly fell silent. Everyone’s breathing seemed to have stopped. The door of the venue was very gorgeous. A slim figure stood under the light and shadow. She was wearing a beige coat and high heels. She walked over with a strong aura. Everyone subconsciously made way for her as they watched her walk in front of He Wenxian.","Qiao Xi glanced coldly at He Wenxian, and the corners of her mouth curled up slightly. Then, she turned around and faced everyone. “I’m sorry, everyone. I’m late.”","Only then did everyone realize that she was wearing a coat because her right hand was in a cast and wrapped in a thick bandage.","“Qiao Xi is really here?”","“She’s injured! Could it be that she really got into a car accident?”","Earlier, Qiao Xi had walked all the way here and clearly saw He Wenxian’s face gradually turn pale. She smiled lightly and looked at the person beside her. “Expert Yu, I can participate in the competition.”","Expert Yu looked at her hand worriedly. “But you... You’re injured!”","“It’s okay. It’s just one hand. I can still handle the competition. Since I’ve already agreed to compete, I can’t go back on my word!”","Qiao Xi turned around slightly and looked at He Wenxian with a faint smile. Her voice was still cold with a trace of ridicule. “The knowledge is stored in my mind. Even if my hand is injured, I can use other methods to prove my ability.”","As soon as these words were spoken, everyone looked at He Wenxian. It seemed that as long as Qiao Xi appeared, she could quickly turn the situation around. He Wenxian, who was still dazzling just now, instantly lost her brilliance.","He Wenxian’s blood instantly froze, and her face gradually turned pale. Her exquisite makeup could not hide her panic at this moment, but she quickly calmed down and said with a worried expression, “Xi Xi, you’re injured. Is your hand okay? Everyone is very worried about you. If your injury is very serious, let’s not compete for the time being. It’ll be unfair to you. We can compete after you recover.”","Qiao Xi sneered. “So you don’t want to compete anymore, Miss He?”","He Wenxian was stunned for a moment, her eyes becoming filled with panic. Of course, she did not want to compete, but...","Her face turned pale, and a layer of sweat seeped out of her forehead. She suppressed her panic and bit her lip to retort, “Xi Xi, I want to postpone the competition because I’m worried about your hand. Why are you saying that I don’t want to compete? Now that you’re injured, how are you going to continue the competition? If news of this gets out, others will say that I’m bullying you. What’s the point of me having the title of Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor? You can win this competition. If you really want this title, I can give it to you...”","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing. She was just about to retort when an arrogant voice came from behind. It was the man who had been speaking up for He Wenxian.","“Qiao Xi! Don’t go too far with your words! Miss He is clearly worried about your injury, but you insist on being overbearing! Who knows if you really got into a car accident and got injured? I think you’re just looking for an excuse to avoid the competition!”"]},{"number":1424,"title":"Chapter 1424 The Knowledge Is In Her Brain","paragraphs":["1424 The Knowledge Is In Her Brain","“If you really got into a car accident, you should be in the hospital for emergency treatment instead of making things difficult for Miss He here.”","Qiao Xi’s gaze suddenly turned cold, and the venue suddenly fell silent. Everyone held their breaths.","Seeing that Qiao Xi was silent, the man continued to say arrogantly, “You’re clearly pretending. You’re neither early nor late, but you got into a car accident at this time and even injured your right hand. If you really got into a car accident, why didn’t you die?”","Xu Yuxin, who was at the side, also echoed, “Yes, isn’t this too much of a coincidence? She only injured her hand!","Everyone looked at Qiao Xi with doubt. Even though this man’s words were very overboard, they made sense.","Why was it such a coincidence?","He Wenxian’s eyes were filled with pride. She almost could not control the smile on her face.","Yes, why did Qiao Xi have to get into a car accident at this time?","“Who did you say you want dead?” Suddenly, a cold voice passed through the layers of obstacles and entered everyone’s ears, making them shudder.","The man was wearing a black mask, and his light brown eyes were filled with killing intent as he scanned the crowd coldly.","Twilight strode toward them with a cold aura. Her wrist was also bandaged, but it was obvious that his injury wasn’t serious.","The moment she saw him, He Wenxian’s heart trembled, and her eyes were filled with panic.","The next second, Twilight walked to Qiao Xi’s side. His thin lips parted slightly as he said word by word, “Miss Qiao and I were both in the car accident and got injured. Do you think I’ll use my power for Miss Qiao’s personal gain?”","The moment that was said, the entire venue was in an uproar. He Wenxian’s ears buzzed, and her mind was a mess.","How was that possible? Twilight was injured too?","Everyone who was clamoring just now instantly shut their mouths. They could question Qiao Xi, but they did not dare to question Twilight. After all, his status in the cultural relic restoration world was extremely high. Even the head of the cultural relic restoration department had to be respectful to him, let alone others.","Seeing that Twilight had stepped forward to speak up for Qiao Xi, those who originally believed in Qiao Xi all stood up to defend against the injustice. “You can like He Wenxian, but you can’t curse Miss Qiao like this. She’s already injured from a car accident, yet you still said such excessive words. Even if you don’t think for yourself, you should at least display an exemplary attitude for the youths to see!”","“The competition hasn’t started yet, and everything has yet to be concluded. I hope everyone can speak rationally. Miss He’s fans are too extreme!”","“Mr. Twilight has already said that he and Miss He got into a car accident. Do you think Mr. Twilight should be killed too?”","Hearing everyone’s retort, the arrogant man’s expression instantly changed. He trembled under Twilight’s cold gaze. “I... I didn’t mean that.”","At this moment, someone stood up. “If Miss Qiao is injured and can’t compete, won’t we have waited for nothing today? Then who’s the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor? The person who said she wanted to compete yesterday was Miss Qiao, and she’s the one who wants to cancel it now. Is it fun to play with us?”","Qiao Xi glanced coldly at that group of people. It seemed that they had all been bribed by He Wenxian. He Wenxian had spent a lot of money to achieve her goal!","The man gritted his teeth and continued, “Am I wrong? You’re an impostor who wants to occupy Miss He’s identity. But you’re still unwilling to admit it. Even if you really got into a car accident, your actions are still disgusting!”","The panic in He Wenxian’s eyes dissipated a little. As long as Qiao Xi was unable to prove her identity, then most people would still support her.","However...","In the next second, Qiao Xi’s cold voice spread to every corner. She chuckled. “Ever since I stepped in here, I’ve never said that I wanted to cancel the competition. Moreover, I’ve already said that I only injured my right hand, but the knowledge is in my mind. I can participate in the competition by dictating or using other methods. However, as soon as I entered, you found all kinds of reasons to cancel the competition. Who exactly is the one who doesn’t want to compete here?”","Qiao Xi’s gaze landed on that group of people again. “Also, all of you have been targeting and cursing me. It looks like all of you are Miss He’s fans! Why are all of you so agitated before Miss He even speaks?”","Everyone looked at He Wenxian in unison, and a subtle glint flashed across their eyes.","At this moment, they also noticed that something was wrong. Qiao Xi had clearly only said that she had gotten into a car accident, but she had never refused to participate in the competition. Meanwhile, He Wenxian’s supporters were using Qiao Xi’s injury as an excuse to curse and incite the atmosphere to cancel the competition.","He Wenxian’s face was pale. She opened her mouth but could not say a word."]},{"number":1425,"title":"Chapter 1425 Preemptive Strike","paragraphs":["1425 Preemptive Strike","Qiao Xi looked at her with a smile as if she was waiting for He Wenxian to give a reasonable explanation.","Everyone’s gazes landed on He Wenxian. There was doubt, mockery, and a trace of disbelief.","He Wenxian felt that she was about to suffocate. She could only try her best to control her emotions, but Madam He could not suppress the anger in her heart. She glared at Qiao Xi with resentment. “You bi—”","“Xi Xi! You were in a car accident, and your hand is injured. Of course, we don’t want to force you to continue competing. Even if we really compete, people will say that Wenxian won unfairly.”","He Weinian interrupted Madam He with a smile and said gently, “Wenxian is doing this for your own good. She’s just worried about your injury.”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up. If she wasn’t wrong, Madam He wanted to call her a ‘b*tch’ just now. Her gentle image was almost ruined!","She nodded thoughtfully. “Chairman He, you’re right. Miss He has good intentions, so I naturally won’t bicker with her. Since there’s no problem now, let’s start the competition.”","“Alright,” He Weinian’s eyes flashed as he replied gently.","He had long thought of a countermeasure and specially found someone to replace Wenxian. At that time, as long as Wenxian made a request and said that she was used to working in a quiet environment and could not be disturbed by anyone or have a camera in the room, all would be fine. Such a request would not be too much. He believed everyone could understand. After all, every artist had their own habits. The organizers had no reason to refuse.","As for Qiao Xi, even if she was the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, she was already injured and could not fully display her standard. She was definitely inferior to the expert he had spent a lot of money to invite.","This time, Wenxian had to win!","He Weinian smiled kindly. “It’s getting late, so let’s start.”","He Wenxian knew that her father had already made preparations for her. She took a deep breath and said helplessly, “Xi Xi, I really don’t want to hurt our relationship, but I’m the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. Moreover, you were the one who suggested this competition. I hope you won’t blame me.”","Everyone was dumbfounded.","“Who exactly is the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor? One moment, I think that it’s Miss Qiao. The next moment, I think it’s Miss He. I’m confused!”","“One of them must be an impostor, and the impostor probably wouldn’t dare to participate in the competition, but both of them have agreed to participate. They look very confident too!”","Qiao Xi glanced at He Wenxian and had already guessed the He family’s methods.","He Wenxian was just about to make a request when Qiao Xi spoke first with a slightly troubled expression, “Mr. Twilight, the request I made just now... Forget it.”","Twilight hesitated for a moment before understanding what Qiao Xi meant. He had seen through He Wenxian’s plan, so he planned to take the initiative.","Everyone was stunned for a moment and asked curiously, “Miss Qiao, what did you request of Mr. Twilight?”","He Wenxian raised her eyes and met Qiao Xi’s smiling eyes. Her heart trembled.","Qiao Xi thought for a moment and chuckled. “It’s not a big deal. It’s just that when I’m restoring cultural relics, I’m used to being alone in a room. I can only focus fully when no one disturbs me. I originally wanted the organizers to arrange a separate room for me, but now that I think about it...”","Qiao Xi deliberately dragged out her voice before continuing, “All of you should know that a few years ago, when the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor restored Autumn Leaves, it was done in front of everyone. Since this is a competition and it’s being broadcasted live, if we arrange for separate rooms, no one will be able to see our method of restoration. It’ll even be boring. Moreover, this is unfair to Miss He, so I’ve decided to forget it after thinking it through. I’ll compete with Miss He in the venue. We’ll compete until the restoration work is completed.”","Hearing Qiao Xi’s words, He Wenxian instantly felt as if she had been struck by lightning, and her body could not help but tremble.","What... What did Qiao Xi say?","Now that Qiao Xi had already said that she would not ask for separate rooms for the competition, it would seem deliberate if she made this request again. It would definitely arouse everyone’s suspicion.","Qiao Xi said that she did not need it because she respected her opponent and wanted to ensure the competition’s fairness. If she made this request again, everyone would think that she did not dare to compete in public. Moreover, most importantly, the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor restored Autumn Leaves in front of everyone back then. This meant that the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor did not have any special habits."]},{"number":1426,"title":"Chapter 1426 Emergency","paragraphs":["1426 Emergency","Just as He Wenxian was panicking, Qiao Xi looked at her and asked with a smile, “Miss He, what do you think?”","Before He Wenxian could speak, Twilight said casually, “Miss Qiao, I admire you for giving up your special request for the sake of the overall situation. Let’s start the competition.”","Expert Yu also immediately said, “Everything has been arranged. Please carry out the restoration work in the hall.”","He Wenxian felt as if she had fallen into an ice cave. Her body was so stiff that she could not move. She never expected that Qiao Xi would speak before her and cut off her escape route.","!!","He Weinian’s gaze gradually turned cold. This was the first time Qiao Xi had seen him reveal such an expression in front of everyone. After all, he had been pretending for many years and would not easily expose himself. It seemed that he was really angry!","Qiao Xi smiled at the He family.","Could they not take it anymore? However, this was just the beginning! Didn’t He Wenxian say that she was the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor? Then they shall see what would happen in the competition later on. When He Wenxian’s identity was exposed, how would the He family explain themselves?","If she could not even explain the matter, how could she explain that she hired an assassin to kill Qiao Xi?","Today, Qiao Xi would tear off the sheepskin this group of foxes was wearing and let everyone see the kind of people they were!","He Wenxian was in a daze. She did not even know how she stood on stage. She did not seem to be able to hear anything except her uneasy heartbeat.","Expert Yu held the microphone and announced, “This competition is divided into theoretical and practical parts. As Mr. Twilight is very familiar with the restoration method of the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, he’ll be the inspector. I believe that with Mr. Twilight’s ability, he’ll definitely be able to find the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor and give everyone present an explanation!”","This was the first time everyone had seen such a competition. They all widened their eyes and looked at the stage.","At this moment, He Wenxian’s face was pale as she looked at He Weinian in a panic.","On the other hand, He Weinian’s expression was indifferent as he nodded at her. Last night, he had already gotten someone to buy the questions for the competition and asked He Wenxian to memorize the answers overnight. Hence, there were no problems with this part.","When He Wenxian saw that the questions on the paper were the same as the ones she memorized last night, she heaved a sigh of relief. She relied on her memory to finish all the questions and even seriously checked them before handing them to Expert Yu.","“Congratulations, both of you! You got full marks for the theoretical questions!”","The entire venue was in an uproar, but it was not strange. After all, it was all about memorizing things. As long as one had learned the craft, one would definitely be able to answer the questions. The next round of the competition mainly depended on practical skills.","He Wenxian lowered her eyes and said in a gentle voice, “Xi Xi, it’s not difficult to get full marks in the first round of the competition, but it’s not that easy to get full marks in the practical aspect.","“If you withdraw from the competition now, no one will laugh at you. After all, your hand is injured, and you’ve already obtained full marks for your theory. You’ve proven your ability.” He Wenxian paused for a moment and continued, “Xi Xi, are you sure you want to compete?”","Everyone’s gazes moved between the two of them. Could it be that Qiao Xi was withdrawing?","At this moment, Qiao Xi, who was on the stage, was preparing the tools she needed. She replied without raising her head, “I’m sure! Miss He, if you have time, you should think about yourself. You don’t have to worry about me.”","He Wenxian’s expression was gloomy as she shook her head helplessly. “Xi Xi, since this is your choice, then I have nothing to say. I hope you won’t regret it.”","Qiao Xi still did not raise her head as if she did not hear her.","Just as the practical competition was about to start, a man suddenly rushed up from below the stage. As he was too fast, by the time everyone reacted, that person had already rushed in front of He Wenxian and poured the water in a thermos onto her hand.","“Ah!!!” A scream resounded throughout the hall.","Everyone took a closer look. He Wenxian’s hands instantly turned red, and blisters quickly appeared on them. She cried from the pain and fell to the floor weakly.","The scene in front stunned everyone for a few seconds before they became restless.","“Miss He!”","“Wenxian!” He Tingchen and He Weinian rushed onto the stage immediately. Madam He’s face was also pale. She went over to support He Wenxian’s shoulder, her eyes filled with tears of heartache.","He Wenxian whimpered in pain and frowned. Tears trickled down her face as she choked. “Dad, Mom, I... My hand...”","The water in the thermos had just been boiled and was poured onto her hand. One could imagine the pain. He Wenxian had been pampered since she was young and had never been tortured like this.","She gritted her teeth, her heart filled with resentment.","Sooner or later, she would make Qiao Xi suffer a hundred times more!"]},{"number":1427,"title":"Chapter 1427 Let Her Take The Blame","paragraphs":["1427 Let Her Take The Blame","He Wenxian panted in pain. When Madam He saw her daughter like this, her heart ached so much that tears fell like rain. “Wenxian, don’t scare me!”","He Tingchen, who was at the side, recovered from his shock and immediately rushed over to stop the man who committed the crime. “Who are you? Why did you hurt my sister?”","The scene was in chaos. Expert Yu hurriedly shouted, “Call the doctor!”","A few doctors were arranged in the venue to avoid any accidents. Hence, as soon as Expert Yu spoke, the doctors rushed over.","There was not much water in the thermos, but every drop was poured on He Wenxian’s hand. At this moment, her hand was covered in blisters, and her fingers were so stiff that she could not move them.","When the doctor helped her clean her wounds, she could not stop her tears from flowing. Everyone’s hearts ached.","“The practical competition was about to start. Why was Miss He scalded? Who exactly is the culprit?”","“This is too much of a coincidence! Why did they have to rush over at this time? How is she going to compete?”","“Miss Qiao only injured her right hand. Fortunately, she can still use her left hand, but Miss He’s hands are scalded and she’s seriously injured. There’s definitely no way for her to compete! Does that mean Miss Qiao won?”","“That’s not right! Why do I feel that something’s wrong?! Could it be that Miss He’s hand...”","Everyone looked at Qiao Xi in succession, their eyes filled with doubt.","He Wenxian’s forehead was covered in sweat from the pain. When she heard everyone’s words, she felt that her suffering was worth it. She wanted everyone to suspect Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent as she slowly raised her eyes to look at He Wenxian. This woman was so vicious to herself. The pain of being scalded was not something that ordinary people could endure.","At this moment, He Tingchen had already pressed the perpetrator to the floor. “Tell me! Who are you and why did you burn Wenxian?”","The man’s face was deformed. “I... I didn’t do it! I didn’t do it on purpose. Maybe the lid wasn’t closed tightly, so it spilled onto Miss He.”","“Nonsense! Why did you rush onto the stage for no reason? You just had to pour a glass of water for Wenxian. You did it on purpose!”","When He Tingchen saw He Wenxian’s red and swollen hands, he could not suppress the anger in his heart. He shouted with widened eyes, “Who instructed you to do this?!”","Actually, everyone had a guess in their hearts. Could it be that Qiao Xi instructed this man to burn Miss He’s hands?","“No... No one instructed me,” the man replied in a panic, but the more he acted like this, the more suspicious he became.","He Weinian waved his hand. “Tingchen, he won’t tell you even if you ask him that. Just call the police! Since he hurt Wenxian, he should pay the price!”","Hearing that they were going to call the police, the man’s expression changed instantly. “Don’t... Don’t call the police! I...”","“Tingchen! Call the police immediately!” He Weinian said coldly.","While He Tingchen was holding his phone, the man struggled to sit up and knelt in front of He Weinian while trembling in fear. “Please, don’t call the police. I didn’t want to hurt Miss He, but...”","When everyone heard this, they pricked up their ears.","The man was kneeling on the floor, his snot flowing out. He looked very disheveled, and his facial features were almost squeezed together. A moment later, he suddenly turned around and cried out, “Miss Qiao! You have to save me! When you looked for me, you didn’t say that they would call the police! I have a child at home. I can’t go to jail!”","Hiss!","Everyone gasped. They were slightly surprised, but most of them expected it. It turned out that the person who instructed this man to commit the crime was really Qiao Xi!","Qiao Xi looked at him unhurriedly. “I don’t know you.”","This time, she finally understood. Not only did He Wenxian want to use burns as an excuse to avoid the competition, but she also wanted to push the blame on her!","He Weinian glanced at Qiao Xi and directly ordered, “Call the police!”","“No!” the man shouted agitatedly, then his eyes were filled with resentment. “Miss Qiao, you left me in the lurch. Don’t blame me for being heartless!”","The man got up from the floor, took out his phone, and clicked on an interface. “This is the reward Miss Qiao gave me!”","The people nearby all saw that the amount of money transferred was 50,000 yuan, and the person who transferred it was Qiao Xi. The gazes everyone shot at Qiao Xi were once again filled with disdain.","He Wenxian widened her eyes in disbelief, her eyes filled with shock and sorrow.","“It’s really her?” Everyone’s eyes were filled with surprise.","“How vicious!”","He Tingchen looked fiercely at Qiao Xi. He knew that she was Gu Zheng’s wife, so he had always treated her as a friend. However, this woman actually hurt Wenxian in such a vicious way."]},{"number":1428,"title":"Chapter 1428 Don’t You Think You Have Double Standards?","paragraphs":["1428 Don’t You Think You Have Double Standards?","“Qiao Xi! You’re too much!” He Tingchen’s voice was filled with anger as he rushed toward Qiao Xi. However, before he could reach Qiao Xi, a tall figure stopped him.","Twilight’s eyes were calm, but there was a hint of warning in them. Just one look made He Tingchen stop in his tracks. He did not dare to go forward anymore and could only grit his teeth and question, “Mr. Twilight! She instructed someone to burn my sister. I want her to apologize to my sister in public!”","Qiao Xi’s expression was calm as she casually said, “Young Master He, are you sure that I’m the mastermind just based on that man’s few words and records?”","“The evidence is conclusive, yet you still want to deny it?” He Tingchen glared at her angrily.","Qiao Xi grunted coldly. “Then call the police and get them to investigate if the transfer record is real. After all, I didn’t transfer the money to him.”","Hearing this, the man’s expression changed.","“Miss Qiao, with your current identity and status, you naturally have the ability to get rid of suspicion.” He Weinian walked forward with a frown. “Originally, on account of Ah Zheng, our He family has been tolerating you. I could forgive you for doubting Wenxian in public and pretending to be the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, but you actually dare to hurt my daughter now!","“Look at her hands! How can you bear to do this to her?!”","As soon as He Weinian finished speaking, the angry gazes of everyone descended on Qiao Xi.","“Miss Qiao, now that we have witnesses and evidence. What else do you have to say? Wenxian can’t participate in the competition, but do you think that your scheme will still succeed? Even if Gu Zheng comes today, I’ll seek justice for my daughter!”","Everyone echoed, “We’ll seek justice for Miss He!”","Under the angry gazes of everyone, Qiao Xi suddenly smiled. She raised her eyebrows and asked, “Chairman He, don’t you think you have double standards? I was injured in a car accident, yet you said that I was making up an excuse to avoid the competition. Now that He Wenxian is injured, you’re saying that I instructed someone else to burn her. In any case, no matter who gets injured, it’s my fault, right?”","The hall instantly fell silent. The people who were clamoring just now were speechless.","Only then did everyone come back to their senses. Miss Qiao had a point!","Seeing this, He Wenxian hurriedly whimpered in pain. “Xi Xi, I never suspected you and was always worried about your injury. Now that I’m injured, how can you suspect me?”","As soon as she finished speaking, someone stood up and echoed, “That’s right! Miss He has never suspected you. Now that she’s injured, you’re being sarcastic. Do you think Miss He is afraid of you, so she deliberately scalded herself to avoid the competition?”","“Miss He is the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. If she participates in the competition, she’ll definitely win. Why would she burn herself?”","“Qiao Xi doesn’t dare to compete, so she instructed that person to burn Miss He. She’s really too vicious!”","Hearing the commotion, Expert Yu looked troubled. “Miss He, Miss Qiao, why don’t we...”","“No! Don’t cancel it.” He Wenxian suddenly struggled to stand up. It was so painful that she frowned and choked. “If I withdraw from the competition, everyone will think that I’m not the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. Although I don’t care about this empty title, I don’t want everything I’ve put in to be gone just like that. I... I can continue the competition.”","“Wenxian!” He Tingchen’s eyes were filled with heartache. When he saw that his sister’s face was covered in sweat from the pain but she was still unwilling to give up, the anger that he had just suppressed surged again. He shouted in a hoarse voice, “Qiao Xi, don’t think that just because you’re Ah Zheng’s wife that we’re afraid of you. You have to be punished for doing something wrong. As long as you immediately admit that you’re pretending to be the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor and apologize to Wenxian, our He family can let this matter go. However, if you’re still stubborn, don’t blame us for being merciless!”","He Wenxian raised her eyes and glanced around. When she saw everyone looking at Qiao Xi with anger and disdain, she pretended to be strong and said, “I... I won’t give up. No matter how painful it is, I have to persist.","“Xi Xi, as long as you’re still willing to withdraw, I’ll forgive you. I know you’re kind-hearted. You were just rash. I won’t blame you.”","Tears trickled down her face as her voice trembled. “Xi Xi, even if you don’t think about yourself, you have to think about Ah Zheng. You’re his wife. How could you do such a thing? Moreover, I don’t want Ah Zheng to be stuck between us.”","The eldest daughter of the He family, who had always been strong and gentle, had tears in her eyes at this moment. She was begging Qiao Xi pitifully, and this sight could not help but make one pity her."]},{"number":1429,"title":"Chapter 1429 A Dignified Old Man","paragraphs":["1429 A Dignified Old Man","Everyone looked at Qiao Xi with unfriendly gazes. It was an accident that she was injured in a car accident, but it was deliberate that Miss He was injured! This was clearly Qiao Xi’s scheme!","At this moment, He Wenxian shot a look at the man below the stage. That person instantly understood and immediately stood up to shout, “Qiao Xi! You’re not the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, so what right do you have to stand here and spout nonsense? Get out!”","With one person clamoring, more people joined in. “Yes, what right do you have to stand here? Miss He is the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. Get lost!”","“Get out! I’m annoyed just looking at you!”","The noise everyone caused was about to overturn the roof, but Qiao Xi’s expression did not change as the corners of her mouth curled into a mocking smile.","No wonder He Wenxian was not afraid of participating in the competition. It turned out that He Weinian had already prepared a backup plan for her.","However...","Twilight’s expression flickered. The next second, the door of the venue slammed open, and an old man in a Tang suit walked in with a young assistant behind him.","Qiao Xi turned around and was slightly stunned.","Mr. Wu?","The venue instantly fell silent because of the old man in front of them.","Everyone present was an expert and scholar in the cultural relic restoration world. They naturally knew the identity of the old man in front of them. Mr. Wu was a famous senior in the cultural relic restoration world. He was a top cultural relic restorer in the country and the president of the cultural relic protection association. He had dedicated his life to the cultural relic world.","Everyone’s eyes were filled with surprise. They did not expect Mr. Wu to be invited to this cultural relic restoration event.","A trace of pride flashed through He Wenxian’s eyes. She still remembered that when the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor was restoring Autumn Leaves, Mr. Wu was not present, so he did not know that Qiao Xi was the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. Now that she was here as the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, Mr. Wu could help her establish her identity as the legitimate Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor.","Everyone said excitedly, “Oh my God! Mr. Wu is here too.”","“They actually managed to invite Mr. Wu to this cultural relics restoration event. Why didn’t I hear any experts mention it before?”","Everyone looked at Expert Yu, who was also a little surprised. Then, he went forward excitedly to greet him. “Mr. Wu, why didn’t you inform me in advance that you were coming? I could have gone out to welcome you!”","The venue, which was originally filled with anger, became peaceful with Mr. Wu’s arrival. Everyone wanted to squeeze in front of Mr. Wu and talk to him.","This senior was a top figure in the cultural relic restoration world. If one could obtain his recognition or guidance, their future would definitely be limitless.","Everyone’s eyes were filled with excitement and admiration, but they had never thought about why Mr. Wu would suddenly appear.","At this moment, Mr. Wu’s assistant slowly said, “Expert Yu, my master is here for the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor.”","Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor!","When everyone heard the assistant’s words, they all looked at He Wenxian. A top figure like Mr. Wu was actually here for Miss He?","The assistant glanced at He Wenxian and smiled formally. “My master has never seen the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. Expert Yu, can you introduce him?”","Expert Yu looked troubled. He did not know which one was the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor.","Mr. Wu’s sharp eyes swept past everyone. In the end, his gaze landed on Qiao Xi, but he only looked at her for a moment.","Qiao Xi scratched her head in embarrassment. This old man was the person who asked her to restore Autumn Leaves back then. Moreover, she remembered that the old man said that he was just a passerby. His greatest wish in life was to see a classic ancient scroll like Autumn Leaves reappear in the world, so he asked her to help him restore it.","How did this old man become Mr. Wu?","Moreover, in her impression, Mr. Wu had never announced to the public that he had participated in the restoration of Autumn Leaves, so everyone thought that she and Mr. Wu had never met.","Just as the atmosphere was awkward, Mr. Wu walked toward He Wenxian.","However, everyone realized that Mr. Wu’s expression was a little gloomy as if he was a little dissatisfied. However, wasn’t Mr. Wu here to look for the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor? Now that he had seen the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, why was he dissatisfied?","After thinking for a moment, everyone felt that Mr. Wu might just be a serious and unsmiling person. It was not that he was dissatisfied with anyone, but he had always been so dignified.","He Tingchen, who was at the side, was extremely excited. “Wenxian, Mr. Wu is here to see you!”","He Wenxian was a little surprised, but when she saw Mr. Wu walking toward her, her heart thumped excitedly."]},{"number":1430,"title":"Chapter 1430 You’re Indeed Blind","paragraphs":["1430 You’re Indeed Blind","He Wenxian became even prouder. Before long, she would become Mr. Wu’s proud apprentice and the legitimate Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. At that time, Qiao Xi would forever be trampled under her feet.","She controlled the excitement on her face and smiled generously. Then, she shot a look at the person beside her.","Xu Yuxin was still indignant in her heart. What right did Qiao Xi have to be so arrogant? She even dared to question Wen Xian and Chairman He!","Qiao Xi was a mistress, a b*tch! Now that her identity was exposed in public, how arrogant could she be?!","At this moment...","Xu Yuxin seemed to understand something. If Mr. Wu knew about Qiao Xi’s actions, then the entire city would definitely know that Qiao Xi was pretending to be the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. From then on, Qiao Xi’s reputation would be ruined and she would never be able to make a comeback.","Before Mr. Wu could arrive, Xu Yuxin said pretentiously, “Mr. Wu! You came at the right time. The Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor and Miss Qiao were about to compete! However...”","The assistant at the side saw He Wenxian’s red and swollen hands and smiled. “Miss He, you’re the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor? What happened to your hands?”","Hearing the assistant’s question, He Wenxian’s eyes instantly turned red. She bit her lip and choked. “I... I’m fine.”","She pretended to be flustered and hid her hands behind her back, but she frowned because of the pain as if she did not want Mr. Wu to see her burned hands.","Xu Yuxin, who was at the side, looked as if her tail had been stepped on. She exclaimed, “How can you be fine? Your hands were burned by boiling water!","“Mr. Wu, you have to stand up for Wenxian! Qiao Xi is pretending to be the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. She even took the initiative to propose a competition to prove who the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor is. What’s even worse is that she instructed someone to burn Wenxian’s hands before the competition started. You also know how important a cultural relic restorer’s hands are. Even a small wound can affect the restoration standard. Now that Wenxian can’t participate in the competition, she won’t be able to prove that she’s the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor.","“Qiao Xi is vicious and unscrupulous. Such a person has no right to continue staying here!”","Mr. Wu’s gaze landed on Qiao Xi again.","Qiao Xi lowered her head in embarrassment. She could even imagine Mr. Wu’s thoughts. How did this little girl end up like this? It was fine that her identity was snatched away, but she was even being criticized like this?","Mr. Wu’s expression was indifferent as he retracted his gaze.","The assistant at the side said on behalf of the old master, “Miss, are you saying that Miss Qiao was afraid of losing the competition, so she instructed someone else to burn Miss He’s hands?”","He Wenxian said anxiously, “Well... Xi Xi can’t be blamed for this. She’s only 20 years old, so it’s normal for her to be a little vain. If she likes the identity of the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, I can give it to her.”","“Wenxian!” He Tingchen’s heart ached when he heard her words.","Everyone was also burning with anger and stopped her. “Miss He, she’s already done this to you. You can’t give in to her!”","“In that case, there’s already evidence that Miss He was injured under Miss Qiao’s orders?” the assistant asked with a smile.","Xu Yuxin said without the slightest hesitation, “Of course, there’s evidence! The man who committed the crime just now kept saying that it was Qiao Xi who instigated it. Moreover, there’s a record of the money being transferred. Plus, who else but Qiao Xi could have done such a thing? She has a vicious heart. She hurt her friend for the sake of the title of Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. Now, she even wants to muddle through it. Does she really think we’re blind?”","“Mhm.”","Suddenly, a voice sounded and the venue fell silent.","He Wenxian’s pitiful face instantly stiffened as she looked at Mr. Wu in surprise.","Had he hummed just now?","Everyone even suspected that they had heard wrongly. Why did Mr. Wu agree? What was he responding to?","Xu Yuxin thought about it carefully and felt that Mr. Wu probably agreed with her. He thought that a woman like Qiao Xi was really too vicious.","However, the next second...","Mr. Wu glanced at He Wenxian, then at everyone. He nodded expressionlessly. “You people are indeed blind.”","The venue suddenly fell silent, and everyone stopped breathing.","Mr. Wu... What was he talking about?","Who was blind?","He Wei was old and experienced. He sensed that something was wrong. Could it be that Mr. Wu knew Qiao Xi?","Everyone was also dumbfounded. He Wenxian, who was at the side, widened her eyes. She was thinking about what Mr. Wu meant when she saw the dignified old man’s expression suddenly darken."]},{"number":1431,"title":"Chapter 1431 She’s The Imposter","paragraphs":["1431 She’s The Imposter","Old Master Wu’s eyes were filled with anger. He suddenly sneered. “Do you all think that Miss Qiao doesn’t dare to compete, so she instructed someone to scald He Wenxian’s hands?”","Everyone could clearly sense Mr. Wu’s anger and took a few steps back in fear. He Wenxian was so afraid that her teeth were chattering. Only then did she realize that something was wrong with Mr. Wu’s arrival. He was probably here to help Qiao Xi!","He Weinian also came back to his senses and was just about to stop them when Mr. Wu glanced around with a sharp gaze. His voice was extremely cold. “All of you actually think that Qiao Xi doesn’t dare to compete? How laughable!”","These words made everyone present dumbfounded. For a moment, they could not figure out whose side Mr. Wu was on. Just as everyone was puzzled, Mr. Wu said loudly, “Back then, even I wasn’t confident in restoring Autumn Leaves, but it was restored by the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. Because of this, she caused a sensation in the entire cultural relic restoration world. That little girl, Qiao Xi, whom even I feel inferior to, is an impostor in the eyes of all of you?!”","Boom!!!","These words were like a thunderclap that struck everyone’s hearts heavily, and everyone’s breathing stopped.","What? Mr. Wu was saying that Qiao Xi was the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor?","Mr. Wu was so angry that he laughed. “Would the famous Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor be afraid of this competition? Who does He Wenxian think she is? What work has she repaired? Is it just because of that ancient painting?”","His sharp gaze landed on the ancient painting at the side. Before he came, his assistant had already explained the situation to him. He Wenxian said that the ancient painting was her work, but Qiao Xi raised her doubts. Hence, no one knew whose painting it was.","Now that Mr. Wu had mentioned it, everyone looked at the painting.","“I still remember this ancient painting. Back then, when Qiao Xi bought this painting, I was also present. When she was restoring the ancient painting, she even asked me some technical questions. How did this painting become He Wenxian’s work? An impostor stole Qiao Xi’s painting and is now biting back?”","Everyone heard it clearly this time. Mr. Wu said that He Wenxian was an impostor!","He Tingchen’s eyes widened as if he had been struck by lightning. He stood rooted to the ground in a daze.","Xu Yuxin’s mouth was wide open as she looked at Qiao Xi in disbelief. How could this b*tch be the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor? Only a noble socialite like Wenxian could be the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor!","Xu Yuxin’s heart was filled with resentment. She shouted in a hoarse voice, “Impossible! There must be a mistake! Wenxian is the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor!”","He Wenxian gritted her teeth and cursed Xu Yuxin in her heart for adding fuel to the fire.","The next second, Mr. Wu was filled with anger. He sneered. “I made a mistake?","“I’ve known this little girl for five years. At that time, she helped me restore Autumn Leaves but refused to tell me her name. After I asked her a few times, she told me the name ‘Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor’. Speaking of which, I was the one who spread the name.","“Moreover, I’m not the only one. Back then, a few people restored the damaged scroll with us. Although not many people know Qiao Xi, they’re all famous figures in the cultural relic restoration world. Do you mean to say that we’re all lying?”","Mr. Wu’s angry gaze landed on He Wenxian, and he said in a mocking tone, “Miss He, I heard that you’re also the daughter of a rich family. Why did your parents teach you to occupy someone else’s identity? You even dared to find someone to frame Qiao Xi? Who gave you the guts to do this?!”","He Wenxian’s face gradually lost color. Her lips trembled slightly as tears welled up in her eyes.","No one had ever berated her so fiercely. The high and mighty Miss He was about to break down.","Everyone who supported He Wenxian at the scene was stunned. The comments in the live-stream also disappeared. Everyone found it difficult to accept this reversal for a moment. It turned out that the person they were cursing and criticizing just now was the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, while He Wenxian was the impostor.","“If He Wenxian is an impostor, why were her hands scalded? Logically speaking, Qiao Xi will definitely win this competition. She doesn’t have to take the risk to hurt He Wenxian!”","“Could it be... Could it be that He Wenxian didn’t dare to compete, so she got someone to scald her hands? Not only did she find an excuse to avoid the competition, but she also used this opportunity to frame Qiao Xi!”","“That’s right! Mr. Wu already said that Qiao Xi is the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. There’s no need for her to harm He Wenxian. All of this was orchestrated by He Wenxian. This scheming woman was using us to attack Qiao Xi!"]},{"number":1432,"title":"Chapter 1432 Dumb Teammate","paragraphs":["1432 Dumb Teammate","“I just freaking realized that He Wenxian knows that she can’t compare to Qiao Xi, so she used us to deal with Qiao Xi and made Qiao Xi unable to explain herself. That way, she’d be able to snatch the title of Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, while the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor’s reputation will be ruined and she’ll never be able to make a comeback!”","” Scheming b*tch!”","Public opinion instantly reversed, and curses almost swallowed He Wenxian.","With Mr. Wu personally testifying, there was naturally no need to carry on with this competition. Moreover, considering how capable Qiao Xi was, everyone confirmed that it was impossible for her to harm He Wenxian.","!!","Mr. Wu instructed coldly, “Call the police immediately and take this vicious woman who framed Qiao Xi away!”","He Wenxian’s legs went weak, and she almost fell to the floor. She endured the pain in her hands as tears trickled down her face. She bit her lip so hard that it bled.","Didn’t they say that Mr. Wu had never seen Qiao Xi before? But why did he say that he and the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor restored Autumn Leaves together?","However, now that Mr. Wu had spoken, it was meaningless to explain herself. No one would suspect Mr. Wu. He respected and liked the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor so much. He could naturally recognize who the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor was.","This time, she had completely lost! She did not hesitate to sacrifice her hands, but she still lost in the end!","What right did Qiao Xi have to be helped out by others all the time? If Mr. Wu had not come, Qiao Xi would have been charged with the crime and she would have had to bear the infamy for the rest of her life!","She was clearly one step away!","This b*tch! B*tch!","He Wenxian’s mind was heavy. She could only curse Qiao Xi in her heart over and over again, but she could not say a word.","Even someone as cunning as He Weinian did not know how to explain himself. However, this was a live broadcast. If he did not explain himself clearly, the He family’s reputation would be damaged.","Just as the scene was filled with curses, Xu Yuxin suddenly caught the main point and shouted, “Right! Qiao Xi... She doesn’t have an invitation! The Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor’s invitation is in Wenxian’s hands. If Qiao Xi is the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, why is her invitation with Wenxian?”","These words instantly exploded in He Wenxian’s ears. The blood in her body suddenly froze, and the strong smell of blood surged out of her throat. The sweat on her back drenched her dress.","Idiot! How could she mention this?","When Qiao Xi heard the matter of the invitation, she was instantly amused. One shouldn’t be afraid of strong opponents but dumb teammates!","She took a few steps forward leisurely, raised her eyebrows, and chuckled. “I almost forgot about the matter of the invitation. Thank you for your reminder, Miss Xu.","“Since we’re talking about this, we have to figure out what’s going on. Miss He, please explain why the invitation ended up in your hands.”","Explain?","He Wenxian’s face was pale, and her body trembled uncontrollably as she panicked. Qiao Xi walked in front of her with a smile and slowly approached. She lowered her voice and said, “Miss He, I really want to know how you intercepted the invitation.”","He Wenxian’s heart trembled as sweat instantly trickled down her forehead. She looked away from Qiao Xi’s burning gaze in a panic.","At this moment, He Tingchen came back to his senses and looked at his sister and father in disbelief.","Qiao Xi revealed a mocking expression when she saw his appearance. It was probably He Tingchen’s misfortune to be so innocent in the He family. In the entire He family, only He Tingchen was unaware of the schemes that went on. He Weinian knew that his son was innocent, so he simply hid all his plans from him to avoid him being exposed in front of others.","He Weinian’s expression darkened, then he smiled helplessly. “Maybe... the staff made a mistake.”","“But aren’t you a gentle and kind socialite, Miss He? Even if you were given the wrong invitation, you shouldn’t have taken it for yourself!” Miss Qiao said casually, “Miss He, are you saying that you thought that the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor was no longer alive and couldn’t bear to see her disappear in front of everyone, so you pretended to be her?”","He Wenxian immediately choked.","She originally wanted to say that, but since Qiao Xi had already said so, what else could she say?","“That’s not right...” Qiao Xi dragged out her words and looked at He Wenxian with interest. “But I clearly received a call from Miss He!”","The expressions of the He family members changed abruptly, but everyone was puzzled.","Qiao Xi said unhurriedly, “A few days ago, Miss He called me and said that she wanted to send me an invitation. She even asked for my address. I told you it was in Mingzhu District.”","At the mention of Mingzhu District, everyone could not help but be stunned for a few seconds. This place did not seem to exist in their minds. Soon, someone stood up and explained, “It’s an old district in the suburbs. The houses there are very dilapidated. Miss Qiao, where do you live?”"]},{"number":1433,"title":"Chapter 1433 Vanity","paragraphs":["1433 Vanity","Qiao Xi replied with a smile, “I don’t live in Mingzhu District. I just rent a house there to store my belongings. When the cultural relics restoration department asked me if I wanted to participate in this event, that was the address I gave them. If you don’t believe me, you can investigate my information.","“Since you called me, it means that you know that the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor is still alive! Then why did you take my invitation and attend the event in my name? This was your first mistake.”","Qiao Xi’s voice was very light, but every word she said was clear. The gazes everyone shot at the He family were gradually filled with doubt.","Miss He calling Qiao Xi meant that she knew that the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor was still alive, but she still wanted to impersonate her. She was clearly doing it on purpose!","!!","From the looks of it, the rumored He family was not as kind-hearted as they thought. Possessing someone else’s identity was not something that kind people could do.","“Miss Qiao, you said that this was Miss He’s first mistake. What else did she do wrong?”","When she heard someone ask this, Qiao Xi revealed a meaningful smile. She looked at He Wenxian and asked with a faint smile, “Miss He, you should know better than me, right? Why don’t you tell me?”","He Wenxian met Qiao Xi’s gaze, and her heart could not help but tremble. A bad feeling surged out of her heart. She forced herself to calm down, and her voice trembled slightly. “Xi Xi, I don’t understand what you mean. A few days after I received the invitation, there was no news of the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. Moreover, I didn’t know that you were the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. I admit that I was greedy, so I pretended to be the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, but I... I thought that the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor was no longer alive. Unexpectedly...”","As she spoke, He Wenxian suddenly choked and looked at Qiao Xi with guilt in her eyes. Tears fell like rain. “Xi Xi, I’m sorry. I apologize to you. I really didn’t mean to make things difficult for you.”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart.","Not on purpose?","He Wenxian was quite smart. At this point, she could only admit that she had pretended to be the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. It was much better than being found out.","If she admitted it now, she would only be condemned morally and wouldn’t be pursued legally. However, if the truth was exposed, she would go to jail!","Qiao Xi pretended to be surprised. “Miss He, you didn’t know? On the night you made your call, a few assassins came to my house in Mingzhu District and charged in. It’s just that they didn’t notice me but alarmed my neighbors and slashed someone. They’ve been arrested by the police and are still being tried at the police station!”","He Wenxian lowered her head, cold sweat dripping down her forehead. Her heart was beating violently as if it would jump out the next second.","He Weinian spoke first, “Miss Qiao, what does this have to do with Wenxian? Wenxian was muddle-headed and occupied your identity, but she’s only in her 20s. It’s understandable that she couldn’t control herself in the face of such temptation, but she definitely wouldn’t have sent people to kill you!”","He Weinian frowned and said self-righteously, “Wenxian did something wrong and has already apologized to you. You can say that Wenxian is vain, but you can’t pin such a big crime on Wenxian. You should think about who you’ve offended!","“If you still suspect Wenxian, I can help you investigate this matter and find the mastermind. It can be considered as clearing Wenxian’s name!”","He Weinian’s words were righteous and dispelled some of the doubts in everyone’s hearts. After all, the He family was known for being philanthropists who had been doing charity for many years. Why would Miss He hire someone to kill someone?","Moreover, Chairman He was not afraid of the investigation, which meant that he was sure that this matter had nothing to do with Miss He. It was possible that it was really as Chairman He had said. Miss Qiao had offended someone, and they made a move on her.","“Miss Qiao, before we investigate the matter clearly, it’s better not to jump to conclusions!”","“That’s right! Miss He is gentle. How could she have hired assassins to kill someone?”","Qiao Xi was not surprised that there were people defending them. After all, the He family’s kind image had been deeply rooted in everyone’s hearts all these years. No one would easily believe that the He family was so vicious.","He Weinian was not afraid of an investigation because he had long been prepared. The assassins who escaped had already been dealt with. As for the people who were arrested by the police, He Weinian would threaten and bribe them to keep this secret. Even if the police suspected He Wenxian, they did not have any evidence.","“Since Chairman He said so, I must have misunderstood Miss He. I won’t investigate the matter of the assassins anymore. I’ll just pretend that Miss He was muddle-headed when she decided to impersonate me.”","He Wenxian’s expression softened a little, but the next second, she suddenly stiffened.","“But...” Qiao Xi spoke once more, and her eyes carried a wisp of ridicule."]},{"number":1434,"title":"Chapter 1434 You Look Like A Fool","paragraphs":["1434 You Look Like A Fool","At this moment, Twilight was standing at the edge of the venue and quietly looking at Qiao Xi in the crowd. His long fingers gently rubbed a silver cufflink that was covered in complicated patterns. If one looked carefully, it looked like a coiled five-clawed golden dragon. The dragon’s eyes were embedded with shining obsidians.","This was Qiao Xi’s birthday gift to him last year. He had always been reluctant to wear it, so it still looked as new as ever.","Ye Qingyuan stood beside him and teased, “Twilight, do you know that you look like a fool now? You can’t take your eyes off your Little Xi Xi!”","Gu Zheng glanced at him indifferently. “Is there a problem?”","“Since you’re so worried, go help her. With Twilight’s status in the cultural relics world, it’s just a matter of saying a few words to help her. Why are you hiding here?”","Gu Zheng sneered. “Mr. Wu is here, so it’ll be fine.”","Ye Qingyuan raised an eyebrow. “Can Mr. Wu compare to you? It’ll definitely be more effective if you personally appear. After all, the He family isn’t easy to deal with.”","Gu Zheng said casually, “Back then, Mr. Wu was in charge of the restoration of Autumn Leaves. He’s the person who can prove Xi Xi’s identity the most. With him around, there’s no need for me to appear.”","“You...” Ye Qingyuan suddenly choked, and his expression was slightly helpless. “I really don’t understand. Do you really not want Qiao Xi to know your identity?”","Gu Zheng glanced at him coldly. “Why are you talking so much nonsense?”","Ye Qingyuan: “...”","He snorted angrily. “Gu Zheng, although your wife is young, she has grown up during this period of time. She’s no longer that weak flower. She can’t hide behind you forever. So what if you tell her? Moreover, you two are husband and wife. If she finds out by herself, she might even be angry with you!”","Gu Zheng really did not understand why ever since Ye Qingyuan got to know Qiao Xi, he had always felt that Qiao Xi was very weak. It was even to the extent that there were times when Gu Zheng did not know where to start even if he wanted to explain.","He paused, and his expression was a little subtle. “Qingyuan, although you’re a doctor, you’re also susceptible to illnesses.”","“What do you mean?” Ye Qingyuan was dumbfounded.","Gu Zheng said, “Go to the hospital to check your brain when you’re free.”","Ye Qingyuan: “...”","He hesitated for a moment, then his eyes were instantly filled with anger. Before he could speak, he heard Gu Zheng say indifferently, “How do you think the He family will cover up their crimes this time?”","Ye Qingyuan looked at him. “Do you have evidence of them hiring assassins to kill Qiao Xi?”","“No.” Gu Zheng shook his head, then sneered. “But Xi Xi isn’t talking about that.”","He Weinian, that old fox, had long been prepared. Moreover, that incident was a few days ago. He Weinian had erased all traces. They indeed could not find any evidence now, but...","Ye Qingyuan immediately remembered. “The car accident?”","“Yes.” Gu Zheng’s lips curled up, but his eyes were terrifyingly cold.","If he had not arrived in time and saved Xi Xi, what would have happened to her today? Would she be disabled? Or would she be unconscious?","At the thought of the possibility of an accident, Gu Zheng could not suppress the killing intent in his heart. How was the He family going to cover up their crimes this time?","That car had already been intercepted. There were witnesses and evidence. He wanted to see how He Weinian would protect He Wenxian.","On the other hand, when He Wenxian was feeling tense, Qiao Xi asked softly, “But how are Miss He and Chairman He going to explain the car accident that just happened?","“Miss He, didn’t you say that you were just being vain and didn’t know that the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor was still alive? Then why did you send someone to hit me with a car? Not only did this car accident cause me to be late, but it also caused me to hurt my hand and almost lose my life.”","He Wenxian’s face instantly turned pale, and her mind was a mess. She opened her mouth, but her throat was dry.","The car accident!","She pretended to be the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor because of her vanity and because she was muddle-headed. However, if the car accident was confirmed, she would definitely face jail time!","No matter how calm He Wenxian was, she could not help but panic when faced with Qiao Xi’s question. Her lips trembled. “Xi Xi, you... What nonsense are you talking about? What... What does the car accident have to do with me?”","“Miss He, there’s no point in pretending to be stupid, right?” Qiao Xi’s tone was slightly impatient. It was enough to pretend to be stupid once. Did He Wenxian think that she could succeed using the same trick?","He Wenxian’s tears could not help but fall, and her eyes were filled with panic. “I... I’m not pretending. Xi Xi, I really don’t know what you’re talking about.”"]},{"number":1435,"title":"Chapter 1435 Whoever Cries Is Right","paragraphs":["1435 Whoever Cries Is Right","He Weinian’s expression instantly changed. He had told Wenxian before that it was fine as long as they delayed Qiao Xi from participating in the competition. There was no need to go too far. After all, they did not want Qiao Xi to die.","A car accident was uncontrollable. It would be troublesome if someone died. Not only would their plan fail, but it might even anger Gu Zheng and cause unnecessary trouble. Moreover, there were many ways to make Qiao Xi unable to participate in the competition. A car accident was not a good choice.","As the car accident had already happened, He Weinian could only brace himself and help He Wenxian explain. As long as he could handle today, he could make some arrangements in the future to help Wenxian clear her name.","He Weinian frowned and retorted, “Miss Qiao, you can’t spout nonsense. Wenxian has been with us since she returned home yesterday. How could she have instructed someone to hit you? If you got into a car accident, she’d be the first person to be suspected. Wenxian wouldn’t have done that!”","Everyone seemed to believe He Weinian’s words, but Qiao Xi sneered. “Everyone, do you still remember what Mr. He and the audience in the live broadcast said when I hadn’t appeared even after a long time?”","Everyone paused and lowered their heads in shame.","“At that time, you all thought that Miss He was the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. You thought that I didn’t dare to come to the competition, so I used the car accident as an excuse to avoid participating. You didn’t think that Miss He was the mastermind at all.","“Miss He, you’re very good at using public opinion. I was injured by the car accident, and your friends cursed me for not dying. Hence, even if I really died, no one would suspect that you were the one who did it. Your reputation will be clean, and you’ll occupy the identity of the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. However, this was your second mistake.","“Miss He, do you still dare to say that the car accident has nothing to do with you?”","Everyone’s gazes landed on He Wenxian one after another. When they thought about it carefully, the car accident was indeed very strange! If Qiao Xi could not participate in the competition, He Wenxian would have won without fighting. She was the biggest beneficiary, so did the car accident really have nothing to do with her?","He Wenxian’s eyes were filled with panic. She could only look at He Weinian helplessly.","He Tingchen’s eyes were filled with shock, then he shouted angrily, “Qiao Xi! You’re talking nonsense! My sister has always been careful and kind. How could she have sent someone to hit you? This must be a coincidence!”","He Wenxian bit her lip tightly and took a deep breath. The current situation was very disadvantageous to her, but as long as Qiao Xi did not have any evidence, she would not be able to convict her. There was room for negotiation.","She shed tears aggrievedly. “Xi Xi, I did take your identity, but I really didn’t do such a thing. I—”","“Miss He.” Qiao Xi interrupted her and asked word by word, “You’re already in your 20s, yet you still want to solve the problem by crying? If crying a little can get you out of this, why do we need the police?”","“If you cry and apologize to me, everyone’s heart will ache for you. If I continue to pursue the matter, it’ll seem that I’m unwilling to let the matter go. Now that you’re related to this car accident, you want to cry to gain sympathy and make everyone criticize me, huh?","“If whoever cries is in the right, then I’ll cry too. Will everyone believe me then?”","He Wenxian’s cries stopped abruptly as her tears silently fell.","Suddenly, police sirens came from outside the door. Everyone’s hearts jumped.","Who called the police?","Not long after, a team of police officers quickly rushed in. When He Wenxian saw this scene, she was terrified to the point her face was as pale as paper. Her weak and aggrieved expression instantly vanished as she glared fiercely at Qiao Xi. “You...”","“Miss He.”","The person who spoke this time was not Qiao Xi but Twilight, who had been in the corner. He slowly walked toward the crowd and elegantly raised his arm, revealing his wrist that was wrapped in bandages.","The man’s voice was low and slightly hoarse. “I’m also a victim of the car accident along with Miss Qiao. I’m not someone to be trifled with. Moreover, the other party deliberately wanted to kill someone. Can’t I call the police?”","It was Twilight who called the police!","When He Wenxian reacted, her heart instantly turned to ashes.","Twilight’s identity was mysterious, and the He family could not find any news of him at all. Hence, her father thought that he was powerful and the He family was probably not his match, so they had been trying their best not to provoke him. Unexpectedly, he became the second victim of the car accident.","If it was just Qiao Xi who was injured, her father could still plead with Gu Zheng. Moreover, Gu Zheng was indebted to her father. If Gu Zheng did not agree, her father could also use public opinion to make Gu Zheng give up on pursuing the matter. However, Twilight was different. He had nothing to do with the He family. Moreover, he was injured in a car accident, so it was reasonable for him to call the police."]},{"number":1436,"title":"Chapter 1436 A Cup Of Full-Sugar Milk Tea","paragraphs":["1436 A Cup Of Full-Sugar Milk Tea","He Wenxian’s body went weak as she was dragged away by the police. From the beginning to the end, He Wenxian did not explain herself at all as if she had accepted her fate. This made everyone even more sure that He Wenxian was related to this car accident.","Seeing that their daughter had been captured, Chairman He and Madam He left in a hurry. Only He Tingchen stood rooted to the ground.","Qiao Xi looked at He Tingchen’s dejected appearance and confirmed that he was unaware of this and was just a stupid little fool.","All of He Wenxian’s previous excuses became a joke when the police came. After all, if there was no evidence, why would the police come to arrest her for no reason?","“In that case, not only did He Wenxian pretend to be the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, but she also hired assassins to kill Qiao Xi. Later on, she faked a car accident and wanted to kill Miss Qiao again. If Miss Qiao is dealt with, no one will compete with her for the title of the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. Even if Miss Qiao doesn’t die, she won’t be able to participate in the competition because of her injuries. He Wenxian would’ve won without fighting, and she could even ruin Miss Qiao’s reputation.”","This person’s words finally explained He Wenxian’s plan. Everyone broke out in a cold sweat.","This... This woman was too vicious!","He Tingchen looked incredulous, and his voice trembled. “No, that’s impossible!”","Everything that had happened today had completely exceeded He Tingchen’s understanding. In his heart, his parents and sister were the kindest. They could not even bear to trample an ant to death, so why would they kill someone?","He Tingchen rushed in front of He Wenyin and was about to break down. “Wenyin, tell me. Wenxian won’t kill anyone, right?”","Actually, He Wenyin could not bear to hurt He Tingchen either. After all, He Tingchen was the only one in the entire He family who treated her the best and cared for her as if she was his biological sister. However, he was protected too well by the He family. He was innocent and could even be said to be stupid. This was not a good thing. Sooner or later, he would have to see the He family’s true colors and learn to accept them.","He Wenyin hesitated for a moment before replying, “She will.”","“Wenxian won’t kill anyone!” He Tingchen could not accept this fact and shouted at He Wenyin, “Wenxian is so good to you. Why are you saying that?!”","He Wenyin: “...”","She pursed her lips and did not retort. He Tingchen was indeed hopelessly stupid.","Not to mention He Tingchen, everyone present and the audience in the live-stream could not accept this fact for a moment. After a long time, they realized that the He family, who had always been called kind, actually had such a dark side. That gentle and kind Miss He actually impersonated someone else, hired assassins to kill someone, and staged a car accident.","Qiao Xi was the first to break the silence. “Expert Yu, let’s cancel the competition.”","Expert Yu recovered from his shock. “Yes... it’s canceled. Miss Qiao, you...”","“Continue the event. Don’t delay everyone’s time,” Qiao Xi said casually.","At this moment, everyone realized that it was the day of the event. Moreover, the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, Twilight, and Mr. Wu were all present!","Everyone did not think about He Wenxian and focused on the event.","Qiao Xi stood up and came to the resting area. She asked for a cup of full-sugar milk tea from the waiter at the side, then raised her eyes to look at the man in front of her. “What do you want to drink, Mr. Twilight?”","“Anything is fine.” Twilight’s voice was still low, but his eyes were a little gentle.","“Then I’ll get you the same thing as me.”","Twilight did not object. “So, the person you offended is He Wenxian. She didn’t hesitate to kill for the title of the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. She’s really audacious.”","Qiao Xi said, “Actually, I’m not familiar with He Wenxian.”","“Oh?” The man’s tone carried a trace of doubt. “But why did I hear that He Wenxian is very familiar with you? Miss Qiao, did you get married at a young age?”","Qiao Xi nodded.","Twilight said calmly, “Most people here know that He Weinian is your husband’s master, but it seems that their relationship isn’t good.”","Qiao Xi smiled. “Then what do you think I should do, Mr. Twilight?”","“Just leave it to Mr. Gu.”","At this moment, the waiter walked over with two cups of milk tea and handed them to the two of them. Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at Twilight, afraid that she would miss a subtle expression.","Twilight looked down at her. “Miss Qiao, it’s not appropriate for you to stare at a man like this, right?”","“I’m sorry, I didn’t mean anything else. I just think you’re very similar to someone I know.”","“Is that so?” Twilight’s tone was calm and emotionless. He picked up the cup and took a few sips of milk tea.","Qiao Xi stared into his eyes. He did not seem to hate milk tea, and Gu Zheng hated sweet things."]},{"number":1437,"title":"Chapter 1437 If You Put On An Act, You Must Go All The Way","paragraphs":["1437 If You Put On An Act, You Must Go All The Way","Qiao Xi’s gaze stopped on the milk tea in the man’s hand. Could it be that he really wasn’t Gu Zheng? Twilight’s figure and eyes were very similar to Gu Zheng’s, but his temperament was very different, and his voice was also different. Hence, He Weinian and He Wenxian did not suspect that he was Gu Zheng.","Even though their figures were similar, their auras were different. It was difficult for others to associate the two of them, but she was Gu Zheng’s wife. They had been together for a year, so she felt an inexplicable sense of familiarity. Even so, she could not explain where that sense of familiarity came from.","Qiao Xi took a sip of milk tea and smiled. “It seems that you don’t hate milk tea, Mr. Twilight?”","“Ms. Qiao, why do you think I hate milk tea?”","As soon as he finished speaking, he lifted his cup and finished his milk tea. “Miss Qiao, the exchange has begun. Let’s quickly take a seat.”","The man strode toward the center of the venue. Then, everyone rushed toward him and chatted enthusiastically with him. He responded curtly to their questions.","Qiao Xi looked at the man’s back and fell into deep thought.","After a while, Song Shijing suddenly appeared. “Madam, the president is here to bring you home.”","Because He Wenxian’s matter had been delayed for too long, the exchange meeting did not last long. It was already lunchtime now. Qiao Xi nodded and subconsciously looked at the crowd. “Where did Twilight go?”","Song Shijing: “...”","Just as Song Shijing was thinking about how to answer, a gentle voice came from behind them. “I’m already here. Xi Xi, why are you still looking for another man?”","Qiao Xi instantly recognized Gu Zheng’s voice and hurriedly turned around. She saw that Gu Zheng was wearing an aqua-blue suit. His hair was neat and tidy, and his entire body exuded an elegant and gentle aura. His deep eyes were fixed on her.","At this moment, Qiao Xi was still holding half a cup of milk tea in her hand. She deliberately finished the milk tea in front of Gu Zheng and observed his reaction.","He clearly saw her drinking milk tea, but Gu Zheng did not say a word. Then, she stared at his wrist.","Qiao Xi stared at his wrist. Gu Zheng’s hand was not bandaged, nor was there a wound. As for Twilight, she was the one who bandaged his injury for him. Although the wound was not serious, it was still very obvious.","There was nothing on Gu Zheng’s wrist. He was only wearing a watch that was worth millions. This watch was something he often wore, so there was no problem.","Was he really not Twilight?","Qiao Xi was filled with doubts, but she still left with Gu Zheng.","On the way, Gu Zheng glanced at her palm and frowned slightly. “Your hand is injured. Let’s go to the hospital.”","Qiao Xi raised her hand. “It’s fine. It’s just a scratch. I wrapped it in multiple layers on purpose.”","With that, she unwrapped the bandage. Just as she was removing it, she heard Gu Zheng say unhurriedly, “Don’t remove it yet.”","“Huh?”","Gu Zheng smiled and said, “You have to put on a show.”","Qiao Xi nodded and lowered her eyes as if she was thinking about something. Gu Zheng, who was at the side, spoke first, “He Wenxian will be released on bail soon.”","Qiao Xi was not surprised and snorted coldly. “I’ve long guessed it. Of course, He Weinian can’t bear to see his precious daughter go to jail. He definitely has to spend a lot of effort to save He Wenxian. If He Wenxian goes to jail just like that, it’ll be meaningless. He Wenxian has been preparing for five years to take over the identity of Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, but the tables were turned against them. I’m really unhappy. I should make her pay a painful price.”","Song Shijing’s eyelids twitched. Of all people, He Wenxian had to provoke Young Madam. She was in trouble now.","Gu Zheng nodded and said gently, “Okay, then what should we do?”","Qiao Xi leaned on Gu Zheng’s shoulder and smiled slyly. “He Weinian will definitely be very busy during this period of time. He’ll be thinking about how to salvage the He family’s good image. However, if he wants to protect his reputation as a benevolent person, he might not be able to protect He Wenxian. As long as the public questions He Wenxian after she comes out, sooner or later, He Weinian will take the initiative to give up on He Wenxian.”","Gu Zheng raised his eyebrows. He already understood what Qiao Xi meant. Just because the He family liked to use public opinion did not mean that Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng did not know how to use it.","“Also...” Qiao Xi paused for a moment before continuing, “He Wenyin came to look for me and said that I’m He Weinian’s target for returning to the country this time.”","“Cheng Juan also called me and told me about this. I’ve thought about it carefully. The only thing that can make He Weinian abandon everything overseas and return to Li City is probably my blood.”","The atmosphere around Gu Zheng suddenly turned cold, and he pursed his lips tightly."]},{"number":1438,"title":"Chapter 1438 I Saw A Trace Of Qiao Xi’s In Her","paragraphs":["1438 I Saw A Trace Of Qiao Xi’s In Her","Qiao Xi’s tone was calm. “Ah Zheng, I told you about Kang Jichuan. Do you think He Weinian knows Kang Jichuan? Since He Weinian was so determined to return to the country, it means that he already knows the use of my blood. If a sly old fox like him had only heard rumors, he wouldn’t have brought his entire family back to Li City. At the very least, he would’ve investigated first and avoided alerting the enemy.","“That’s why I think he might have seen for himself what my blood can do. So there must be some connection between him and Kang Jichuan. At the very least, they must have met.”","He Weinian must have known that Kang Jichuan had taken her blood and used it to save someone. That was why he brought his family back to Li City.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up slightly as she sneered. “Since He Weinian and Kang Jichuan are both our enemies, how can I let He Wenxian go to jail so easily? I must let her reveal her true colors bit by bit. Moreover, there’s a huge secret behind He Wenyin and Cheng Juan. If He Weinian is alerted, we won’t be able to continue investigating Cheng Juan.”","!!","Gu Zheng pursed his lips. Cheng Juan was probably the person in the world who wanted He Weinian to fall the most. He carried a huge grudge and would become their most powerful helper.","...","At the entrance of the venue.","He Wenyin hummed a tune as she walked out. She specially avoided the crowd and prepared to take a taxi.","“Miss He.”","He Wenyin stopped in her tracks, her eyes sharp as she slowly turned around.","Cheng Juan could clearly feel the killing intent exuding from her body. When she saw the man in front of her clearly, the killing intent in her eyes dissipated. Her round eyes were filled with doubt, then she smiled sweetly. “Oh! Mr. Cheng!”","Cheng Juan: “...”","Why did he feel like he saw a trace of Qiao Xi on He Wenyin?","He Wenyin’s face and eyes were round. She had fair skin and two dimples when she smiled. She looked like an innocent and cute little sister. It was not difficult for her to act cute. “Mr. Cheng, why are you looking for me?”","Cheng Juan could not help but hold his forehead and say helplessly, “Alright, don’t pretend to be innocent in front of me.”","He Wenyin pretended to be stupid. “What are you talking about, Mr. Cheng?! I don’t understand!”","“We met at the banquet of the noble daughter of Y Nation five years ago.” Cheng Juan went straight to the point.","He Wenyin narrowed her round eyes and let out a cold glint. The corners of her mouth were clearly still curled up, but her eyes were terrifyingly cold. She said coldly, “Cheng Juan, what exactly are you trying to do?”","“Xi Xi came back from Y Nation five years ago. You were also in Y Nation at that time. Is it a coincidence?”","He Wenyin snorted. “It’s just a coincidence. At that time, I didn’t know Qiao Xi at all.”","“What about He Weinian?” Cheng Juan’s voice carried a trace of probing. “Does He Weinian know Kang Jichuan?”","Kang Jichuan...","He Wenyin slowly said, “I’ve never heard of this person, but the He family did go to Y Nation five years ago. I know that you and Qiao Xi are good friends, so I’m willing to talk to you. However, you have to tell me what you want to know.”","“Second Miss He.” Cheng Juan’s expression suddenly turned cold. Strong hatred burst out of his eyes. He gritted his teeth and asked, “Do you know that He Weinian once sponsored an orphanage?”","He Wenyin nodded.","“Miss He, do you know that those orphans are all dead?”","He Wenyin’s pupils constricted as she looked at Cheng Juan in shock. She seemed to understand something.","Cheng Juan’s heart was filled with hatred. He gritted his teeth and said word by word, “Other than me, they’re all dead.”","“You want to kill He Weinian?” He Wenyin was enlightened.","Yes, not only did he want to kill him, but he also wanted to kill his entire family!","Tears welled up in Cheng Juan’s eyes. He slowly looked up and clenched his fists.","When He Wenyin found out that Cheng Juan and He Weinian had a grudge, she said in relief, “Kang Jichuan and He Weinian know each other. Moreover, you must’ve heard that Kang Jichuan believes in ghosts and gods. Since five years ago, he has always invited exorcists to his house to perform rituals. He even insists on going into seclusion every month to pray for blessings. However, Kang Jichuan grew up in Y Nation and doesn’t have any family members who believe in ghosts and gods. So why did he suddenly believe in these things?","“I’ve sent someone to investigate it. I heard that Kang Jichuan goes into seclusion to pray for blessings for someone who passed away, but he announced to the public that he’s praying for his sister and mother. Moreover, Kang Jichuan often goes to remote areas. He Weinian has also gone there with him. That’s all I know.”","Cheng Juan lowered his eyes. When all the clues were linked together, they seemed to form a line. That was the truth!"]},{"number":1439,"title":"Chapter 1439 Guests Are Here","paragraphs":["1439 Guests Are Here","The car slowly drove into Longwan Residential. Gu Zheng reminded her again, “Don’t remove the bandage yet. It’s still useful.”","Qiao Xi was slightly curious. “You’ve already said it twice. What exactly are you planning on doing?”","“You’ll understand in a while.” Gu Zheng tapped her forehead lightly and smiled mysteriously.","Longwan Residential was located at the intersection between the suburbs and the city. It was a famous wealthy district in Li City. Few outsiders usually came, so it was very quiet. A garden was built around the villa. After entering the villa, the first thing one saw was a luxurious fountain.","After Qiao Xi entered, she could not help but sigh. “As expected of the richest man in Li City! This villa is really luxurious!”","Gu Zheng glanced at her and chuckled. “You only realized it after staying here for a year? If you think it’s too extravagant, you can change it according to your preferences.”","“That’s not necessary. Are there guests at home today? Is that why you specially asked me to pretend to be pitiful?” Qiao Xi thought carefully and felt that someone might have come to Longwan Residential.","Gu Zheng pinched her cheek. “You’re right. Mr. Kang is here again. He even brought... his son and adopted daughter.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes instantly turned cold. “Kang Jichuan is here!”","She knew that Kang Jichuan would visit sooner or later. After all, Kang Ru had not achieved his goal and would definitely have his son persuade her. However, she did not expect Kang Qingzhi to come too.","Didn’t Kang Qingzhi know that she was seriously ill? Why did she come all the way to Li City? Did she want to die?","Qiao Xi thought for a moment and said firmly, “Kang Qingzhi knows that she’s seriously ill, yet she appeared here. Kang Jichuan must want to use me to save Kang Qingzhi again.","“I’ll go see what this stupid pair of father and cunning brother want!”","In the living room of Longwan Residential.","Uncle Sheng brought over two pots of hot tea and some pastries. Kang Qingzhi leaned weakly against Kang Jichuan, while Kang Ru looked out anxiously. “It’s been so long, but Xi Xi isn’t back yet!”","Kang Jichuan had long heard about He Wenxian, but he could not use his cell phone on the plane. After getting off the plane, he rushed to Longwan Residential, so he did not know what was happening at the venue.","At this moment, he wondered if Xi Xi had lied again. Did she steal He Wenxian’s identity and was too embarrassed to see them after being exposed in public?","After waiting for so long and still not seeing anyone, Kang Jichuan was a little impatient. Although Qingzhi and Xi Xi were both his younger sisters, their personalities were vastly different. Qingzhi was obedient, sensible, and understanding. Her health was clearly not good, yet she still forced herself to accompany them and wait for Qiao Xi.","This was unfair to Qingzhi. She was originally the eldest daughter of the Kang family, but now, she had to accompany her father and brother to pick up another young miss. When she found out that she was about to be replaced, she even had to drag her seriously ill body over and wait here. Qiao Xi clearly knew that they were here, but she did not appear for a long time and deliberately ignored them.","The difference between the two of them was obvious.","“Cough, cough...” Suddenly, Kang Qingzhi covered her mouth and coughed in pain.","Kang Ru’s and Kang Jichuan’s expressions changed instantly as they looked at her nervously.","“Qingzhi! Qingzhi, what’s wrong? Are you feeling unwell? Do you need us to call the doctor?” Kang Jichuan panicked as if he was going to rush out with Kang Qingzhi in his arms the next second.","Kang Qingzhi leaned against Kang Jichuan’s shoulder and said weakly, “Brother... I’m fine. We still have to wait for Sister! I... I can still hold on.”","Hearing her words, Kang Jichuan’s heart ached even more. He frowned and asked Uncle Sheng, “Quickly call Xi Xi and ask her to come back quickly. We’ve been waiting for so long!”","Uncle Sheng was also unhappy, but these were Young Madam’s guests, after all. He could only answer as the butler, “Mr. Kang, Young Madam went to the cultural relic restoration exchange this morning. It’s not convenient for me to disturb her, but I’ve already told the president about this. Our president has gone to the venue to pick Young Madam up. They’re already on their way back. Mr. Kang, please calm down.”","“Qingzhi can’t take it anymore.” Kang Jichuan was a little helpless.","“Brother, it’s okay.” Kang Qingzhi’s face was as pale as paper, but she still revealed a smile. “We’re here to bring Sister back. Sister is our top priority. Cough, cough... Cough, cough. If Sister comes back and Brother and I leave, Sister will be unhappy. I’ll definitely feel guilty.”","Kang Ru and Kang Jichuan looked at her with eyes that were filled with guilt. Kang Ru only glanced at her. After all, in his heart, his biological daughter was still the most important. Of course, Qiao Xi was the most important person in his heart. Meanwhile, Kang Jichuan had complicated feelings. He already had such an obedient sister like Qingzhi. No matter how good Xi Xi was, she could not replace Qingzhi’s status in his heart."]},{"number":1440,"title":"Chapter 1440 The Understanding Little B*tch","paragraphs":["1440 The Understanding Little B*tch","At this moment, Kang Qingzhi began to tremble as if she was cold. Her body subconsciously curled up into a ball. Kang Jichuan was originally patient, but when he saw Kang Qingzhi biting her lip to endure the pain, he became even more anxious.","“Father, Qingzhi’s illness has acted up. She really can’t take it anymore. I’ll bring her to see a doctor first. As for Xi Xi...”","Kang Ru seemed to be in a difficult position, but he still nodded. “Qingzhi, if you really can’t take it anymore, then you should go back first. Xi Xi won’t blame you.”","Kang Qingzhi bit her lip and shook her head weakly. “Dad, I can’t do that. You and Brother have been looking forward to Sister’s return for so many years. It wasn’t easy for you to find her now. If Sister finds out that Brother abandoned her for me, she’ll definitely be sad. I’m just an adopted daughter. I shouldn’t be taking away her love. I... Cough, cough...”","“Qingzhi, stop talking.” Kang Jichuan hurriedly interrupted and gently stroked her back to calm her down. He could not help but feel angry. Looking at the weak Qingzhi, he was about to speak when...","Kang Ru slapped his thigh and praised, “Qingzhi, you’re really understanding! Thank you. When we see your sister, I’ll immediately send you to the doctor.”","Kang Qingzhi clenched her pale fingers.","Kang Ru was simple-minded and thought that they were a family. Qiao Xi and Kang Qing were sisters, so it was fine for Kang Qing to wait for a while. However, it was different for Kang Jichuan. Kang Qingzhi had been waiting for so long with her seriously ill body, but their father did not feel sorry for her and was even thinking about Qiao Xi. This made him very angry.","Now, their father had already started to be biased even before Xi Xi returned home. If they waited for Xi Xi to come back, what would he do then?","Kang Qing had bitten her lip so hard that it was bleeding. Kang Jichuan suddenly stood up. “Dad, the exchange meeting ended a long time ago, but Xi Xi hasn’t come back. Who knows how long Qingzhi can last? Her body...”","Before he could finish, a gentle male voice came from outside the door. “Xi Xi, don’t be anxious. Walk slowly.”","Slowly? When Kang Jichuan heard this, the anger in his heart instantly surged. Qingzhi had forcefully endured her weak body and waited for so long, yet Qiao Xi still came back unhurriedly. Was she deliberately making Qingzhi suffer?","Coincidentally, at this moment, Kang Qingzhi frowned and coughed twice, igniting Kang Jichuan’s anger.","“Qingzhi!”","Kang Ru could not help but frown. Xi Xi knew that they were waiting at home but was still stalling for time. It did not matter if he and Jichuan waited a little longer, but Qingzhi’s body was weak to begin with. She really could not afford to wait!","Was Xi Xi deliberately making things difficult for them?","“Qingzhi, I’m sorry. I didn’t expect her to do this. You’re already sick, yet she still wants to torture you. I’ll bring you away now.” Kang Jichuan felt his heart bleed.","“Brother, you can’t... I’m sorry.” Kang Qingzhi’s voice was intermittent. “If it weren’t for you and Dad, I would’ve died a long time ago. How could I have lived until now? It’s the luckiest thing in my life to be able to become your family. Don’t blame my sister because of me. If I had known that my body was so useless, I wouldn’t have come and made things so difficult for you.","“Your family of three will be reunited today. I’m just an adopted daughter. My arrival might make my sister unhappy. Brother, I’ve let you down. Cough, cough!”","The more Kang Qingzhi tolerated it, the more Kang Jichuan felt guilty. At the same time, he was even more dissatisfied with Qiao Xi’s actions.","Look at how understanding Qingzhi was, but what was Xi Xi doing? She clearly knew that they were waiting at home, yet she still did not appear for a long time. She had already lost her memory, so she should not hate him. Hence, she was deliberately making things difficult for Qingzhi. She wanted to take her down a notch and establish an imposing air for herself.","She had already lost her memory, yet she was still making things so difficult for Qingzhi. If she recovered her memory, wouldn’t she kill Qingzhi?","The more Kang Jichuan thought about it, the angrier he became. He could not help but clench his fists.","After a few seconds of silence, he suppressed his anger and shouted outside, “Xi Xi, you’re already back. Hurry up and come in. It doesn’t matter how long my father and I wait for you, but Qingzhi’s health isn’t good, so she can’t wait any longer! If you’re unwilling to come home with us, we won’t force you, but is it so difficult for us to see you? What exactly are you—”","Before he could finish, Gu Zheng helped Qiao Xi in. Her arm was in a cast, and her neck was wrapped in a thick bandage. She looked seriously injured. Song Shijing and Song Shiyu followed closely behind, afraid that Qiao Xi would faint the next second."]},{"number":1441,"title":"Chapter 1441 It’s Her Turn To Perform","paragraphs":["1441 It’s Her Turn To Perform","Qiao Xi had just stepped through the door when she looked at the three of them.","Gu Zheng also looked up. The gentleness in his eyes instantly dissipated and was replaced by a layer of coldness. His voice was extremely cold. “Young Master Kang, were you criticizing Xi Xi just now?”","The three of them widened their eyes as they looked at Qiao Xi’s arm and were stunned for a few seconds.","Gu Zheng carefully supported Qiao Xi. “Xi Xi, sit down and rest first.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","Pretending to be weak was her forte. It was her turn to perform now!","Gu Zheng helped her to the sofa and sat her down. The three people from the Kang family looked a little embarrassed. In the end, Kang Ru broke the silence first. “Xi Xi is injured?”","Kang Jichuan was still angry. After hesitating for a few seconds, he asked, “How did Xi Xi get injured when she went to attend the cultural relic restoration event? Could it be that it’s because you pretended to be the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, so...”","Kang Jichuan thought that Qiao Xi was lying and pretending to be the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. It must be because she couldn’t keep it up anymore and caused a series of conflicts, leading to her injuries. However, she was still his younger sister, after all. It was their first time meeting, so he could not be too harsh. Thus, he restrained himself.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes, and her sharp gaze caused Kang Jichuan’s heart to skip a beat.","She did not say anything. Instead, Gu Zheng sneered. “Young Master Kang, why don’t I understand what you mean? Say that again.”","Meeting their sharp gazes, Kang Jichuan could not say anything.","Gu Zheng sneered. “Young Master Kang, are you here at Longwan Residential today to defend He Wenxian? If that’s the case, you’re not welcome here! Send the guests out!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Uncle Sheng immediately went forward. “Young Master Kang, please leave.”","“I’m not! He Wenxian and I don’t know each other, so how could I stand up for her?!” Kang Jichuan explained anxiously. “I’m just worried about Xi Xi. I thought that she’s injured because of He Wenxian. Actually, if she didn’t pretend to be the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, she wouldn’t have—”","“Young Master Kang, perhaps you’ve made a mistake.” Song Shijing went forward and interrupted Kang Jichuan, his voice carrying a trace of coldness. “Young Madam is the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. He Wenxian pretended to be Young Madam. Mr. Kang, weren’t you informed of this?”","Kang Ru frowned and shouted, “Jichuan, you’ve misunderstood!”","Kang Jichuan’s expression froze as he lowered his head awkwardly.","In that case, it was He Wenxian who stole Xi Xi’s identity and bullied her. However, Qingzhi said that...","Qingzhi had just said it casually. She had never seen Xi Xi before, so it was normal for her not to know.","Kang Jichuan was Qiao Xi’s biological brother and the earl of Y Nation. However, he was almost chased out by Gu Zheng. He felt that it was embarrassing, so his tone was very serious. “Xi Xi, you clearly knew that we were waiting for you here. Why didn’t you come back quickly? Qingzhi has already—”","“Young Master Kang, you’ve been scolding me since I entered. Could it be that you didn’t see the injury on my arm?” Qiao Xi raised her eyes and looked at him coldly.","Kang Jichuan was instantly speechless.","Gu Zheng’s gaze landed on Kang Ru. “Have you been waiting for a long time, Mr. Kang?”","Kang Ru replied truthfully, “An hour.”","“Heh, you’re getting impatient after an hour? But do you know what Xi Xi encountered? He Wenxian faked a car accident and wanted to kill Xi Xi, causing her to be injured. When she found out that you were waiting at home, she refused to go to the hospital. She hurriedly rushed back and only got her wound treated at the last minute. But how is Young Master Kang treating her?","“Ever since Xi Xi entered, Young Master Kang has accused Xi Xi of pretending to be Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. Now, he’s accusing Xi Xi of making you guys wait for too long. All of you can see that she’s injured, but no one is asking about it. You keep saying that you’re here to look for your relative, but do you treat Xi Xi as your family? In that case, you don’t have to come anymore. Uncle Sheng, see the guests out!”","Kang Jichuan hurriedly explained, “Qingzhi’s illness is acting up, and she can’t wait long. I was just anxious. I didn’t—”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Miss Kang is sick? Uncle Sheng, Miss Kang is sick. Why didn’t you get her to seek treatment as soon as possible? Why was she still waiting for me here?”","Uncle Sheng immediately explained, “Young Madam, how would I dare to keep Miss Kang? Miss Kang insisted on staying and waiting for you to come back. If you didn’t come back, she wouldn’t leave. Even Mr. Kang couldn’t persuade her, so I couldn’t do anything about it!”","Kang Jichuan frowned and said unhappily, “Xi Xi, what do you mean by this? Qingzhi is your younger sister. She had good intentions and wanted to wait for you to come back. The long wait made her illness act up. It’s fine that you took so long to come back, but why are you blaming Qingzhi?”"]},{"number":1442,"title":"Chapter 1442 An Illness That Acts Up Intermittently","paragraphs":["1442 An Illness That Acts Up Intermittently","“Young Master Kang, I’ve already said that I got into a car accident.” Qiao Xi stared at him with a burning gaze and said unhurriedly, “Do you mean to say that even though I’ve gotten into a car accident, I can’t treat my injuries, much less go to the hospital? Do you expect me to rush back immediately because Sister Qingzhi can’t wait? It doesn’t matter how injured I am at all, huh? I can’t seek treatment if Miss Kang is sick, right?”","Kang Jichuan’s expression changed as he hurriedly retorted, “Xi Xi, that’s not what I meant!”","“Then what do you mean?” Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Young Master Kang, you’re clearly blaming me for making Miss Kang wait for too long. In that case, I should give up on treatment. Even if my hand were to cripple, I’d have to rush back to see Miss Kang, right? However, if Miss Kang is really unwell, she could go to the hospital. It’s not like I stopped her. Why is it my fault now that her illness has acted up?”","The living room was silent. Qiao Xi’s every word hit the nail on the head, making Kang Jichuan unable to retort.","Song Shiyu, who was at the side, said in a low voice, “Young Madam is right! If Kang Qingzhi wants to show that she’s understanding, that’s her own business. She insisted on enduring it even when her illness flared up. Why should she blame Young Madam?","“I really wonder if Kang Jichuan is Young Madam’s biological brother. We need to do a paternity test. This family keeps saying that they want to bring Young Madam home, but they don’t care about Young Madam at all. Young Madam is so seriously injured, but they don’t care at all.”","Hearing Song Shiyu’s faint voice, Kang Jichuan gritted his teeth. Kang Qingzhi took a deep breath weakly. “Sister, I’m sorry. It’s all my... It’s my fault. My body is useless, so I made Brother worry. Don’t... blame Brother.”","Kang Ru was sandwiched in the middle with a difficult expression. In the end, he sighed helplessly. “Jichuan, as Xi Xi’s brother, you clearly know that she’s injured. It’s fine if you don’t comfort her, but you’ve been blaming her since she entered. You really shouldn’t have done that!”","Then, Kang Ru looked at Qiao Xi, his eyes filled with affection. “Xi Xi, your brother was rash just now. He and Qingzhi grew up together. Qingzhi’s health isn’t good, so your brother can’t help but be more concerned about her. Don’t mind him too much. You’re his younger sister, so he naturally cares about you.”","Qiao Xi smiled noncommittally, then looked at Kang Qingzhi. She looked like a weak little flower, but her eyes carried a trace of resentment.","“It’s okay. We’re family! Even if my brother blames me, I won’t mind.”","Kang Ru smiled in relief. “Alright! My good daughter!”","Kang Qingzhi widened her eyes in shock. Why did she feel that Qiao Xi seemed to have changed into a different person?!","Before she could figure it out, Qiao Xi asked with a smile, “Have all of you had lunch?”","Seeing that she was so obedient, the anger in Kang Jichuan’s heart dissipated a little. Before he could speak, Kang Ru hurriedly replied, “We came in a hurry and haven’t eaten.”","“Then how about we have a meal together?” As soon as Qiao Xi finished speaking, she looked at Kang Qingzhi and said softly, “Miss Kang, if you aren’t feeling well, you should quickly go to the hospital. I naturally won’t force you to stay. Otherwise, if you faint, I won’t be able to absolve myself of the blame.”","Kang Qingzhi bit her lip, her eyes filled with viciousness.","Kang Ru instantly understood what Qiao Xi meant. They could stay and eat together, but the prerequisite was that Kang Qingzhi had to be willing. If her body could not endure it, she could not stay.","He naturally wanted to stay, so he looked at Kang Qingzhi expectantly. “Qingzhi...”","Kang Qingzhi’s nails dug into her palms. If she agreed to stay, it meant that her relapse just now was an act. If she did not agree, Kang Jichuan would naturally not have any objections. However, Kang Ru would definitely blame her and think that she was hindering their relationship as father and daughter.","She did not expect that Qiao Xi would actually use Kang Ru to deal with her. Moreover, this method would not be noticed by others. Everyone would think that Qiao Xi was just doing things appropriately.","Kang Qing thought for a long time before nodding with a smile. “Dad, I’m much better now. It’s fine for me to stay for dinner.”","When Kang Ru heard this, he instantly smiled. “Xi Xi, since Qingzhi said that she’s fine, we can stay.”","Qiao Xi nodded, then instructed Uncle Sheng to make the arrangements. Then, she casually said, “Miss Kang, your illness is really aggressive. It was so serious just now. It’s only been a short while, yet you’ve already recovered. What exactly is your illness? Why does your illness act up intermittently?”"]},{"number":1443,"title":"Chapter 1443 My Home Is Wherever Dad Is","paragraphs":["1443 My Home Is Wherever Dad Is","Kang Qingzhi’s body suddenly stiffened, and she looked flustered. “I... I’m not...”","“Looks like your condition is very serious. You should get yourself checked after dinner. What do you think, Young Master Kang?” Qiao Xi said casually, “I don’t want Young Master Kang to think that I’m making things difficult for you.”","Kang Jichuan looked at Qiao Xi, then at Kang Qingzhi. Had he misunderstood Xi Xi? Xi Xi came back late because of the car accident. She did not deliberately make things difficult for Qingzhi. She was even worried about Qingzhi’s health and advised Qingzhi to see a doctor as soon as possible.","At this moment, when he recalled what he had just said, Kang Jichuan felt a little guilty. He had let Xi Xi down. Now that Xi Xi was not dead, he should be happy. How could he malign her like this?","!!","His eyes were filled with guilt. “Xi Xi, it was my fault just now. I... I’ll bring Qingzhi to the hospital later.”","Qiao Xi nodded. “Let’s hurry up and eat. The food will get cold soon.”","The more understanding she was, the guiltier Kang Jichuan felt. He owed Xi Xi enough. Before he came, he had decided to make it up to Xi Xi. Why did he reprimand Xi Xi the first time they met?","Kang Qingzhi’s eyes were filled with viciousness. Five years ago, Qiao Xi was clearly not like this. She had a proud character. Qiao Xi would’ve exposed her in public the moment she found out she was pretending to be sick. Even if their brother reprimanded her, she would not give in. Instead, she would mock their brother. However, Qiao Xi only said a few gentle-sounding words this time, and her eyes were filled with disappointment. Their brother was at a loss and felt that he owed Qiao Xi.","At this moment, the butler served the food. Gu Zheng picked up a piece of fish and carefully removed the bones before giving it to Qiao Xi. Then, he raised his eyes and glanced at Kang Qingzhi. “Looks like Miss Kang is really fine now.”","Kang Qingzhi was in an uncomfortable situation and could only answer with a smile, “My illness has always been like this. It comes and goes quickly. Thank you for your concern, Mr. Gu.”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. After so many years, Kang Qingzhi was still the same. How boring!","Kang Ru was simple-minded and could not understand what was going on. He only felt that since Xi Xi was willing to let them stay for dinner, she had probably accepted them. It seemed that it would not be long before she would go home with them.","Kang Ru’s life had been extremely smooth-sailing. He was too arbitrary and had even forgotten how Xia Yunqiu left him. Seeing that Qiao Xi had gotten closer to him, Kang Ru was so proud that he forgot about everything else. He said impatiently, “Xi Xi, since you’re willing to let us stay for dinner, have you already accepted your brother and me? I still hope that you can return to Y Nation with us. As long as you’re willing to go back, I’ll support you in whatever you want to do.”","The moment that was said, the few of them paused, and the surroundings fell silent.","Kang Qingzhi bit her lip. The delicacies on the table were tasteless.","Kang Jichuan subconsciously glanced at Kang Qingzhi, then raised his eyes to look at Qiao Xi with an extremely complicated gaze.","Everyone was waiting for Qiao Xi’s answer. Just as Kang Ru thought that Qiao Xi would still refuse him, Qiao Xi suddenly smiled. “Sure!”","The surroundings fell into a dead silence.","She... She actually agreed?","Qiao Xi said unhurriedly, “But... Dad, I still have a lot of work to do in Li City. I can’t return to Y Nation with you for the time being. After I’m done dealing with things here, I can go home with you for a while.”","Kang Ru originally thought that he would return in disappointment this time, but he did not expect Qiao Xi to agree readily. Although she only agreed to a temporary stay in Y Nation, it was enough to make him excited. “Alright! You can stay as long as you want. Since you’ll be staying in Li City for the time being, I’ll stay here too. After you’re done with your matters, I’ll go back with you.","“Xi Xi, I’ve also bought a villa in Li City. It’s already been tidied up. Do you want to stay at home with me?”","Song Shijing and Song Shiyu looked at each other, and their hearts trembled. They wanted to kidnap Young Madam and leave the president alone in the house?","Qiao Xi smiled sweetly. “Alright! Although I’m married, my home is wherever Dad is. We haven’t seen each other for so many years, so I should go home and stay with you.”","‘My home is wherever Dad is!’","These words touched Kang Ru’s heart. He was so excited that he was at a loss for what to do. The fatherly love in his heart was about to surge out. When Kang Jichuan heard Qiao Xi’s words, the trace of fear and uneasiness in his heart earlier dissipated.","Since Xi Xi had agreed to go home, it meant that she had not recalled what had happened back then. In that case, he still had a chance to make it up to her. When Xi Xi and Qingzhi became good friends, Xi Xi would be willing to help Qingzhi with a blood transfusion."]},{"number":1444,"title":"Chapter 1444 Who’s The Real Eldest Miss Kang?","paragraphs":["1444 Who’s The Real Eldest Miss Kang?","Kang Jichuan could not help but recall what had happened five years ago. Back then, when Xi Xi was in Y Nation, she always targeted Qingzhi and looked for trouble with her. She even said that if he wanted her to come home, he had to chase Qingzhi away. That was why he hated Xi Xi a little.","Xi Xi was his biological sister, so his heart naturally ached for her. However, how could Xi Xi compare to Qingzhi? If only one of them could live, he could only bear the pain and give up on Xi Xi.","Qiao Xi swept her gaze over everyone, her eyes filled with ridicule. At this moment, her memory had not completely recovered, but from Kang Qingzhi’s appearance, she knew that Kang Qingzhi had deliberately pretended to be sick to gain Kang Jichuan’s sympathy back then and make him misunderstand her. She trusted Kang Jichuan too much, so she exposed Kang Qingzhi in front of him.","One was his weak and sickly sister who had accompanied him for many years, while the other was his biological sister who shared no emotional foundation with him. Kang Jichuan chose to believe in Kang Qingzhi without hesitation.","In Kang Jichuan’s opinion, Qiao Xi was willful and arrogant. Qiao Xi was also Kang Qingzhi’s greatest threat. At that time, Qiao Xi knew that she would not have any good days if she went back with Kang Jichuan, so she jumped into the sea resolutely.","However, at this moment, she no longer trusted Kang Jichuan, so all the methods Kang Qing knew were useless against her. The reason why she agreed to return to the Kang family was not because of their ridiculous kinship but because she wanted to take revenge for the forced blood transfusion back then!","“Mr. Kang,” Gu Zheng suddenly said. “I have something to tell you.”","Kang Ru was in a good mood. Qiao Xi agreeing to go home with him was a pleasant surprise. When he heard Gu Zheng speak, he smiled and nodded. “Mr. Gu, feel free to tell me.”","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled up, and his light brown eyes were filled with coldness. “Xi Xi has already suffered too much throughout the years. Hence, ever since Xi Xi married me, I’ve taken care of her in every way and refused to let her suffer any grievances. However, the Kang family already has an adopted daughter now. If Mrs. Gu returns to the Kang family and has to listen to others, I won’t agree to let her return. After all, Xi Xi has already suffered because of your adopted daughter today.","“In short, I don’t want to see Xi Xi suffer again. If you want Xi Xi to go back, you have to make her position known and let everyone know who the real eldest daughter of the Kang family is.”","The moment that was said, the dining hall fell silent.","Kang Ru’s eyes were filled with a complicated expression. The last time he came, he was in a hurry and did not investigate Xi Xi’s past. After he returned, he investigated Xi Xi and found out that when she returned to the Xu family, she was harmed by Xu Anran many times. However, Qingzhi was different from Xu Anran! Although Qingzhi was an adopted daughter, she had always been obedient, sensible, and kind-hearted. She would not fight with Xi Xi.","Now that Gu Zheng said such things in public, wouldn’t it hurt Qingzhi’s heart?","Kang Jichuan immediately covered Kang Qingzhi’s ears and said unhappily, “Mr. Gu, Qingzhi is different from the adopted daughter of the Xu family. She has never fought for anything. How could she let Xi Xi suffer? Mr. Gu, why do you have to...”","Kang Qingzhi’s eyes were red, and her face was pale. Her voice trembled slightly. “Mr. Gu, I... I know my identity. I won’t compete with my sister. My sister is the eldest daughter of the Kang family. She should be the most important person in the family.”","Gu Zheng asked casually, “Miss Kang, since you’re an understanding adopted daughter who won’t fight for anything, you won’t object to Mr. Kang making Xi Xi’s position known, right?”","Kang Qingzhi gasped.","“That’s right...”","Gu Zheng looked at Kang Ru. “You also know what Xi Xi has encountered. I can’t let the Xu family’s incident happen again, much less let Xi Xi suffer. Mr. Kang, you’re Xi Xi’s father, so you can naturally understand my love for Xi Xi.”","Kang Ru’s hand that was holding the chopsticks trembled. Gu Zheng was worried that Xi Xi would suffer. As Xi Xi’s father, he naturally could understand. Moreover, he knew that Xi Xi had suffered a lot all these years. She was bullied by that mother and daughter in the Qiao family and then by Xu Anran. She had already suffered a lot. Such a thing absolutely could not happen again.","Kang Ru looked at the silent Qiao Xi, and his heart ached. He immediately nodded and agreed. “Mr. Gu, you’re right. Xi Xi is my biological daughter. She has suffered a lot all these years when she was wandering outside. I naturally have to dote on her a little more. Qingzhi is understanding and definitely won’t mind, right?”","Kang Qingzhi pursed her lips tightly, her nails almost digging into her palms. The sharp pain made her maintain her rationality, but she still smiled. “Dad, I won’t mind.”","Kang Jichuan’s gaze shifted between Kang Qingzhi and Qiao Xi. He was slightly dissatisfied in his heart. Xi Xi had been bullied by Xu Anran, so of course, his heart ached for her. However, this had nothing to do with Qingzhi!"]},{"number":1445,"title":"Chapter 1445 I’ll Avenge You","paragraphs":["1445 I’ll Avenge You","Now that Kang Ru had already agreed, if Kang Jichuan objected, not only would he anger Kang Ru, but he would also offend Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng. He could only watch helplessly as Kang Qingzhi’s face was filled with disappointment and she weakly forced a smile.","Kang Jichuan’s heart ached. Why did Xi Xi have to target Qingzhi? She was his father’s biological daughter and the daughter of the Kang family. Why couldn’t she tolerate an adopted daughter who was weak and sick?","She was indeed as mean as before!","Qiao Xi picked up a tissue and wiped the corners of her mouth. She took a sip of fruit juice and looked at the Kang family with a meaningful smile.","Kang Jichuan helped Kang Qingzhi up. Kang Ru’s eyes were filled with excitement. “Xi Xi, I’ll get the servants to prepare your room. Qingzhi will also be recuperating in Li City for a period of time, so Jichuan and I will both be here. If you have time, go home and stay there.”","“Alright,” Qiao Xi agreed with a smile.","The Kang family bought a villa in Li City not because of her but to let Kang Qingzhi recuperate. She would wait for Kang Qingzhi to stay for a period of time before going over to recreate the scene from back then. She wondered what Kang Qingzhi’s and Kang Jichuan’s expressions would be when they found out that she had recovered her memory.","When the three people from the Kang family were leaving, Kang Ru looked satisfied, while Kang Jichuan had a complicated expression on his face. As for Kang Qingzhi, she looked sick from the beginning to the end. She covered her mouth and coughed twice.","After all, she was the daughter the Kang family raised. Kang Ru’s heart naturally ached for Kang Qingzhi. He asked with a worried expression, “Qingzhi, let’s go home first. We’ll get a doctor to treat you later.”","Kang Qingzhi shook her head weakly. “It’s alright, Dad. It’s just an old problem. I’ll be fine in a while. If Sister finds out that you’re so good to an adopted daughter, she’ll definitely be sad.”","“You grew up by my side. Although you’re an adopted daughter, Jichuan and I treat you as family. How can I not care about you?” Kang Ru’s eyes were filled with heartache.","Kang Qingzhi stood at the door and looked back at Qiao Xi with a smile.","Yes! So what if she was an adopted daughter? She had lived with the Kang father and son for more than 10 years and had a deep relationship with them. Qiao Xi could not compare to her status in the hearts of the Kang father and son at all.","Just as Kang Qingzhi was feeling proud of herself, she heard Kang Ru say earnestly, “Qingzhi, you saw it just now. Xi Xi is so understanding. It’s just that she has suffered too much all these years when she was wandering outside and was bullied by that adopted daughter of the Xu family, so she’s a little wary of you. However, she won’t make things difficult for you. Don’t misunderstand Xi Xi.”","The smile on Kang Qingzhi’s face froze as intense anger surged in her heart.","She misunderstood Qiao Xi? Was Qiao Xi still the most important person in Kang Ru’s heart?","“Don’t think too much. Xi Xi is a child who looks cold on the surface but has a warm heart. You’ll know after interacting with her for a long time,” Kang Ru said, then his gaze suddenly froze. “This child is like her mother. Yunqiu had the same character. Unfortunately, she...”","Kang Qingzhi clenched her fists tightly, her sharp nails leaving deep marks on her palms.","It was Xia Yunqiu again! It was because of this woman that Kang Ru insisted on finding his biological daughter. That woman had already been dead for so many years. What right did the noble earl have to keep thinking about her?","Why wasn’t Qiao Xi dead? She fell into the sea and fell into a coma, but she still didn’t die. However, she wouldn’t always be so lucky. She wasn’t able to kill Qiao Xi previously, but she could make another attempt in the future.","At this moment, Qiao Xi was standing in the living room and watching the three people from the Kang family leave. She instructed, “Close the door.”","Uncle Sheng immediately closed the door of the villa, cutting off all lines of sight.","Qiao Xi glanced sideways. “Ah Zheng, you know very well that even though Kang Ru agreed to that matter, it’s impossible for them to do it. They’re just saying it.”","“Then why do you think I said it at the dining table, Xi Xi?” Gu Zheng’s voice was gentle.","Qiao Xi looked at his eyes that were as deep as obsidian as if she had been struck by love. She looked away unnaturally and hesitated for a few seconds before replying, “Is it to anger Kang Qingzhi?”","Gu Zheng suddenly approached her and pinched her slightly red earlobe. His magnetic voice sounded in her ear. “More or less. They made my Xi Xi suffer, so I won’t let them have an easy time. However, Xi Xi still has to maintain her weak image, so I’ll take revenge for you.”","At this instant, Qiao Xi felt that her heart was about to melt. It really felt good to be cared for. Moreover, the man in front of her could easily see through her thoughts. She didn’t have to be direct with her words."]},{"number":1446,"title":"Chapter 1446 Found A Scapegoat","paragraphs":["1446 Found A Scapegoat","s","At this moment, Song Shiyu suddenly rushed over and reported, “President, our people found out that He Weinian went to Y Nation many times five years ago, but He Tingchen and He Wenxian never went. He only brought Madam He along.”","Qiao Xi lazily leaned against the sofa and looked at Gu Zheng. “Does the He family have business in Y Nation? Why did they go to Y Nation?”","Gu Zheng stopped picking up the cup and gestured for Song Shijing and Song Shiyu to turn around and leave. He said slowly, “Xi Xi, five years ago, I cut off all contact with the He family.”","Qiao Xi’s gaze was slightly cold.","“I’ve always thought that my memory loss was related to the He family. After all, how can there be so many coincidences in the world? I lost my memory five years ago and happened to cut off all ties with the He family.”","Qiao Xi also felt that Gu Zheng’s words made sense. There must be something wrong with this abnormality. Why did everything happen five years ago?","Five years ago, she met Kang Jichuan in Y Nation and had her blood drawn. She had no choice but to jump into the sea. Gu Zheng had cut off all contact with the He family and lost his memory. He was also in Y Nation. Coupled with the fact that He Weinian knew the secret of her blood, she had always thought that He Weinian and Kang Jichuan knew each other. In that case, could it be that the He family and Kang Jichuan had joined forces?","However, it seemed that Kang Jichuan and Kang Qingzhi did not know Gu Zheng well. Otherwise, they would not have been so calm and composed when they saw Gu Zheng again.","If Kang Jichuan did not know that Gu Zheng had lost his memory, then his collaboration with the He family might be about something else. What deal did they make?","Qiao Xi supported her chin and tapped her fair cheek with her fingertip. She said thoughtfully, “Kang Jichuan is a meticulous person. Even if he knows He Weinian, it’s impossible for him to easily tell He Weinian this secret, but it’s possible if it’s someone else.”","“Kang Qingzhi.” Gu Zheng met Qiao Xi’s eyes, and the two of them said this name in unison.","“He Weinian knows the secret of my blood, but he doesn’t seem to know Kang Ru and Kang Jichuan. That’s too strange. Moreover, the sudden recovery of a person who’s already incurable will naturally attract people’s attention.”","Five years ago, Kang Qingzhi knew that she was seriously ill and clung to the Kang father and son. From time to time, she would say that she was about to die to gain sympathy. However, five years had passed and she was still alive and well. She could even go overseas to play. Was she really seriously ill?","Kang Qingzhi knew that it was very difficult for an adopted daughter like her to cause such a big commotion. Moreover, Kang Jichuan would not tell her the secret of Qiao Xi’s blood. How did she know and how did she tell He Weinian?","Even though Kang Qingzhi was scheming, she was just a 16-year-old girl at that time. She could pretend to be pitiful and fight for favor, but why would she use He Weinian to set up a trap?","Qiao Xi suddenly asked, “Has He Wenxian come out?”","“Yes, the He family found a scapegoat and quickly bailed her out.”","Qiao Xi was not surprised. The He family should be very familiar with doing such things.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with coldness. “The chauffeur who hit you took the initiative to confess and take on all the blame. He said that he chose his target indiscriminately. From the branded clothes you were wearing, he could tell that you were a rich person, so he drove over on impulse.","“As for why he exposed He Wenxian after he was arrested, he said that he heard that there was an exchange meeting going on upstairs and that there was a very famous cultural relic restorer called He Wenxian. In order to get away with the crime, he said He Wenxian’s name.","“The only witness has already changed his mind. The police don’t have any other evidence, and He Wenxian pretending to be you doesn’t constitute a crime. The police could only release He Wenxian.”","Qiao Xi knew that He Weinian would definitely try his best to protect his beloved daughter, but she did not expect He Wenxian to be released so quickly.","“The entire exchange was live-streamed, and the He family has also been questioned. I’m really curious about how He Weinian is going to salvage the He family’s image.”","Qiao Xi looked at Gu Zheng and asked meaningfully, “Say, He Weinian has been wearing the mask of a kind person for so many years, yet such a scandal suddenly broke out. It’s an undeniable fact that He Wenxian was pretending to be me. How are they going to explain themselves?”","A trace of mockery appeared in Gu Zheng’s light brown eyes. He said bluntly, “Donation.”","Qiao Xi came to a sudden understanding. That was right! Wasn’t this He Weinian’s usual method?","“He Weinian has always relied on donations to offset negative effects. He Wenxian pretended to be you because of her vanity, but she has also donated a lot of money and helped many people. In that case, such a small matter like pretending to be someone else will naturally be soon forgotten.”"]},{"number":1447,"title":"Chapter 1447 Achilles Heel","paragraphs":["1447 Achilles Heel","Qiao Xi suddenly recalled. “Right. Is that necklace, ‘Scorching Heart,’ still in the He family?”","“It’s still there.” Gu Zheng suddenly smirked. “What if the necklace the He family takes out is fake? What should the He family do then?”","Qiao Xi instantly understood what Gu Zheng meant.","That was right! He Wenxian relied on donations to salvage the He family’s image. The He family’s good reputation was also achieved through donations. Once the donations were proven to be fake, the He family would definitely face a crisis in their reputation.","At this moment, Kang Ru and the other two had already returned to their villa in Li City. Kang Ru was rich and would buy real estate wherever they went. Now that they were in Li City, they naturally would not treat themselves badly. The Kang family’s villa was in a very famous villa area in Li City. There was a garden and a pavilion in the courtyard. Moreover, every villa was very far away from each other to ensure enough privacy. It was very suitable for recuperation.","Kang Ru smiled and nodded. “Qingzhi, the environment here is not bad. Rest here and don’t go to crowded places. There’ll be doctors coming to check on you every day.”","Kang Qingzhi nodded and followed the Kang father and son into the villa. The two of them went straight upstairs. When they turned around, they realized that Kang Qingzhi was still standing there with a troubled expression.","Kang Ru and Kang Jichuan turned around slightly and asked in confusion, “Qingzhi, why are you standing there? Hurry up and go back to your room to rest.”","Kang Qingzhi lowered her eyes and bit her lip. She said uneasily, “Dad, Brother, I know that there are only three rooms on the second floor. If I go to the second floor, then... I’ll stay on the first floor. That way, I won’t have to go up and down.”","Kang Ru frowned. “That won’t do! The first floor is for the servants. As the daughter of the Kang family, how can you stay there?! Moreover, the rooms on the first floor are too small. You won’t be used to staying there!”","“But...” Kang Qingzhi hesitated, and her voice trembled slightly. “But Sister Xi Xi also said that she’ll stay at home. If I stay on the second floor, then Sister will have to stay on the first floor. She’s your biological daughter, and I’m just an adopted daughter. How can I occupy Sister’s room?”","Kang Ru instantly choked, and his eyes were filled with complicated emotions. Qingzhi had been obedient and sensible since she was young. She was clearly weak and sick, but she always thought of others. There were indeed only three rooms on the second floor. Qingzhi was worried that Xi Xi would be unhappy if she stayed there, and she was also worried that he and Jichuan would be stuck in the middle.","Kang Ru looked at Kang Qingzhi’s pale cheeks and weak body, and his heart instantly ached. He had long forgotten what he had promised Gu Zheng and blurted out, “Qingzhi, don’t worry and stay on the second floor. After all, your health isn’t good. The room on the second floor is big and airy, so it’s suitable for you to recuperate there. Xi Xi is your sister and is understanding. She won’t mind.”","“Jichuan, quickly help Qingzhi up!”","Kang Qingzhi knew that she had gotten her wish and moved into the largest and most brightly lit room in the villa. The decorations in the room were also the most luxurious. Now that her luggage had already been moved in, could Qiao Xi still chase her out?","Agreeing to clear Qiao Xi’s name and clarify her identity as the eldest miss were nothing but empty words! Even if her identity was restored, Kang Qingzhi would still be the most favored person in the entire Kang family!","The corners of Kang Qingzhi’s mouth curled up proudly. Five years ago, she drove a wedge between Kang Jichuan and Qiao Xi. In order to save her, Kang Jichuan almost caused Qiao Xi’s death. Five years later, she could still make Kang Ru hate his biological daughter and completely give up on Qiao Xi.","Moreover, she had Old Madam Kang backing her. No matter how well Qiao Xi did, she would not be able to win Old Madam Kang’s favor. She could guarantee that as long as Old Madam Kang saw Qiao Xi’s face, she would be extremely disgusted.","In the past, the person Old Madam Kang hated the most was Xia Yunqiu. It was because of this b*tch that Kang Ru never married. Many noble families wanted to marry into the Kang family, but Kang Ru rejected them all. He disobeyed his entire family for Xia Yunqiu, but Xia Yunqiu was unwilling to return to his side even until her death.","Old Madam Kang treated Xia Yunqiu as a thorn in her side. How could she like a granddaughter who was so similar to Xia Yunqiu?","Kang Qingzhi lay comfortably on the rocking chair at the side of the balcony and suddenly frowned. The Kang family would naturally stand on her side, but Qiao Xi had Gu Zheng protecting her. That man was clearly not simple. With him by Qiao Xi’s side, it would be extremely difficult to obtain Qiao Xi’s blood.","At this moment, there was a knock on the door.","“Qingzhi, can I come in?”","Hearing this voice, Kang Qingzhi’s vicious expression suddenly vanished. She covered her lips and coughed a few times. She said weakly, “Brother, come in.”","Kang Jichuan pushed the door open and entered with a registration form in his hand. “Qingzhi, I remember that you’ve always liked perfumes. You even came up with a few recipes. Coincidentally, the International Fragrance Competition is being held in Li City this year. Do you want to participate?”"]},{"number":1448,"title":"Chapter 1448 We’re Allies!","paragraphs":["1448 We’re Allies!","Kang Qingzhi lowered her eyes to look at the registration form and pretended to be uneasy. “Brother, I... I like to make perfumes, but if I can’t advance, I’ll embarrass you and Dad.”","Kang Jichuan smiled gently. “It doesn’t matter. As long as you want to participate, I’ll help you arrange everything. I guarantee that you’ll be able to advance.”","It was good enough that she was happy. As for who he would hurt by secretly manipulating things, Kang Jichuan did not care at all.","Kang Qingzhi was in a dilemma. “Brother, I heard that you have to submit a perfume recipe every week for the perfume competition, but I...”","“You don’t have to worry about that. Since I’ve promised you, I’ll naturally help you solve these problems. Rest well. You just have to make the perfumes during the finals.”","After Kang Jichuan left, Kang Qingzhi immediately made a call. “Yes! I want to participate in the perfume competition. No matter what, you have to help me get rid of Qiao Xi.","“She likes perfumes and will definitely participate in the perfume competition. I have the recipes she left behind back then. Fortunately, she has already lost her memory and can’t remember the recipes from back then.","“Helping me is equivalent to helping yourself. As long as Qiao Xi falls, she won’t be a threat to you. We’re allies!”","At this point, Kang Qingzhi lowered her voice and smiled. “And haven’t you always wanted her blood? Don’t forget how magical her blood is. As long as you capture her, she’ll forever be at your disposal. You don’t have to worry about your secret being exposed.”","The person on the other end of the phone hesitated for a few seconds and said a few words. A moment later, Kang Qingzhi revealed a satisfied smile. “You don’t have to worry about that. Even if the matter is exposed, it won’t be traced back to you. That stupid woman hasn’t recovered her memory. She almost died back then. She naturally won’t be able to escape this time.”","Kang Qingzhi seemed to have convinced the person on the other end of the phone. After hanging up, she leaned against the rocking chair and sunbathed.","As the daughter of the Kang family, she was really blessed! She did not need to do anything as someone would help her arrange everything.","The Kang family clearly already had a favored daughter, so why did her father insist on finding his biological daughter? Could her father not give up on Qiao Xi for her?","Kang Qingzhi’s eyes were filled with viciousness. She wanted everyone to know who was most suitable to be the eldest daughter of the Kang family! She wanted to completely destroy Qiao Xi and let her die in pain!","...","Longwan Residential.","Gu Zheng knocked on the door of the study and walked in, placing a registration form on the table.","“International Fragrance Competition? No one from Gu Corporation is participating?” Qiao Xi asked.","“A few perfumers have signed up. You should participate too.”","Ever since the perfume exchange, Qiao Xi had not made perfumes. She raised her eyebrows and looked at Gu Zheng. “It’s just a perfume competition. Why do you want me to participate?”","Gu Zheng smiled gently. “The champion of this International Fragrance Competition will get the right to collaborate with the top eight perfume companies in the world. Gu Corporation is among these eight companies. I don’t like working with other perfumers, so I hope you can get first place and collaborate with Gu Corporation.”","With that, he glanced at her meaningfully. “Mrs. Gu, you don’t have to hide it from me. I know your identity very well.”","Qiao Xi’s heart skipped a beat as she lowered her eyes. “Let me think about it.”","She liked perfumes and had been a judge in perfume competitions, but ever since the death of the president of the Fragrance Association, she had never participated in the activities of the Fragrance Association.","Moreover, she was qualified to be a judge. If she participated in the competition, wouldn’t she be bullying others?","Most importantly, she really did not like the new president of the Fragrance Association. The thought of seeing that person made her feel inexplicably resistant, so she was still hesitating about whether to sign up.","She took the registration form and returned to the bedroom. Not long after she lay down, she fell asleep and fell into another dream.","Qiao Xi looked at the scene in her dream and her appearance. She knew that this was Y Nation. It was a piece of memory from when she returned with Kang Jichuan.","Back then, Kang Jichuan’s hypnosis caused her to lose her memory. Now that her memory was recovering bit by bit through her dreams, it was not strange. However, what she did not understand was that every time she recovered her memory, she would usually be stimulated by something. However, nothing major happened today!","At this moment, she was rummaging through the room in her dream. Her eyes were filled with anxiety. She remembered putting the perfume box in the drawer, but it suddenly disappeared.","During that period of time, she suddenly became obsessed with perfumes. Those perfume recipes were written by her on a whim. She even gave up food and sleep to work on them. However, they disappeared without a trace."]},{"number":1449,"title":"Chapter 1449 The Lost Recipes","paragraphs":["1449 The Lost Recipes","In her dream, Qiao Xi was extremely anxious. She flipped through the room until it was very messy. She searched every corner, but she still could not find the recipes.","Later on, she went downstairs to the living room and saw Kang Qingzhi holding a few sheets of paper in her hand. She smiled and walked in front of Kang Jichuan. “Brother, these are the perfume recipes I came up with. Take a look!”","At that time, Qiao Xi was still very surprised. When did Kang Qingzhi suddenly like making perfumes? She suddenly recalled the recipes she had lost and went over to take a look. She was instantly infuriated.","They were clearly the perfume recipes she lost!","Qiao Xi felt that Kang Jichuan was her biological brother and would definitely believe her, so she immediately looked at Kang Qingzhi with a burning gaze and questioned, “When did these perfume recipes become yours?”","Kang Qingzhi met her eyes, and her eyes instantly turned red. She lowered her hands and took a few steps back in fear.","Kang Jichuan immediately frowned. “Qingzhi, what’s wrong?”","Kang Qingzhi pursed her lips aggrievedly. “Brother, I know that I’m an adopted daughter. I’m already very grateful that you and Dad took me in. Now that Sister Xi Xi is back, I shouldn’t stop your family from reuniting. Why don’t I leave the Kang family?”","Kang Jichuan was instantly infuriated when he heard this. He immediately turned to look at Qiao Xi and berated angrily, “Xi Xi, I told you a long time ago that Qingzhi has lived in the Kang family for more than ten years. She’s also the daughter of the Kang family. Even if you’re back now, her life shouldn’t change in the slightest. Why do you always bully her? She’s always been obedient and sensible. She doesn’t fight for anything. How is she stopping you in any way?”","Qiao Xi was instantly stunned with a shocked expression. “When did I bully her?”","“Then why are you always making things difficult for Qingzhi? Is it because she’s an adopted daughter?” Kang Jichuan glanced at her coldly and turned around to comfort Kang Qingzhi softly. “Qingzhi, you grew up in the Kang family. You’ll always be the daughter of the Kang family. You’re my father’s daughter and my sister. No matter who comes back to the family, we won’t let you leave.”","Kang Jichuan’s eyes were filled with disappointment as he looked at Qiao Xi. He suddenly regretted letting Qiao Xi come back. After all, Qiao Xi had been wandering outside for so many years and was tainted with many bad habits. Qingzhi was already so tolerant, but she just could not tolerate Qingzhi and always bullied her.","Qiao Xi was disappointed. “I’ve never despised her identity as an adopted daughter, nor have I made things difficult for her!”","“If you didn’t make things difficult for Qingzhi, why does she want to leave the Kang family as soon as you come back? Could it be that she’s deliberately framing you? Xi Xi, Qingzhi and I grew up together. I know her character very well. She would rather suffer than implicate others. How can you bear to do this to her?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","She lowered her eyes coldly and pointed at the perfume recipes. “Kang Qingzhi, are you sure you wrote these?”","Kang Qingzhi took a few steps back in fear and grabbed Kang Jichuan’s sleeve like a frightened little white rabbit. “Brother...”","In Kang Jichuan’s opinion, Qiao Xi was going to cause trouble again today. He was just about to reprimand her when Qiao Xi said coldly, “I spent a few days writing these three perfume recipes. They suddenly disappeared this morning. How did they become the perfume recipes you wrote?”","The moment that was said, the living room fell silent.","Kang Qingzhi’s eyes were red as tears welled up in her eyes. She said anxiously, “Xi Xi, you... Are you saying that I stole your perfume recipes? I... I really didn’t do it!”","She hid behind Kang Jichuan in a panic, her pale fingers pulling Kang Jichuan’s clothes. She looked at him with sorrow and pleading eyes. She shed tears and shook her head. “Brother, I really didn’t steal anything! Xi Xi, if you like these perfume recipes, I can give them to you, but I...”","Her thin body could not help but tremble, and her voice was choked up. “Sister Xi Xi, it’s all my fault. If I had known... that you like to make perfumes, I wouldn’t have made these. I’ll give you the perfume recipes. I... I don’t want them anymore!”","Kang Qingzhi was weak to begin with. At this moment, tears were streaming down her face as she leaned against Kang Jichuan’s shoulder. The more she retreated, the more it made Qiao Xi look like she was causing trouble for no reason.","When Kang Jichuan saw that Kang Qingzhi was crying until she was out of breath, he was angered to the point his face turned red. He roared angrily. “Qiao Xi!”","He kept telling himself that Xi Xi was his biological sister. He took a long time to calm down before suppressing the anger in his heart. He tried his best to say in a gentle voice, “Xi Xi, it’s a good thing that you like to make perfumes, but why do you have to snatch Qingzhi’s perfume recipes? You also know that Qingzhi’s health isn’t good, so she has to rest for a long time after writing a few perfume recipes. Moreover, I was the one who accompanied her to write these perfume recipes. I saw her sniff the spices bit by bit and choose the spices. She worked hard to come up with them. Why should Qingzhi give them to you just because you like to make perfumes?”"]},{"number":1450,"title":"Chapter 1450 Enough Is Enough!","paragraphs":["1450 Enough Is Enough!","“Xi Xi, don’t think that just because you’re my biological sister, I have to be biased toward you. You can’t bully Qingzhi as you please! Don’t be too selfish!”","Hearing Kang Jichuan’s berating, Qiao Xi’s heart turned cold bit by bit. She widened her eyes in shock and sorrow. “This is clearly...”","“Shut up! Stop talking!”","Kang Jichuan interrupted her coldly and carried Kang Qingzhi upstairs. Before he left, he said, “Aunt Zhang, send Xi Xi back to her room and let her reflect on her mistakes!”","!!","Qiao Xi stood on the spot and watched the two of them leave. The servant’s disdainful voice sounded in her ears. “Second Miss, Sir asked you to reflect on yourself behind closed doors. Quickly return to your room. I advise you to stop before you go too far!”","At that time, although Qiao Xi was angry, she did not pursue the matter because of the last trace of kinship. After that, she wrote a few more perfume recipes, and they disappeared soon after. Then, she saw Kang Qingzhi acting in front of Kang Jichuan with her perfume recipes.","Qiao Xi knew that Kang Jichuan would not believe her, so she did not ask further. During that period of time, she came up with more than 20 perfume recipes, but they were all stolen by Kang Qingzhi.","The scene in the dream changed. Qiao Xi saw the servant, Aunt Zhang, quietly enter her room and steal the perfume recipes before handing them to Kang Qingzhi.","“Miss Qingzhi, she wrote a few more perfume recipes. Take a look.”","Kang Qingzhi leaned against the recliner and smiled weakly. “It’s useless for her to keep these perfume recipes. I’ll take them to participate in the competition so that I can do these recipes justice.”","The dream ended here. Qiao Xi suddenly opened her eyes, her heart thumping.","At this moment, she finally understood why she had suddenly recovered her memory. It was because the International Fragrance Competition had stimulated her and triggered her memories.","It turned out that Kang Qingzhi stole her perfume recipes!","She immediately took out her phone and sent a message. The other party quickly replied: [Kang Qingzhi is the champion of two consecutive competitions. However, because of her health, she didn’t participate in the past two years.]","Qiao Xi had been a judge before, but she had never met Kang Qingzhi. It was probably because Kang Qingzhi only participated in the competition when she wasn’t around. Kang Qingzhi did not know how to make perfumes, but she won two championships with Qiao Xi’s perfume recipes. How laughable!","However, Qiao Xi was puzzled. In her dream, she had clearly discovered that Kang Qingzhi had stolen her recipes and even obtained evidence of it. Why didn’t she expose her in public?","She closed her eyes and recalled the scene in her dream. Each of her perfume recipes was mixed with a spice with a special smell. The smell of the spices that were mixed like this was not perfect.","If she were still a judge in the International Fragrance Competition, she would definitely be able to tell that there was something wrong with Kang Qingzhi’s perfume recipes. The other spices were clearly very harmonious when mixed together, but there were one or two spices that seemed to be an odd inclusion. Of course, other than her, the previous president of the Fragrance Association could also tell. Unfortunately, the president had passed away, and she no longer served as a judge. Hence, no one exposed the problem in the perfume recipes.","Kang Qingzhi won two consecutive championships with these perfume recipes.","Qiao Xi suddenly smiled and immediately stood up to go to Gu Zheng’s study. “Ah Zheng, I’ve decided to participate in the International Perfume Competition!”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow and sized up her. “Mrs. Gu, you thought it through so quickly?”","Qiao Xi blinked. “That’s right! I’ve thought it through. Coincidentally, I have some ready-made perfume recipes. I’m very confident in winning the championship!”","The rules of the competition were to select 200 perfume recipes from thousands of them. Then, there would be a one-on-one competition. After layers of screening, only ten people would be able to enter the finals.","Qiao Xi felt that this method was unscientific. After the previous president, Madam Leng, passed away, those people changed the original rules. However, since she was participating in the competition, no matter how dissatisfied she was, she had to follow the rules.","Qiao Xi took out a perfume recipe and placed it in front of Gu Zheng. “What do you think of this perfume recipe? It should be more than enough to participate in the competition, right?”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and glanced at her. The corners of his lips curled up. “Mrs. Gu, I know your secret very well, but I’m very curious about why you suddenly want to participate.”","Qiao Xi revealed a meaningful smile. “How can I take revenge if I don’t participate in the competition?!”","Even a thief could become the champion. Now that the real creator was here, it was time for the thief to abdicate!","Qiao Xi filled in the registration form and submitted her perfume recipe for the competition online. Then, she drove to the venue of the perfume competition and handed over the bottle of perfume she had made."]},{"number":1451,"title":"Chapter 1451 She Was Actually Eliminated","paragraphs":["1451 She Was Actually Eliminated","Qiao Xi did not use the name she was known as in the perfume world for this competition. After all, that name was too resounding. If it appeared on the list of participants, it would definitely cause a commotion. At that time, she might even be dragged back to be a judge and wouldn’t be able to participate.","Mu Jin’s name resounded throughout the entire perfume world. She was an internationally stunning perfumer back then. If she used this name to participate in the competition, the competition would be meaningless!","Hence, Qiao Xi thought for a moment and directly wrote ‘Bright Moon’ in the name column. This name corresponded to ‘Black Tide’. Moreover, Gu Zheng said that she was like the moon in his heart.","The staff member took the registration form and looked at the name on it. “Bright Moon, we’ll announce the results of the audition in two days. After the audition, the competition will immediately start. If you’re selected, we’ll call to inform you.”","Qiao Xi nodded and stood up to leave.","The staff member sniffed the bottle of perfume carefully and could not help but sigh in his heart. This perfumer was so outstanding at such a young age, but he had never heard of a perfumer called Bright Moon.","From the looks of it, it was probably her first time participating in the competition. She would definitely become famous this time. He looked at the registration form again. Bright Moon’s real name was Qiao Xi?","This name sounded so familiar!","Qiao Xi had just handed in the registration form when Kang Qingzhi received the news. Her eyes turned vicious. “After the audition, I want to compete with her. Help me arrange it immediately. Spend as much money as you need to.”","The person on the other end of the phone was a little puzzled. “You don’t want her to participate in the competition, so you plan to change her perfumes or perfume recipes directly. Why do you still have to compete with her?”","Kang Qingzhi sneered. “It’s a little difficult to change her perfumes or perfume recipes under the noses of so many people, but it’s very easy to arrange for me to compete with her. Moreover, her perfume recipes could let me win two championships. This means that no one else but me can compare to her. If I don’t make a move, she’ll definitely successfully enter the finals.","“Moreover, my brother has long bribed a few judges. No matter how perfect Qiao Xi’s work is, she’ll lose to me. After all, my work was produced by her back then.”","Kang Qingzhi smiled proudly. “Only I can eliminate her. I want her to be defeated by me in public. I want my father and brother to know how outstanding I am and prove how useless she is...!”","With Kang Jichuan’s help, she would naturally be successful. After all, Kang Jichuan was the earl of Y Nation. Of course, those people had to give him face. It was not difficult to eliminate an unknown person.","“I only have a limited number of perfume recipes. I can’t use them in the audition. I have to use them in the competition and the finals.”","The perfume recipes she stole from Qiao Xi would be used up sooner or later. Kang Qingzhi had registered for the competition, but she had yet to submit her work. Kang Jichuan thought that she was not in good health and did not have the energy, but in reality, she wanted to stall for time and find a chance to steal more perfume recipes from Qiao Xi. Otherwise, how could she participate in the competition?","“No matter what, I can’t let Qiao Xi advance. The championship belongs to me, and Qiao Xi’s perfume recipes will belong to me!”","“If she had stayed in Li City forever, none of this would have happened. However, she ran to Y Nation and was spotted by my father and brother. She shouldn’t blame me for being heartless!”","After hanging up, Kang Qingzhi lay on the bed and panted slightly. She was suddenly looking forward to the arrival of the perfume competition. She wanted to see Qiao Xi be eliminated with her own eyes.","Two days later, Kang Qingzhi received a call from the perfume competition. On the other hand, Qiao Xi received a call from Xue Yi.","The Xue family had been researching spices for generations, and the companies under their name were also ranked in the top ten in the perfume world. When Xue Liang heard that Qiao Xi was participating in the perfume competition, he asked Xue Yi to help take care of her. However, he did not expect Qiao Xi to actually... be eliminated!","Everyone in the Xue family knew that Qiao Xi’s perfume skills were extremely high. Moreover, she had a resounding name in the perfume world—Mu Jin.","Back then, she used ancient methods and chose medicinal herbs to make perfume. She introduced the entire world to ancient-style perfumes. They were also taught that perfumes were not only used to smell good but also to temper one’s emotions. They could even cultivate one’s body and mind.","All these years, her style had often changed. She had made elegant and rich perfumes, and without exception, they were all perfect. Although she was not the top perfumer in the perfume world, no one thought that they could surpass her. As such, how did such an outstanding perfumer get eliminated in the first round?"]},{"number":1452,"title":"Chapter 1452 The Perfume Competition Is Chaotic","paragraphs":["1452 The Perfume Competition Is Chaotic","After Qiao Xi received Xue Yi’s call, her eyes instantly widened. “Huh? I was eliminated?”","Xue Yi also looked puzzled. “Is there a mistake? You couldn’t have been eliminated!”","Qiao Xi’s eyes flashed. Although the perfume she handed in wasn’t the best one she had, it was enough for her to reach the finals. It wouldn’t be surprising if she even won the championship. How could she be eliminated in the first round?","Qiao Xi suddenly thought of something. “Help me find out who the participants in the first round are.”","Hearing her words, Xue Yi immediately understood. Her voice was serious. “I’ll investigate immediately.”","Originally, Xue Yi did not suspect that someone had cheated, but since Xi Xi had said so, she knew that someone had secretly caused Xi Xi to be eliminated.","After a while, Xue Yi called Qiao Xi back. “It’s Kang Qingzhi.”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up. “I expected it, but I didn’t expect her to be in a rush to eliminate me in the first round. She’s using my perfume recipe to deal with me? She’s too shameless!”","“No...” Xue Yi’s expression suddenly changed. If Kang Qingzhi had participated in the competition with Xi Xi’s perfume recipe, it would be reasonable for them to eliminate Xi Xi. After all, both perfume recipes were perfect. The judges could choose whoever they wanted, but...","Xue Yi’s voice was filled with anger. “Kang Qingzhi didn’t submit her work at all! She didn’t submit a perfume recipe or a perfume sample. She just registered and eliminated you!”","Qiao Xi suddenly held her cell phone tightly, and her hand turned slightly pale. After a long time, she sneered. “After Madam Leng passed away, this perfume competition has become chaotic. What’s the point of an unfair competition?”","“Little Six, what are you going to do?” Xue Yi asked.","They were really going too far! Kang Qingzhi did not even submit her work, but she easily eliminated Xi Xi. What right did she have?","Qiao Xi was silent for a moment before smiling. “I think I should return to the Kang family at this time.”","“Sister Xue Yi, I have something to ask of you.” Qiao Xi’s voice was calm. “Write a report and send it to the perfume competition.”","Xue Yi immediately agreed. “Alright! Don’t worry, I’ll definitely cause trouble for them!”","Not long after, Xue Yi called again and flew into a rage. “I’m going to beat them to death! They took the Kang family’s money! No matter who Kang Qingzhi’s opponent is, they’ll be eliminated! They even said that Kang Qingzhi is the champion of two past competitions and didn’t submit her work because of her poor health, but her standard is obvious to all. Eliminating a nameless junior and choosing Miss Kang to advance in the competition was the judges’ joint decision.”","“Did you record the conversation?”","“Of course! I called them to make them expose themselves!” Xue Yi said indignantly, “I called them and went straight to the point. I asked them why Bright Moon was eliminated. They all defended Kang Qingzhi and even asked me to ask Kang Jichuan. In order to let Kang Qingzhi advance, he spent a lot of money. Those people accepted his money, so they naturally have to side with Kang Qingzhi.”","Qiao Xi said casually, “I see! I heard that Mr. Kang’s friend, Madam Wen Lai, is also coming to Li City. Madam Wen Lai and Madam Leng were good friends! After Madam Wen Lai comes to Li City, she’ll definitely go to the Kang family’s residence first. I’ll take that opportunity to go over and meet her.”","Xue Yi instantly understood what Qiao Xi meant. “If Madam Wen Lai finds out that Kang Qingzhi is secretly manipulating things behind the scenes and didn’t even submit her work, what will her reaction be?”","...","Two days later, at the Kang family’s residence.","Kang Qingzhi had long received the call to advance. Her sickly face looked more energetic.","Kang Ru looked at her affectionately. “Qingzhi, are you very happy?”","Kang Qingzhi smiled sweetly. “Dad! I registered in the International Perfume Competition and was selected to advance!”","“That’s a good thing! My daughter is so outstanding! I remember that you won the perfume competition twice a few years ago. After that, you didn’t participate anymore because of your poor health,” Kang Ru praised.","Kang Qingzhi pursed her lips, her eyes complicated. “Dad, I’m really happy to be able to be by your side when I’m alive and do what I like. I won’t have any regrets.”","Kang Ru frowned and berated softly, “Qingzhi, don’t always say such things. Medicine is so advanced now, and you’re still so young. You’ll definitely recover.”","Kang Jichuan sat at the side, but he recalled some past events.","Qingzhi’s illness was actually very difficult to treat, so every day she was alive seemed precious. Hence, since she liked to make perfumes, the father and son were very supportive of her. It was just that five years ago, Xi Xi said that Qingzhi had stolen her perfume recipes.","However, that was impossible! How could Qingzhi have stolen something?"]},{"number":1453,"title":"Chapter 1453 Belated Affection Is Worthless","paragraphs":["1453 Belated Affection Is Worthless","Kang Jichuan was silent as he recalled what had happened five years ago. At that time, because of what Xi Xi said, he once suspected Qingzhi. Later on, he realized that he had wrongly accused Qingzhi.","Qingzhi was so obedient and sensible. How could she steal Xi Xi’s things? Moreover, he had seen Qingzhi write those perfume recipes with his own eyes.","Kang Jichuan’s guilt toward Qiao Xi dissipated a little. He looked at Kang Qingzhi gently. “Qingzhi, you’re really outstanding. Dad and I are proud of you.”","Kang Qingzhi smiled sweetly. Their family of three was so happy! As long as Qiao Xi did not come back, they would always be so harmonious and happy!","!!","Ring, ring, ring...","Kang Ru’s phone suddenly rang. As a noble in Y Nation, he had power and influence. There were many people who wanted to contact him, so most of the calls were answered by his assistant. The only people who knew his private number were his relatives and friends.","Kang Qingzhi’s expression froze for a moment as if she had guessed who the caller was.","When Kang Ru saw the caller ID, he shouted in surprise, “It’s Xi Xi!”","He hurriedly picked up the call, and Qiao Xi’s cold voice came from the phone. “Dad, I’m free recently and want to stay with you for a while. Is it a convenient time?”","Kang Ru had always hoped that Qiao Xi could come home to stay with them. Now that Qiao Xi had finally agreed, he was extremely excited and hurriedly replied, “Of course, it’s convenient! This is your home. You can come back to stay anytime!”","Qiao Xi’s voice softened a little. “I remember you saying that you miss Mom very much. Coincidentally, I found a few photos and her diary among her belongings recently. If you want to see them, I’ll bring them over to you.”","Kang Ru’s heart suddenly ached.","Yunqiu’s photos and diary...","All these years, he had not spent a moment not missing Yunqiu. At the thought of seeing Yunqiu’s photos and diary, his tone became even more excited, and his breathing became hurried. “Alright! Alright! Bring them over! When you’re done packing, I’ll get a chauffeur to pick you up!”","“That’s alright, Dad. Send me the address. I’ll be there in a while.”","After hanging up, Qiao Xi’s eyes were slightly cold. If she did not know that her mother had taken the initiative to leave Kang Ru, she would have been moved by Kang Ru’s deep love.","However, belated affection was worthless. Kang Ru might have her mother and her in his heart, but he would never be a good husband and father!","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at Gu Zheng. “I think I can give Mr. Kang a chance. If he’s willing to choose me, I can spare Kang Jichuan and Kang Qingzhi’s lives on his account.”","Gu Zheng’s eyes contained a trace of coldness, but his voice was extremely gentle. “Xi Xi, you don’t have to worry about others if you want to do something. I’ll help you get whatever you want.”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up. “I want Kang Qingzhi’s life.”","“Alright,” Gu Zheng agreed without hesitation.","“Ah Zheng, don’t you think I’m vicious?” Qiao Xi sat on the sofa and supported her chin as she looked at him. Her beautiful eyes moved. “Although Kang Qingzhi almost killed me, I survived, after all. Isn’t it a little cruel for me to kill her?”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with affection. “Xi Xi, you’re very kind. If it were me, I’d definitely make her wish she was dead. There are few brothers in this world who are as heartless as Kang Jichuan. If someone almost caused Gu Yao’s death, what do you think I’ll do? Or if someone harms Ye Qingyuan’s younger brother, what will Ye Qingyuan do? We won’t tolerate our family being bullied!”","Qiao Xi sighed. “That’s right! Kang Jichuan is really a failure as a brother! Since he’s heartless to me, why should I care about him?”","Although the evidence Xue Yi sent her was not enough to take down Kang Jichuan, it was enough to trouble him. In order to let his sister win the competition, he secretly manipulated things and bribed the judges. The dignified earl of Y Nation was really embarrassing!","Qiao Xi stood up and stretched. “It’s about time. Let’s go to the Kang family’s villa.”","...","An hour later, the car slowly stopped at the entrance of the Kang family’s villa. Before Qiao Xi could get out of the car, Kang Ru was about to welcome her. “Xi Xi is here! Jichuan, let’s go welcome Xi Xi!”","Kang Jichuan subconsciously glanced at Kang Qingzhi. Her face was pale, and she forced a smile with a complicated expression. “Brother, go quickly. Don’t worry about me. My health isn’t good, so I won’t go out. Sister Xi Xi won’t be angry with me, right?”","“Of course, Xi Xi won’t be angry. Wait here. I’ll be right back. Don’t move.”","Kang Jichuan reminded her a few times, but he could not help but frown. Recently, he had been feeling that something was wrong. Kang Qingzhi’s expression was clearly normal, but she was always sickly."]},{"number":1454,"title":"Chapter 1454 He’s Just Unwilling","paragraphs":["1454 He’s Just Unwilling","Kang Jichuan and Kang Ru were about to leave when they heard the servants exclaim behind them, “Eldest Miss!”","The two of them turned around and saw Kang Qingzhi falling weakly. Fortunately, the servants supported her in time. He was shocked and hurriedly rushed out to hug Kang Qingzhi. He shouted in panic, “Qingzhi!”","Kang Qingzhi leaned weakly in his arms. Her face and lips were pale. She looked as if she was going to die the next second.","Everyone was shocked by the sudden change. Kang Qingzhi fainted, and Kang Jichuan could not care less about Qiao Xi anymore. He hurriedly instructed someone to call a doctor.","Kang Ru, who was at the side, only had his mind on his biological daughter. He was about to go and welcome her when he realized that Kang Qingzhi was grabbing the corner of his shirt. Her eyes were tightly shut, and cold sweat seeped out of her forehead. She kept calling out for her father and brother. She grabbed the corner of Kang Ru’s shirt tightly, her slender fingers extremely pale.","Kang Ru frowned and wanted to pry Kang Qingzhi’s hand away, but he was afraid of hurting her. The atmosphere became awkward.","After a while, the family doctor rushed over with the medicine box. Kang Qingzhi was still unwilling to let go of Kang Jichuan and Kang Ru’s clothes.","The butler at the side reminded him softly, “Sir, Young Master... Miss Xi Xi is still waiting at the door.”","Kang Ru instantly came back to his senses. This was Xi Xi’s first visit, so he definitely had to go out to welcome her. If he could not even do that, Xi Xi would probably be unhappy.","However, Qingzhi...","Kang Ru tugged at the corner of his shirt, but Kang Qingzhi’s fingers were still tightly clenched. His daughter was sick, so he could not use too much strength. He could only instruct helplessly, “Butler, go pick Xi Xi up in my place. She’s so understanding. She’ll definitely understand me.”","“Uhh...” The butler looked troubled. How could he, a butler, replace the master of the house? Miss Xi Xi was willing to stay here to be with her biological father and brother. If the two masters did not welcome her the first time she came, it meant that they did not take Miss Xi Xi seriously. If news of this got out, what would others think of Miss Xi Xi?","For the sake of an adopted daughter, Mr. Kang did not welcome his biological daughter. This action would tell everyone that he did not care about his daughter. Miss Xi Xi was not favored and was not even comparable to an adopted daughter. The Kang family did not even take her seriously. Who would look up to Miss Xi Xi in the future?","It had been so many years, so why didn’t Mr. Kang understand the logic behind it? Miss Xia Yunqiu’s heart was broken time and again before she decided to leave!","Doctor Hu and the butler looked at each other helplessly.","Mr. Kang seemed to dote on Qiao Xi very much, but in reality, he did not have deep feelings for his biological daughter. After all, she had been wandering outside for 20 years. He was just unwilling to give up. He thought that he would have an obedient and cute daughter while he could be a good father, but that was not the case.","The butler sighed helplessly and went over to welcome Qiao Xi.","Doctor Hu took the stethoscope and examined Kang Qingzhi before replying, “Miss Kang’s body... is fine.”","Kang Jichuan frowned. “If there’s nothing wrong, why did she suddenly faint?”","Doctor Hu: “...”","He looked at the Kang father and son helplessly. Did he need to say this? If it were anyone else, they would be able to see the situation clearly. Only the father and son were unwilling to think in that direction.","Miss Kang was fine in the morning, but she only fainted when Master Kang and Young Master Kang were about to welcome Miss Qiao. Wasn’t this too much of a coincidence? Moreover, he had already diagnosed Miss Kang. There was clearly nothing wrong with her body.","Doctor Hu was unwilling to offend the Kang family, so he could only say tactfully, “Miss Kang’s illness didn’t flare up, but Miss Kang’s body is weak to begin with. It might be because she didn’t rest well or didn’t eat breakfast that she fainted due to low blood sugar. She’ll be fine after eating something and resting for a while.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Kang Qingzhi slowly opened her eyes. She held her temples weakly. “Dad, I... I’m so dizzy! I don’t know what happened just now, but I suddenly lost my strength. I might not have eaten in the morning, so my blood sugar is a little low. I’m fine. Don’t worry.”","Hearing this, Kang Ru and Kang Jichuan heaved a sigh of relief. “Qingzhi, you scared us to death. Your health isn’t good to begin with, so how could you not eat breakfast?! In the future, you have to eat and sleep on time every day.”","Kang Qingzhi looked at the two of them in a daze. “Dad, Brother, I remember that before I fainted, you said that you wanted to welcome Sister Xi Xi. Is she here?”"]},{"number":1455,"title":"Chapter 1455 Fear Will Accompany Her Forever","paragraphs":["1455 Fear Will Accompany Her Forever","After Kang Qingzhi finished speaking, she saw that the father and son of the Kang family had complicated expressions. She instantly widened her eyes. “Dad, Brother, didn’t you go to welcome Sister Xi Xi? Is it because I fainted that you... In that case, Sister Xi Xi...”","Kang Jichuan knew very well that Qiao Xi would definitely be sad since they got the butler to welcome Xi Xi. However, Qingzhi suddenly fainted. How could they ignore her?","Qingzhi had been weak and sickly since she was young. Xi Xi was also a girl, so her heart would probably ache for Qingzhi. If she bickered with them over such a small matter, then she was too petty.","Kang Qingzhi suddenly coughed a few times and frowned. “Dad, Brother, I’m sorry. It’s all my fault. If I hadn’t suddenly fainted, you would definitely have gone to welcome Sister. It’s Sister Xi Xi’s first day home and I’ve already delayed you. She... Will she blame me? I... I really didn’t do it on purpose.”","As she spoke, Kang Qingzhi suddenly choked. Her health was not good to begin with. Seeing that she was blaming herself so much, Kang Jichuan’s heart ached even more. It was not Kang Qingzhi’s fault that she fainted. She could not control it.","If Qiao Xi had not returned, Qingzhi would not have been so uneasy. Perhaps it was because of Qiao Xi that Qingzhi did not rest well or eat!","When he thought about this, Kang Jichuan’s guilt toward Qiao Xi was instantly swept away. Instead, he felt aggrieved for Kang Qingzhi. He comforted her softly. “Qingzhi, this isn’t your fault. You don’t have to apologize. If Xi Xi blames you for this, then it’s because she’s too much of a bully.”","“Will Sister Xi Xi be angry with me? I’m really afraid! I’ve let her down...”","Kang Jichuan gently wiped Kang Qingzhi’s tears, then looked at Kang Ru. “Dad, Qingzhi’s body is weak to begin with and can’t take any stimulation. Why don’t we let Xi Xi go to the backyard first? Qingzhi will be afraid if she comes in now.”","Seeing Kang Qing cry, Kang Ru’s heart naturally ached. Moreover, she was weak to begin with, so it was only right for Xi Xi to give in to her. Xi Xi was so obedient, so she definitely would not mind.","Qingzhi’s illness was serious, and she might die one day. Hence, while she was still alive, they had to take good care of her. Xi Xi was still so healthy, so there would be many chances to compensate her in the future. There was no rush.","Kang Ru thought for a moment before nodding. “Alright.”","Kang Jichuan was satisfied and stroked Kang Qingzhi’s back gently. “Don’t be afraid, Qingzhi. Xi Xi won’t come to the main residence. She won’t make things difficult for you.”","“Huh? Ah Zheng, I haven’t even entered yet, but why do I hear people talking bad about me behind my back? Who am I making things difficult for?” A cold female voice came from the door, and the expressions of the Kang family instantly changed.","“Xi Xi...” Kang Jichuan’s heart trembled.","Qiao Xi walked to the door and stood still. She glanced coldly at everyone before her gaze finally landed on Kang Qingzhi. “Miss Kang, when did I make things difficult for you? We only met for the first time two days ago, and I don’t seem to have spoken much to you. Why are you crying and saying that I’m making things difficult for you before I even enter? You’re not even letting me enter the main residence?”","Kang Qingzhi’s expression froze. She looked up and saw Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi standing at the door with a strong aura. Song Shijing and Xue Yi were behind them.","Kang Ru could not help but frown when he heard Qiao Xi’s words.","Two days ago, Xi Xi and Qingzhi had just met for the first time in front of everyone. Xi Xi did not make things difficult for Qingzhi. Instead, she was very concerned about Qingzhi’s illness. Why did Qingzhi think so badly of Xi Xi?","When Kang Jichuan heard Qiao Xi criticize Kang Qingzhi, his face was instantly filled with displeasure.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up. “Why is Young Master Kang looking at me like that? Do you think I’m wrong? Miss Kang and I don’t know each other. When have I ever made things difficult for her?”","Kang Jichuan lowered his eyes, and his heart instantly skipped a beat. In Qiao Xi’s opinion, they were indeed strangers, but he knew very well that they had already met five years ago. At that time, Xi Xi had always looked for trouble with Qingzhi and bullied her until she cried all day.","Qingzhi was probably afraid of Xi Xi because she subconsciously remembered the trauma she received from Xi Xi’s bullying. When she saw Qiao Xi, she had an inexplicable fear. Although she no longer had memories of Qiao Xi, that fear might accompany her for the rest of her life.","However, even if he knew the reason, he could not say it.","Kang Jichuan calmed down. “Xi Xi, don’t misunderstand. Qingzhi just fainted. She can’t be agitated right now.”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with sharpness as he looked coldly at the three people from the Kang family. His gaze was about to burn the three of them to ashes."]},{"number":1456,"title":"Chapter 1456 How Can There Be So Many Coincidences In The World?","paragraphs":["1456 How Can There Be So Many Coincidences In The World?","“If you don’t welcome Xi Xi to stay here, feel free to tell me. She has a group of people who treat her as a treasure. She doesn’t lack one or two relatives.","“I said that it’s fine for Xi Xi to return to the Kang family, but I can’t let Xi Xi suffer. Since you care more about your adopted daughter, there’s no need for Xi Xi to stay. We’ll leave now.”","As soon as Gu Zheng finished speaking, he held Qiao Xi’s hand and prepared to leave.","When Kang Ru heard this, he instantly panicked. He shook off Kang Qingzhi’s hand and hurriedly rushed over to shout, “Don’t go! Xi Xi, you’re my biological daughter. Of course, I care about you!","!!","“Xi Xi, I’m your biological father. This is your home. You can come back and stay here anytime!”","Gu Zheng sneered. “Today is Xi Xi’s first day home. Mr. Kang, you only sent a butler to welcome her, while you and Young Master Kang were accompanying the Kang family’s adopted daughter in the main residence. Do you know what impact this will have on Xi Xi?”","Kang Ru was so anxious that he was sweating. “What impact?”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were calm, but his voice carried a trace of mockery. “Mr. Kang, you might not understand, but Young Master Kang often discusses business outside. You should understand the logic behind this.”","Kang Ru immediately looked at Kang Jichuan. He lowered his head and pursed his lips. “I don’t understand.”","“You don’t understand?” Gu Zheng curled his lips. “Since Mr. Kang and Young Master Kang don’t understand, let me tell you. The Kang family’s actions are clearly telling everyone that Xi Xi, the daughter of the Kang family, isn’t favored. Even if she returns to the Kang family, she’ll forever be inferior to the family’s adopted daughter. If even Mr. Kang doesn’t care about his daughter, who will take her seriously in the future?","“Not only will Mr. Kang make Xi Xi sad, but he’ll also make Xi Xi become a laughing stock. Is there a need for Xi Xi to come back to such a home?”","Gu Zheng had always been a man of few words. When he said these words, his voice was very calm, but his eyes were filled with coldness. Kang Ru’s face was filled with embarrassment and panic when he heard this. He lowered his head guiltily. “Xi Xi, I... I really care about you, but Qingzhi...”","“How’s Miss Kang’s health?” Gu Zheng looked at Doctor Hu.","Doctor Hu replied uneasily, “It’s nothing serious. She just didn’t rest well. She... has low blood sugar.”","Actually, in Doctor Hu’s opinion, there was nothing wrong with Kang Qingzhi’s body at this moment. There was no reason to faint. However, he could not say such things. If he offended Miss Kang, he would definitely suffer.","“Heh.” Gu Zheng’s voice was filled with ridicule. “In that case, Miss Kang’s body is fine, but she fainted just as Xi Xi was about to enter.”","“Oh! I understand.” Xue Yi suddenly took a few steps forward and looked at Kang Qingzhi with a cold gaze. “Miss Kang deliberately fainted when Xi Xi returned home and made Xi Xi’s two family members not welcome Xi Xi because of her. Then, she cried and pretended to be pitiful so as to not let Xi Xi enter the main residence.","“Xi Xi just wants to go home and see her father and brother, but she has to walk on eggshells because of the family’s adopted daughter. It’s only Xi Xi’s first day here, yet she encountered such a thing. If she continues to stay here, I don’t know how much she’ll suffer!","“Miss Kang, you’re really capable! This move can stabilize your status and make the real daughter of the Kang family lose all her dignity. It’s killing two birds with one stone!”","Kang Jichuan said unhappily, “Miss Xue, please don’t spout nonsense! Qingzhi has been weak and sick since she was young. She’s bedridden all year round and doesn’t understand the deception of high society at all. Her fainting this time was just a coincidence. She doesn’t want to affect Xi Xi.”","Xue Yi was so angry that she laughed. “Miss Kang doesn’t understand, but don’t you understand, Young Master Kang? If Miss Kang fainted, you should call the doctor. You’re not a doctor. What’s the point of staying by her side? You’re willing to let your biological sister suffer for your adopted sister. You don’t treat Xi Xi as your family at all. What right do you have to ask her to come home?”","She glared coldly at Kang Qingzhi and smirked. “Moreover, do you really not understand? How can there be so many coincidences in the world? Two days ago, Miss Kang’s illness acted up in Longwan Residential and it caused Xi Xi to suffer. Now, Miss Kang’s illness acted up again when Xi Xi came to visit. Miss Kang, you’re quite good at choosing timings! You can suppress the Kang family’s real daughter every time. You’re really ruthless.”","Kang Qingzhi bit her lip and lowered her head aggrievedly.","Kang Ru, who was at the side, also understood what Gu Zheng and Xue Yi meant and could not help but frown.","Could it be that doing this had really made Xi Xi suffer? Would the people of high society think that Xi Xi was not valued and laugh at her?","At that time, he did not think too much about it. He only thought that since Qingzhi had fainted, he could get the butler to welcome Xi Xi in his place. After Qingzhi woke up, she could not be agitated, so he temporarily agreed to have Xi Xi go to the backyard. When Qingzhi’s emotions stabilized, he would let Xi Xi return to the main residence."]},{"number":1457,"title":"Chapter 1457 She Has A Condition","paragraphs":["1457 She Has A Condition","Xue Yi said indifferently, “Mr. Kang, when your Kang family was looking for your biological daughter, you once said that Kang Qingzhi is just an adopted daughter. It’s because you missed Xi Xi that you adopted her. In the end, Kang Qingzhi is just Xi Xi’s shadow. It’s all thanks to Xi Xi that she was able to join the Kang family. Now that Xi Xi is back, she’s not even asking you to chase Kang Qingzhi away. However, you actually let Xi Xi be bullied by an adopted daughter. Look at her expression. Isn’t this too much?”","Kang Ru looked troubled. “Qingzhi grew up in the Kang family since she was young. She’s also my daughter. We can’t treat Qingzhi badly now that Xi Xi is back, right?”","Xue Yi was furious. “Xi Xi has never made things difficult for Kang Qingzhi. You have to know your priorities! Xi Xi is the eldest daughter of the Kang family. However, she has to go along with the whims of the adopted daughter even when she wants to return to her home. Just because she’s sick, Xi Xi can’t even stay in the main residence. Then what’s the point of returning to this family?”","Kang Ru instantly fell silent. He began to reflect on himself.","!!","However, Qingzhi had been by his side for more than ten years. He had long treated her as his biological daughter. The two of them were both his daughters. He did not want to favor one over the other, but when he thought about it carefully, it was so unfair to Xi Xi! Even so, he could not bear to abandon Qingzhi!","Gu Zheng’s voice was low. “Actually, Xi Xi doesn’t have to be the daughter of the Kang family. Weren’t you the ones who came all the way here to look for her?”","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly as the corners of her mouth curled into a smile.","Kang Jichuan looked unhappy. “President Gu, what are you talking about?! Xi Xi is my younger sister, so she’s naturally the daughter of the Kang family. Could it be that she can’t tolerate Qingzhi?”","“Young Master Kang, I can emphasize it again.” Gu Zheng’s gaze was cold as he said word by word, “If you want Xi Xi to return to the Kang family, you have to know where your priorities should lie between your biological sister and adopted sister. You have to clarify Xi Xi’s name and let everyone know that Xi Xi is the eldest daughter of the Kang family. Now, it seems that not only did you not do it, but you even let the family’s adopted daughter ride on Xi Xi’s head. Thus, there’s no need for you to acknowledge her as your biological sister.”","The moment that was said, the expressions of the Kang father and son changed.","Kang Jichuan knew that today’s matter had caused Qiao Xi to suffer, but Qingzhi had fainted. He could not ignore it!","Kang Ru, who was at the side, did not look too good. Gu Zheng’s words were clearly a threat. Actually, he knew that Gu Zheng’s words made sense, but he was still unwilling to lower his head and admit his mistake.","Doctor Hu and the butler looked at each other and saw speechlessness in each other’s eyes.","Young Master Kang and Master Kang both said that they wanted to be impartial and take an impartial approach. In reality, they were already unknowingly biased toward Miss Qingzhi. If Miss Xi Xi really returned to the Kang family, she would suffer many grievances in the future!","The atmosphere instantly became awkward. Kang Qingzhi pursed her lips, and her voice trembled slightly. “Sister Xi Xi, don’t blame Brother and Dad. It’s all my fault. I’ve let you down...”","Xue Yi raised her hand to signal her to shut up. “Miss Kang, stop talking. You’re making it sound as if our Xi Xi bullied you.”","Kang Qingzhi bit her lip aggrievedly. Tears welled up in her eyes, but she pretended to be strong and refused to cry.","“Alright.” Kang Ru waved his hand, then looked at Qiao Xi. His voice was gentle as he said, “Xi Xi, come in and take a seat first. Actually, your brother and I were waiting for you in the living room for a long time. It’s just that Qingzhi suddenly fell sick, so we didn’t welcome you. If it weren’t for the sudden situation, of course, we would’ve gone. Let’s forget about this matter. I won’t let you suffer in the future.”","Kang Ru had a noble status since he was young. It was always the people around him who curried favor with him. He felt that he was already full of sincerity by lowering his head to coax Qiao Xi.","Seeing the Kang father and son like this, the anger in Xue Yi’s heart surged. She was just about to go forward and argue when she was stopped by Qiao Xi. She looked at everyone with a smile. “Alright, I’ll listen to you.”","Kang Qingzhi widened her eyes in surprise. Qiao Xi was actually not pursuing the matter anymore?","Seeing Qiao Xi give in like this, Kang Qingzhi was uneasy and had a bad feeling.","Just as Kang Ru was filled with joy and praising Qiao Xi for being tolerant, Qiao Xi suddenly smiled and said, “Dad, since Miss Kang has already lived in the Kang family for so many years, I naturally won’t chase her away. I won’t mind it even if Miss Kang hates me or doesn’t want to see me, but I have a condition.”","Qiao Xi gently touched the things in her bag. Kang Ru’s attention was suddenly attracted, and his eyes were filled with anticipation. “Xi Xi, feel free to tell me. I’ll agree to anything. Do you have the photos in your bag?”"]},{"number":1458,"title":"Chapter 1458 She Wants To Take Revenge","paragraphs":["1458 She Wants To Take Revenge","“Yes.” Qiao Xi took out the photos from her bag in front of everyone. She was a little puzzled for a moment. Did Kang Ru like her mother, or was he immersed in his fantasies?","Kang Ru’s eyes turned red as he reached out to take the photos. “Yunqiu...”","However, in the next second, Qiao Xi took the photos back. “Dad, I haven’t said my conditions.”","Kang Jichuan, who was at the side, frowned. What conditions did she have?","!!","Kang Ru stared fixedly at the photos in Qiao Xi’s hand. At this moment, he seemed to be possessed and agreed without hesitation. “Xi Xi, I’ll agree to anything you say.”","Qiao Xi glanced at Kang Qingzhi and said with a smile, “I’m willing to return to the Kang family, and I can get along well with Miss Kang. However, I hope you can announce to the public that we’re not biological sisters.","“Now, everyone in high society thinks that Miss Kang is Dad’s biological daughter. Not many know that she’s his adopted daughter. You love this adopted daughter of yours, and I can’t stop you, but I don’t want Miss Kang to have any affiliation with my mother, Madam Xia Yunqiu.”","The moment that was said, the surroundings instantly fell silent.","Kang Ru widened his eyes. He did not expect Qiao Xi to raise such a condition, but...","Kang Jichuan was a little unhappy. “Xi Xi, how can you do this? Of course, it’s fine if you want Dad to clear your name, but if we announce to the public that Qingzhi isn’t Dad’s daughter, everyone will suspect that she’s an illegitimate daughter or an adopted daughter. Qingzhi’s health isn’t good to begin with, so how can she withstand the rumors outside?”","“Why not?” Qiao Xi blinked and looked at him innocently. “Isn’t it the truth? Miss Kang is indeed not my mother’s daughter. Moreover, all these years, Miss Kang has been living in the Kang family with my identity. She was living a carefree life, while I was thrown to the countryside by the Qiao family when I was young and almost lost my life.","“Mom doted on me so much. She wouldn’t have let anyone occupy my identity, much less let me suffer. Now that I’ve finally returned to the Kang family, I can give in to anything. I just don’t want people to think that Kang Qingzhi and I are biological sisters. Can’t you fulfill this condition?","“Dad, Brother, you can ignore me, but you have to respect Mom!”","The Kang family was speechless.","Kang Qingzhi gritted her teeth. She knew that Qiao Xi would not let her off so easily. In the end, she brought up Xia Yunqiu!","Everyone knew that the person Kang Ru loved the most was Xia Yunqiu. Now that she mentioned Xia Yunqiu, she was forcing Kang Ru and Kang Jichuan to make a choice.","As expected, when Kang Ru heard these words, his eyes turned red, and they were filled with sorrow. “Xi Xi, I’ve let you and Yunqiu down! If Yunqiu finds out about the pain you’ve been through all these years, her heart will definitely ache! I... I agree!”","“Dad!” Kang Jichuan shouted, then felt a little guilty. “But what should we do about Qingzhi...”","“Young Master Kang,” Gu Zheng interrupted him coldly and sneered. “I have a question. In your heart, who’s your biological sister? For Miss Kang’s sake, you don’t even care about your mother’s and sister’s feelings. Have you ever thought that although Miss Kang is weak and sickly, she has been living in luxury since she was young and has a family doctor to take care of her at all times? She has never suffered at all, but Xi Xi is struggling to survive under persecution. It’s already not easy for her to survive.","“Now that Xi Xi has returned to the Kang family, she has already made a concession. She has only one condition. Is there anything wrong with wanting to clear her name for herself and her mother?”","Xue Yi echoed, “That’s right! Young Master Kang, you’re really strange. You don’t care about your biological mother and sister at all. You only care about an adopted sister who’s not related to you by blood. How laughable!”","Kang Jichuan’s face turned red. His lips moved, but he could not say anything.","Kang Qingzhi clenched her fists. She finally understood why Qiao Xi did not pursue that matter anymore, why she suddenly called Kang Ru ‘Dad,’ and why she mentioned Xia Yunqiu to make Kang Ru’s heart soften. She wanted to return to the Kang family and snatch everything that belonged to her!","She gritted her teeth and abruptly raised her eyes to look at Qiao Xi. At the same time, Qiao Xi also looked at her and revealed a provocative smile.","Kang Qingzhi’s body instantly stiffened.","Yes! Qiao Xi wanted to snatch her identity as the eldest daughter of the Kang family! She had been the eldest daughter of the Kang family for more than ten years. Why should she give it to Qiao Xi?","What made Kang Qingzhi feel even stranger was why Qiao Xi seemed to have changed into a different person. She was clearly not like this five years ago!","Kang Qingzhi suddenly took a deep breath as her surroundings turned cold. Could it be that... Qiao Xi recovered her memory? Had she suddenly recalled it and come back to take revenge?"]},{"number":1459,"title":"Chapter 1459 He Has Already Made His Choice","paragraphs":["1459 He Has Already Made His Choice","Kang Qingzhi’s teeth chattered.","No! Qiao Xi would not recover her memory after being hypnotized!","Kang Ru held Xia Yunqiu’s photos with trembling hands and suddenly recalled Qiao Xi’s words just now. ‘Mom doted on me so much. She wouldn’t have let anyone occupy my identity, much less let me suffer. Dad, Brother, you can ignore me, but you have to respect Mom!’","Yunqiu was his wife! Xi Xi was his and Yunqiu’s only daughter. How could he not care about her? Moreover, Xi Xi had indeed given in. Her request was not too much. It was also a fact that Qingzhi was not Yunqiu’s daughter!","!!","After thinking about it, Kang Ru nodded solemnly. “Alright! I agree. Xi Xi, I’ll announce to the public that Qingzhi isn’t Yunqiu’s daughter. You’re Yunqiu’s and my only daughter. You’re the eldest daughter of the Kang family!”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled into a smile as she subconsciously looked at Kang Qingzhi. She was indeed whimpering in pain, and her face was as pale as paper. She coughed violently and clutched her chest as if she was having difficulty breathing.","Kang Ru was shocked and hurriedly got Kang Jichuan and Doctor Hu to send her upstairs. Just as he was about to go upstairs, he suddenly realized that Qiao Xi was still there. He could only say, “Xi Xi, Qingzhi can’t be agitated due to her illness right now. If her illness flares up, her life will be in danger. I naturally won’t go back on my word. I’ll go upstairs to see Qingzhi first. I’ll get the butler to bring you to choose a room later. When Qingzhi’s condition stabilizes, I’ll come down to accompany you.”","Before Qiao Xi could speak, Xue Yi said unhurriedly, “Mr. Kang, let’s talk in private.”","As she spoke, Xue Yi walked to Kang Ru’s side and said in a low voice, “I grew up with Xi Xi. I know that she suffered a lot when she was young. Of course, with Mr. Kang’s power, you must have also checked Xi Xi’s information. To be honest, Xi Xi and your adopted daughter can’t get along. You can only choose one in the end. If you choose Kang Qingzhi, you’ll definitely regret it.”","Anger surged in Kang Ru’s heart as he berated loudly, “Miss Xue, what do you mean by this? Xi Xi and Qingzhi are both my daughters. Why can I only choose one? Xi Xi is the daughter of the Kang family. Why can’t she tolerate my adopted daughter?”","Xue Yi was not surprised to hear his words. She snorted. “That’s all I have to say. Mr. Kang, the choice lies in your hands.”","She originally thought that it was a good thing that Xi Xi had found her biological family. Kang Jichuan was unreliable, but fortunately, Kang Ru was around. As long as Kang Ru was on her side and sincerely loved Xi Xi, it was fine for Xi Xi to acknowledge him as her father.","Unexpectedly, Kang Ru did not care about Xue Yi’s earnest persuasion at all. In that case, there was no need for Xi Xi to acknowledge the Kang father and son.","Kang Ru thought highly of himself and hated being questioned the most. He hated what Xue Yi had just said even more. Qingzhi and Xi Xi were about the same age, and both of them had very gentle personalities. How could they not get along?","Xue Yi said casually, “Since you’ve already made your choice, Mr. Kang, go and see your adopted daughter.”","Although Kang Ru was dissatisfied with Xue Yi’s words, he thought that he had to maintain his gentle temper and not bicker with Xue Yi. Hence, he did not take Xue Yi’s words seriously and quickly went upstairs.","Xue Yi watched him leave in a hurry and shook her head helplessly. “Xi Xi, the Kang family is indeed unreliable.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were calm as the corners of her mouth suddenly curled up. “When will Madam Wen Lai arrive?”","Xue Yi replied, “It should be soon. Kang Qing has already been internally confirmed as the champion of the International Perfume Competition. Everyone is praising her for being a rare genius. Of course, Madam Wen Lai will come to Li City to take a look, but she probably doesn’t know that I’m here too. Do you want me to call her?”","“There’s no need,” Qiao Xi said softly. “If we call, it’ll be too deliberate. We have to pretend to meet by chance. In the afternoon, Madam Wen Lai will be here. I really want to see the expressions on Kang Jichuan’s and Kang Qingzhi’s faces!”","At this moment, upstairs.","Kang Qingzhi was lying on the bed, her breathing weak. Her eyes were red. “Dad, I didn’t know that... my illness would suddenly flare up today. I’ve clearly... recovered! I’ve let you down. If it weren’t for me, you wouldn’t have...”","Her tears drenched the blanket bit by bit. She was heartbroken. “I don’t hate Sister Xi Xi, nor did I scheme against her. Dad, Sister must have misunderstood me. Go look for Sister now. I don’t want Sister to hate me.”","Before Kang Ru could speak, Kang Jichuan hurriedly went forward and held her hand. He comforted her softly. “Qingzhi, don’t cry anymore. You can’t be blamed for this. Your health hasn’t been good since you were young. It’s normal for you to suddenly faint. What happened today was just a coincidence.”"]},{"number":1460,"title":"Chapter 1460 Her Status Is Still Unshakeable","paragraphs":["1460 Her Status Is Still Unshakeable","As soon as Kang Jichuan finished speaking, he suddenly choked. Actually, he wanted to say that Qiao Xi was to blame for what had happened today. If she had not been overbearing, things would not have been so embarrassing.","However, in the end, he did not say this. He calmed down and said gently, “Xi Xi won’t hate you. Don’t be too agitated. After resting for a while, we’ll go downstairs and eat together.”","Kang Ru echoed, “That’s right! Xi Xi will be staying at home for a while. The two of you must get along well. If you encounter any conflicts, let her have her way. After all, she suffered today.”","Kang Qingzhi bit her lip as tears trickled down her face. Then, she pounced into Kang Jichuan’s arms and cried. “Brother, I’m so sad!”","!!","Kang Jichuan’s heart ached.","“Sister Xi Xi is Dad’s biological daughter. Now that she’s home, Dad and you don’t need me to accompany you anymore. I know my identity very well. I’m just Sister Xi Xi’s substitute. Now that the legitimate daughter is back, it’s time for me to leave. I would’ve had to leave the Kang family sooner or later anyway!” After Kang Qingzhi finished speaking, she cried uncontrollably.","“Qingzhi!” Kang Ru frowned and said firmly, “Regardless of whether Xi Xi comes back or not, you’re still the eldest daughter of the Kang family. Your grandma said this herself, so I can’t go against her. Moreover, your brother and I love you so much. How could we let you leave the Kang family?!”","Kang Qingzhi was nestled in Kang Jichuan’s arms and revealed a victorious smile. Since Kang Ru had said so, her status in the Kang family was still unshakable. So what if Qiao Xi was Kang Ru’s biological daughter? She would still be trampled under her feet.","She was the daughter of the Kang family who grew up under the love of thousands. Qiao Xi was just a wild girl who led a wandering life. Qiao Xi’s existence was to change her blood and treat her illness. That was all.","Kang Qingzhi stopped crying at the right time and forced a weak smile. “Dad, I understand. I’ll get along well with Sister Xi Xi. Sister Xi Xi’s room hasn’t been tidied up yet, so why don’t you leave it to me? I’ll do my best to satisfy Sister Xi Xi as an apology.”","Kang Ru smiled affectionately. “Alright! Qingzhi, you’re really a good child. It’s just that you have to act within your limits. Don’t tire yourself out.”","“Yes! I’m Dad’s good daughter!” Kang Qing smiled sweetly.","Kang Jichuan was also infected by Kang Qingzhi’s smile and was in a good mood. He could not live without Qingzhi. Only when Qingzhi was by his side could he feel the warmth of his family.","He naturally hoped that Xi Xi could come home, but if Xi Xi came back and Qingzhi wanted to leave or turn the Kang family upside down, then Xi Xi might as well not come back!","Five years ago, Xi Xi could not tolerate Qingzhi. She felt that Qingzhi was occupying her identity and thus always made things difficult for her. However, Qingzhi was only a child when she was adopted. How could she be blamed?","Five years later, Xi Xi still could not tolerate Qingzhi and insisted on suppressing her. She was causing chaos in the family. Why could she not understand him and his father? Although Qingzhi was adopted, she had been by his and his father’s side for more than ten years. Their relationship was deep. How could they bear to let Qingzhi suffer?","All these years, Kang Jichuan had never regretted his choice. Now, the remaining trace of guilt within him had dissipated. He sacrificed an emotionless younger sister to save the obedient and sensible Qingzhi. He thought that he had done nothing wrong. Moreover, Xi Xi was still alive. He had not let Xi Xi down. At the very least, he had helped Xi Xi forget that sad memory.","Kang Jichuan thought that everything would be different this time. Now, he realized that as long as Qiao Xi returned, this family would be in turmoil and Qingzhi would have to suffer. During this period of time, Qingzhi often cried, and her illness kept acting up. It was all because of Qiao Xi!","Kang Jichuan gritted his teeth as if he had already made up his mind.","A moment later, the three people from the Kang family went downstairs together. Kang Qingzhi’s expression was much better.","Qiao Xi and the other two were sitting on the sofa. They slowly raised their eyes to see the smugness in Kang Qingzhi’s eyes.","Xue Yi leaned against Qiao Xi’s side and said in a low voice, “Xi Xi, the adopted daughter of the Kang family can’t be underestimated! She looked like she was about to die just now, but now, she’s smiling as she walks downstairs.”","Qiao Xi said casually, “It’s probably because Mr. Kang promised her something, which is why she’s so happy.”","“Sister Xi Xi.” Kang Qingzhi had a smile in her eyes, but she was also a little afraid as she walked in front of Qiao Xi. “It’s my fault today. If I hadn’t suddenly fainted, you wouldn’t have suffered. Sister, can you give me a chance to make it up to you?”"]},{"number":1461,"title":"Chapter 1461 Stupid Woman","paragraphs":["1461 Stupid Woman","The Kang father and son immediately looked at Qiao Xi. Kang Ru smiled affectionately. “Qingzhi, you’re really sensible! Xi Xi, we’re family. Don’t bicker over such a small matter.”","Qiao Xi smiled lightly. “Since Miss Kang has said so, I’ll naturally forgive her.”","Seeing that Qiao Xi did not bicker with her, Kang Ru was even happier. “Xi Xi, Qingzhi knows that you’ll be staying at home, so she’s taking the initiative to help you decorate your room!”","After she finished speaking, Kang Qingzhi held a tablet and walked in front of Qiao Xi with a smile. She bent down slightly to show her and said in a soft voice, “Sister Xi Xi, do you like these styles? If you don’t, I’ll help you choose some more.”","!!","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and glanced at her. It seemed like Kang Qingzhi was acting like the host of the villa and arranging a guest’s living arrangements. She pretended to curry favor with Qiao Xi. “Look at this luxurious and noble appearance. It’s worthy of your identity. There’s also a simple style like this one. Which one do you like?”","Xue Yi leaned over to take a look and was instantly infuriated. No matter what, Xi Xi was a fashion designer and had high standards. However, among the few interior styles Kang Qing had chosen, one was over-the-top and vulgar while the other was too simple. It was essentially a sea of white. Those who did not know better would think that it was a hospital ward. It was obvious that Kang Qingzhi was not sincerely helping Xi Xi renovate her room but was provoking her.","However, Qiao Xi was not angry. Instead, she lowered her eyes and looked at the tablet for a long time. Then, she asked with a smile, “Miss Kang, which one do you think is better?”","A trace of success flashed past Kang Qingzhi’s eyes. She tried her best to control her excitement and pretended to think seriously for a while. Then, she smiled and said, “Sister Xi Xi, I think this luxurious and noble style suits you. After all, you’ve been wandering outside for so many years. It’s not easy for you to come home. I definitely can’t treat you badly. You have to use the best things.”","With that, she looked at Kang Ru. “Dad, you’ve been thinking about my sister all these years. Now that she’s finally back, the Kang family naturally has to give her the best. We have to decorate her room to make it more luxurious. Only then will she be worthy of being the eldest daughter of the Kang family!”","Kang Ru’s face was filled with gratification. He originally thought that Qingzhi did not want Xi Xi to come back. He did not expect her to be so sensible and considerate of Xi Xi.","Kang Qingzhi continued, “Since we’re going to renovate it, we have to hire the best designers. I know a designer who’s very outstanding. I’ll invite him to help my sister design her room!”","“Alright!” Qiao Xi agreed without hesitation.","Kang Qingzhi knew that her scheme had succeeded and laughed arrogantly in her heart. Five years had passed, but Qiao Xi was still so stupid. Back then, she could play Qiao Xi like a fiddle, and she could do the same now!","The rooms of high society’s socialites had to be luxurious, but they also had to be elegant. Who would stay in such an over-the-top room? It looked very tasteless! When Qiao Xi stayed in such a room, she would definitely be mocked by the people of high society!","The smile on Kang Qingzhi’s face grew wider. “Sister Xi Xi, I’ll arrange it as soon as possible, but the rooms on the second floor are already full. You can choose one from the first and third floors.”","As the Kang family’s villa was bought after coming to Li City, the main residence was not very big. The first floor was where the servants stayed, the second floor was where the family’s rooms were, and the third floor was where guests stayed.","Xue Yi frowned.","Qiao Xi did not object and continued to smile. “I’m not picky about the rooms. Miss Kang, you can help me choose.”","Kang Qingzhi sneered in her heart. It seemed that she had overestimated Qiao Xi. She did not expect her to be so obedient and as stupid as Xia Yunqiu. It would not be long before Qiao Xi paid the price for her stupidity.","Kang Qingzhi had a sweet smile on her face and hurriedly agreed. “Alright! Then you’ll stay on the third floor! The rooms on the third floor are big. I’ll choose a room with good lighting for my sister. We can also plant some flowers and plants out on the balcony. You’ll be in a good mood after seeing the greenery.”","“Thank you.” Qiao Xi nodded slightly at her.","Seeing that the two sisters were getting along harmoniously, Kang Ru beamed. “I’m relieved to see the two of you so close. But Xi Xi, since you’re already back home, don’t keep calling Qingzhi ‘Miss Kang.’ She’s your younger sister. Why are you treating her like an outsider?”","“Like an outsider?” It was just a simple request, so Kang Ru thought that Qiao Xi would definitely agree. He did not expect Qiao Xi to raise her eyes in surprise.","Kang Qingzhi’s heart trembled as she had a bad feeling. The next second, she saw that Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with confusion as she asked word by word, “Aren’t I an outsider?”","“You... What are you talking about?! How can you be an outsider?” Kang Ru choked and looked a little puzzled."]},{"number":1462,"title":"Chapter 1462 A Guest Will Go Along With The Host","paragraphs":["1462 A Guest Will Go Along With The Host","Qiao Xi straightened her back and crossed her arms. “That’s not right! If I’m not an outsider, why would I stay in a guest room on the third floor? Miss Kang, didn’t you arrange for me to stay in a guest room because you treat me as a guest? Since Miss Kang doesn’t treat me as family, why should I treat her as family? Is there anything wrong with me calling her Miss Kang?”","The living room was silent. Kang Qingzhi pursed her lips with an aggrieved expression.","“Xi Xi, the rooms on the second floor are all...” Kang Jichuan hurriedly opened his mouth to explain, but he was interrupted by Qiao Xi with a wave of her hand.","“There are only two hosts in this household, Dad and Brother. There are three rooms on the second floor, so there should be one left.” Qiao Xi asked unhurriedly, “Could it be that Dad didn’t mean it when he said he wanted me to stay at home? He didn’t even arrange a room for me?”","Kang Qingzhi’s heart skipped a beat. No wonder Qiao Xi did not bicker with her. It turned out that she wanted to snatch her room!","Kang Ru wanted to say something but hesitated. He looked troubled. The remaining room had long been occupied by Qingzhi. He could not ask Qingzhi to move out, right?","Seeing this, Kang Jichuan explained, “Xi Xi, Qingzhi has taken over the room on the second floor. She’s weak and sickly, so the room has to be spacious and airy. Please don’t take offense.”","Kang Qingzhi curled her lips proudly. With her brother protecting her, it was absolutely impossible for Qiao Xi to snatch her room!","Qiao Xi ignored Kang Jichuan and raised her eyes to look at Kang Ru. “Alright. In any case, I’m already married. I can still stay in Longwan Residential most of the time. I’ll only come here occasionally for a few days. It doesn’t matter even if I stay in the guest room.”","Gu Zheng said gently, “Xi Xi, don’t be sad. Longwan Residential is your home. If they think you’re a guest here, you don’t have to treat them as family.”","Xue Yi echoed in a mocking tone, “Mr. Kang, you really fulfilled your promise. You sure know how to distinguish between your adopted daughter and your biological daughter. It’s just that you treat Kang Qing, your adopted daughter, well but you treat Xi Xi, your biological daughter, as a guest!","“Xi Xi, your biological daughter has been wandering outside since she was young. She definitely can’t compare to your adopted daughter who has been by your side for more than ten years. Blood relations aren’t that important. Xi Xi is just an outsider, after all.","“Xi Xi, even though you don’t go to the Xue family’s house often, we still prepared a room for you. The Kang family is a noble family in Y Nation, but they’re not even willing to prepare a room for you. This is a problem with their attitude! Since their family of three is already so happy, don’t interfere lest you’re mocked.”","From the beginning until the end, Qiao Xi’s expression was very calm. Her thin lips parted slightly. “Sister Xue Yi, you’re right. I’m indeed just a guest. I know my identity. Miss Kang, you can make any arrangements. A guest will go along with the host’s wishes!”","Kang Ru gasped and subconsciously looked at Kang Qingzhi, his gaze filled with conflict.","Kang Qingzhi’s face was pale, and her heart was filled with resentment. Kang Ru was soft-hearted. As long as Qiao Xi made herself appear as the victim, he would make Kang Qingzhi give in to her. However, she had lived with the Kang family for more than ten years. Why should she give in to Qiao Xi?","Kang Jichuan looked unhappy. “Xi Xi, when we moved in, Qingzhi wanted to leave the room on the second floor to you, but she’s not in good health. The room on the second floor is spacious and bright, suitable for recuperation. That’s why Dad and I arranged for her to stay on the second floor. She’s a patient. How can you bicker with a patient?”","Qiao Xi blinked, and her eyes carried a trace of confusion. “Young Master Kang, why don’t I understand what you’re saying? Do you think I’m bickering with Miss Kang? But I didn’t blame Miss Kang for staying on the second floor at all, nor did I refuse to let Miss Kang arrange for me to stay in the guest room.”","Her beautiful eyes shifted as she looked at Kang Jichuan innocently. “I’ve already agreed. Why are you still not satisfied, Young Master Kang?","Kang Jichuan was instantly speechless. He frowned as his body tensed up. He sighed helplessly. “Xi Xi, you’ve agreed, but you’re still unhappy. Qingzhi has been sick since she was young. No matter what her requests are, Dad and I will try our best to satisfy her. Now that you’re back, you’re unwilling to let Qingzhi stay in her room. It’s just a room. Can’t you stay on the third floor? Why must you fight with Qingzhi?”","The moment that was said, the air seemed to have frozen. There was a dead silence.","After a long time, Qiao Xi suddenly sneered. Her eyebrows were exquisite as she coldly glanced at Kang Jichuan.","“To be honest, I’m just unhappy. Anyone would be unhappy to encounter such a thing, right? You’ve clearly agreed to treat me as the rightful eldest miss of the Kang family, but it’s my first time coming home and I have to stay in the guest room while Kang Qingzhi stays in the most spacious and bright room in the main residence.”"]},{"number":1463,"title":"Chapter 1463 Killing People","paragraphs":["1463 Killing People","“You’re my biological father and brother, but you’re all speaking up for the family’s adopted daughter. I’m just an outsider in your eyes. I came home happily to accompany you, but I saw this scene instead. I’m unhappy about it, and Young Master Kang is criticizing me for it. Don’t I have the right to be unhappy?”","Qiao Xi sneered. “Moreover, even if I am unhappy, it’s not like I’m forcing Miss Kang to give up her room. I’ve already accepted her arrangements for me. However, Young Master Kang still thinks that I’m being petty with Miss Kang. Since Young Master Kang can’t tolerate me, then I don’t have to stay in the Kang family anymore.”","Kang Qingzhi and Kang Jichuan gasped.","Kang Ru instantly panicked. “Xi Xi, don’t go! Your brother... didn’t mean that. He said something wrong.”","“Mr. Kang, Young Master Kang.” Gu Zheng looked over with cold eyes. “Why don’t you think about it from Xi Xi’s perspective? Miss Kang has been living with the Kang family in Xi Xi’s place for more than ten years. All these years, she has enjoyed wealth, splendor, and endless love. Now that Xi Xi is back, she has never thought of bickering with her and has also made concessions. But you’re still dissatisfied, so what exactly should Xi Xi do?”","Gu Zheng’s voice was filled with coldness. “Does Xi Xi have to happily accept all your arrangements regardless of what they are before you’re satisfied? On the surface, she’s the daughter of the Kang family, but she’s actually an outsider. Are you looking for your family member, or are you looking for a puppet who won’t resist?","“Miss Kang.” Gu Zheng’s gaze was cold, and his voice was low. “You’re so young, but you’re really good at playing tricks. You’re truly vicious and ruthless.”","Kang Qingzhi met Gu Zheng’s cold gaze and was so scared that cold sweat broke out on her back. She even felt that Gu Zheng would break her neck in the next second.","Kang Jichuan’s heart skipped a beat, and he could not help but fall into deep thought. He still remembered that Qingzhi had always cried to him in the past, saying that Xi Xi had bullied her and Xi Xi could not tolerate her, but he had never seen it with his own eyes.","From Xi Xi’s perspective, they were indeed biased toward Qingzhi and made her sad. However, Qingzhi had accompanied them for more than ten years, after all. There was nothing wrong with them doting on her!","However... Xi Xi was his father’s biological daughter. She would naturally be aggrieved staying in a guest room.","When he thought about this, a trace of guilt suddenly arose in Kang Jichuan’s heart. He was thinking about how to win Qiao Xi back.","At this moment, the butler’s voice suddenly came from the door. “Sir, there’s Madam Wen Lai here to visit. Do you want to invite her in?”","The surroundings instantly fell silent as the corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up imperceptibly.","Kang Qingzhi looked as though she had been pardoned and met her savior. She hurriedly said, “Dad, Madam Wen Lai must be here to look for me.”","“Wen Lai?” Kang Ru thought for a moment and instantly remembered. “She’s the founder of Planet Music Festival. At the same time, she’s also an extremely talented perfumer. I heard that many nobles in Y Nation have invited her to make perfumes.”","Kang Qingzhi nodded with an extremely bright smile. “Yes, Madam Wen Lai said that if I can win the award this time, she’ll introduce me to those nobles.”","In an instant, Kang Ru forgot about what had just happened and looked at Kang Qingzhi with gratification. “Qingzhi! I really didn’t expect you to know Madam Wen Lai. You’re really my good daughter! Quickly invite Madam Wen Lai in!”","Kang Qingzhi glanced at Qiao Xi worriedly. “But Sister Xi Xi...”","Kang Ru suddenly reacted and thought for a moment before saying, “Xi Xi, it’s my fault for not taking your feelings into consideration. However, Qingzhi has already moved into that room. I can’t chase her out. I remember that there’s an empty room on the second floor. I’ll get the servants to clean it out later. You can stay there first and redecorate it when you have time.”","Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes and met Kang Qingzhi’s scheming eyes that were filled with ridicule. The corners of her mouth curled up.","Wasn’t it too early for Miss Kang to be happy? Madam Wen Lai was already here. She might cry soon!","Qiao Xi knew very well that the Kang father and son would not let Kang Qingzhi move out. Even if Kang Ru agreed on an impulse, Kang Qingzhi would faint on the spot. At that time, the father and son would soften their hearts and go back on their word.","As for Kang Ru saying that she would be arranged to stay in an empty room on the second floor, it was even more laughable. She had already asked the butler just now. There were only three bedrooms on the second floor. The remaining room was probably a storeroom. It would not be very big. Wasn’t it too perfunctory to make the storeroom into a bedroom?"]},{"number":1464,"title":"Chapter 1464 The Good Show Is Still To Come!","paragraphs":["1464 The Good Show Is Still To Come!","Seeing this, Kang Jichuan hurriedly echoed, “Xi Xi, you have to consider the overall situation. Madam Wen Lai is extremely famous among the nobles, so we can’t offend her. Moreover, Madam Wen Lai specially came to our house to visit Qingzhi. This is a rare opportunity. Even if you’re dissatisfied, don’t fool around first. After Madam Wen Lai leaves, we’ll talk as a family.”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart.","As a family? Had they become a family now?","“Qingzhi, quickly go welcome Madam Wen Lai.” At this moment, Kang Ru had already completely forgotten about Qiao Xi’s grievances. His heart was filled with the desire to entertain Madam Wen Lai and pave the way for Kang Qingzhi’s future.","Xue Yi looked at the Kang father and son and was about to explode from anger. They were too snobbish. Just because Kang Qing could bring honor to the Kang family, they did not care about Qiao Xi’s feelings? Moreover, Kang Qingzhi’s honor was stolen!","Kang Ru wanted to invite Madam Wen Lai in as soon as possible because he thought that Xi Xi would not dare to cause trouble in front of Madam Wen Lai again and could only swallow her anger. Xue Yi naturally saw through Kang Ru’s thoughts, but he would never have expected that the show would continue!","She wanted to see how Kang Qingzhi would explain herself to Madam Wen Lai. She did not submit her work, but she could advance. A dignified noble socialite was secretly manipulating the competition. If news of this got out, where would the Kang family put their dignity?","Not long after, Kang Qingzhi slowly walked in with a woman in her 60s. She was elegant and dressed exquisitely.","Kang Ru had met Wen Lai a few times, but they were not very familiar with each other. It was just that he did not expect Wen Lai to personally visit Qingzhi.","“Hello, Madam Wen Lai,” Kang Ru said gently.","“Thank you for coming, Madam Wen Lai. I’ll thank you on behalf of Qingzhi.” Kang Jichuan hurriedly went forward to greet her and supported Kang Qingzhi.","Madam Wen Lai nodded and said calmly, “Hello. I heard from Miss Kang that you recently moved to Li City, so I came to visit.”","Kang Qingzhi was filled with pride as she glanced at Qiao Xi provocatively and smiled in embarrassment. “Madam Wen Lai, I originally came to Li City to recuperate. Coincidentally, this year’s International Perfume Competition is also being held in Li City, so I signed up to participate. I didn’t expect you to come and see me. It’s really my honor.”","Madam Wen Lai was a little surprised. “You signed up for the perfume competition?”","Kang Qingzhi won two past perfume competitions consecutively. Madam Wen Lai thought that she would continue to participate and win three consecutive championships. Unexpectedly, her health was not good, so she did not continue to participate. Madam Wen Lai felt that it was a pity, so when she heard that Kang Qingzhi was participating in the competition, she was a little surprised and excited.","“Miss Kang, you should have already advanced! You’ve won the championship twice, so you’ve definitely advanced. Are you confident in winning the championship this time?”","Kang Qingzhi smiled shyly. “Thank you for your praise. I was lucky the first two times. I heard that there are many outstanding contestants this year. I’m not sure if I can win the championship. Actually, the championship isn’t that important to me. I just have to do my best and not regret it.”","“Well said!” Madam Wen Lai’s eyes were filled with admiration. She smiled and said, “Actually, I came this time to persuade you to participate in the competition. I didn’t expect you to have already signed up.”","Kang Qingzhi glanced at Qiao Xi. This woman’s perfume recipes were indeed perfect. As long as she participated in the competition with Qiao Xi’s work, she would definitely win the award.","The original owner of the perfume recipes was standing in front of everyone, but other than her, no one knew that these perfume recipes were all written by Qiao Xi. Back then, Qiao Xi knew that she had stolen the perfume recipes, yet she still developed them day and night. She was really an extremely stupid woman!","Kang Qingzhi curled the corners of her mouth. Suddenly, her eyes shifted as she said with a smile, “Madam Wen Lai, let me introduce you to my sister, Qiao Xi.”","She stretched out her hand and pointed at Qiao Xi. Although there was a smile on her face, her eyes were filled with pride and provocation. “Sister Xi Xi, I heard that you signed up for the competition as well. Did you advance?”","When Madam Wen Lai heard the name Qiao Xi, she found it a little familiar. It was only when she saw Qiao Xi’s face that she remembered who she was. Although she did not know when Qiao Xi became a member of the Kang family, since Kang Qingzhi said that Qiao Xi was her sister, then they must be very close.","Now that the Kang family already had an outstanding perfumer like Miss Kang, if Qiao Xi was also an extremely talented contestant, then it would be a good story for the two sisters to work together to make perfumes.","When she thought about this, Madam Wen Lai looked at Qiao Xi with anticipation."]},{"number":1465,"title":"Chapter 1465 Strong Evidence","paragraphs":["1465 Strong Evidence","At this moment, when Xue Yi heard Kang Qingzhi’s words, her fists instantly stiffened. She wished for nothing more than to rush over and slap that b*tch, but she was stopped by Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes and glanced at Kang Qingzhi with a calm gaze. “Are you so curious about whether I advanced?”","Kang Qingzhi’s thin body trembled as she hid behind Kang Jichuan like a frightened rabbit. “Sister Xi Xi, I... I’m just concerned about you. I... I don’t have any ill intentions.”","Kang Jichuan was unhappy. “Xi Xi, why are you bullying Qingzhi? She was just casually asking. It’s fine if you don’t want to say it, but Qingzhi’s health isn’t good. Don’t always frighten her like that.”","!!","“I only asked a question, and my tone wasn’t bad. Is this called bullying?” Qiao Xi grunted coldly. “Since she’s so curious, I’ll tell her.”","She replied casually, “I was eliminated.”","The living room instantly fell silent.","Kang Ru did not know that Qiao Xi had participated in the perfume competition, but the daughter of the Kang family did not advance. It would not be pleasant if news of this got out!","Wen Lai’s eyes were slightly disappointed as well. Actually, it was normal for her not to advance. Qiao Xi was already very good at composing. She could not be so good at perfume-making. Even if she passed the audition, she would still have to participate in the competition. It was reasonable for her to be eliminated if she encountered a professional perfumer.","Hearing that Qiao Xi had not advanced, Wen Lai withdrew her gaze.","Kang Qingzhi apologized helplessly. “Sister Xi Xi, I’m sorry. I didn’t mean to... hurt you. I just asked casually. I didn’t know... that you were eliminated.”","After she finished speaking, she hid behind Kang Jichuan in fear as if Qiao Xi would blame her.","Kang Jichuan, the escort, immediately stood up and criticized, “Xi Xi, you were eliminated because you weren’t capable enough. You can’t blame Qingzhi. Do you have to pretend to be cold?”","Madam Wen Lai subconsciously looked at everyone. Why did she feel that something was wrong? Qiao Xi did not seem to have said anything either. Why was Kang Jichuan criticizing her the moment he opened his mouth?","However, this was the Kang family’s family matter, after all. It was not appropriate for an outsider like her to interrupt, so she did not say anything.","However, in the next second, Qiao Xi abruptly raised her eyes as a trace of coldness flashed past her eyes. “Young Master Kang, I wasn’t eliminated because I wasn’t capable enough. There’s another reason behind it.”","“What other reason could there be? Xi Xi, I know you’re unhappy and want to compete with Qingzhi, but it’s a fact that you’re not capable enough. Why find an excuse for yourself? If you really like perfumes, you can get Qingzhi to teach you. There’s no need to use such a method.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Qiao Xi said unhurriedly, “I was eliminated because my opponent secretly manipulated things behind the scenes and bribed the judges.”","Her voice was very calm, but it was like a thunderclap that heavily struck everyone’s hearts.","Madam Wen Lai did not like to interfere in other people’s family matters, but when she heard Qiao Xi’s words, she instantly frowned. “Miss Qiao, you said that someone bribed the judges?”","Kang Qingzhi subconsciously lowered her head and bit her lip.","Kang Jichuan did not know that the person who made Qiao Xi be eliminated was Kang Qingzhi, but he still retorted, “Xi Xi, don’t spout nonsense. I know you think highly of yourself and don’t want to believe that you were eliminated, but if everyone who was eliminated suspects that the opponent bribed the judges, how will this competition continue?","“You’re not capable enough, yet you’re suspecting others. You have to know that there’s always someone better. There are many people who are more outstanding than you. Madam Wen Lai is here. Can you stop fooling around?!”","Kang Jichuan’s tone was impatient. He did not care about Qiao Xi and was just worried that Qingzhi would be implicated.","“Sister Xi Xi, it’s not scary to fail, but it’s a little too much to suspect the judges. The perfume competition is an international competition. Won’t you offend many people by saying this?” Kang Qingzhi said weakly.","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent as she said casually, “It’s not my suspicion, though. I’m sure of it because I have evidence.”","Boom!!!","Madam Wen Lai could not sit still anymore. She suddenly looked up. “Miss Qiao, do you really have evidence? If you can really prove that the other party manipulated things, I’ll definitely help you seek justice!”","Qiao Xi smiled as she glanced at Kang Qingzhi. The other party’s expression instantly changed, and her body trembled uncontrollably.","At this moment, Xue Yi looked at Kang Jichuan meaningfully, then said softly, “Hello, Madam Wen Lai. Let me introduce myself. I’m the daughter of the Xue family, Xue Yi.","“Since Xi Xi said this in public, she naturally has strong evidence. That’s why she thinks that someone bribed the judges.”"]},{"number":1466,"title":"Chapter 1466 They No Longer Have A Bottom Line","paragraphs":["1466 They No Longer Have A Bottom Line","“Miss Xue?” Madam Wen Lai immediately recalled that the Xue family was also a wealthy family. They had been perfumers for generations and were also one of the sponsors of this perfume competition. They were also one of the eight permanent judges. Hence, the Xue family’s weight in the perfume competition could not be underestimated. Hence, her tone softened a little. “Miss Xue, feel free to speak.”","Xue Yi nodded and said seriously, “Xi Xi and I grew up together. Her perfume skills have obtained the recognition of everyone in the Xue family, so I felt that something was wrong when she was suddenly eliminated. I investigated in private and realized a problem.”","She paused for a moment and glanced coldly at Kang Qingzhi before continuing, “Xi Xi’s opponent signed up to participate in the competition, but she didn’t hand in her work. According to the rules of the competition, those who didn’t hand in their work will be deemed to have automatically forfeited. Xi Xi should’ve advanced, but Xi Xi was eliminated in the end.","“Young Master Kang, don’t you think there’s something wrong with this?”","Kang Jichuan frowned. Why was Xue Yi always targeting him? He was not the one who caused Xi Xi to be eliminated. Why was she asking him?","Before Kang Jichuan could say anything, Madam Wen Lai asked with a gloomy expression, “Miss Xue, are you sure that the other party advanced without submitting their work?”","Xue Yi nodded without hesitation.","Madam Wen Lai’s expression darkened even more, but she did not notice that Kang Qingzhi was trembling in fear and had lowered her eyes guiltily.","Xue Yi continued, “Madam Wen Lai, our Xue family is also a sponsor of the perfume competition. Such a thing will have a bad impact on the competition, so I’ve already sent someone to investigate. We’ll have the results soon. Although we already have evidence, the other party’s identity is a little special. It’s not convenient for me to say it now.”","When Madam Wen Lai heard this, she berated angrily, “If someone really broke the rules of the International Perfume Competition, I definitely won’t tolerate it no matter who that person is! Miss Xue, please say the names of that person and those judges who were bribed!”","Xue Yi looked at Kang Jichuan with mockery and raised an eyebrow. “Young Master Kang, do you think I should tell Madam Wen Lai?”","Everyone in the Kang family was instantly stunned. Kang Jichuan did not understand why Xue Yi kept mentioning him. What did this have to do with him?","“Miss Xue, what exactly do you mean?” Kang Jichuan’s expression darkened, and his gentle face rarely revealed anger.","Kang Jichuan had an excellent upbringing and was unwilling to bicker with a woman like Xue Yi. However, how could he be asked about the perfume competition?","The atmosphere fell into a deadlock for a moment. After a moment of silence, Gu Zheng broke the silence first. His voice was low and hoarse. “Since Young Master Kang doesn’t understand, Miss Xue, just say it. There’s no need to worry.”","Xue Yi replied, then said with a smile, “Alright! I originally wanted to save Young Master Kang some dignity on account of Xi Xi, but now that I think about it, there’s no need. I know that Young Master Kang and Master Kang are biased toward their adopted daughter, but I didn’t expect you to have no bottom line for the sake of the family’s adopted daughter.”","Kang Qingzhi gritted her teeth and panicked. She originally thought that Qiao Xi would let the matter rest after being eliminated. Unexpectedly, she had Xue Yi by her side. Moreover, the Xue family’s status in the perfume competition was very high, so it was not difficult to investigate this matter.","She reminded herself repeatedly in her heart that she had to calm down and not expose herself!","At this moment, Kang Jichuan’s expression was gloomy. In his opinion, Xi Xi was eliminated because she was not capable enough, but she actually suspected that her opponent was faking it. She was clearly a sore loser!","Kang Jichuan tried his best to suppress the surging emotions in his heart. Xi Xi was his biological sister, after all. He could not berate her in public, so he could only vent his anger on Xue Yi. He roared angrily. “Miss Xue, I know you’re dissatisfied with me because of the matter of the room. It’s my fault for not considering Xi Xi, but this perfume competition—”","Before she could finish, Xue Yi took out her cell phone and played a recording.","The person in charge said, “Miss Xue, we realized that Miss Qiao’s opponent didn’t submit her work. Logically speaking, her opponent should have been eliminated during the audition, but not only did this person advance in the competition, but she also eliminated Miss Qiao. I’ve already sent someone to investigate this matter. I believe we’ll have results soon.”","Xue Yi said, “In that case, the person who should’ve advanced according to the rules of the competition is Xi Xi, but the other party secretly manipulated things, causing Xi Xi to be eliminated.”","The person in charge said, “Yes... Yes.”","Xue Yi said, “Investigate who Xi Xi’s opponent is. I have reason to suspect that they bribed the judges.”"]},{"number":1467,"title":"Chapter 1467 Xue Yi’s Crazy Damage","paragraphs":["1467 Xue Yi’s Crazy Damage","A moment later, the person in charge finished his investigation and called Xue Yi again, but his tone was a little subtle.","“Miss Xue, Miss Qiao’s opponent was Kang Qingzhi, the previous champion of two past consecutive competitions.”","These words exploded in everyone’s ears. They all looked at Kang Qingzhi.","Xue Yi’s recording was undoubtedly a heavy bomb. It blew Kang Qingzhi up. Her eyes were red as she clutched her chest in pain as if she was going to faint the next second.","!!","“Hey! Miss Kang, are you going to faint again?!” Xue Yi sneered. “I remember you saying just now that failure isn’t scary, but isn’t it a little too much to doubt the judges?","“Young Master Kang said that Xi Xi didn’t advance because she’s not capable enough. If everyone who’s eliminated has to suspect their opponents, then this competition won’t be able to continue.","“At first, I didn’t understand why the two of you were targeting Xi Xi. Now, I finally understand. You were just defending yourselves! Because you were the ones who secretly manipulated the competition! Miss Kang didn’t submit her work and bribed the judges to advance. Now, she’s even accusing Xi Xi of going too far. Who do you think went too far?”","Xue Yi’s words were like a slap to Kang Qingzhi’s face. She felt her cheeks burn.","Madam Wen Lai’s gaze changed from shock to disdain. “Miss Kang, it’s actually you?”","Kang Qingzhi was so scared that her entire body trembled. Tears trickled down her face as she looked like she was having difficulty breathing. “I... I didn’t do it. I don’t know anything. You guys... believe me.”","Kang Jichuan’s expression was ugly, and the angry expression from before vanished completely. He looked at Qiao Xi with a complicated expression. It turned out that Xi Xi was really eliminated because of him.","However, Qingzhi was the champion for two consecutive years. She was very strong, but it was only because her health was poor that she could not submit her work. Even if Qingzhi submitted her work, Xi Xi would still be eliminated.","Out of everyone, only Kang Ru knew nothing about this. He looked at Kang Qingzhi’s pale face and pitiful appearance. His eyes were filled with heartache.","“Xi Xi, this... This is impossible! Qingzhi grew up by my side since she was young. I know her very well. She wouldn’t have bribed the judges. It’s possible that those judges saw her name and knew that she had won the championship twice before letting her advance.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Xue Yi played another recording.","‘Young Master Kang, don’t worry. We guarantee that Miss Kang will definitely win the championship. She doesn’t have to submit her work for the audition. We’ll let her advance regardless!”","Kang Jichuan said, “Alright, after this is done, I’ll transfer the money to your account. Qingzhi has been weak since she was young and only likes to make perfumes. As her brother, of course, I have to satisfy her. Don’t disappoint me.”","“No problem! However, there’s one thing. This competition is one-on-one. If Miss Kang advances, the other party will definitely be eliminated, but...”","Before the other party could finish, Kang Jichuan interrupted impatiently, “I don’t care who the other party is. Qingzhi has to advance. Since you’ve accepted my money, you have to solve this problem.”","“Young Master Kang! Hello? Young Master Kang, this...”","With that, Kang Jichuan hung up, but the person on the other end of the phone muttered, “But Miss Kang’s opponent is Bright Moon. Her work is really too perfect. Unfortunately, she encountered Miss Kang. Otherwise, she would definitely have advanced to the finals and might have become the champion. If only Bright Moon had such a brother!","“Why does Bright Moon’s name sound a little familiar? Qiao... Qiao Xi?’","After the recording ended, the living room was eerily silent.","Kang Ru’s expression changed from confusion to shock. He widened his eyes and looked at Kang Jichuan.","Xue Yi sneered. “Young Master Kang, will you still say that the perfume competition has nothing to do with you? Did you hear what the judge said just now? If only Xi Xi had such an elder brother. What he doesn’t know is that Xi Xi does have such an elder brother, but he’s only willing to help his adopted sister and not her. Hence, no matter how good her perfume is, she has to give way to Kang Qingzhi. In Young Master Kang’s eyes, Kang Qingzhi is his only younger sister!","“I really wonder if Xi Xi is Mr. Kang’s biological daughter and Young Master Kang’s biological sister. In order to let the family’s adopted daughter get her wish, both of you don’t care about Xi Xi’s feelings!","“Kang Qingzhi went up against Xi Xi, but she didn’t even submit her work and got Xi Xi eliminated. What right does an adopted daughter like her, who’s occupying Xi Xi’s identity, have to bribe the judges and eliminate the legitimate daughter? She treats Xi Xi like this, yet you guys still want Xi Xi to acknowledge you?”"]},{"number":1468,"title":"Chapter 1468 You Shouldn’t Be The One Who Got Eliminated","paragraphs":["1468 You Shouldn’t Be The One Who Got Eliminated","“Young Master Kang, you did something wrong but accused Xi Xi of going too far and fooling around. What right do people like you, who have no bottom line, have to criticize Xi Xi?”","Xue Yi’s anger, which she had been suppressing for a long time, was finally released. Every word she said was a slap to the Kang family’s faces. Madam Wen Lai’s expression darkened as she listened. Even the butler could not help but shake his head.","Even the butler felt that the young master shouldn’t have done this. How would Miss Xi Xi feel?","Hearing Xue Yi’s questions and accusations, Kang Jichuan felt his temples throbbing. He lowered his head and did not dare to look into Qiao Xi’s eyes.","!!","He... He did not know that Qingzhi’s opponent was Xi Xi! If he had, he...","“In order to satisfy Kang Qingzhi’s selfish desires, Young Master Kang secretly manipulated things behind the scenes and destroyed the work that others have spent a long time on. Yet you actually want Xi Xi to return to the Kang family and continue to be bullied by Kang Qingzhi? Our Xi Xi has people who dote on her very much. She doesn’t have to acknowledge you as her relatives.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Xue Yi looked at Madam Wen Lai and said respectfully, “Madam Wen Lai, everything I said is true. You can send someone to investigate it again. I think it won’t be long before the person in charge calls to tell you about this. I can’t interfere in the final outcome, so you’ll have to decide.","“However, the perfume competition is an international competition. If we can’t even guarantee basic fairness, our Xue family will definitely personally solve this problem. We definitely won’t let Xi Xi suffer!”","After Xue Yi finished speaking, Gu Zheng suddenly laughed, and everyone looked at him.","The man sat beside Qiao Xi with a tall figure and sharp eyes. His entire body emitted a shocking coldness. “Thank you, Miss Xue, for standing up for Xi Xi, but I’ll handle this matter differently. If the perfume competition doesn’t give me a satisfactory outcome, then there’s no need for this competition to exist.”","Kang Qingzhi’s body trembled. She knew that with Gu Zheng’s ability and character, he was completely capable of doing such a thing. If the perfume competition completely disappeared because of her dirty tricks, how many people would she offend?","Madam Wen Lai’s expression was very ugly. It was not because of Xue Yi and Gu Zheng’s slightly threatening words but because of her anger and disappointment in Kang Qingzhi.","This time, Kang Qingzhi used such a method. Did it mean that she had used the same method twice before?","Kang Ru calmed down for a long time. Xi Xi was eliminated because of Qingzhi, but Qingzhi did not have any other hobbies. She only liked to make perfumes. If Qingzhi gave up on this competition, he would not be able to bear it!","However, in this situation, he knew that if she did not withdraw from the competition, Gu Zheng and Xue Yi would definitely not stop.","Kang Ru was silent for a long time before he slowly said, “Madam Wen Lai, Qingzhi won the championship twice in a row. If she submits her work, she’ll definitely be able to advance. This time, perhaps it’s because her health isn’t good that she couldn’t submit her work in time, so can you let Qingzhi continue...”","“Dad, are you saying that even if Miss Kang had submitted her work, I’d still be the one eliminated?” Qiao Xi interrupted Kang Ru unhurriedly.","Earlier, it was Xue Yi who was denouncing the Kang family and Qiao Xi did not speak a word. Now that she finally spoke, she called out ‘Dad’ in a calm tone as if she was not the one who was eliminated.","“According to the rules of the competition, if you don’t submit your work, it’ll be considered a forfeit. Hence, Miss Kang didn’t even pass the audition. Even though she was once the champion, she can’t ignore the rules of the competition and manipulate things to eliminate her opponent!”","Kang Ru opened his mouth but did not retort.","Qingzhi was once the champion. If she had submitted her work, she would definitely have advanced. Hence, it was not a big deal even if she did not submit her work!","Kang Ru’s eyes were filled with complicated emotions. “Xi Xi, please bear with me...”","Qiao Xi’s tone was still indifferent. “Dad, you said that I’m your biological daughter and you’ll compensate me well, but you only care about Miss Kang and don’t care about my feelings at all! Your son and adopted daughter bribed the judges and ignored the rules of the competition to ruin my hard work. I’m clearly the victim, yet you still want me to forgive Kang Qingzhi. Is this fair?","“You heard the recording just now. That judge said that my work would’ve definitely let me advance to the finals and I might even become the champion. In that case, why do you and Brother think that I’ll definitely be eliminated? Will you persuade me to give in to Kang Qingzhi even if I can defeat her?”","Madam Wen Lai frowned. “Miss Qiao, don’t worry. I won’t allow anyone to ignore the rules of the competition. No matter what, you shouldn’t be the one who got eliminated. Don’t worry and continue participating in the competition!”"]},{"number":1469,"title":"Chapter 1469 Made A Concession And Got Slapped In The Face","paragraphs":["1469 Made A Concession And Got Slapped In The Face","Madam Wen Lai looked at Kang Qingzhi coldly. “Miss Kang, even if you’re the champion of two consecutive competitions, you have to abide by the rules of the competition. After all, Young Master Kang just said that there’s always someone better. There are many people who are more outstanding than you. The judges all think that Miss Qiao’s work is perfect. Maybe she’s stronger than you. You can’t abuse your power and deprive others of the chance to advance!","“Hence, the person I announce to be eliminated is Miss Kang. According to the rules of the competition, Miss Qiao will advance.”","Kang Qingzhi instantly widened her eyes. Her body swayed as tears trickled down her face. She sobbed softly. “No... No! Sister Xi Xi, I beg you. I... I don’t want to be eliminated. I only have one hobby. Can you...”","She was already eliminated now. Could it be that she had to watch helplessly as Qiao Xi became the champion?","Kang Jichuan’s heart ached. He hurriedly came over to support Kang Qingzhi, feeling guilty and troubled. Xi Xi was his biological sister. He had bribed the judges and caused Xi Xi to be eliminated, so he felt very guilty. However, Qingzhi’s health was not good. She only liked to make perfumes. Why should Xi Xi bicker with a patient?","Moreover, it was not that Qingzhi did not have the ability. It was just that her illness had been serious recently and she did not have the energy to make perfumes. As Qingzhi’s sister, Xi Xi should be more tolerant.","Kang Ru’s gaze shifted between Qiao Xi and Kang Qingzhi. His heart ached for Qiao Xi, but he also pitied Kang Qingzhi.","Qingzhi’s illness kept acting up. She might suddenly die one day. If she did not win the championship this time, it would be a lifelong regret.","Kang Ru said hesitantly, “Xi Xi, you also know that Qingzhi’s health isn’t good. She really wants to participate in this competition. Can you let her have her way this time? Just take it as if it’s for my sake...”","“Why should I give in?” Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with coldness. She stood up and was about to walk out. “Sister Xue Yi and Ah Zheng are right. Since the Kang family doesn’t welcome me, I’ll leave. For the sake of the family’s adopted daughter, my biological brother didn’t hesitate to bribe the judges to eliminate me. My biological father also wants me to swallow my anger for the sake of his adopted daughter.","“I’m not a fool. I’ve clearly been wronged, yet you still want me to swallow my anger. I made a concession, but I didn’t expect to get slapped in the face as a result of it. I really can’t get along with Miss Kang, so I’ll choose to leave the Kang family.”","Kang Ru said anxiously, “Xi Xi, don’t be rash...”","Qiao Xi stopped in her tracks and suddenly turned around to walk in front of Kang Ru. She quickly snatched the photos back from him and said coldly, “Mr. Kang, I’ll take my mother’s photos back with me. If my mother were still around, she would absolutely not let me suffer. Since you no longer have my mother and me in your hearts, there’s no point in letting you keep her photos.”","As soon as Qiao Xi finished speaking, she turned around domineeringly and pulled Gu Zheng toward the door. “From now on, I won’t be in contact with the Kang family anymore. Let’s pretend not to know each other.”","Kang Ru shouted in a panic, “Xi Xi! Xi Xi!”","He never expected that what should have been a happy day would become like this.","Kang Ru lowered his eyes to look at his empty hand. Before he could finish looking at Yunqiu’s photos, they were snatched away by Qiao Xi. His heart seemed to be missing a piece, and it hurt so much that he frowned.","At this moment, he finally panicked and quickly rushed to Qiao Xi’s side, but he was stopped by Gu Zheng’s tall figure.","Kang Ru’s face was ashen, and he did not know how to salvage Qiao Xi. He could only be stunned on the spot as he watched Qiao Xi and the others leave in a daze. This scene could not help but remind him of the scene of Xia Yunqiu leaving 20 years ago, and his heart was filled with sorrow.","Why... Why did she have to leave him? Yunqiu was like this, and so was Xi Xi!","Madam Wen Lai also understood the scene in front of her. She slowly stood up, her eyes cold. “Mr. Kang, logically speaking, this is your family matter and I shouldn’t interfere. But aren’t you going too far by forcing your biological daughter to withdraw from the competition for an adopted daughter?”","Seeing that Kang Ru was silent, she looked at Kang Qingzhi coldly and sneered. “Miss Kang, I wanted to recommend you to be a judge in the perfume competition earlier. Now, it seems that someone like you isn’t qualified at all!”","Kang Qingzhi’s body trembled as she leaned against Kang Jichuan weakly.","With that, Madam Wen Lai stood up and left angrily. Only the Kang family and the butler were left in the originally lively villa.","Kang Ru’s emotions were extremely complicated. He felt guilty and regretful. He even wanted to rush out and beg Qiao Xi to come back, but the arrogance in his bones did not allow him to do so."]},{"number":1470,"title":"Chapter 1470 If We Could Do It Again","paragraphs":["1470 If We Could Do It Again","Kang Jichuan stared blankly at the spot, Qiao Xi’s words echoing in his mind. It was not easy for him and his father to find his sister. Could it be that they still had to separate?","However, he... He really did not mean to eliminate Xi Xi. His heart just ached for Qingzhi, and he hoped that she could live to show her value in her lifetime. He did not know that Xi Xi had also participated in the competition and coincidentally became Qingzhi’s opponent.","If he could do it again, he would’ve arranged for the two of them to compete separately. It would be good if the two of them advanced. No matter what, Xi Xi was his biological sister, so his heart naturally ached.","Kang Qingzhi lowered her head and pursed her lips tightly. When Qiao Xi left just now, she turned around to look at her. Her eyes were cold and soul-stirring, but they carried strong ridicule, making Kang Qingzhi feel uneasy.","What was Qiao Xi going to do? Was she going to expose this matter?","Actually, she was not afraid even if it was exposed. She had won the championship twice in a row and had already received the public’s recognition. What happened this time was just an accident. She was not in good health, so she wasn’t able to submit her work on time. The judges knew that she had won the championship twice in a row, so they made an exception to let her advance. This was understandable!","At the thought of this, Kang Qingzhi took a deep breath and gradually calmed down. She squeezed out a few more tears and looked at Kang Ru pitifully. “Dad, I’m sorry. It’s all my fault. My sister hates me. I shouldn’t have participated in the perfume competition.”","Kang Ru sat weakly on the sofa and did not say anything.","“Before Sister left, she even glared at me. It’s all my fault. Don’t blame Brother. He did it for my own good. From now on, I won’t participate in any more competitions. I won’t make Sister angry anymore. Dad... Please forgive me.”","Kang Qingzhi’s face was pale, and her eyes were red. If it were any other time, Kang Ru’s heart would have ached a long time ago, but at this moment, Qiao Xi’s words kept echoing in his mind. ‘If my mother were still around, she would absolutely not let me suffer. Since you no longer have my mother and me in your hearts, then there’s no point in you keeping her photos.’","Kang Ru was annoyed and said impatiently, “Stop crying! Qingzhi, you’re indeed in the wrong this time. You always think so badly of Xi Xi. She didn’t do anything to you at all. Instead, you’re the one who hurt her. You didn’t apologize to her and even caused trouble in front of me. How did you become like this?!”","The moment that was said, Kang Qingzhi stopped crying.","Kang Jichuan sighed helplessly. “Qingzhi, it’s my fault for not taking Xi Xi’s feelings into consideration. She has indeed suffered. It’s reasonable for her to advance. I’ll think of a way to let you continue participating in the competition. Don’t cry.”","Kang Ru suddenly looked up with a trace of displeasure in his eyes. “Forget it. Qingzhi, don’t participate in this competition. Find some time to apologize to Xi Xi. Jichuan, you should go with her. You shouldn’t have done such a thing. You have to remember that Xi Xi is your biological sister.”","“Dad, I can apologize, but Qingzhi...” Kang Jichuan looked troubled. He knew how much Qingzhi liked to make perfumes. Even though she was sick, she would still stay up late to come up with a perfume recipe. If they did not let her participate in the competition, it would be too cruel to her.","Kang Qingzhi’s body stiffened. She choked and said, “If I don’t participate in the competition, then the Kang family’s perfume company...”","“It’s okay! Xi Xi has been wronged. If she finds out that you’re still participating in the competition, she’ll definitely be angry!” Kang Ru interrupted her without hesitation.","Kang Qingzhi’s heart trembled, and she stopped breathing.","She had lived with the Kang family for more than ten years, but her father had never said anything harsh. Now that Qiao Xi had just returned to the Kang family, her father had reprimanded her. He even disregarded the company’s interests for Qiao Xi!","Qiao Xi! Why did this b*tch come back? Five years ago, the Kang family was in chaos upon her return. Unexpectedly, it became even worse five years later!","Kang Qingzhi’s nails were digging into her palms. She lowered her head to hide the resentment in her eyes. After Kang Ru and Kang Jichuan left, she took out her phone and made a call.","As soon as the call connected, she sobbed softly. “Grandma, I... I can’t participate in the perfume competition anymore, but if I can’t participate in the competition, the Kang family’s perfume company will be affected. Our family will lose a large sum of money!","“Sister Xi Xi doesn’t want me to participate in the competition. I know... I’m just an adopted daughter. I shouldn’t compete with Sister Xi Xi, but I can’t let the company lose money! This is all my fault. I’m so sad! Sister just doesn’t like me. She doesn’t know the company’s situation, so she forced me to withdraw from the competition. Grandma... Don’t be angry. Sister Xi Xi is your biological granddaughter, after all!”"]},{"number":1471,"title":"Chapter 1471 She Wouldn’t Believe A Word","paragraphs":["1471 She Wouldn’t Believe A Word","At this moment, Qiao Xi and the others had already gotten into the car and left.","Xue Yi was still filled with anger. “The Kang father and son are really muddle-headed! They’re being played by a b*tch. It seems that they regret it now, but it’s too late.”","“Of course, they’ll regret it and feel a little guilty,” Qiao Xi said casually. “But that’s all to it. They’re still on Kang Qingzhi’s side.”","Gu Zheng’s expression was cold.","Qiao Xi chuckled and said, “Mr. Kang has been trying to find his biological daughter for so many years. It seems that he still has feelings for me, so he’ll fall into self-reproach and guilt for a period of time. However, such emotions come and go quickly. He won’t make things difficult for Kang Qingzhi for such emotions.”","Xue Yi pursed her lips. “Tsk! His own daughter ran away in anger, yet he still cares about that b*tch!”","Ever since Qiao Xi entered the Kang family’s villa, she had been calm as if she was not the protagonist of this farce. The corners of her mouth curled up as she said, “He clearly knows that I’ve been wronged, but he still wanted me to let Kang Qingzhi off. Do you think their regrets are meaningful? There are many things a person will regret in their life, but if they had to do it all over again, they would still choose to do it the same way. Moreover, Kang Qingzhi knows that she won’t be punished at all. She’s still the daughter of the Kang family who’s loved by everyone.”","At this moment, Qiao Xi understood her mother’s feelings very well. She probably knew that Kang Ru’s regret and guilt were meaningless. If such a thing happened again, she would still be the one who would suffer, so she left him resolutely.","If what happened today had happened five years ago, perhaps Qiao Xi would have given Kang Ru and Kang Jichuan a chance. After all, they were related by blood, so she would be willing to give in. But at this moment, she was already disheartened. She had no feelings for the Kang family and was only focused on taking revenge.","She would no longer believe in the Kang family, much less be hurt by them!","Yes! Kang Ru did feel guilty, but did he try to make things up to Qiao Xi? He was still unwilling to let Kang Qingzhi be punished at all! He wanted Kang Qingzhi to continue participating in the competition!","His guilt and regret were just tools to maintain his affectionate image. Perhaps he could deceive Qiao Xi five years ago, but Qiao Xi would not believe a word of his five years later!","Qiao Xi lowered the car window, and a breeze blew in. She narrowed her eyes as she watched the scenery outside the window recede bit by bit. Suddenly, the man’s cold and suppressed voice sounded in her ears.","“Xi Xi, I won’t let you suffer.”","His voice was very gentle, but Qiao Xi could hear a trace of killing intent at the end of his sentence. Gu Zheng reached out and pulled her into his arms, caressing her soft black hair bit by bit. He said firmly, “If the Kang family isn’t willing to give you an explanation, then take the matter into my own hands!”","Qiao Xi suddenly raised her eyes. The man seemed to have expected this and turned his face away. Hence, Qiao Xi saw his exquisite side profile. His thick eyelashes trembled slightly. “They made you sad, so I’ll make them pay the price. This is just the beginning. There’s still time.”","Five years ago, Kang Qingzhi almost caused Xi Xi to lose her life. Now, she was playing tricks and caused Xi Xi to be eliminated. Did she think that she would be let off so easily?","Gu Zheng exuded a cold killing intent as the corners of his mouth curled up slightly. “I heard that the Kang family owns a large perfume company.”","“Oh?” Qiao Xi abruptly raised her eyes with a teasing gaze.","Gu Zheng said casually, “Although the Kang family is a noble family in Y Nation and lives a rich life, no one will complain about having too much money. They don’t care about ordinary investments and losses, but if the amount involved is too large, they definitely won’t be able to sit still.”","Gu Zheng paused for a moment and said a number in Qiao Xi’s ear. Qiao Xi could not help but raise her eyebrows when she heard this. “The Kang family has really spent a lot of money on Kang Qing! They’re actually willing to spend so much money?”","“Their title as the earl of Y Nation is just a title. If they don’t have any businesses under them, their lives will be difficult. The Kang family has many companies under them. Their perfume company is their pillar, and that’s why Kang father and son can’t bear to abandon Kang Qingzhi.”","Xue Yi suddenly remembered. “I heard that the Kang family’s perfume company only rose in recent years. Old Madam Kang has been spreading the news that the Kang family’s perfumer is the champion of the International Perfume Competition. The perfumes she creates are unique and comparable to gold. She must have been talking about Kang Qingzhi!”","Gu Zheng snorted. “The Kang family treats Kang Qingzhi as a treasure. Feelings account for a portion of it, but the most important thing is still benefits.”"]},{"number":1472,"title":"Chapter 1472 She’s More Shameless Than Anything","paragraphs":["1472 She’s More Shameless Than Anything","Xue Yi looked disdainful. “The Kang father and son seem to value relationships on the surface, but they’re actually blinded by greed. Don’t they know that Kang Qingzhi stole your perfume recipes?”","“They believe that Kang Qingzhi wouldn’t steal anything.” Qiao Xi sneered. “But after the perfume competition, they’ll have no choice but to believe it. Before that happens, we’ll get the Kang family to spend more money. What do you think, Ah Zheng?”","Gu Zheng turned his head, and the two of them looked at each other and smiled.","Xue Yi: “...”","What kind of plan was this couple thinking about? Why did it look so scary?","At this moment, in the Kang family’s villa, Kang Ru had just gone upstairs when he received a call from Old Madam Kang. She questioned, “Son, what’s going on? Why aren’t you letting Qingzhi participate in the competition?”","A few hours had passed. Not only did Kang Ru feel guilty about Qiao Xi, but his heart also ached for Kang Qingzhi. He had doted on his adopted daughter since she was young, and Kang Qingzhi was also obedient and sensible, so he had never reprimanded her. Today, he had said a few words to Kang Qing on impulse. At this moment, he was very regretful.","“Mom, I’m not letting Qingzhi participate in the competition because of her...”","“What did I tell you when you went to Li City? Whether Qiao Xi returns to the Kang family or not, you can’t treat Qingzhi badly! So what if Qiao Xi is your biological daughter? Qingzhi has been by our side all these years. Do you really want Qingzhi to be sad for a girl we have no emotional ties to?”","Old Madam Kang’s voice was serious. “I agreed to let you bring Qiao Xi back on the premise that you can’t let Qingzhi suffer. Qingzhi’s health has been poor since she was young. Qiao Xi has a lifetime, but how long does Qingzhi have? Don’t wait until Qingzhi is no longer alive before you think of regretting it!”","Hearing Old Madam Kang’s words, Kang Ru felt extremely guilty. “Mother, I...”","“Most importantly, the Kang family has to expand our development in the perfume world in the future. With Qingzhi’s title as a two-time champion, we can stand firmly in the industry. Qingzhi is weak and sickly, but she can still create benefits for the Kang family. What can Qiao Xi do? It’s already good enough that she doesn’t embarrass the Kang family!”","Kang Ru suddenly recalled that the judge in the recording had said that Bright Moon might be able to win the championship. Did Xi Xi really have the ability?","Later on, he thought about it carefully. The judge probably felt uneasy, so he praised Xi Xi’s perfume. After all, it was not easy to win the championship of the International Perfume Competition.","Seeing that Kang Ru did not answer for a long time, Old Madam Kang said unhappily, “No matter what, the champion of this perfume competition has to be Qingzhi. If Qingzhi doesn’t have the chance to compete because of Qiao Xi, I won’t agree to Qiao Xi returning to the Kang family. Do as you deem fit!”","With that, Old Madam Kang hung up. Kang Ru stood by the window in a daze and fell into deep thought.","Although his mother’s words were unpleasant, they made sense. Qingzhi only had a few years left. Her body could not hold on for long. If she could not participate in the competition this time, would she still have a chance in the future? Xi Xi still had a lot of time. He could slowly make it up to her.","After thinking for a long time, Kang Ru finally made a decision.","...","The next day.","Xue Yi called Qiao Xi angrily. “I’m really going to die of anger. Kang Qingzhi, that b*tch, is indeed on the list of finalists! In order to let her enter the finals, the Kang father and son are willing to be so shameless! Do they really think our Xue family and Madam Wen Lai are blind? We clearly made it clear yesterday that Kang Qingzhi was already eliminated. We were already showing the Kang family enough respect by not publicizing the lie, yet they still shamelessly put her in the finals. Moreover, she’s ranked first. She’s more shameless than anything!”","Qiao Xi replied calmly, “As expected. The Kang family has always been like this.”","Xue Yi was a little curious. “I’m about to die of anger. Why aren’t you angry at all? Do you and Gu Zheng have a plan? How are you going to deal with the Kang family? Tell me.”","Qiao Xi said casually, “Since it involves the company’s interests, the Kang family will let Kang Qingzhi participate in the competition no matter what. I’m guessing that Kang Ru will definitely come to see me and ask me to keep Kang Qing’s secret and make way for her during the competition.”","The corners of Xue Yi’s mouth twitched: “...”","Shameless people were invincible!","“I say... Why don’t you do a paternity test? I suspect that Kang Ru isn’t your biological father!”","Qiao Xi did not doubt this. When Kang Jichuan found her five years ago, he should have already done a paternity test. With his meticulous character, he would not allow such a mistake to happen."]},{"number":1473,"title":"Chapter 1473 The Genius Perfume Master’s Return","paragraphs":["1473 The Genius Perfume Master’s Return","Xue Yi had a fiery temper to begin with. She was filled with anger and had nowhere to vent it. She was so angry that she hammered Xue Liang, who was beside her. “Xi Xi! They’re really too much! They clearly know that you’re the one who’s wronged, yet they still want you to give way to Kang Qingzhi. You can’t complain or expose this secret. You can only watch helplessly as this woman wins the championship. Moreover, I can guarantee that even if you really give in, Kang Qingzhi won’t thank you and will even show off in front of you!”","Xue Liang pursed his lips aggrievedly after being punched by his younger sister. He thought silently, ‘If it isn’t for the Kang family, I wouldn’t be getting beaten up. Hence, it’s all their fault!’","He touched the poison in his pocket. No matter what, he was a doctor and was good at making poisons. He had not taken action for so long. Why not use the Kang family to practice?!","Qiao Xi was stunned for a few seconds on the other end of the phone. She said softly, “Kang Qingzhi participating in the competition is a good thing for me.”","!!","“What do you mean?” Xue Yi looked puzzled.","Qiao Xi smiled lightly. “After Kang Qingzhi won the championship for the first time in the perfume competition, the Kang family started investing in a perfume company for her. Now, the investment amount has already exceeded four billion. This sum of money is not a small sum for the Kang family. If Kang Qingzhi fails, what will the Kang family face?”","Xue Yi said, “The Kang family will lose money, but it won’t be a lot. With the perfume recipe that Kang Qingzhi submitted, even if she’s not the champion, she can still get into the top three. It’s impossible for the four billion to evaporate overnight.”","“That’s indeed the case, but what if everyone knows that Kang Qingzhi stole the championship title for two consecutive years? I hope she can participate in the competition so that I can expose her in public. Then, not only will her reputation be ruined, but the Kang family’s four billion yuan will also go down the drain. It’s killing two birds with one stone!”","Xue Yi pondered for a few seconds and laughed out loud. “That makes sense! Then what’s Gu Zheng’s plan?”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up, but she did not answer.","At the same time, a piece of news quickly occupied the trending list.","[The Genius Perfumer Twilight has made a comeback!]","Everyone in the cultural relics and perfume world knew the name Twilight, but because he had disappeared for many years, everyone could not react in time. It was not until they clicked on it that they realized that Mr. Twilight was the genius perfumer who made the Tide collection of perfumes back then.","Back then, Mr. Twilight was a sensation, but he quickly withdrew from the perfume world. Why did he suddenly make a comeback?","Qiao Xi leaned against the sofa and clicked on the news.","Twilight was invited to the perfume competition and was the most powerful judge in this competition. He had the right to veto. In the past, the judges who had this right had never used it. After all, this right could easily change the outcome of the competition. Now that Twilight had obtained this right, it was enough to prove his supreme status in the perfume world.","Even when Qiao Xi was invited to be a judge back then, she did not have this authority. On the other hand, Twilight had the same authority as Madam Leng the first time she became a judge.","Qiao Xi’s finger slid across the screen, and she saw a comment: [I heard that Twilight suddenly came back for someone.]","[F*ck! Really? Twilight has always done things his own way. When he left the perfume industry back then, no matter how many people tried to persuade him to stay, it was useless. Madam Leng personally appeared but even she couldn’t keep this genius perfumer. Who had the cheek to invite Twilight back?]","[Can anyone reveal the news? Is that person a contestant or a judge? That’s not right! The judges are still the same as before. If one of the judges was really able to invite Twilight back, they would have invited him a long time ago. It must be a contestant!]","[If that person is a contestant, it’s not fair to others! After all, Twilight has the right to veto!]","[Twilight won’t abuse his power to deceive others! I heard that the person who invited him is very powerful. Even without Twilight, that contestant can still compete for the championship.]","The comments online were overwhelming. Qiao Xi vaguely felt that something was wrong. How did they know that Twilight came back for someone? It seemed that someone was deliberately spreading rumors online!","Perhaps Twilight’s comeback was just his own wish. What did it have to do with others?","Qiao Xi looked down again, and her fingers suddenly stopped. A comment attracted her gaze...","[When Twilight announced his comeback, I found a name on the list of finalists for the perfume competition. I believe everyone has heard of Kang Qingzhi! She’s a top contestant who won two consecutive perfume competitions and uses her real name every time she participates.]"]},{"number":1474,"title":"Chapter 1474 Veto","paragraphs":["1474 Veto","[Kang Qingzhi? I know her! I heard that she didn’t participate in the competition last year because she was sick. Fortunately, she recovered this year. I can finally see a beautiful woman participate in the competition.]","[That’s right! Kang Qingzhi is returning to the competition, and Twilight announced his comeback. Could it be that these two people know each other?]","[Kang Qingzhi actually managed to invite Twilight to make a comeback? She’s too awesome! Twilight has such high standards. Someone who can be valued by him must be extraordinary! I have to support Kang Qingzhi in this competition!]","[I understand now! Twilight suddenly made a comeback for Kang Qingzhi. He returned to be a judge for the competition because he wants to see Miss Kang win the championship with his own eyes!]","After a while, Kang Qingzhi’s and Twilight’s names appeared on the trending list. Among the overwhelming comments, there was a comment that was especially eye-catching.","[Actually, I have another guess. There’s a contestant on the finals list called Bright Moon. Her real name is Qiao Xi. You should remember that during the cultural relic restoration event some time ago, Twilight stood up for Qiao Xi and even got injured saving Qiao Xi! Could it be that Twilight suddenly came back because of Qiao Xi?]","However, this comment only appeared for a minute before it was quickly rejected. No one believed that Twilight came back because of Qiao Xi. The internet was filled with Kang Qingzhi’s name.","Qiao Xi put down her phone and suddenly said, “Sister Xue Yi, help me investigate Twilight.”","Xue Yi was a little surprised. “Don’t you know him? Didn’t he protect you last time and even call the police to arrest He Wenxian?”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up with interest. “I’m not too sure of his identity either, so I really want to know why he helped me and who he came back for.”","However, Qiao Xi had a feeling that no matter what Twilight’s comeback was for, it should not be for Kang Qingzhi. If all of this was directed by Kang Qingzhi, Kang Qingzhi would definitely be drowned by the netizens’ spittle when Twilight exposed her.","Kang Qingzhi dared to publicize it online. Did she know who Twilight was?","After a moment of silence, Xue Yi was a little puzzled. “Twilight is famous in the perfume world. He suddenly left the perfume world a few years ago. It seems a little strange that he suddenly came back!","“He always wears a mask and doesn’t interact with anyone. The internet says that he came back for Kang Qingzhi. Would such a cold man come back for a b*tch? I don’t believe it!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Actually, I don’t quite believe it either. I keep having the feeling that...”","She felt that Twilight and Kang Qingzhi were not the same kinds of people. She could tell from his eyes.","However, the news was spreading like wildfire online. Why wasn’t Twilight explaining himself?","...","At the Kang family’s residence.","Kang Jichuan was the first to discover the rumors online. He realized that Kang Qingzhi’s Twilight’s names appeared at the same time. He hurriedly showed the comments to Kang Ru.","As soon as they saw the name Twilight, they recalled that there seemed to be a Mr. Twilight at the cultural relic restoration event last time. He seemed to be related to Qiao Xi.","Before Kang Jichuan could figure it out, Kang Ru frowned and asked, “Qingzhi, who is Twilight? Do you know him?”","Although Qingzhi was just an adopted daughter, she had always been the daughter of the Kang family. If she was related to indecent people, it was inevitable that she would embarrass the Kang family.","Kang Qingzhi was silent for a few seconds, and her eyes were filled with surprise. “Dad, are you asking about Mr. Twilight?”","Seeing her like this, Kang Ru and Kang Jichuan knew that she knew Twilight.","Kang Qingzhi smiled sweetly. “Dad, Brother, Mr. Twilight is a genius in the perfume world. He’s an internationally recognized perfumer. We’ve invited him to the perfume competition many times, but he has always refused to come. Unexpectedly, he suddenly came back to be a judge in the competition. Moreover, Mr. Twilight has the right to veto!”","The most outstanding perfumer in the world?","Kang Ru continued to ask, “This person is not bad. How do you know him?”","Kang Qingzhi blinked her round eyes, her face filled with confusion. “Actually, I’ve never seen Mr. Twilight. I heard that he’s famous in the cultural relic restoration and perfume world. His identity is mysterious, and he comes and goes without a trace. I rarely go out, so we naturally never had the chance to interact.”","Hearing Kang Qingzhi’s explanation, Kang Ru’s expression softened a little. Then, he sent someone to investigate Twilight.","Before he received the news, Old Madam Kang called. Her voice was filled with excitement. “I saw on the internet that Qingzhi knows Twilight?”"]},{"number":1475,"title":"Chapter 1475 She Lost From The Start","paragraphs":["1475 She Lost From The Start","Hearing the name Twilight, Kang Ru paused for a moment. “I asked Qingzhi just now. She said that she has never seen Twilight and doesn’t know why this matter is spreading online. Qingzhi is a girl, so it’s a little disadvantageous to have a scandal with this man.”","“What do you know?! Twilight is someone even the top nobles in Y Nation can’t invite. He became the most powerful judge even though it’s his first time being a judge. His status in the perfume world is supreme!”","Old Madam Kang was extremely excited, and her voice was filled with joy.","Kang Ru was a little surprised. “He actually refused the invitations of the top nobles?”","“I heard that Twilight has a noble status and is extremely talented in cultural relic restoration and perfumery. Not to mention those top nobles, even the leaders of Y Nation have to show him some respect.”","Old Madam Kang became more and more excited as she spoke. “Someone of such a noble status even specially participated in the perfume competition for Qingzhi’s comeback. Our Qingzhi is really awesome!","“Fortunately, you listened to me and arranged for Qingzhi to enter the finals. If you miss out on this big shot, you’ll definitely regret it. If you build a relationship with Mr. Twilight, Qingzhi will definitely win the championship this time. At that time, the company’s perfumes will also sell well!”","Kang Ru was stunned. Qingzhi just said that she had never seen Twilight before, but Twilight made a comeback because of Qingzhi and even became a judge for the competition. Did that mean that Twilight simply admired Qingzhi’s talent?","It seemed that sending Qingzhi to participate in the competition was the right decision. In that case, if Qingzhi had submitted her work, Xi Xi would’ve been eliminated. Now that Xi Xi had advanced, it was a good thing!","When he thought about it like this, Kang Ru’s guilt toward Qiao Xi completely dissipated. He said excitedly, “Mom, don’t worry. I’ll arrange everything and guarantee that Qingzhi will win the championship!”","“Alright! With Qingzhi’s strength, it won’t be a problem for her to win the championship. It’ll be fine as long as Qiao Xi doesn’t cause trouble. I’ve already discussed it with the higher-ups of the company and decided to invest another four billion. Hence, we have to succeed this time!”","This perfume competition was very eye-catching. As long as Qingzhi won the championship, the Kang family’s perfumes would go international. At that time, the money they had invested would be returned.","Old Madam Kang said anxiously, “Get Qingzhi to send me the works that won the competition in the past and the remaining perfume recipes. I’ll get the factory to start production first. After Qingzhi wins the championship, I’ll immediately start selling them.”","Kang Ru knew very well that the Kang family had not been as prosperous as before. Although they had inherited a noble title, they had always been mocked because they did not have any famous businesses. Now, as long as Qingzhi won the championship, the Kang family’s reputation would resound throughout the world. At the very least, no one in Y Nation would look down on them anymore.","It would be best if they could invite Twilight to join their company. At that time, the Kang family’s perfumes would become the top in the world and be internationally renowned.","At this moment, on the second floor.","Kang Qingzhi walked into the new bedroom and sized it up. This bedroom was modified from a storeroom. It was not as good as the rooms the servants lived in on the first floor. Not only was it small, but it also smelled of mold.","Originally, her father wanted Qiao Xi to stay in this room, but Kang Qingzhi knew very well that if she took the initiative to stay here, her father and brother would feel heartache and guilt. Thus, they would try their best to make it up to her in other ways. On the other hand, Qiao Xi, who forced Kang Qingzhi to stay in this room, would be blamed and hated by the Kang father and son.","Kang Qingzhi had known how to make others happy since she was young. In the past ten years, she had been prudent and made everyone in the Kang family praise her endlessly. Hence, Qiao Xi had already lost to her.","As for the perfume competition, she was not confident about it. Why would Twilight help her?","She had long heard of Twilight, but she had never seen him before. Moreover, he was a loner and arrogant. How could he come back because of her?","She had indeed sent someone to publicize the news online to create momentum for herself. She thought that Twilight would clarify things, but she did not expect that Twilight would not do anything at all. Instead, the netizens thought that the two of them knew each other.","Kang Qingzhi smiled proudly. When one was lucky, everyone would help one. Mr. Twilight had probably smelled the perfumes she made and admired her talent, so he did not explain himself.","Unfortunately, Qiao Xi did not have many perfume recipes left. What should she do if she used all of them?","...","Longwan Residential.","In the study, Gu Zheng looked at the rumors online and curled his lips slightly. He asked in a gentle voice, “Xi Xi, have you seen the news online?”"]},{"number":1476,"title":"Chapter 1476 Four Billion Is Just Interest","paragraphs":["1476 Four Billion Is Just Interest","“Yes, I’m quite happy,” Qiao Xi replied indifferently.","“Happy?” Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow. He was originally thinking about how to coax Mrs. Gu, but she was already very happy after reading those rumors.","Qiao Xi said with a smile, “Of course, I’m happy. Twilight admires Kang Qingzhi’s work, but her works are all the perfume recipes I left behind five years ago! My work five years ago is enough to make Twilight look at me in a different light, so he should admire me now! Shouldn’t I be happy to be valued by a genius in the perfume world?”","Gu Zheng looked away imperceptibly and chuckled happily. “Xi Xi, your train of thought is indeed very special.”","!!","“Kang Qingzhi won the championship for two years with the perfume recipes I left behind five years ago. All these years, I’ve been improving at lightning speed, but she’s still staying where she is. The perfume recipes from back then are equivalent to practice works for me. Kang Qingzhi is probably the only one who treats those things as treasures.”","After Qiao Xi finished speaking, she added, “Twilight doesn’t have good taste either. A dignified genius of the perfume world actually took a liking to those perfume recipes.”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent. “You’ve also met Twilight once. Why don’t you ask him about Kang Qingzhi?”","“No need.” Qiao Xi waved her hand.","Whether Twilight knew Kang Qingzhi or not had nothing to do with her. The rumors online were what she wanted to see the most. Kang Qingzhi was at the peak of her glory now. When the matter was exposed, she would be in a sorry state.","“I heard that the Kang family invested another four billion!” Qiao Xi sighed. “As expected, human nature is greedy. Kang Jichuan took so much of my blood. I’ll consider this four billion as... remuneration for me!”","Song Shijing clicked his tongue. Four billion yuan? Young Madam was so vicious!","The next second, the president smiled gently, but his voice contained cold killing intent. “How can they pay just four billion for your blood? This sum of money can only be considered interest. We’ll settle the rest in the future.”","Song Shijing: “...” Alright! He had misunderstood Young Madam just now. In terms of viciousness, who could compare to the president?","At this moment, the two shadow guards Gu Zheng had sent out were walking to the door and happened to hear Qiao Xi’s words. One of them, An Long, muttered softly, “Isn’t Young Madam the daughter of the Kang family? How could she bear to ask for four billion from the Kang family? I reckon Mr. Kang will definitely regret acknowledging this daughter.”","The study fell silent. Song Shijing’s body stiffened, and he could not wait to rush over and kick An Long out.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with coldness, and the temperature around him had dropped a few degrees. However, Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression as she held Gu Zheng’s hand. “Don’t be anxious. I want to hear what else he’ll say.”","An Long stood outside the door, not knowing that Gu Zheng, who was inside, had heard his words. He continued to complain to his partner beside him, “Even if Kang Qingzhi has offended Young Madam, she can’t vent her anger on the Kang family’s company! The Kang family has invested so much money into their business, but she wants to destroy their company. That’s four billion! The Kang family will suffer such a huge loss. What benefits can she get?","“Tell me, why did the president marry such a vicious woman?!”","When An Long finished speaking, the other shadow guard, An Chen, still did not respond. When he saw Gu Zheng in the study, his breathing seemed to have stopped.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were calm as he leaned lazily against the chair. The corners of his mouth curled up slightly as if he had heard something funny, but Song Shijing knew that this was just the calm before the storm.","An Chen wanted to remind An Long, but he was stopped by Gu Zheng with a wave of his hand. He could only brace himself and listen to An Long continue to express his opinion.","“Actually, before I came back, I heard about Mrs. Gu’s background. She’s the daughter of the Kang family who led a wandering life outside. They’ve just reunited. With this identity, the president is out of her league! Moreover, she’s not favored by the Kang family and is even targeting the Kang family. Is she trying to perish with her family? I really don’t know what she’s thinking!","“No matter what, Mr. Kang is her family, but she actually—”","Before he could finish, a cold female voice suddenly came from inside the door. She asked with a smile, “Then what do you think I should do?”","An Long was so scared by the sudden voice that his entire body trembled. When he turned around, he realized that Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng were in the study. Seeing that An Chen had already knelt down beside him, he knelt down reluctantly. “President.”","The two of them lowered their heads. An Chen was trembling with fear. He had been the president’s shadow guard for so many years, so of course, he knew the president’s character. His current appearance was clearly a sign that he was about to flare up."]},{"number":1477,"title":"Chapter 1477 The President’s Bottom Line","paragraphs":["1477 The President’s Bottom Line","An Chen and An Long had been hiding in the capital and waiting for orders. They had just returned to Li City today and found out that the president was married. They heard from their brothers that the president doted on this young madam very much. Now that An Long was caught complaining about her behind the president’s back and was even heard by the young madam and the president, he had definitely crossed the president’s bottom line!","An Long’s heart trembled, and his eyes were filled with panic. Only then did he realize what he had just said. However, he was right! That woman was indeed vicious. He did not know why the president would marry her.","He was the captain of the shadow guards in the capital and was deeply trusted by the president. He was the president’s trusted aide. He had just casually said a few words, so the president would not punish him.","Qiao Xi looked indifferently at the shadow guards kneeling in front of her. Gu Zheng did not let them get up, so they lowered their heads and did not dare to make a sound. They obediently knelt on the floor.","!!","After a long time, Gu Zheng slowly said, “An Chen, bring them down to rest.”","An Chen instantly heaved a sigh of relief and nodded. He hurriedly left with his companions. Before he left, he wanted to say something to An Long when Gu Zheng’s cold voice came from behind. “An Long, Young Madam asked you a question just now. Why didn’t you answer?”","The study instantly fell silent, and the air seemed to have frozen.","Only then did everyone remember that Qiao Xi had asked An Long, ‘Then what do you think I should do?’","Qiao Xi smiled as she looked at An Long. Her exquisite face was extremely stunning.","An Long thought that Mrs. Gu was just a woman with good looks but nothing else. He looked at Gu Zheng and gritted his teeth. “Madam, are you sure you want to hear it?”","Qiao Xi glanced at Gu Zheng. The next second, Gu Zheng stood up and walked to the French windows with his back facing everyone.","An Long looked at this scene in confusion. Did the president mean that he would not care about their conversation? Even if he said something offensive, the president would not blame him?","He was the president’s shadow guard. As long as the president did not punish him, what could a weak rich madam do to him?","After a few seconds of silence, An Long said righteously, “Mrs. Gu, I’ve heard about you and Kang Qingzhi. Since you know that Kang Qingzhi manipulated things behind the scenes and stole your perfume recipes, why didn’t you tell Kang Ru directly? This way, not only can you suppress Kang Qingzhi, but you can also prevent the Kang family from losing money. Isn’t this killing two birds with one stone for you?”","An Long looked at Qiao Xi with a trace of disdain in his eyes. What was the use of just being good-looking? She was just a stupid woman. This woman was not worthy of the president at all!","Qiao Xi glanced at him indifferently and chuckled. “It sounds very reasonable, but have you ever thought about what the Kang family will do if I expose Kang Qingzhi in front of Kang Ru?”","An Long was instantly speechless. Actually, he had already thought of the outcome. Since Kang Ru had already helped Kang Qingzhi hide it, he would naturally pretend not to know anything and continue to think of ways to let Kang Qingzhi win the championship. Only then would the Kang family not suffer any losses.","He gritted his teeth. Even if that was the truth, he would not lower his head in front of this delicate rich madam.","An Long raised his head and stood on the moral high ground to criticize. “Mrs. Gu, you’re the daughter of the Kang family. They’re your family! You suffered five years ago, but time has passed. It’s time for you to let go. Why be so vicious to your family?”","Qiao Xi’s eyes curved into crescents as she couldn’t help but laugh out loud. “Oh! In that case, you know about what happened five years ago too! Gu Zheng’s shadow guards are really omnipotent. You even know my secrets!","“Since you’ve heard of what happened five years ago, you should know that Kang Jichuan almost killed me five years ago. Now, just for the sake of kinship, you want me to forgive them and even sacrifice myself to fulfill their wish?”","An Long was still unwilling to lower his head. “Mrs. Gu, even if you don’t think about the Kang family, you should think about the president. If you do this, you’ll—”","Before he could finish, An Long’s voice suddenly stopped. A cold dagger was pressed against his neck. He was Gu Zheng’s shadow guard and was naturally used to fighting and killing. The trace of fear in his heart quickly dissipated.","Qiao Xi’s expression was calm, and the corners of her mouth curled into a cold smile. She held the dagger and played with it for a few seconds. Then, she bent down slightly, raised her hand, and stabbed the back of An Long’s hand.","“Mrs. Gu, you...” An Long grunted. The sharp pain on the back of his hand made cold sweat break out on his forehead. He gritted his teeth."]},{"number":1478,"title":"Chapter 1478 The Basic Qualities Of A Shadow Guard","paragraphs":["1478 The Basic Qualities Of A Shadow Guard","Qiao Xi’s tone was indifferent. “What you mean is that as long as the other party is my blood-related family members, I have to forgive them unconditionally no matter what they do to me? If I want revenge, that’ll make me vicious and merciless? Then as Gu Zheng’s shadow guard, doesn’t that mean I can deal with you as I please? You can’t complain or even struggle in the slightest, right?”","She straightened her back and looked down at An Long. She pulled the dagger out of his hand. Her eyes were cold and disdainful as she asked casually, “Are you seeking death?”","An Long’s body trembled, and cold sweat drenched his clothes. His eyes were filled with disbelief. He did not expect this woman’s aura to be so strong, but didn’t that person say that she was just a brainless stupid woman? They said that she was not worthy of the president at all. The president only married her on impulse!","This woman was completely different from what that person had said. How could that person’s words be wrong?","How did this brainless stupid woman stab the back of his hand? He could feel the strong killing intent emitted by the other party, making him shudder. He did not even have the chance to resist.","Cold sweat trickled down An Long’s forehead and fell to the floor. He held the wound on his hand tightly, but blood still spread between his fingers. His face gradually turned pale. After a long silence, Gu Zheng slowly turned around and said lightly, “Bring him to see a doctor.”","As soon as he finished speaking, a shadow guard quickly rushed in from outside the door and helped An Long up. Just as he was about to leave, he heard Gu Zheng’s cold voice behind him. “There’s no need for a shadow guard who doesn’t respect their master to continue staying here. Uncle Sheng, get An Long to leave immediately.”","The moment that was said, everyone gasped.","An Long had been by the president’s side for five years and had secretly completed many missions before he was gradually promoted to captain. He was considered the president’s trusted aide. Now, the president was actually chasing him away?","An Long broke free from his partner’s support and suddenly turned around. He knelt on the floor with a plop and shouted in disbelief, “President!”","Everyone stood at the door in a daze. No one dared to plead for An Long. It would be fine if the reason he was in trouble was that he failed to complete a mission, but he had offended Young Madam!","An Long’s eyes were sorrowful, and his voice trembled. “President, I’m loyal to you. I just casually said a few words to Young Madam. Are you going to chase me away for that?”","“Young Madam is the president’s wife, which means she’s your master. As a shadow guard, you don’t respect your master. Of course, the president won’t let you stay,” Song Shijing said indifferently, his eyes filled with helplessness. An Long was very powerful and performed very well when in missions. Unfortunately, he had offended Young Madam, so the president would never let him stay.","Song Shijing’s expression was serious. “An Long, you know the president’s temper. He’s choosing not to deal with you because you’ve made many contributions. He’s just chasing you away. If it were anyone else, they probably wouldn’t be able to leave this room today. If you continue to pester the president and anger him, you know the consequences.”","An Long widened his eyes in disbelief. He had just returned to Li City today and had yet to report the situation in the capital to the president but the president already wanted to chase him away. Did the president not care about anything else just because of that woman?","Even though he was the captain of the shadow guards who lurked in the capital, the president was chasing him away without hesitation all because he had offended the young madam. The president was telling everyone that whoever offended Young Madam would suffer the same outcome as him.","An Long knew that the president’s decision could not be changed. He was instantly dispirited. He stood up shakily, and he still ended up collapsing weakly.","Qiao Xi sized up the shadow guard in front of her. She could tell that this person was capable. Otherwise, Uncle Sheng and Song Shijing would not have looked so regretful.","However, as a shadow guard, the most important thing was obedience and loyalty. An Long had already lost the basic qualities of a shadow guard when he mocked his master behind his back. Hence, no matter how outstanding he was, Gu Zheng would not keep him.","An Long fell to the floor and struggled to get up. The blood on his hand flowed to the floor. He said in a panic, “President! Please give me another chance. I was really wrong!”","Before Gu Zheng could speak, Qiao Xi suddenly took a few steps forward. “Wait!”","Everyone looked at her and saw her smile. “His expression didn’t change even after being stabbed by me. It seems that this shadow guard is quite outstanding. It’s a pity to chase him away like this. If An Long is really unwilling to leave, then let him follow me.”","An Long abruptly looked at Qiao Xi, his eyes filled with shock."]},{"number":1479,"title":"Chapter 1479 A Womans Intuition","paragraphs":["1479 A Woman’s Intuition","Qiao Xi stood in front of the French windows. She turned slightly to look at the man behind her. A ray of light happened to shine in from the window and shone on her. Every strand of her hair seemed to be dyed with a layer of gold. Her eyelashes were long, leaving a shadow on her eyelids. Her fair skin was suffused with a dazzling light under the sunlight, and her lips were as delicate as cherries. She slowly said, “Ah Zheng, do you agree?”","In the silence, Gu Zheng suddenly smiled. His gaze was gentle like water. “I agree.”","He agreed? The shadow guards standing at the door were quite shocked, but they also heaved a sigh of relief for An Long.","An Long originally thought that there was no way to salvage the situation, but he did not expect Young Madam to get him to stay with just one sentence. He did not expect the person who would plead for him to be the rich madam he had looked down on from the beginning.","!!","At this moment, An Long was extremely ashamed. He could not help but doubt that lady’s words. Young Madam was clearly a decisive person who did things swiftly and decisively. Moreover, she was kind-hearted. Why did outsiders think that she was stupid?","However, that lady would not have lied to him. She did not know that he was the president’s shadow guard at all, so there was no need to target Young Madam. She had probably heard some rumors from somewhere, so she casually said a few words.","An Long felt very guilty. He offended Young Madam without distinguishing right or wrong. However, Young Madam disregarded the past and even pleaded for him. The more he thought about it, the more he felt that he had made a huge mistake. He should not have doubted the president and Young Madam just because of someone else’s casual words.","Qiao Xi glanced at An Long. The blood on the back of his hand had already dried up, so she instructed softly, “Uncle Sheng, quickly bring him to the treatment room.”","When An Long heard this, he felt guilty and grateful. He knelt on the floor and kowtowed heavily to Qiao Xi twice. “Young Madam, from today onward, I, An Long, am your shadow guard. I’ll protect your safety to the death and absolutely obey your orders!”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up as she waved her hand to signal them to leave.","After the shadow guards dispersed, Gu Zheng asked unhurriedly, “Why do you want to keep him by your side? Is it just because he’s an outstanding shadow guard?”","Song Shijing was also a little curious. After what An Long had just said, Young Madam should be very angry, but it seemed that Young Madam did not care at all. She even begged for mercy for An Long. Could it be that Young Madam had changed her mind because of the pity on his and Uncle Sheng’s faces?","At the thought of this, Song Shijing’s heart trembled. He quickly opened his mouth to admit his mistake. The next second, he heard Qiao Xi’s light voice. “Because he’s an impulsive person.”","Impulsive?","Song Shijing looked confused, but Gu Zheng smirked.","Qiao Xi said indifferently, “He’s quite loyal. Unfortunately, he’s too impulsive, so it’s not appropriate for him to stay by your side. Moreover, he’s never seen me before, but he knows about me. I’m very curious about who he heard about me from.”","Song Shijing was enlightened and could not help but be shocked.","“I’m guessing that someone told him about me. He’s loyal to you and values relationships, so he thinks that I’m not worthy of you and looks down on me. Now that he realizes that I’m different from the rumors and I even pleaded to keep him, he feels guilty. He has even decided to be loyal to me for the rest of his life. People who are too impulsive are easily used by others and are not suitable to stay in important positions.”","Gu Zheng narrowed his eyes and said in a low voice, “Do you think someone is controlling him?”","Qiao Xi smiled. “I can’t say that they’re controlling him. An Long is indeed loyal to you, but he also trusts that person very much, so he easily believed their words.","“The shadow guards beside you are naturally not fools. For him to be able to trust the other party means that the two of them have known each other for a period of time. That person should know An Long very well and know that he’s a sentimental person. They deliberately said something about me in front of him and made him look for trouble with me. Hence, that person is here for me.”","Hearing this, Song Shijing said immediately, “President, Young Madam, I’ll investigate who instigated An Long behind the scenes. Could it be another shadow guard...”","“Impossible.” Qiao Xi shook her head. “There’s no need to investigate the shadow guards who were with him. Go and find out who he has gotten to know in the past year. It’s very likely that it’s a woman. You’ll probably be able to guess who it is just by looking at the name.”","“Yes, Young Madam,” Song Shijing agreed, but his eyes were cold.","The other party had actually schemed against the president’s shadow guards. This was too much.","At this moment, Gu Zheng slowly walked in front of Qiao Xi and smiled with interest. “Why do you think that the other party is a woman?”","Qiao Xi blinked and smiled mysteriously. “A woman’s intuition.”"]},{"number":1480,"title":"Chapter 1480 He Wants To Cooperate With Gu Zheng","paragraphs":["1480 He Wants To Cooperate With Gu Zheng","Although Qiao Xi’s knife had pierced into the back of An Long’s hand, it had avoided his vital points. Hence, An Long’s injury wasn’t serious. After getting it bandaged, he recovered in a few days.","These few days, Qiao Xi had been preparing for the perfume competition. She leaned against the chair and stretched. She casually asked Gu Zheng, “Have you seen the news online? The Kang family has already put Kang Qingzhi’s perfumes into production. They’ve even invested billions more.”","“I have,” Gu Zheng replied.","“Kang Jichuan is meticulous and not an impulsive person. Why are they so sure that Kang Qingzhi will win the championship this time? What exactly happened to increase their confidence?”","!!","Gu Zheng pursed his lips and did not answer.","“It’s because of Twilight, right?” Qiao Xi paused for a moment and continued, “If it weren’t for Twilight, the Kang family wouldn’t have invested so much. It’s not that they believe in Kang Qingzhi but in Twilight’s strength. Looks like I have to thank Mr. Twilight properly this time.”","“How are you going to thank him?” Gu Zheng paused and smirked.","Qiao Xi supported her chin and thought for a moment before smiling slyly. “If he’s willing to do me the honor, I can treat him to a meal. He’s been wearing a mask all this time. I’m very curious about what his face looks like under the mask. Aren’t you curious, Ah Zheng?”","Gu Zheng: “...”","He could smell danger! This woman was up to no good!","Gu Zheng was silent for a few seconds, then he smiled brightly. “Xi Xi, you’re right. He did you a great favor. We should treat him to a meal to express our gratitude.”","Qiao Xi observed his expression with a burning gaze and said word by word, “I heard from Song Shiyu that Twilight wears a mask because he’s disfigured. He has always liked to imitate you, and Song Shiyu even said that he’s a hypocrite. Aren’t you worried about me eating with such a person?”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent without changing at all.","Qiao Xi stared at him playfully and continued, “Song Shiyu also said that Twilight is good at pretending and that he’s a petty person. He’s ugly, has a bad character, and looks down on others. He’s as arrogant as a peacock. Song Shiyu told me not to interact with such people lest they have ulterior motives. Ah Zheng, do you think Twilight’s such a person?”","At this moment, Song Shiyu had the feeling that his death was approaching.","Gu Zheng’s gaze was doting, and his cold eyebrows instantly softened as if he was not the one being scolded. He pretended to think for a moment, then chuckled. “He’s indeed good at pretending. He has ulterior motives for getting close to you.”","Song Shiyu was right. He was wearing a mask and pretending to be Twilight. He deliberately approached Qiao Xi and helped her behind her back, afraid that she would suffer.","Qiao Xi instantly choked and was speechless.","...","Five days later, the news of Twilight making a comeback and becoming the top judge of the perfume competition spread like wildfire. All the perfumers in the world had heard about this.","Unfortunately, Twilight was not participating in the earlier rounds. He would only appear in the semi-finals. Hence, the participants were all very hardworking. Not only were they doing this for their own honor, but they also wanted to see the genius perfumer, Twilight.","“Young Madam, should I send you there?” Song Shijing asked respectfully.","“There’s no need. I’ll go myself,” Qiao Xi replied.","Song Shijing frowned. “The Brook family is here again. They’ve already gone to Gu Corporation.”","Qiao Xi sneered. “They haven’t made a move for so long. I almost forgot about them. Why are they here this time?”","Song Shijing was silent for a moment before saying slowly, “The Brook family... has their eyes on the perfume industry.”","“Perfume industry?” Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed.","Huo Yuzhou was also eyeing this cake? He wanted to collaborate with Gu Zheng?","Qiao Xi shook her head and stopped thinking about Huo Yuzhou. She drove out and quickly arrived at the competition area. She found her own lounge.","There were a total of 40 contestants who advanced this time. The competition’s organizers had arranged a separate lounge for all the contestants so that it would be easier for the teams to discuss the perfume recipe.","Qiao Xi threw down her bag and leaned against the chair in the lounge to rest.","On the other hand, in Gu Corporation.","Gu Zheng sat on the master seat in the meeting room while the Brook family’s representative sat on the other side. They said respectfully, “President Gu, my master sent me here to discuss a collaboration with you.”","“Tell me,” Gu Zheng replied indifferently.","The person smiled gently. “President Gu, do you know this perfumer?”","Song Shijing thought that the other party was going to ask about Twilight because the name Twilight had been appearing on the internet frequently recently. The internet was filled with news of his comeback.","However, the next second, the person said, “Her name is Mu Jin.”","Gu Zheng’s eyes suddenly turned cold, and his entire body was filled with sharp killing intent."]},{"number":1481,"title":"Chapter 1481 Successful Scheme","paragraphs":["1481 Successful Scheme","The Brook family’s representative smiled extremely proudly. “Mu Jin is a famous ancient perfumer. The people of Y Nation like Mu Jin very much. Almost all the socialites in Romulan City are using her perfumes. President Gu, do you want to work with her?”","Gu Zheng retracted his killing intent and curled his lips into a mocking smile. “Can Mr. Huo invite Mu Jin?”","The person stopped in his tracks arrogantly. “Of course. If Mr. Huo can’t invite Mu Jin, he wouldn’t have sent me here to discuss the collaboration.”","Gu Zheng pressed the tip of his tongue against his teeth and sneered in his heart.","!!","If he wanted to work with Mu Jin, did he need anyone to introduce him? After all, they slept in the same bed every night!","Gu Zheng was very clear about Qiao Xi and Huo Yuzhou’s past, so it was impossible for her to agree to collaborate with Huo Yuzhou.","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow and said in a low voice, “Alright. As long as Mr. Huo can invite Mu Jin, we’ll work together.”","At the same time, at the event location of the perfume competition.","“Miss Kang!” As soon as Du Ming, a judge of the perfume competition, saw Kang Qingzhi, he went forward warmly. “I heard that your physical state is weak right now. Why didn’t Master Kang and Young Master Kang come with you?”","Kang Qingzhi smiled sweetly. “Dad and Brother are busy with work, so I got the chauffeur to send me over. If I enter the finals, they’ll definitely come to watch. Cough, cough...”","“Miss Kang, you’re so outstanding. You’ll definitely enter the finals.” Du Ming’s wretched gaze lingered on Kang Qingzhi. He did not hide it at all.","Kang Qingzhi felt a chill in her heart. Such a wretched person actually dared to covet her? Not only was she a champion, but she was also the daughter of the Kang family. Du Ming was not worthy of her at all!","He was just a judge for the perfume competition. He had no power or influence. He just had a good reputation. A trace of disgust flashed past Kang Qingzhi’s eyes, but her expression was very gentle. “Mr. Du, I’m a little tired, so I’ll go back to the lounge to rest. I’ll see you later.”","Du Ming’s gaze was still fixed on Kang Qingzhi. He deliberately took a few steps closer and said in a teasing voice, “Miss Kang, I’ll send you to rest, alright?”","Kang Qingzhi subconsciously took a few steps back. Looking at his pockmarked and greasy face, her heart was filled with disgust. After hesitating for a few seconds, she suddenly curled her lips and smiled. “Mr. Du, I don’t wish to trouble you. But a friend of mine admires you very much. If you have time, can you go see her? She’s in Room 306.”","Du Ming was stunned for a moment and smiled wretchedly.","Kang Qingzhi’s friend must be a woman. She said that her friend admired him and wanted to meet him in the lounge. It seemed that this woman wanted to seduce him!","Du Ming rubbed his hands excitedly and said anxiously, “In that case, I’ll go see your friend first. Miss Kang, rest well.”","“Alright.” Kang Qingzhi nodded gently.","As she watched Du Ming leave, Kang Qingzhi’s eyes instantly turned vicious with a trace of smugness. Her evil plan had succeeded.","She did have a friend participating in the competition, but that person was in Room 307, while the person in Room 306 was Qiao Xi.","Kang Qingzhi had participated in two perfume competitions and previously interacted with Du Ming. She had also sent someone to investigate him. Only then did she know that Du Ming relied on his identity as a judge to sleep with many women. However, he hid it very well after that, so in everyone’s eyes, he was still a master in perfumery.","It was precisely because of this that if Du Ming and Qiao Xi’s affair was discovered, everyone would not think that it was Du Ming’s fault. They would only think that Qiao Xi seduced a judge for the sake of winning the competition.","If Du Ming exposed her after that, she could just explain to everyone that she had remembered the room number wrongly. After all, she did have a friend in Room 307. The two rooms were adjacent, so it was normal for her to remember the wrong room number.","It was just a mistake, and it was not a big mistake. Qiao Xi and Du Ming were indeed in the same room, and Qiao Xi’s indiscretion had nothing to do with her.","Kang Qingzhi was in a good mood when she thought of what was about to happen.","Five years ago, Qiao Xi was an idiot and could not win against her. Five years later, when Qiao Xi met a wretched man like Du Ming, would she cry for help or swallow her anger?","Once she shouted loudly, it would attract everyone’s attention. Du Ming could use his identity as a judge to escape, but no one would believe Qiao Xi. If she swallowed her anger and endured it, she would completely betray Gu Zheng. At that time, would Gu Zheng still want this dirty woman?","In Room 306, Qiao Xi was already sleepy when a strange sound suddenly came from outside."]},{"number":1482,"title":"Chapter 1482 I Heard The Lounge Is Soundproof","paragraphs":["1482 I Heard The Lounge Is Soundproof","Qiao Xi suddenly came back to her senses. She looked sharply at the door and realized that someone was opening it.","The perfume competition’s organizers had arranged a separate lounge for every participant. Some perfumers had their own teams. During this period, they would gather together to discuss perfume recipes. Hence, under normal circumstances, no one would disturb them. Even if they really wanted to meet, they would knock on the door first and not open it directly.","Qiao Xi frowned and suddenly realized something. The other party had the key to this lounge!","She looked around. The lounge was very simple, and there was nothing to protect herself with. She quickly took out a hidden weapon that Luo Qing had made for her.","This area was filled with lounges, yet the person outside the door came to her lounge. It seemed that they had a goal.","Qiao Xi took out her phone, turned on the recording function, and placed it on the bookshelf beside her.","Not long after, the person outside the door pushed open the door and sized up the room. The moment he saw Qiao Xi, his eyes were stunned for a moment before a wretched expression overtook his face. “It’s you! Your name is Bright Moon, right? I heard that you admire me!”","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly as she recognized the man in front of her.","Du Ming was a judge in this perfume competition. No wonder he had the key to the lounge. However, there were so many participants. How did Du Ming know which room she was in?","Before Qiao Xi could think it through, Du Ming walked forward and stared at Qiao Xi with a lecherous gaze. “Pretty lady, you asked me over because you want to advance to the semi-finals, right?! As long as you let me have some fun, I can get it settled!”","Qiao Xi glanced coldly at him.","Du Ming did not notice the coldness around her and pounced on her anxiously. “Bright Moon, you’re really beautiful. I’ve slept with so many women, but I’ve never seen anyone so good-looking. If you’re willing to follow me, I can guarantee that you’ll enter the finals. I’ll even arrange a collaboration for you. How about it?”","Qiao Xi nimbly dodged the other party’s touch and chuckled. “You said that I invited you over? I even asked you to help me enter the semi-finals?”","Du Ming smiled wretchedly. “Yes! Otherwise, why would you look for me?”","“Then how did you know that my lounge is Room 306?” Qiao Xi continued to ask.","“Your friend told me. If it weren’t for her, how could I have gotten a beauty like you?!” Du Ming’s heart itched. At the thought of sleeping with such a beauty later, he was extremely excited. “Bright Moon, time is tight. Don’t play hard to get with me. I know what you’re thinking. Serve me well and I’ll try my best to satisfy you!”","Qiao Xi sneered.","Playing hard to get? Where did he get his dignity from?!","She had never participated in a perfume competition as a contestant before. She did not know many of the 40 contestants this time, let alone have friends here.","Suddenly, she narrowed her eyes and thought of someone—Kang Qingzhi.","It seemed that Kang Qingzhi was still unwilling to give up. She actually thought of such a dirty method! However, when Qiao Xi thought about it, it made sense. Five years ago, Kang Qingzhi almost caused her death when she was only in her teens. Now, she was using a wretched man to ruin her innocence. This was just a small trick for Kang Qingzhi.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at Du Ming and smiled charmingly at him. She said gently, “Mr. Du, since time is tight, why haven’t you closed the door?!”","Looking at her charming appearance, Du Ming’s heartstrings were pulled. He was burning with desire.","At the thought that he could have sex with such a beauty later, Du Ming hurriedly rushed over and closed the door. Right after that, he began to take off his jacket.","“I heard that the soundproofing in the lounge is very good!” Qiao Xi stood up and clenched her fists.","At this moment, outside the lounge, someone sneakily appeared at the door and took a photo of Qiao Xi and Du Ming. Because the other party had chosen a special angle, the photo looked very ambiguous.","In the lounge, Du Ming could no longer suppress the desire in his heart. He coaxed her wretchedly. “Bright Moon, you little beauty! Don’t worry. The soundproofing here is very good. No one will hear you. Follow me in the future and I won’t treat you badly.”","“Heh.” Qiao Xi chuckled, cracked her fingers, and clenched her fists.","Seeing her like this, Du Ming’s expression instantly changed. He pointed at her and said while trembling, “You... What are you doing? Ah...!”","A miserable scream resounded throughout the lounge. Qiao Xi raised her fist and attacked Du Ming, knocking him to the floor. Then, she raised her foot and stepped on his face, smiling coldly. “Du Ming, you know Xue Yi, don’t you?”"]},{"number":1483,"title":"Chapter 1483 Beat That Bastard Up","paragraphs":["1483 Beat That Bastard Up","Of course, Du Ming knew Xue Yi. That woman was very arrogant just because she was the daughter of the Xue family.","He did not know why Bright Moon would mention Xue Yi at this time. The next second, he heard her say softly, “Xue Yi is my sister. If I want to advance, I don’t need to seduce you at all.”","“What?” Du Ming struggled to get up, but he was fiercely suppressed by Qiao Xi like a worm squirming on the floor.","Qiao Xi curled her lips into a mocking smile. “You’re really stupid! You don’t even know that you’re being used by others! Use your pig brain and think. Even if someone wants to seduce you to advance, they wouldn’t have chosen to do it today. Let me remind you again. If you really touch me today, the Xue family will absolutely not let you off!”","Xue Yi was her sister, so Bright Moon was the daughter of the Xue family?","Du Ming’s eyes were filled with horror. Kang Qingzhi did not say that this woman was from the Xue family! He... He was indeed dissatisfied with Xue Yi, but how could he dare to offend the Xue family?","After being punched a few times by Qiao Xi, Du Ming felt that his bones were about to break. What he could not accept was that he was only a judge in the perfume competition but had offended the daughter of the Xue family!","No! It was okay! He had always had a good reputation outside. Everyone thought that he was clean. Even if the matter was exposed, he could say that Bright Moon seduced him. He was only fooled by her in a moment of muddle-headedness.","Du Ming rolled his eyes and suddenly felt confident.","So what if she was the daughter of the Xue family? After all, she was a woman. As long as they had sex, the Xue family could only swallow their anger. They might even marry their daughter to him!","Qiao Xi loosened her foot, and Du Ming immediately struggled to get up. He ignored the injuries on his body and pounced toward Qiao Xi.","He was knocked down by Bright Moon just now because he was not prepared. He was a man, after all, so he was definitely stronger. Moreover, the lounge was soundproofed, so no one would notice. If Bright Moon shouted and attracted the attention of others, he would say that she seduced him. He naturally could not refuse such a beautiful woman who took the initiative to give herself to him.","“Miss Bright Moon, now that things have come to this, just listen to me! If you serve me well, I’ll treat today’s matter as a wet dream. I won’t tell anyone about it.","“After all, we’re alone in the same room. If we’re discovered, you’ll be the one at a disadvantage. In order to advance, you seduced a judge and lost your virginity. At that time, you won’t be able to explain yourself. No one will believe you.","“Bright Moon, I really like you. As long as you serve me obediently, everything will be fine. Otherwise, don’t blame me...”","Bang!","The door of the lounge was suddenly kicked open, and Qiao Xi looked at the door.","Who was disturbing her?! She had not even beaten Du Ming up yet. Moreover, the situation in front of her was indeed inexplicable. She took a closer look and realized that it was Twilight!","A man in a black mask had appeared at the door. He was tall and wore a black suit. His body was filled with cold killing intent. He slammed the door shut and grabbed the back of Du Ming’s collar.","Du Ming only felt his body rise into the air. In the next second, he fell heavily to the floor. This time, his bones seemed to have really broken!","He had already taken a few punches from Qiao Xi and was fiercely thrown down by this man. At this moment, he collapsed on the floor like a dead dog. Before he could recover from his shock, the man punched him in the face again, instantly causing him to lose consciousness.","Twilight did not say anything after entering. He beat Du Ming up fiercely, then straightened his suit. He was still as elegant as ever. At this moment, a few strands of his hair fell slightly, and he exuded a cold aura. His light brown eyes were as sharp as knives as he looked down at Du Ming.","Du Ming had never seen such a scene. Every punch from this man made him wish he were dead. It was as if he wanted to kill him. His lips trembled. “D-Stop hitting me...”","“How dare you threaten Bright Moon?” Twilight bent down slightly and grabbed Du Ming’s neck. Seeing his terrified expression, Twilight tightened his grip.","Du Ming’s face turned red, and his eyes were about to pop out of their sockets. He made a sound. “Uh... Uh...”","“Mr. Twilight, if you don’t let go, you’ll strangle him to death,” Qiao Xi reminded.","Twilight looked up at her with cold eyes. “I saved you, yet you want me to let him go?”","Qiao Xi was slightly speechless. She looked at Du Ming in disgust and said helplessly, “It’s precisely because you saved me that I’m advising you not to kill him. You can’t ruin yourself for this bastard.”"]},{"number":1484,"title":"Chapter 1484 My Husband Is A Jealous Lover","paragraphs":["1484 My Husband Is A Jealous Lover","Twilight looked at Qiao Xi with burning eyes. He suddenly let go and kicked Du Ming away. His voice was filled with anger. “Scram!”","Du Ming fell to the floor and panted crazily. He was clearly about to lose consciousness, but after hearing Twilight’s words, he still relied on his last bit of strength to crawl out.","Twilight slammed the door of the lounge and slowly walked toward Qiao Xi. His tall figure shrouded her in his shadow.","Qiao Xi sat on the sofa and slowly raised her head to meet his cold eyes. He bent down slightly, his hot breath spraying all over her body as she gasped slightly. “Miss Qiao, why are you in danger every time I see you?”","Only then did Qiao Xi come back to her senses. Twilight was talking about the time He Wenxian sent someone to knock her down. It was indeed dangerous that time, but the person in danger this time was not her but Du Ming!","“I saved you twice.” Twilight’s light brown eyes looked straight at her. “Can’t you protect yourself?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows and smiled like a fox. “Mr. Twilight, you seem to care a lot about me?”","“I’ve smelled your work. You’re the candidate for the champion of this competition. As the top judge, of course, I have to take your safety seriously.” Twilight pursed his lips. “Miss Qiao, you’ve offended quite a number of people. I’ve seen you in danger twice.”","Qiao Xi stared straight at him. He was so close that even the breath he exhaled was so similar to Gu Zheng’s. It was clear and carried a trace of charm, making her heart beat violently.","Only Gu Zheng could move her heart. He must be Gu Zheng, but why was he hiding it from her?","Qiao Xi was silent for a long time before she chuckled. “Mr. Twilight, thank you for saving me again. I’ll treat you to a meal as a form of repayment for your kindness last time.”","“Be serious.” Twilight’s tall body trapped her on the sofa, and his voice was extremely serious. “I’m not joking with you. Why aren’t you protecting yourself?”","Qiao Xi was stunned for a moment. When she saw his icy-cold eyes, she realized that he was really angry.","Gu Zheng had always been gentle to her and never lost his temper. He was probably only so serious with her at times like this. She shrunk her neck in fear and said in a trembling voice, “You... Why are you so fierce to me?! I was just in the lounge. It was Du Ming who opened the door with the key and wanted to plot against me. I... I didn’t want this to happen either!”","“After Du Ming entered, you could have run out to ask for help. Why did have him close the door?” The man looked at her with a gloomy gaze.","He knew that Qiao Xi had the ability to deal with this man, but when he saw the door close, his heart that had always been calm and composed seemed to have stopped beating. He was afraid that she would be harmed.","He had warned Qiao Xi time and again not to risk her life, but she turned a deaf ear to him. Hence, his tone was very serious at this moment.","Qiao Xi replied with a guilty conscience, “Du Ming is a judge. He came to the lounge to see me. If news of this gets out, outsiders will think that I seduced a judge. Even if I win the competition in the end, I won’t be acknowledged.”","“I’m here.” Twilight’s voice softened a little. “Miss Qiao, as long as I’m here, I won’t let you suffer.”","At this moment, Qiao Xi was already sure that Twilight was Gu Zheng, but she still pretended not to know. She widened her eyes in surprise. “Huh? Didn’t they say that Mr. Twilight likes Kang Qingzhi a lot? But Kang Qingzhi and I are like fire and water! I’m very curious about who you’ll help.”","Gu Zheng felt like he had been tricked. He could not appear here as Gu Zheng, so the situation forced him to wear a mask to save Qiao Xi.","He did not want to hide it from Qiao Xi either, but he had his own difficulties. Even if Qiao Xi suspected something, he could not admit it for the time being.","Gu Zheng stood up and looked away. “Miss Qiao, I don’t want to see such a thing again.”","Qiao Xi blinked and looked at him with a puzzled expression. “Mr. Twilight, why do you always appear by my side in the nick of time? Don’t tell me you’re following me?”","Gu Zheng took a few steps back, his Adam’s apple bobbing.","Qiao Xi continued to play dumb. “You’re so concerned about me. Do you like me?! But I’m already married, and my husband is a jealous lover. Once he finds out about your existence, I really won’t know how to explain it.”","There was a moment of silence...","“Mr. Twilight? Say something! Nothing happened between us. We can’t let my husband misunderstand!”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with helplessness as he pursed his thin lips. “Miss Qiao, since you’re fine, I’ll leave first.”"]},{"number":1485,"title":"Chapter 1485 I Hope To See You In The Finals","paragraphs":["1485 I Hope To See You In The Finals","Qiao Xi looked at his hurriedly leaving figure and smiled wantonly. “You’re frightened now that I brought up my husband! Weren’t you just fierce to me a second ago?”","After Gu Zheng left, he specially closed the door for Qiao Xi. At this moment, he was leaning against the wall of the corridor and felt his face heat up. Fortunately, he was wearing a mask that could cover it, but the blush on his ears could not be concealed.","“President.” Just then, Song Shijing walked over and said in a low voice, “Du Ming met Kang Qingzhi this morning.”","“It’s indeed her.” Gu Zheng’s voice was low and hoarse.","!!","Song Shijing’s heart trembled. He asked in a low voice, “Do you need my help?”","“There’s no need. Kang Qingzhi will be handed to her to handle,” Gu Zheng said casually, but the corners of his mouth curled into a cold smile. “Kang Qingzhi and Kang Jichuan will be handed to her to handle, while I’ll handle the rest. Is Old Madam Kang also in Li City?”","Song Shijing replied respectfully, “Old Madam Kang will be in Li City soon. Kang Ru will pick her up personally. Moreover, their family will be eating at Fragrance Hotel in the afternoon.”","Gu Zheng nodded, his eyes narrowing.","In the lounge, Qiao Xi looked at the time and walked out of the lounge to prepare for the competition. When she passed by the corridor, she happened to meet Kang Qingzhi.","Kang Qingzhi sized her up and realized that there was nothing wrong with her. Her gaze changed, and she smiled affectionately. “Sister Xi Xi, you’re here too!”","Qiao Xi stopped in her tracks with an indifferent expression. “Is it very strange for me to be participating in the competition?”","At this moment, there were only the two of them in the corridor. Kang Qingzhi smiled proudly. “I knew that my sister would participate in the competition, but she must be very surprised to see me!”","Qiao Xi ran to the Kang family and caused a scene, exposing her for faking the competition. However, she still advanced in the end. Qiao Xi was probably about to die of anger!","“I’m indeed a little surprised,” Qiao Xi said lightly.","“Sister Xi Xi...”","“Miss Kang, the competition is about to start. Are you sure you want to continue chatting with me here?” Qiao Xi coldly interrupted Kang Qingzhi and continued, “You won the championship for two consecutive competitions, so there should be many reporters waiting to interview you. Have you been following me because you want those reporters to notice me?”","Kang Qingzhi lowered her eyes slightly. She did not expect Qiao Xi to easily expose her intentions. However, she was puzzled. Where did Du Ming go? If he had entered Qiao Xi’s lounge, how could Qiao Xi stand here unharmed?","However, she did not care what had happened to Du Ming and Qiao Xi. In any case, she already had a photo of Du Ming entering the lounge. No matter how outstanding Qiao Xi’s results were this time, she would still be a sl*t who seduced a judge.","“Sister Xi Xi, I hope to see you in the finals!” Kang Qingzhi’s eyes curved into crescents when she smiled. She looked very sweet, but she also concealed her true emotions.","Qiao Xi replied with a smile as the corners of her mouth twitched. “Thank you. I hope you can enter the finals as well.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi swiftly turned around and left. Two hours later, Qiao Xi handed in her work for the competition and walked out of the competition venue.","As soon as she arrived at the underground parking lot, Qiao Xi saw the man waiting beside the car from afar. Gu Zheng was really too eye-catching. He was tall and handsome. He was wearing a high-end suit as he stood beside the five million yuan luxury car. When he looked at her, his deep eyes were filled with a gentle smile. Everyone who passed by could not help but take a few more glances.","“It’s been hard on you, Mrs. Gu. I heard that Fragrance Hotel has come up with a new menu. I’ve already booked a room. Let’s go.”","Qiao Xi did not expose Gu Zheng and nodded with a smile before obediently getting into the car.","On the other hand, Kang Ru picked up Old Madam Kang, who had come from afar, at the airport.","“Mom, Qingzhi is still at the event location of the perfume competition. She can’t rush over. Jichuan is also arranging the release of the perfumes and can’t come, but the two children said they want to have lunch together.”","Kang Ru helped Old Madam Kang into the car and explained patiently.","Old Madam Kang naturally would not blame them. She even smiled affectionately. “Qingzhi and Jichuan are both good children. They can take charge of the perfume business at such a young age. We’ve invested more than eight billion yuan into the perfume business. We can only succeed this time. We can’t fail!”","Kang Ru was a noble young master who did not know anything about business at all. In the past, the Kang family’s business was managed by Old Master Kang. After he passed away, the Kang family’s business went downhill as Kang Ru could not shoulder the burden. Old Madam Kang was also a rich madam who only knew how to shop and look good. As for Kang Qingzhi, she was weak and sick, so it was even more impossible for her to manage the company. In the end, Kang Jichuan, who had just come of age, could only take on this heavy responsibility."]},{"number":1486,"title":"Chapter 1486 She’s A Jinx","paragraphs":["1486 She’s A Jinx","Kang Jichuan was meticulous and had inherited a portion of Old Master Kang’s business acumen. The company gradually improved in his hands. After Kang Qingzhi won the perfume competition, he invested in a company that specialized in perfumes for her. With the title of the champion of the International Perfume Competition, their business had been doing well all these years. This time, they invested another four billion yuan and even publicized it online. They wanted to completely cause a sensation in the perfume industry and become the leader of the perfume world.","Old Madam Kang was very happy as if she could already see the Kang family’s future.","All these years, the Kang family’s life had not been as glamorous as it seemed. Although the Kang family was a noble family in Y Nation, ever since Old Master Kang passed away, the Kang family’s business had plummeted. No one was shouldering their huge family business, and they were even mocked by everyone in high society. However, things were different now. The Kang family had produced a top perfumer. After this competition ended, Kang Qingzhi would be famous throughout the world. The Kang family’s perfumes would also become popular brands worldwide. Before long, the Kang family would become the top noble family in Y Nation. They would have endless wealth to enjoy and a noble status.","The corners of Old Madam Kang’s mouth curled up slightly, and her tone was very gentle. “Son, the two of us will rely on Jichuan and Qingzhi for our entire lives. You can’t let Qingzhi suffer!”","!!","Kang Ru smiled and nodded. “Qingzhi is my daughter. Of course, I won’t let her suffer.”","“But why did I hear that Qingzhi gave her room to that little b*tch?” Old Madam Kang’s expression darkened as she said with disgust, “Ah Ru, before you came to Li City, I was against you coming to acknowledge her. So what if she’s your biological daughter? She has been wandering outside for so many years and has been tainted with bad habits. She doesn’t know noble etiquette at all. If she returns to the Kang family, she’ll only embarrass us. Moreover, she even stole Qingzhi’s room. If she returns to the Kang family, she’ll turn the originally harmonious family upside down. It won’t be a good thing!”","Kang Ru looked troubled. “Mom, Xi Xi is my biological daughter, after all. She hasn’t been doing well outside all these years. I just want to make it up to her. Moreover, she’s very sensible and won’t compete with Qingzhi. As for that bedroom, Qingzhi was the one who took the initiative to give it up. Xi Xi didn’t snatch it from her.”","“That’s because Qingzhi is sensible. She’s afraid that you’ll be stuck in the middle and be put in a difficult position. Why don’t you know how to feel sorry for Qingzhi?!” Old Madam Kang berated loudly, “Qingzhi has always been obedient and sensitive. She always thinks about others first. She knows that you want to compensate Qiao Xi, so she took the initiative to give up her room. So as long as Qiao Xi is in the Kang family, Qingzhi will have to walk on eggshells!”","Old Madam Kang glared at him. “Qingzhi is kind-hearted. She’ll choose to suffer on her own just so she can help others. If you don’t protect her, what will this child do?! Moreover, Qingzhi can bring benefits to the Kang family. What can Qiao Xi do?","“I’ve long sent someone to investigate Qiao Xi’s past. She grew up in the Qiao family since she was young. Now, the Qiao family is bankrupt and Qiao Rou even died in a car accident. After the Xu family came to acknowledge her and brought her back to the Xu family, Xu Zhi and Xia Lan divorced. Xu Anran went missing, and the Xia family was also implicated. Those who are related to Qiao Xi ended up in such a miserable state. Qiao Xi is a jinx. Are you going to watch helplessly as the Kang family falls to that state?”","Kang Ru wanted to open his mouth to explain, but he did not know where to start. Of course, he had investigated Xi Xi’s past. It was the Qiao family who abused Xi Xi and almost caused her death. It was reasonable for her to take revenge on the Qiao family. As for Xu Zhi and Xia Lan’s divorce, it was because they did not get along. How could Xi Xi be blamed for that?","He also knew that Xia Lan had pretended to be Yunqiu’s younger sister for many years and had done many dirty things behind everyone’s back. She had repeatedly framed Xi Xi. Xi Xi was already soft-hearted by not taking revenge on Xia Lan.","If Yunqiu were still alive and knew that Xia Lan had almost killed her child, she would definitely not let Xia Lan off.","At that time, Kang Ru did not think too much about it, but now that he heard his mother’s words, he felt a little uneasy.","“Mother, I... I understand.”","Old Madam Kang frowned unhappily. “You have to remember my words. Don’t always be soft-hearted. Also, I heard from Jichuan that Qiao Xi slandered Qingzhi and accused her of stealing her perfume recipes. Is that true?”","Kang Ru looked puzzled. “I’ve never heard Xi Xi mention it before. Xi Xi and Qingzhi have only met twice. What’s this about perfume recipes? Did Jichuan remember wrongly?”","Old Madam Kang suddenly fell silent. Jichuan was indeed not the one who said this. She had heard it from Qingzhi."]},{"number":1487,"title":"Chapter 1487 Permanent Ban","paragraphs":["1487 Permanent Ban","Old Madam Kang recalled the scene from that day. Qingzhi had a nightmare. When she woke up, she was covered in sweat. She cried loudly and said that she dreamed of having an elder sister at home. That woman slandered her and accused her of stealing her perfume recipes, but she was the one who dragged her sick body and stayed up late to come up with those recipes.","Old Madam Kang had always doted on Kang Qingzhi because she thought that she was a lucky star who could bring good luck to the Kang family. She had always remembered this matter. She did not tell Kang Ru that Qingzhi had dreamed of this because she was afraid that Kang Ru would think too much and think that Qingzhi was deliberately targeting Qiao Xi.","“I probably heard wrongly,” Old Madam Kang casually replied when she saw that Kang Ru did not know anything about it.","“That’s right! Xi Xi is very understanding. She won’t slander Qingzhi! Even if such a thing really happens, I won’t let Qingzhi suffer.”","Kang Ru hurriedly explained, then asked carefully, “Mom, when Qingzhi wins the championship and the perfumes are released, can you treat Xi Xi to a meal? It’ll be lively if the family gets together. When Xi Xi sees that Qingzhi is so outstanding, she’ll take Qingzhi as her role model.”","Old Madam Kang did not answer. The car slowly stopped at Fragrance Hotel. Kang Ru introduced, “Mom, this is Fragrance Hotel, a famous place in Li City.”","Kang Ru helped Old Madam Kang out of the car. The smiling usher at the door was suddenly stunned. Then, he went forward and asked, “Are you Mr. Kang Ru and Madam Liang Chunyu?”","“Yes,” Kang Ru replied in a daze, not knowing why the other party asked for their names.","When Old Madam Kang heard the other party ask for their names, she guessed that the boss of Fragrance Hotel knew that they were nobles of Y Nation, so he arranged for an attendant to serve them. She nodded proudly. “I’m Liang Chunyu. What’s the matter?”","Seeing that he got the right people, the usher bowed slightly to them. “I’m really sorry, Mr. Kang and Old Madam Kang. Fragrance Hotel doesn’t welcome the two of you. There’s a permanent ban on the two of you.”","The moment that was said, everyone outside Fragrance Hotel looked at the two of them. Fragrance Hotel was considered one of the top places in Li City. The environment was beautiful, and the prices were expensive. There were not many private rooms in the restaurant, and 60 tables of guests were served a day. Qin An had many businesses under him. His original intention of opening this hotel was to let his friends and relatives enjoy themselves at ease. Unexpectedly, it became popular for no reason. The people of Li City’s high society even treated being able to eat in Fragrance Hotel as a symbol of status.","It was not strange for Fragrance Hotel to reject guests. Once they received 60 tables of guests today, the ushers outside the door would inform the guests who came to eat. Their attitudes would be gentle and respectful. They would even give them a small gift to express their apology. However, today, an usher actually said to the two guests, ‘There’s a permanent ban on the two of you.’","Since they were doing business openly, they had to respect the idea that customers were God. Furthermore, Qin An had always been gentle and polite to everyone. Why would he chase customers out in public?","Everyone thought about it carefully. Young Master Qin had been in business for so many years. Of course, he knew the importance of a good attitude. To be able to make Fragrance Hotel, which had always been gentle and respectful to customers, chase them away in public, could it be that these two people had done something overboard?","The strange gazes landed on Kang Ru and Old Madam Kang. Those who could come to Fragrance Hotel to eat were all famous figures in Li City. Most of them had a good upbringing and subconsciously looked away. However, Kang Ru still felt uncomfortable.","At this moment, Old Madam Kang came back to her senses from the shock. Her face was ashen. She married into the Kang family when she was 18 years old. As the wife of the earl, she was respected by everyone and her life had been smooth sailing. No one had ever offended her. Now that she wanted to eat at this hotel, she was actually rejected. Moreover, the other party said that they would never be allowed in?","Kang Ru suppressed the anger in his heart and frowned. “Are you guys mistaken? This is our first time coming to Fragrance Hotel. Why aren’t you letting us in?”","He had just arrived in Li City, and this was his first time in Fragrance Hotel. The other party had no reason to refuse them entry!","The young man standing in front replied respectfully, “Mr. Kang, I’m really sorry. This was our boss’ order. We don’t know the reason either. Perhaps you’ve offended someone you shouldn’t have?”","Offend?","Kang Ru’s expression became uglier and uglier. He had only been in Li City for a short period of time and did not know many people. Moreover, he had always been gentle. How could he have offended anyone?","Seeing that everyone was looking at them, Kang Ru’s face turned red. He helped Old Madam Kang to the side and said helplessly, “Mom, I don’t know the boss of Fragrance Hotel at all. I definitely didn’t offend him. Could it be that Jichuan has violated someone’s interests?”"]},{"number":1488,"title":"Chapter 1488 How Unlucky","paragraphs":["1488 How Unlucky","“Jichuan is a good child. Logically speaking, he shouldn’t have offended anyone. It’s probably a misunderstanding,” Kang Ru muttered to himself.","Old Madam Kang, who was at the side, thought carefully. She knew Jichuan and Qingzhi well. The two children had gentle personalities. Moreover, Qingzhi was weak and sickly. She rarely went out, so it was impossible for her to offend anyone.","After thinking about it, Old Madam Kang suddenly thought of someone. Qiao Xi had lived in Li City for so many years and was arrogant and despotic. She must have offended someone. Perhaps the boss of Fragrance Hotel knew about their relationship with Qiao Xi, so he did not allow them to enter.","Old Madam Kang’s eyes turned cold. “Ah Ru, could it be that Qiao Xi offended someone?”","When Kang Ru heard Qiao Xi’s name, he immediately retorted, “Impossible! Xi Xi... How could Xi Xi...”","Old Madam Kang snorted unhappily. “You’ve only been in Li City for a short while, but Qiao Xi has been staying here for 20 years. Moreover, Jichuan and Qingzhi are obedient and sensible. They wouldn’t have caused trouble in Li City, much less damage the Kang family’s reputation. It must be that little b*tch...”","She gritted her teeth and said hatefully, “She’s arrogant. It’s not strange for her to offend someone in Li City. I knew it. She’s a jinx. She actually implicated us and made us unable to enter Fragrance Hotel. I told you not to bring her back to the Kang family. How long has it been and such a thing has already happened?!”","Kang Ru lowered his head and explained weakly, “It can’t be Xi Xi...”","“Why not? We don’t know the boss of Fragrance Hotel at all. On the other hand, Qiao Xi has lived in Li City for so many years. She must have come to Fragrance Hotel for a meal before!” Old Madam Kang’s voice was sharp, and her expression was vicious. “Your daughter hasn’t even officially returned to the Kang family yet, yet she’s already implicated us and made us lose our reputation. I don’t know what will happen when she returns to the Kang family!”","Old Madam Tang was burning with anger. The people around her heard her words and recognized them as nobles of Y Nation. From what Old Madam Tang said, Miss Qiao did not grow up by Mr. Kang’s side. Now that they had just acknowledged each other, it would indeed be infuriating if Mr. Kang and Old Madam Kang were chased out of Fragrance Hotel because of Miss Qiao.","At this moment, Old Madam Kang could not care less about her image anymore. She said angrily, “She caused Qingzhi to suffer previously, and now, she’s causing us to lose our dignity. She hasn’t even officially entered our family but has already caused us trouble. Everyone knows that the boss of Fragrance Hotel has a noble status. She actually offended such a person. She’s a jinx. Whoever touches her will be unlucky!”","Kang Ru lowered his head and felt a little uncomfortable when he heard Old Madam Qiao scolding Qiao Xi. However, they had just arrived in Li City and indeed did not know the boss of Fragrance Hotel. Xi Xi was probably the only one who knew him. Could it be that it was really her?","Seeing this, Kang Ru could only comfort her softly. “Mom, don’t be angry. Xi Xi lacks discipline, after all. When she returns to the Kang family, I’ll educate her well.”","Old Madam Kang’s face was ferocious, and her eyes were filled with viciousness. “That little b*tch! If I see her, I’ll definitely—”","Suddenly, Old Madam Kang’s voice stopped abruptly as she stared fixedly at Qiao Xi, who had gotten out of the car. Gu Zheng elegantly opened the car door for her and held the girl’s hand intimately while smiling gently at her.","In an instant, Old Madam Kang’s anger surged!","“Qiao Xi!”","Everyone’s gazes looked at the two people at the door. When they saw the man’s handsome face clearly, their hearts trembled. Before they could react, Old Madam Kang pointed at Qiao Xi and roared angrily, “Get over here!”","Qiao Xi was stunned for a moment. How unlucky! Why was the Kang family still here at a time like this?","Gu Zheng’s gentle expression instantly darkened. He exuded the domineering aura of a king as a chill lingered around him. “Mr. Kang, what do you mean by this?”","Kang Ru looked at Qiao Xi, then at the young man standing at the door to welcome the guests. The other party did not seem to have any intention of chasing Qiao Xi away. He was silent for a few seconds before he frowned and asked, “Xi Xi, did you offend...”","“Who else could it be? Who are you to speak to my son like this?” Old Madam Kang pointed at Gu Zheng, her tone arrogant. Then, she glared at Qiao Xi with widened eyes and roared, “Qiao Xi! Come here! Don’t you know how to greet your elders? You’re really uneducated!”","“Who are you?” Qiao Xi asked casually.","Seeing her indifferent appearance, Old Madam Kang was infuriated. She glared fiercely at Qiao Xi and gritted her teeth. “You wretched girl, why are you pretending? Do you not know who I am?”"]},{"number":1489,"title":"Chapter 1489 People’s Prejudice Is A Mountain","paragraphs":["1489 People’s Prejudice Is A Mountain","“Have we met?” Qiao Xi still had an indifferent expression. Old Madam Kang was angered to the point her face turned red. She panted heavily and could not say anything.","Kang Ru, who was at the side, hurriedly said, “Xi Xi, this is your grandmother.”","Old Madam Kang pointed at Qiao Xi while trembling and flew into a rage. “You’re indeed an uneducated wild girl! You don’t even greet your elders when you see them and you’re still pretending not to know me. I told you to come here. Are you deaf?”","The surrounding crowd was full of questions. How could Miss Qiao not know her grandmother? Even if she did not grow up by the old lady’s side, she could not be so cold!","Everyone around Fragrance Hotel looked over. What puzzled them was that Fragrance Hotel was Qin An’s territory. Ordinary people would not cause trouble here as they were afraid of offending Qin An. Even if someone really caused trouble, an attendant would ask them to leave. Why did the usher standing at the door have no intention of chasing them away?","Old Madam Kang was angered to the point her face was ashen. Being rejected by Fragrance Hotel had already caused her anger to soar. Now, Qiao Xi’s attitude made her unable to restrain her anger. Her voice gradually became sharp. “I’ll say it one last time. Come over immediately!”","The surroundings were silent as everyone’s gazes landed on Qiao Xi. She raised her eyes slightly and said casually, “Old Madam Kang, if I remember correctly, this is the first time we’ve met, right? I’ve never seen you before, so I naturally didn’t know that you’re my grandmother. Why would I obediently go over when a stranger asked me to get lost?”","Kang Ru frowned. The corners of Old Madam Kang’s mouth twitched slightly as she shouted in exasperation, “You sharp-tongued wild girl!”","Qiao Xi looked at her with a deep gaze. Before she could speak, Gu Zheng’s expression darkened. His thin lips parted slightly. “The Kang family has never raised Xi Xi, and she has never spent a single cent of the Kang family’s money. You’re naturally not Xi Xi’s elders. Moreover, didn’t we agree not to keep in contact anymore, Mr. Kang?”","Hearing Gu Zheng mention him, Kang Ru frowned even more and explained in a panic, “Xi Xi, your grandmother only arrived in Li City today. I wanted to arrange for you to meet, but an accident happened.”","Old Madam Kang was still filled with anger. This was not an accident at all. It was Qiao Xi who offended the boss of Fragrance Hotel and caused them to lose their dignity in public. This little b*tch was as annoying as her mother.","For decades, Old Madam Kang had been living the life of a noble madam. Everyone around her tried to please her, and she had never been so angry. At this moment, she had already convicted Qiao Xi and berated loudly, “Qiao Xi! You’re a jinx. You offended the boss of Fragrance Hotel, which is why we were rejected. It’s only right for me to reprimand you!”","Qiao Xi curled her lips indifferently.","Seeing her smile, Gu Zheng understood. She had long known that Old Madam Kang and Kang Ru would come to Fragrance Hotel, so when he mentioned coming, she agreed without hesitation.","At this moment, Kang Ru’s expression was a little ugly. He tried his best to make his tone gentle. “Xi Xi, you’re already 20 years old. You should be more mature. Since you’ve offended someone, you should bear the consequences and not let us lose our reputation with you. Your grandmother came all the way here and just got off the plane today to try the dishes from Fragrance Hotel, but she encountered such a thing...”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows and asked softly, “You were rejected by Fragrance Hotel. Why are you so sure that I offended the boss of Fragrance Hotel? Have you never thought that it might be your own problem?”","Kang Ru’s eyes were filled with disappointment. “Xi Xi, it doesn’t matter if you’ve offended the boss of Fragrance Hotel. I’ve always thought of you as a good child. If you do something, you have to admit to it.”","Old Madam Kang’s gaze was cold as she said fiercely, “You grew up in Li City and are arrogant. Who else could it be but you?”","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing. Indeed, one’s prejudice was like a mountain. Old Madam Kang was her biological grandmother. Moreover, the two of them had never met before, yet she was so disgusted with her. Her eyes were even filled with hatred.","Everyone could not help but look over. Although Qin An had a noble status in Li City, Miss Qiao’s status was not bad either! She was Gu Zheng’s wife. Even if Young Master Qin did not show Miss Qiao any respect, he had to show Gu Zheng some respect!","Just as everyone was feeling puzzled, Qiao Xi said unhurriedly, “Old Madam Kang, you keep saying that I’ve offended the boss of Fragrance Hotel, but no one’s stopping me from entering!”","Kang Ru’s and Old Madam Kang’s expressions instantly stiffened. At this moment, Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng were already standing at the door of Fragrance Hotel. The young man standing at the door to welcome the guests did not stop them and even bent down to greet Qiao Xi respectfully."]},{"number":1490,"title":"Chapter 1490 Threatened By A Chef","paragraphs":["1490 Threatened By A Chef","After the young man greeted Qiao Xi, he said something to Gu Zheng. This meant that in the eyes of this usher, Qiao Xi’s identity was even nobler than Gu Zheng’s.","Qiao Xi crossed her arms and looked at the two of them coldly. “Old Madam Kang, you haven’t even figured out the situation yet and you already concluded that I caused you to be rejected. If it’s really because of me, why didn’t Fragrance Hotel stop me but insisted on stopping you?”","As soon as she finished speaking, a middle-aged man walked out of Fragrance Hotel. He was wearing the clothes of a chef.","He was Fan Cang, the apprentice of the top chef, Su Dongjun. When he saw Qiao Xi standing at the door, he immediately went forward and said with pleasant surprise, “Miss Qiao, why aren’t you going in?! I just developed a few new dishes. They’re still hot after being prepared. They’re all in the private room!”","Kang Ru’s eyes instantly widened when he heard this. The chef of Fragrance Hotel was an apprentice of a top chef, so why was he so respectful to Qiao Xi?","Only then did Fan Cang realize that the atmosphere was not right. He asked in confusion, “Miss Qiao, what’s wrong?”","Qiao Xi smiled at him. “It’s not a big deal. It’s just that some people suspect that I’ve offended the boss of Fragrance Hotel. Do you think that’s possible?”","Fan Cang was extremely shocked and replied loudly and generously, “Of course not! Even the boss can’t wait for you to come to Fragrance Hotel for a meal. How could you have offended our boss? Who has the guts to spread rumors behind his back? I’ll tell the boss and let him settle it!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows and looked at Kang Ru.","Kang Ru instantly panicked. He had a noble status, and everyone in Romulan City had to be polite to him. However, now that he was in Li City, he was actually threatened by a chef.","Old Madam Kang, who was at the side, also came back to her senses. Her eyes were bloodshot as she roared angrily. “Qiao Xi! Who are you kidding?! This person must be—”","“This old madam keeps insisting that I offended the boss of Fragrance Hotel, which is why the usher at the door rejected them.” Qiao Xi raised her head.","Fan Cang looked at Kang Ru and Old Madam Kang and instantly reacted. “Are the two of you Mr. Kang Ru and Madam Liang Chunyu?”","Everyone could tell that there would be a twist in the situation and was filled with curiosity.","Fan Cang seemed to understand the situation now, and his eyes were filled with disdain. “Actually, it’s not just the two of you who have been blacklisted by Fragrance Hotel. Our boss has ordered that no one in the Kang family is allowed to enter Fragrance Hotel. You know what you’ve done. Don’t look for trouble with Miss Qiao!”","When everyone heard this, they were even more curious. Someone could not help but say, “What did they do to make the boss of Fragrance Hotel so disgusted?”","“Old Madam Kang cursed at Miss Qiao the first time they met. It seems that she’s not very cultured! Could it be that she did something wrong and doesn’t dare to admit it, so she deliberately wanted Miss Qiao to take the blame?!”","Old Madam Kang was so angry that her face was ashen. She had never been slandered like this before. She shouted at everyone, “Shut up! I just came to Li City today. It’s impossible for me to have offended the boss of Fragrance Hotel!”","Fan Cang snorted. “I’m just a chef. That’s all I know. However... instead of making things difficult for Miss Qiao, why don’t you go home and ask the daughter of the Kang family, Kang Qingzhi? Perhaps she’ll know the reason!”","The moment that was said, everyone understood. The person who had really offended the boss of Fragrance Hotel was Kang Qingzhi!","Kang Ru’s and Old Madam Kang’s expressions changed drastically. Their arrogance from before had also been extinguished. What did this have to do with Qingzhi?","Old Madam Kang’s expression was complicated. Everyone’s disdainful gazes made her extremely angry. “What nonsense are you talking about?! Qingzhi is weak and sickly. She rarely goes out. Moreover, she’s kind-hearted. She wouldn’t have offended—”","“Mother! Stop talking!” When Kang Ru saw that the situation was bad, he immediately interrupted Old Madam Kang. Then, he quickly walked in front of Qiao Xi and said softly, “Xi Xi, your grandmother was just rash just now. She’s your elder, after all. Don’t mind her.”","Qiao Xi glanced at him indifferently. Gu Zheng, who was at the side, said coldly, “Since she’s an elder, she has to set an example. Old Madam Kang cursed Xi Xi the first time she saw her. Now that she realizes that it’s a misunderstanding, she’s forcing Xi Xi to forgive her?","“Mr. Kang, I told you before that if you don’t care about Xi Xi, we’ll treat each other as strangers and not keep in contact with each other. Anyway, even without the Kang family, I, her husband, dote on her.”","Kang Ru lowered his eyes and was a little flustered. He hurriedly explained, “Mr. Gu, this is just a misunderstanding...”","“Mr. Gu, what’s the point of telling them this? Hurry up and leave with Mrs. Gu!” The person beside him could not stand it anymore and interrupted Kang Ru."]},{"number":1491,"title":"Chapter 1491 Do You Have The Word ‘Shame’ In Your Dictionary?","paragraphs":["1491 Do You Have The Word ‘Shame’ In Your Dictionary?","Everyone stood at the side and watched for a long time. They also understood the ins and outs of the matter now. To put it bluntly, Old Madam Kang did not like her wandering granddaughter, so she concluded that Qiao Xi had made a mistake. Now that she realized that it was a misunderstanding, she wanted to put on the airs of an elder and force Qiao Xi to forgive her.","The person who spoke just now said in a mocking tone, “She’s forcing the younger generation to forgive her just because she’s old. Even if some people are old, they’re still full of evil tricks!”","Kang Ru gasped, and his face was ashen as he gritted his teeth. He had never been so embarrassed in his life. At this moment, he did not want to say anything. He pulled Old Madam Kang along and was about to leave when she stood stiffly on the spot and glared fiercely at Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and met her gaze, her gaze calm.","!!","A few years ago, Old Madam Kang came to Li City once. At that time, she had a meal at Fragrance Hotel. After so long, she was still thinking about the food in Fragrance Hotel. Now that she was finally here but was not allowed to eat here, of course, she was unwilling.","Old Madam Kang shook off Kang Ru and said self-righteously, “Qiao Xi, I’m your biological grandmother. Since you’ve booked a private room in Fragrance Hotel, let us have it!”","The surroundings fell silent, and everyone was once again shocked by Old Madam Kang’s shamelessness. After a few seconds of silence, Qiao Xi chuckled. “Old Madam Kang, you want my private room?”","“Can’t I? It’s our first time meeting and you didn’t even prepare a gift. It’s not too much for me to want this private room, right?” Old Madam Kang looked at her sideways and raised her head arrogantly.","Qiao Xi did not even bother to look at them. She pulled Gu Zheng in. Seeing this, Old Madam Kang hurriedly shouted, “Why don’t we use the same private room? In any case, there are only two of you. The private room is so big. You can easily let us join you.”","Old Madam Kang knew very well that the smallest private room in Fragrance Hotel could seat six people. Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi would only occupy two seats, so there would still be room even for Qingzhi and Jichuan.","Qiao Xi frowned. Was Old Madam Kang really the madam of a noble family? Why did she look like a shrew in the market? Although Madam Tan from the Brook family had ill intentions, she at least had the bearing of a noble. She would not shout.","The first time she saw Madam Tan, Qiao Xi observed her. She was indeed the madam of a noble family. Her clothes were very exquisite, and her every move was elegant and noble. She maintained the posture of a noble madam at all times, but Old Madam Kang did not have the aura of a noble at all!","Just as Qiao Xi was complaining in her heart, the surrounding people could not help but mock, “Old Madam Kang, do you still have any shame? It’s clearly Kang Qingzhi who offended the boss of Fragrance Hotel, but you didn’t distinguish right or wrong and wrongly accused Miss Qiao. Now that you realize that it’s a misunderstanding, it’s fine that you’re unwilling to apologize, but you’re even so arrogant as to occupy Miss Qiao’s private room. Do you have the word ‘shame’ in your dictionary?”","Old Madam Kang had never been humiliated like this before. She glared at that person with widened eyes. The person who spoke was a socialite who was dressed exquisitely. She snorted fearlessly. “I’m telling the truth! I have to say it even if you glare at me!”","At this moment, Kang Ru’s face was burning. Old Madam Kang pointed at the socialite, then at Qiao Xi. She was so angry that the loose flesh on her face trembled. “Y-You actually dare to offend me? I’m the old madam of the Kang family!”","“So what?!” The person who spoke this time was a noblewoman standing beside the socialite. “Old Madam Kang, this is Li City, not your territory. Moreover, no matter who you are, you have to be reasonable. If you continue to fool around, I don’t mind reporting to the leader of Y Nation and getting him to bring you back.”","Old Madam Kang was so angry that her eyes rolled back. It was as if she would faint the next second.","Kang Ru’s face flushed red as he hurriedly apologized to everyone. He glanced at Qiao Xi with a complicated expression and pulled Old Madam Kang along. He said in a low voice, “Mother, let’s go.”","At this moment, no matter how dissatisfied Old Madam Kang was, she could only leave first. If that noblewoman really reported it to the leader of Y Nation, they would be in trouble.","Looking at the disdainful gazes around them, Kang Ru advised in a low voice, “Mom, the people who come to Fragrance Hotel to eat are all rich and noble. It’s not strange for them to know Y Nation’s leaders. We definitely can’t offend them. Moreover, we’ve just invested in our perfume company and are preparing to promote our perfumes with all our might. We can’t have any negative news.”","The Kang family was a noble family in Y Nation. On the surface, they looked glamorous and had a noble status, but there were many people watching them from behind. Once a scandal was exposed, others would definitely seize the opportunity to publicize it."]},{"number":1492,"title":"Chapter 1492 Quit The Competition To Prove Her Innocence","paragraphs":["1492 Quit The Competition To Prove Her Innocence","Old Madam Kang pointed at Qiao Xi angrily and gritted her teeth. “This is the daughter you’ve been longing to acknowledge. If she returns to the Kang family, she’ll anger me to death sooner or later!","“From what that chef said, Qiao Xi is very familiar with the boss of Fragrance Hotel. As long as she puts in a few good words, they’ll definitely agree to let us in, but she ignored us and watched us lose our dignity in public!","“I’ve lived for decades, but no one has ever dared to speak to me like that. Moreover, it’s a little girl. It’s all Qiao Xi’s fault!","“I’m her biological grandmother, but she doesn’t have the slightest respect for me. Bastard! Even if news of this gets out, it’s her fault. I only taught a junior a lesson. What’s wrong with that?”","!!","Hearing Old Madam Kang’s curses, Kang Ru looked helpless. “But you can’t blame Xi Xi. Qingzhi was the one who offended the boss of Fragrance Hotel...”","“You can’t blame Qingzhi! She grew up by our side. Don’t you know her character? She’s kind and weak. How did she offend the boss of Fragrance Hotel? This must be a misunderstanding!”","Old Madam Kang was stubborn. She believed that Kang Qingzhi had done nothing wrong. No matter what others said, she would find an excuse to explain things for Kang Qingzhi. She said hatefully, “I heard that Qiao Xi is also participating in the perfume competition. Tell Qingzhi that she has to win this time and surpass Qiao Xi. I’m so angry. This bastard!”","Kang Ru frowned and did not dare speak up for Qiao Xi anymore. “Qingzhi will definitely win the championship, while Xi Xi... is on her own.”","At the door of Fragrance Hotel, everyone watched them leave and said in disdain, “Are these two people crazy?”","“Yes, normal people can’t say such things!”","“Who’s Kang Qingzhi? Why haven’t I heard of her? Is it a misunderstanding that she offended Mr. Qin?”","Someone quickly told Qin An what had happened at the entrance of Fragrance Hotel. When he found out that Old Madam Kang was so arrogant, he curled his lips. “Misunderstanding?”","Not long after, a rumor appeared in Li City...","Kang Qingzhi had offended the boss of Fragrance Hotel, who was Qin An. In order to enter Fragrance Hotel for a meal, the Kang family staged a farce at the door. Qin An had never seen such a shameless family. He also hated Miss Kang, who exuded the aura of a two-faced b*tch. Hence, he gave the order that all the businesses under him would have a permanent ban on Kang Qingzhi. This was to tell everyone that the person who offended him was Kang Qingzhi. The Kang family would not have the cheek to cause trouble again.","However, by the time the rumor got to Kang Qingzhi’s ears, it became that she wanted to seduce the boss of Fragrance Hotel. Unexpectedly, she accidentally offended the other party, so the other party refused to let her enter all the businesses under him.","Kang Qingzhi was furious and smashed the things on the table.","She had never seen the boss of Fragrance Hotel before, let alone offended him!","It must be Qiao Xi! She had lived in Li City for so many years and even knew the boss of Fragrance Hotel. She was the one who deliberately framed her!","Qiao Xi still dared to take the initiative to attack. She wanted to see how long Qiao Xi could continue being arrogant!","Two days later, the perfume competition entered its climax. The contestants who advanced would participate in the next round at nine in the morning.","In the past few days, Qiao Xi had been busy preparing for the perfume competition while collecting information. She felt a little sleepy after dinner. She was about to go upstairs to take a shower and sleep when she received a call from Xue Yi. “Xi Xi! The competition’s organizers have canceled your right to participate in the competition and have already informed another contestant to take over!”","Qiao Xi tightened her grip on the cell phone.","Xue Yi said anxiously, “The competition’s organizers said that the reason you’re disqualified from the competition is that you colluded with a judge, so the results of the competition aren’t valid. Heh! I’m really laughing now. Doesn’t my power in the perfume competition exceed that wretched man, Du Ming? If you wanted to advance using shady means, you didn’t have to seduce him at all. You could just look for me! Everyone must have lost their brains!”","Du Ming?","Qiao Xi pondered for a few seconds before remembering Du Ming. He was the wretched man who entered the lounge that day and wanted to plot against her. After that, he was beaten up by Gu Zheng and crawled out!","“Where’s the evidence?” Qiao Xi asked casually.","Xue Yi said, “They said that someone took a photo of Du Ming entering your lounge and anonymously reported you for colluding with a judge. The competition’s organizers first looked for Du Ming to ask about it. He said that you asked him to go to the lounge and tried to seduce him to advance, so he decided to withdraw from this competition to prove his innocence. Now, the netizens are all scolding you.","“The competition’s organizers have already posted this matter online. They said that the perfumer, Bright Moon, colluded with a judge. The competition’s organizers will punish you by disqualifying you from participating in the competition for three years. They still had some brains and didn’t write your real name, Qiao Xi. Otherwise, Liuli would definitely sue them!”"]},{"number":1493,"title":"Chapter 1493 Had A Trick Saved Up","paragraphs":["1493 Had A Trick Saved Up","Hearing Xue Yi’s words, Qiao Xi could not help but feel that it was a little laughable. Madam Leng had only passed away a few years ago, yet the perfume competition was already so chaotic. Was there no good person left on the committee?","Qiao Xi picked up her phone and saw that the officials of the perfume competition had issued a statement and disqualified her from participating. There were also many signatures of familiar people. As long as those people smelled the perfume she handed in, they would probably be able to guess that she was Mu Jin. However, they easily believed Du Ming’s words. They did not investigate at all and directly disqualified a perfumer.","“Xi Xi, how should we handle this?”","Xue Yi sighed. “Of course, I know that it’s impossible for you to seduce Du Ming, but Du Ming has already withdrawn from the competition to prove his innocence. Someone even took a photo of him entering the lounge. It’s really hard to explain things. Even if you continue to participate in the competition, people will suspect that you’re lying.”","!!","“Don’t worry, I’ll handle it.”","Xue Yi was a little curious. “What are you going to do?”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up into a smile. “Kang Qingzhi must have been captured by the surveillance cameras when she met Du Ming. Moreover, when Du Ming entered my lounge, I recorded our conversation.”","Recording?","Xue Yi sighed in her heart. As expected of Xi Xi. She had a trick saved up!","“Then what can I do for you?”","“Help me keep an eye on the people from the perfume competition. I want to know who Kang Qingzhi bribed,” Qiao Xi said softly.","Xue Yi said, “I know she’s close to a few judges. I’ll go investigate now. We won’t alert the enemy.”","After the two of them hung up, Qiao Xi looked at the news online. The announcement issued by the competition’s organizers clearly stated that in order to advance, she seduced a judge, so her right to participate in the competition was revoked. She was also not allowed to participate in the competition for three years.","A few minutes later, the competition’s organizers released another video. Du Ming was wearing a mask and personally admitted that he entered Bright Moon’s lounge in a moment of folly. Hence, he resigned from his position as a judge of this competition. This news instantly occupied the hot list. The participants of the perfume competition reposted it one after another. Kang Qingzhi was naturally among these people.","Qiao Xi clicked on the content that Kang Qingzhi had reposted. The comments below were very lively.","[Who’s Bright Moon?! I’ve never heard of her. One look and I can tell that she’s a fancy schlock. She actually seduced a judge in order to advance. How disgusting! This woman is really shameless!]","[To be able to think of such a dirty move, she’s probably a trash perfumer without any ability. An outstanding perfumer like our Qingzhi relied on her own ability. Although Qingzhi only participated in the competition in recent years, she’s already comparable to Sally. Now that Sally has been banned, Qingzhi is the only female perfumer in the younger generation who’s more famous. The champion of this competition will definitely be Qingzhi!]","[Du Ming has already admitted it himself and even released a video. His reputation has also been affected. This matter must be true. This woman is really unscrupulous to do such a thing just to rise to power! Qingzhi, don’t interact with such a person!]","[F*ck! The internal news says that Bright Moon got first place in the competition. How many judges did she seduce?! Fortunately, she was reported. Otherwise, Qingzhi’s title as the champion would’ve been snatched away!]","At this moment, the Kang family and several people were dining in a restaurant.","Kang Qingzhi looked at the message on her phone and frowned. Her eyes were filled with worry.","Kang Jichuan’s voice was gentle. “Qingzhi, what’s wrong?”","Hearing the voice in her ear, Kang Qingzhi was shocked. She quickly hid her phone behind her back and looked panicked. “It’s nothing.”","Kang Ru also looked over worriedly. “Qingzhi, you’ve lost weight recently. Eat more food so that your body can recover. If you encounter anything, you must tell us. Don’t shoulder it alone.”","Kang Qingzhi’s slender fingers held the cell phone tightly as she looked at Kang Ru in embarrassment. She said carefully, “It’s Sister Xi Xi...”","“Qiao Xi?” Old Madam Kang instantly exploded when she heard Qiao Xi’s name. She slammed the chopsticks in her hand on the table and asked coldly, “What did she do this time?”","Kang Qingzhi lowered her head and looked like she wanted to say something but hesitated. After hesitating for a long time, she braced herself and said, “Sister Xi Xi... She can’t participate in the competition anymore.”","Kang Ru also put down her chopsticks and frowned. “What exactly is going on?”","Kang Qingzhi bit her lip and sighed. “Someone reported Sister Xi Xi for seducing a judge. After the competition’s organizers investigated, they found out that it was true. Moreover, that judge also confirmed it, so the competition’s organizers disqualified her from participating in the competition and banned her from participating for three years.","“Dad, it’s all my fault. Sister must have gotten muddle-headed from not wanting to lose to me...”"]},{"number":1494,"title":"Chapter 1494 Stepping On Her Forever","paragraphs":["1494 Stepping On Her Forever","Hearing Kang Qingzhi’s words, Kang Ru’s and Kang Jichuan’s expressions instantly stiffened. Then, they looked as ugly as if they had eaten a fly. They calmed down for a long time before realizing what they had heard.","Kang Ru, who had always had a good temper, could not help but glare. “What? Xi Xi seduced a judge?”","Kang Qingzhi held the cell phone with both hands and showed it to Kang Ru. Her eyes were red, and her voice was delicate. “Sister has a strong character. Even though she doesn’t know how to make perfumes, she still wanted to advance. That’s why she came up with such a method. If she had grown up in the Kang family, she would definitely have advanced. It’s my fault for snatching the position that originally belonged to her.”","Kang Ru’s mind was buzzing, and his eyes were filled with disbelief.","!!","His biological daughter seduced a judge in order to advance? How could she do this? She was the daughter of the Kang family. How could she be so shameless?!","Kang Ru’s hand that was holding the cell phone trembled slightly. He was so angry that his breathing quickened. “He... actually did such a thing!”","Previously, when his mother said that Xi Xi did not know noble etiquette and was arrogant, he did not care. He could slowly teach her what she needed to know. In any case, she was the daughter of the Kang family, so no one would laugh at her. However, she was now a girl who sold her body to seduce the judges. Not only did she ruin her reputation, but she also implicated the Kang family and made them lose their dignity with her!","Kang Ru thought of himself as a gentle person. After finding out about this, however, he could not control his expression at all. He gritted his teeth and shouted, “Qiao Xi! How can my daughter be so shameless?!”","Kang Jichuan, who was at the side, lowered his head, his eyes filled with disgust. Indeed, Xi Xi was no different from five years ago. She was unscrupulous in order to achieve her goal. Back then, she slandered Qingzhi for stealing her perfume recipes. Now, in order to win the competition, a married woman like herself offered herself to a judge. It was really disgusting!","Kang Qingzhi clearly saw the disgust in the eyes of the father and son of the Kang family and smiled imperceptibly. Qiao Xi did have the ability to win the championship, but so what? She had already lost the qualifications to participate in the competition and even became a sl*t who seduced a judge!","Qiao Xi had successfully tricked her with the matter of Fragrance Hotel, but the final winner was still her! She would successfully take Qiao Xi’s perfume recipes and become the champion, forever trampling on Qiao Xi.","Kang Ru instantly lost interest in eating and scrolled through the comments online. As expected, all the comments were filled with curses. The more he read, the colder his heart became. He never expected his daughter to do such a thing. Everyone did not know that Bright Moon was Qiao Xi. If they found out one day that it was Qiao Xi, what would the situation be like?","At that time, someone would say that Qiao Xi was actually the daughter of the Kang family. As a father, he did not teach his daughter well and made her do such a shameless thing!","At the thought of this, Kang Ru felt anger surge into his heart. His temples were throbbing. “Why did she do this?! In order to bring her back to the Kang family, I came all the way from Y Nation to Li City. I even wanted to arrange a banquet for her and invite the nobles of Y Nation to attend so that everyone would know that she’s my daughter. However, she did such a shameful thing. How can I—”","Old Madam Kang slammed the table and roared, “I won’t allow her to return to the Kang family! Our family’s reputation has been clean for generations. We can’t be tainted by her!”","“Grandma, it wasn’t easy for us to find Sister Xi Xi. If we don’t let her return to the Kang family, I’ll be sad,” Kang Qingzhi advised softly, her eyes filled with guilt.","“Don’t blame Sister Xi Xi. If you want to blame someone, blame me. Although Sister did something wrong, she isn’t such a person. She must have wanted to win against me, so...”","Kang Qingzhi’s tears were welling up in her eyes. She lowered her head and straightened her thin body like a child who had done something wrong. She said with a sobbing tone, “I’m sorry, Dad. If it weren’t for me, my sister would have returned to the Kang family a long time ago. I’m willing to withdraw from the competition and negotiate with the competition’s organizers. No matter what the price is, I must help Sister Xi Xi salvage her reputation. At most, I’ll just say that I seduced the judge.”","“Nonsense!” Old Madam Kang frowned, her eyes filled with heartache. “Qingzhi, this isn’t your fault at all. Qiao Xi was jealous of you, so she did such an ugly thing. She’s just an uneducated wild girl. Why should you pay the price? Just participate in the competition in peace and don’t care about her life or death!”","Kang Qingzhi’s tears fell like pearls. Her nose was slightly red as she choked. “If my sister had grown up in the Kang family, she wouldn’t have become like this. She would’ve been a gentle and generous socialite. I occupied her identity...”"]},{"number":1495,"title":"Chapter 1495 Can’t Bring Her Home Unless I’m Dead","paragraphs":["1495 Can’t Bring Her Home Unless I’m Dead","“Qingzhi!” Kang Jichuan, who had been silent all this while, suddenly spoke. His expression was filled with anger, but when he looked at Kang Qingzhi, his heart was filled with heartache. “This isn’t your fault. She’s not worth your sacrifice.”","Five years ago, he already knew Qiao Xi’s character. She was selfish, scheming, full of lies, and shameless. He originally thought that Qiao Xi would be different five years later. Now, it seemed that he was thinking too much. Not only did she not get better, but she even became worse. Not only did she lose her reputation, but she also implicated the Kang family.","He still clearly remembered that five years ago, he accompanied Qingzhi to the hospital for treatment and did not pick Xi Xi up from school. The next day, Qiao Xi rushed to Qingzhi’s room and smashed many things. At that time, Qiao Xi’s clothes were all torn apart and she was wrapped in a large man’s jacket. Not long after, there was a scandal about her in Romulan City. At that time, he spent a lot of money to use his connections to suppress those rumors to protect Qiao Xi’s reputation.","At that time, he was already disappointed in her. After five years, he had already forgotten the unbearable past. He just wanted to bring Xi Xi home and make it up to her, but she actually did such a shameful thing again!","!!","She actually seduced a man again in order to achieve her goal. As a girl, why didn’t she cherish her body and reputation at all?","Five years ago, after Qiao Xi returned home, she smashed Qingzhi’s bedroom and said that Qingzhi was the one who caused her to be almost killed. Was Qingzhi to blame this time?","Qiao Xi was his biological sister. Why was she so unbearable? What right did such a shameless woman have to return to the Kang family?","The Kang family lost their appetite. Old Madam Kang was filled with anger as she stood up angrily. “Kang Ru! Let me tell you, you can’t bring that b*tch’s daughter home unless I die!”","Kang Ru’s expression changed. “Mom! Don’t say that about Yunqiu!”","“What? Did I say something wrong? She ran away when she was pregnant back then. Who knew if she had fooled around with another man?!” Old Madam Kang’s face was ferocious as she picked up a cup and slammed it on the floor. Then, she roared, “She’s a b*tch! That b*tch gave birth to another little b*tch. She’s a jinx!”","At this moment, she had already lost her mind. She did not care about her image or Kang Ru’s and Kang Jichuan’s feelings. She shouted like a shrew, “Qiao Xi is just like her mother. She’s a sl*t! A b*tch! She seduces men everywhere just because she has a good-looking face. If I had known that Xia Yunqiu would give birth to such a b*tch, I would have forced her to abort the child earlier!”","“Mom!” The veins on Kang Ru’s forehead popped out as he clenched his fists tightly.","He did not want to hear his mother’s words, but he did not retort. He only stopped her indifferently.","Kang Ru had received the Kang family’s education since he was young and thought that it was understandable for the elders to criticize the younger generation. Moreover, Xi Xi had done something wrong and angered his mother, which was why she was cursing so agitatedly.","At the thought of Xia Yunqiu, Kang Ru’s mood fell to rock bottom. Why did Yunqiu not understand his mother’s painstaking efforts? His mother taught her a lesson for her own good, hoping that she could get better. However, Yunqiu thought that his mother was making things difficult for her, so she abandoned him and their son.","Kang Jichuan’s expression was also very ugly. After all, the woman Old Madam Kang was cursing was his biological mother. He wanted to retort, but he could not say a word.","His impression of his mother was already very vague. He did not know what kind of woman his mother was at all. He only heard that his mother left because of his grandmother. Just because his grandmother reprimanded her a few times, she heartlessly abandoned her son and husband!","Her character was indeed very similar to Xi Xi’s!","“Fortunately, the organizers only mentioned Bright Moon and didn’t use Xi Xi’s name. There’s still a chance. We’ll clarify this matter immediately. We can’t let this matter spread to Y Nation and embarrass the Kang family!” Kang Ru said seriously.","“Jichuan, call Xi Xi and tell her not to participate in the competition for now. No matter what, she has to clarify the rumors of her seducing a judge!”","Kang Jichuan suppressed the discomfort in his heart and lowered his eyes to reply.","Kang Qingzhi shifted her eyes and hurriedly said, “Brother, the netizens are too angry now. It’s useless to explain. Just get someone to delete all the posts about my sister. If the people who scolded my sister are banned, it won’t be long before this matter is over.”","Kang Jichuan did not think too much about it and nodded in accordance with Kang Qingzhi’s words. After all, Qiao Xi was his biological sister. They were connected by blood. No matter how much he hated her, he had to help his sister when she was in trouble."]},{"number":1496,"title":"Chapter 1496 My Patience Is Limited","paragraphs":["1496 My Patience Is Limited","Longwan Residential.","Qiao Xi had just eaten and was comfortably lying on the sofa eating Matcha ice cream when her phone suddenly rang. When the call connected, Kang Jichuan’s voice came from the other end. “Xi Xi, our family knows about what you did. You definitely can’t participate in the competition anymore. Dad said that he’ll help you suppress the news and try his best to protect your reputation.”","“There’s no need.” Qiao Xi refused coldly.","Kang Jichuan’s tone was serious. “Xi Xi, stop fooling around! Do you know what such news means to a woman? Leave the perfume competition and leave the rest to me.”","!!","Qiao Xi sneered. They kept saying that they were a family, but the Kang family did not believe her at all and thought that she had seduced a judge.","“There’s no need to trouble you, Young Master Kang.” Qiao Xi’s voice was still cold.","Anger surged in Kang Jichuan’s heart. “Xi Xi, what exactly do you want? The competition’s organizers have already revoked your right to participate in the competition. If you continue to fool around, your life will be ruined. If Gu Zheng finds out that you did such a thing, will he still tolerate you?”","“Heh, how are you going to help me, then, Young Master Kang?”","Kang Jichuan blurted out, “I’ll get the competition’s organizers to delete the threads, comments, and accounts.”","Qiao Xi rolled her eyes. “This is your method? You’re clearly trying to cover it up! The more you do this, the more dissatisfied the netizens will be. They’ll be even more sure that I seduced a judge. When the matter festers, not only will I be embarrassed, but my real name will also be exposed.”","Kang Jichuan had a bit of a business mind, but he did not often go online and did not understand the horror of online public opinion. His tone gradually became annoyed. “Xi Xi, time is tight. My patience is limited!”","Qiao Xi scooped up a spoonful of ice cream and said unhurriedly, “Young Master Kang, you’re really interesting. All my relatives and friends know that I’m Bright Moon. After this matter was exposed, Gu Zheng, the Yin family, the Qin family, and the Xue family all believe that I wouldn’t do such a thing. They’re even looking for evidence to prove my innocence. Only those who are related to me by blood don’t believe me!","“Even if you delete the negative comments online, you’ll never be able to change the thoughts of the netizens. The image they have of me is already deeply rooted. When you said you’ll help me, did you mean you’ll completely destroy me?”","Qiao Xi said casually, but Kang Jichuan’s expression changed abruptly. “Qiao Xi! What nonsense are you talking about?! I’m doing this for your own good. Everyone doesn’t know that you’re Bright Moon yet, so we should quickly suppress the news now. Before long, no one will remember this matter.”","“Young Master Kang, who gave you this idea?”","Kang Jichuan instantly choked. Before he called, Qingzhi had given him the idea, but Qingzhi did it for Xi Xi’s own good!","He was silent for a moment before the flames of rage surged out of his heart. “You didn’t repent after making a mistake. To think that Qingzhi was so anxious about you that she cried and helped you think of a way. You’re ungrateful and even think that Qingzhi wants to harm you! Qiao Xi, you’re the one who said that you don’t need our help this time. Don’t regret it. From now on, don’t beg me if you encounter trouble!”","With that, Kang Jichuan hung up angrily. He was so angry that his face turned red. He slammed the phone on the table, anger surging in his heart.","He had already tried his best to control his emotions, but it was clearly Qiao Xi who made a mistake. She did not accept the Kang family’s good intentions and even tried to drive a wedge between him and Qingzhi. How could she be so vicious?!","After Qingzhi found out that something had happened to Qiao Xi, she was so anxious that she did not even eat. She wanted to help Qiao Xi salvage her reputation and even suggested sacrificing herself. However, Qiao Xi still thought that Qingzhi wanted to harm her. Qiao Xi was an ignorant fool!","Five years ago, when Qiao Xi returned home, Qingzhi had always been careful and tried her best to please her. However, Qiao Xi made things difficult for Qingzhi and even beat and scolded her.","Qingzhi was weak and sickly to begin with, but she gritted her teeth and endured it. She did not want to offend Qiao Xi, but she still refused to let the matter go. Qiao Xi felt that Qingzhi had snatched away more than ten years of her love and wealth. Qingzhi felt that she had let Qiao Xi down and kept giving in to her. However, Qiao Xi was ungrateful. Even though Qingzhi was about to die, Qiao Xi was unwilling to donate her blood.","She was so selfish back then, and she was still the same now!","Kang Jichuan was furious. Looking at the curses online, he clenched his fists tightly, his eyes red.","“Brother...”","At this moment, Kang Qingzhi’s petite figure appeared at the door. Her eyes were red as she said awkwardly, “The competition’s organizers called to ask the contestants to repost that thread. I’m the only one who hasn’t reposted it. They called me and asked me to repost it.”"]},{"number":1497,"title":"Chapter 1497 We’ll Always Trust Miss Bright Moon","paragraphs":["1497 We’ll Always Trust Miss Bright Moon","Kang Jichuan looked up at Kang Qingzhi. Her eyes were red as she looked at him pitifully. “Brother, if I repost that thread, Sister Xi Xi will definitely not forgive me. However, if I don’t repost it, those judges will definitely suppress me.","“I had already decided that even if I had to give up on the competition, I wouldn’t repost it. However, my manager said that she has already reposted it with my account. I have many followers to begin with. Now, many people are scolding Sister Xi Xi on my page. She’ll definitely blame me. What should I do?!","“I didn’t want to repost it either! I’m worried that Sister Xi Xi will be affected, but they threatened me. Brother...”","Kang Jichuan instantly frowned. Ever since the incident, Qingzhi had been thinking about Xi Xi. She was afraid that she would offend Xi Xi, but when he called Qiao Xi just now, she hinted that Qingzhi wanted to harm her.","The two of them were clearly about the same age. Qingzhi was kind-hearted and understanding, but Xi Xi had a bad temper and was full of bad habits.","Kang Jichuan recalled Qiao Xi’s words just now, and his eyes were filled with disappointment. He comforted her softly. “Qingzhi, since you’ve already reposted it, don’t think too much about it. Moreover, I called Xi Xi just now. She doesn’t want the Kang family to interfere in this matter. Moreover, all the participants have reposted it. If you don’t repost it, it’ll arouse the suspicion of others. Don’t blame yourself for this. You did the right thing.”","Kang Qingzhi wiped away the tears on her face, but the corners of her mouth curled into a proud smile.","If Qiao Xi knew that Kang Jichuan had agreed to her reposting the thread, would she be very sad? Her biological brother had given up on her five years ago, and it was the same now. As the true daughter of the Kang family, she was really too useless!","At this point, Kang Qingzhi knew that Qiao Xi no longer had a chance to make a comeback. Moreover, the participants had reposted the news one after another, but she had yet to explain herself. This meant that she could not explain herself. If she rashly appeared, it would be easy for others to expose her true identity.","Just then, Kang Qingzhi’s phone suddenly rang. It was a call from her friend, Xu Ling.","Xu Ling was a friend Kang Qingzhi had gotten to know during the perfume competition. She was the person who was in Room 307 previously. Kang Qingzhi told Du Ming that a friend was waiting for him because she wanted to use Xu Ling to shirk her responsibility. Once the matter was exposed, she would say that she had given the wrong room number. The person who reported Qiao Xi was also Xu Ling.","Kang Qingzhi picked up the phone and said gently, “Ling Ling, what’s wrong?”","“Qingzhi, look at what’s going on on the internet. They’re all scolding that b*tch! Originally, the competition’s organizers banned her from participating in the competition for three years. Now, it’s been changed to a permanent ban. Moreover, all the major perfume brands have stood up and expressed their stand. They said that they’ll forever refuse to collaborate with her and want the entire industry to ban her. Hahaha!”","Kang Qingzhi sounded worried. “Ling Ling, that’s not good, right? She’s my sister!”","“Who does she think she is?! She’s not worthy to be your sister. She seduced a judge. She’s indiscreet. If you hadn’t taken that photo, we would’ve been kept in the dark!”","Kang Qingzhi sighed helplessly. “I wanted to look for you that day and happened to pass by and take that photo. If I had known earlier, I wouldn’t have shown that photo.”","“Ah! What’s going on? Qingzhi, who exactly is Bright Moon? Isn’t she the adopted daughter of the Kang family? Why is Gu Corporation standing up for her?”","Xu Ling’s voice broke down as she was filled with disbelief.","When Kang Qingzhi heard about Gu Corporation, her breathing became irregular. She finally understood what was going on.","Why?! The scandal of Qiao Xi seducing a man was exposed. Why did Gu Zheng still believe her? Didn’t he have the slightest doubt?","Kang Qingzhi immediately clicked on the website and saw Gu Corporation’s statement.","Gu Corporation: [We’ll always believe in Miss Bright Moon and do our best to investigate the truth to clear Miss Bright Moon’s name. I hope everyone can speak rationally before the truth is revealed. Otherwise, we’ll sue on behalf of Miss Bright Moon for personal attacks and slander!]","There was a photo below this message. It was of the people who had been the most active in insulting Qiao Xi online recently. There were also some perfumers and studios that had attracted public opinion. Even the people who had reposted the competition’s organizers’ thread were on it. Of course, this included Kang Qingzhi.","When Xu Ling saw this message, she instantly panicked. “Qingzhi, this... This is Gu Corporation!”","“Don’t worry, Ling Ling. You didn’t do anything wrong. What’s there to be afraid of?” Kang Qingzhi’s voice was still gentle. “I really didn’t expect my sister to find someone from Gu Corporation to help her. I don’t know how many backers she has!”"]},{"number":1498,"title":"Chapter 1498 Twisting The Situation With One Word","paragraphs":["1498 Twisting The Situation With One Word","Xu Ling instantly caught the main point of Kang Qing’s words. It seemed that Bright Moon must have used her vixen face to seduce the higher-ups of Gu Corporation. That was why Gu Corporation was openly going against the netizens.","At the thought of this, Xu Ling was even angrier. She immediately logged into her alternate account and went online.","At this moment, because of this news from Gu Corporation, the server was about to collapse. Everyone was guessing Bright Moon’s true identity. After all, Gu Corporation had never interfered in the affairs of outsiders. Previously, the person Gu Corporation stood up for was Gu Zheng’s wife. It seemed that this perfumer, Bright Moon, had a powerful background!","[Is Gu Corporation crazy? Why are they defending this b*tch?! She’s already been proven wrong, yet they’re still speaking up for her. Does Gu Corporation not want to do business anymore?!]","!!","[Oh! I understand now. This woman seduced the judge previously and must have seduced the higher-ups of Gu Corporation now! President Gu, are you going to interfere in this matter? If this goes on, Gu Corporation’s reputation will be ruined!]","[Bright Moon is quite capable! She seduced Du Ming and even seduced the higher-ups of Gu Corporation. She’s really a femme fatale!]","[I was originally neutral, but now that Gu Corporation is stepping in, I still choose to believe them. After all, if a big company like Gu Corporation doesn’t have enough confidence, they won’t rashly make a statement. Moreover, it’s meaningless to offend the netizens for a small perfumer. Maybe Du Ming is up to no good and will bite back after the matter is exposed?]","[The person above has a point. Gu Corporation is a world-class corporation. President Gu Zheng is smart and wise. This statement must have been issued with his permission. If Bright Moon is really that kind of person, why would Gu Corporation stand up for her? Just as the statement said, before the truth is revealed, everyone should speak rationally. We’re all people who have gone to university. Don’t use personal attacks, lest we regret it once we receive Gu Corporation’s lawyer’s letter!]","As Gu Corporation’s status in the country was too high, the originally one-sided situation suddenly began to change. Everyone thought that since Gu Corporation could speak up for Bright Moon, there must be something else going on. Otherwise, why would Gu Corporation ruin the company’s image for a perfumer?","Qiao Xi glanced at the news online and smiled. “President Gu, you turned the situation around with just a few words. I’m really impressed!”","Gu Zheng looked at her affectionately with a gentle smile. “Thank you for your praise, Mrs. Gu.”","Qiao Xi looked at him and smiled. She casually said, “Kang Jichuan called me. They want me to withdraw from the competition.”","A glint flashed through Gu Zheng’s eyes, but when he looked at Qiao Xi, his eyes were still filled with gentleness. He said casually, “If they don’t let you participate, I’ll make Kang Qingzhi know that she can’t participate in the competition for the rest of her life.”","Qiao Xi suddenly said, “Right, I remember something. Five years ago, Kang Jichuan hypnotized me, causing me to lose my memory. I originally thought that Kang Jichuan and Kang Qingzhi knew about it. Now, it seems that Kang Qingzhi seems to have lost her memory as well!","“I still remember that when Kang Jichuan saw me in the villa area of Y Nation, he was first shocked, then afraid. He even felt a little guilty. That’s because he thought that I had died in the sea a long time ago. When he saw me, he vaguely thought that my ghost was looking for him to take revenge. Later on, when he found out that I was still alive, there was only guilt in his eyes.","“But Kang Qingzhi... When she saw me, her eyes were empty as if she was seeing a stranger. Do you think she really lost her memory, or is she pretending?”","“We’ll know if it’s true or not after we try it out,” Gu Zheng said indifferently, his eyes filled with mockery.","Qiao Xi muttered, “Kang Jichuan has always thought that Kang Qingzhi is a kind-hearted girl, so he would definitely be afraid that Kang Qingzhi would feel guilty after my death. He would’ve been afraid that Kang Qingzhi, who was already weak and sick, would feel uneasy, so it’s likely he used hypnosis to help Kang Qingzhi erase her memory.","Gu Zheng narrowed his eyes and said, “Have you ever thought that Kang Qingzhi wasn’t surprised to see you at all because she already knew that you were still alive? Moreover, she has been secretly sending people to monitor you. As long as you didn’t return to the Kang family, she wouldn’t attack you. However, if you threaten her status, she’ll kill you without hesitation.”","Qiao Xi nodded. “That explains it. I don’t believe that Kang Qingzhi lost her memory. If she lost her memory, how did she know about the perfume recipes? She clearly knows that the perfume recipes are mine, so she’s deliberately using them to deal with me. This way, she would have a greater sense of accomplishment. Moreover, she doesn’t know that I’ve recovered my memory and recalled the perfume recipes. That’s why she feels that even if she rides on my head, she won’t be exposed by me.”"]},{"number":1499,"title":"Chapter 1499 Shameful Tricks","paragraphs":["1499 Shameful Tricks","Qiao Xi pondered. Perhaps five years ago, Kang Qingzhi had already sent people to secretly monitor her. Not only was she not discovered by anyone, but she even maintained her kind and weak image.","She suddenly felt a chill run down her spine. This woman was so scary!","...","At this moment, in the office of the International Perfume Competition, Du Ming looked at Gu Corporation’s statement with a gloomy expression. “Didn’t you say that Bright Moon only has the Xue family as her backer? Why is Gu Corporation speaking up for her?”","The other judges did not expect such a thing to happen either. They all replied helplessly, “Mr. Du, is it possible that Bright Moon seduced you and others too? You were clean and didn’t fall for it, but the others...”","When Du Ming heard this, he instantly frowned. “You’re right. This kind of woman is unscrupulous and will do anything in order to achieve her goal. Even if I hadn’t helped her, she would’ve just looked for another man. There’ll always be people who can’t control themselves.”","“Gu Corporation has already sent a lawyer’s letter to everyone who reposted the thread. They’re not even letting us off. It looks like they’re determined to help this woman this time.”","Du Ming snorted. “If Gu Corporation wants to send out lawyer’s letters, so be it. Anyway, they don’t have any evidence to prove Bright Moon’s innocence. Moreover, Bright Moon came in first in the competition, which confirms the rumors that she faked it.”","Bright Moon had just gotten first place in the advancement competition, and the incident of her seducing the judge happened right after that. Everyone would naturally think that her ranking was invalid.","Du Ming knew that Gu Corporation was powerful, but the matter had already caused an uproar online. No matter how capable Gu Corporation was, they could not make everyone shut up. As long as they could not produce evidence, it was a fact that Bright Moon had seduced a judge. She would never be able to continue participating in the competition.","Actually, Du Ming originally wanted to let the matter rest. Although he had been beaten up, it would affect him if this matter was exposed. However, that lady found him and hoped to join forces to deal with Bright Moon. That lady had a respected status, so dealing with Bright Moon was as easy as flipping his hand. Moreover, he could also benefit from it.","Unexpectedly, Gu Corporation suddenly spoke up for Bright Moon and swayed the netizens. Fortunately, Bright Moon did not have any evidence, so the matter would definitely be left unsettled in the end.","Just as Du Ming was deep in thought, one of the judges suddenly said, “I understand why Gu Corporation is protecting Bright Moon!”","The other party handed the phone to Du Ming and pointed at the news. “Bright Moon is a perfumer signed by Gu Corporation. If something happens to Bright Moon, Gu Corporation’s reputation will naturally be affected, so they have to stand up and protect her!”","Du Ming’s eyes instantly lit up when he saw this message. He did not have time to verify the information and directly logged into the official account of the International Perfume Competition to write a thread.","[After the competition’s investigation, the perfumer, Bright Moon, is a perfumer signed by Gu Corporation. Gu Corporation didn’t produce any substantial evidence, but they publicly protected Bright Moon. This is disrespectful to the competition! Gu Corporation insists on protecting someone who ignored the rules of the competition and cheated. It seems that Miss Bright Moon used some shameful methods.]","The moment this news was released, the internet instantly exploded.","Xu Ling reposted it without hesitation and added: [She probably seduced the higher-ups of Gu Corporation! How can such an immoral woman become a perfumer of Gu Corporation?!]","Public opinion on the internet changed again.","[It’s understandable for Gu Corporation to protect their own perfumers, but shouldn’t they pay attention to their employees’ character when recruiting them?! Protecting such a piece of trash will ruin the company’s image!]","[We have to disqualify Bright Moon from the competition! President Gu, can you control the higher-ups of the company?! Some men have been bewitched by vixen sirens. In order to protect this woman, they don’t even care about their future!]","Du Ming looked at the comments online and smiled proudly. “What’s the use of Gu Corporation stepping forward? It can’t offset the anger of the netizens. We have the photo as evidence and me as a witness. The matter of Bright Moon seducing a judge is a sure bet, a shoo-in. Unless she can produce stronger evidence!","“However, if Bright Moon had evidence, she wouldn’t have dragged it out until now. Now that she has been permanently banned from competing and is even banned by the entire industry, I think her path in the perfume industry has come to an end!”","There seemed to be only one person who could speak up for Bright Moon, and that was Twilight. However, after thinking about it carefully, Twilight only entered the lounge later. He did not have any evidence to prove Bright Moon’s innocence."]},{"number":1500,"title":"Chapter 1500 A Lawyer’s Letter From Each Family","paragraphs":["1500 A Lawyer’s Letter From Each Family","Du Ming finally heaved a sigh of relief, but not long after, another statement appeared online, but it was not from Gu Corporation.","The Official Account of Li City University: [The perfumer, Bright Moon, is the most outstanding teacher at Li City University. Her character is obvious to all the teachers and students in the university. All the teachers and students of Li City University are willing to vouch for Bright Moon. She won’t ignore the rules of the competition and seduce a judge. Moreover, with her strength, she doesn’t need to seduce a judge at all!","[Once this matter was spread, the students all stepped forward to vouch for Bright Moon. Unfortunately, our act is too small and won’t have much of an impact. If someone is willing to believe in Bright Moon, perhaps it’s a coincidence. If everyone is willing to believe in her, then that’s enough to prove Bright Moon’s innocence!","[Bright Moon’s students and colleagues all think that she was wronged. We’ve been with her for so long and know her better than the netizens. I hope Mr. Du Ming can face his mistake and not ruin a perfumer’s future because of his nonsense!","!!","[I believe that Bright Moon will be able to clear her name one day. I hope that those who have insulted Bright Moon can sincerely apologize. Otherwise, Li City University will sue everyone on behalf of Bright Moon!]","The accompanying photo was a guarantee document with the signatures of the university’s teachers and students. Immediately after, this thread was reposted by countless people. Among them, there was a small internet celebrity with a million fans who was a student at Li City University. He posted: [I believe in Teacher Bright Moon’s character. She’s conscientious in her work and is very gentle and capable. I swear on my character that she won’t do such a thing.]","The statement released by Li City University caused public opinion on the internet to fall into a deadlock again. Everyone was dumbfounded. Li City University was a famous university in the country. If they were willing to stand up for Bright Moon, it meant that they believed in this teacher’s character.","Moreover, to be able to become a teacher at Li City University, her character, quality, and ability were definitely top-notch. She already had a solid background. It was indeed very good to be able to get first place in the perfume competition, but she would not go astray just to achieve her goal. After all, her life was already perfect. There was no need to ruin her glorious future for a perfume competition!","At this moment, public opinion was once again biased toward Qiao Xi’s side, but it was not over yet.","Ten minutes later, a Y Nation account called the ‘The Brooke Family’ released a statement that shocked everyone.","[Oh my God! Am I seeing things? Doesn’t the Brook family have a grudge against Gu Corporation?]","[I remember that the madam of the Brook family offended Mrs. Gu. Both parties are strong, and neither was willing to back down. I heard that the head of the Brook family and Gu Zheng are like fire and water. Why would the Brook family speak up for Bright Moon?]","[Didn’t they say that Bright Moon is Gu Corporation’s perfumer? That doesn’t make sense! If Bright Moon really seduced a judge, the Brook family would definitely take the opportunity to attack Gu Corporation!]","[Gu Corporation standing up for Bright Moon might be a coincidence, but with so many people standing up for her, Bright Moon must have been wronged! Some people might say that Bright Moon seduced someone from the Brook family. If that’s the case, Bright Moon is also an awesome person. She actually seduced a family far away in Y Nation. I want to acknowledge her as my master. I also want so many men to be loyal to me!]","[F*ck! The Brook family has sent a lawyer’s letter to the perfume competition. They said that they’ll protect Bright Moon’s rights and interests to the death. Two incompatible forces are protecting Bright Moon together. I’m really envious!]","[Wait! It’s not just the Brook family. There’s also the Xue family in the capital, the Yin family in Shengdu, and the Qin family. They’re all true wealthy families!]","When Du Ming saw the Brook family getting involved, he was so scared that his face turned pale. Now, his phone was vibrating crazily. He had received a lawyer’s letter from the various families. Cold sweat could not help but fall from his forehead.","He widened his eyes and looked at the news online. The netizens were discussing it fervently. So many noble families were speaking up for Bright Moon at the same time. What was Bright Moon’s background?!","He still remembered that day when Bright Moon said that she was the daughter of the Xue family. Later on, Du Ming got someone to investigate and it turned out that Bright Moon was just an orphan. That was why he slandered her without any worries. But what was going on now?","Just as Du Ming was immersed in shock, someone suddenly pushed open the office door. The current president of the Perfume Association, Jiang Ying, appeared in front of him with a gloomy face and roared, “Du Ming!”"]}]);
